__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God.",pt:"No princ\xedpio era o Verbo, e o Verbo estava com Deus, e o Verbo era Deus."},{verse:2,en:"The same was in the beginning with God.",pt:"Ele estava no princ\xedpio com Deus."},{verse:3,en:"All things were made by him; and without him was not any thing made that was made.",pt:"Todas as coisas foram feitas por interm\xe9dio dele, e sem ele nada do que foi feito se fez."},{verse:4,en:"In him was life; and the life was the light of men.",pt:"Nele estava a vida, e a vida era a luz dos homens;"},{verse:5,en:"And the light shineth in darkness; and the darkness comprehended it not.",pt:"a luz resplandece nas trevas, e as trevas n\xe3o prevaleceram contra ela."},{verse:6,en:"There was a man sent from God, whose name was John.",pt:"Houve um homem enviado de Deus, cujo nome era Jo\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"The same came for a witness, to bear witness of the Light, that all men through him might believe.",pt:"Este veio como testemunha, a fim de dar testemunho da luz, para que todos cressem por meio dele."},{verse:8,en:"He was not that Light, but was sent to bear witness of that Light.",pt:"Ele n\xe3o era a luz, mas veio para dar testemunho da luz."},{verse:9,en:"That was the true Light, which lighteth every man that cometh into the world.",pt:"Pois a verdadeira luz, que alumia a todo homem, estava chegando ao mundo."},{verse:10,en:"He was in the world, and the world was made by him, and the world knew him not.",pt:"Estava ele no mundo, e o mundo foi feito por interm\xe9dio dele, e o mundo n\xe3o o conheceu."},{verse:11,en:"He came unto his own, and his own received him not.",pt:"Veio para o que era seu, e os seus n\xe3o o receberam."},{verse:12,en:"But as many as received him, to them gave he power to become the sons of God, even to them that believe on his name:",pt:"Mas, a todos quantos o receberam, aos que cr\xeaem no seu nome, deu-lhes o poder de se tornarem filhos de Deus;"},{verse:13,en:"Which were born, not of blood, nor of the will of the flesh, nor of the will of man, but of God.",pt:"os quais n\xe3o nasceram do sangue, nem da vontade da carne, nem da vontade do var\xe3o, mas de Deus."},{verse:14,en:"And the Word was made flesh, and dwelt among us, (and we beheld his glory, the glory as of the only begotten of the Father,) full of grace and truth.",pt:"E o Verbo se fez carne, e habitou entre n\xf3s, cheio de gra\xe7a e de verdade; e vimos a sua gl\xf3ria, como a gl\xf3ria do unig\xeanito do Pai."},{verse:15,en:"John bare witness of him, and cried, saying, This was he of whom I spake, He that cometh after me is preferred before me: for he was before me.",pt:"Jo\xe3o deu testemunho dele, e clamou, dizendo: Este \xe9 aquele de quem eu disse: O que vem depois de mim, passou adiante de mim; porque antes de mim ele j\xe1 existia."},{verse:16,en:"And of his fulness have all we received, and grace for grace.",pt:"Pois todos n\xf3s recebemos da sua plenitude, e gra\xe7a sobre gra\xe7a."},{verse:17,en:"For the law was given by Moses, but grace and truth came by Jesus Christ.",pt:"Porque a lei foi dada por meio de Mois\xe9s; a gra\xe7a e a verdade vieram por Jesus Cristo."},{verse:18,en:"No man hath seen God at any time; the only begotten Son, which is in the bosom of the Father, he hath declared him.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m jamais viu a Deus. O Deus unig\xeanito, que est\xe1 no seio do Pai, esse o deu a conhecer."},{verse:19,en:"And this is the record of John, when the Jews sent priests and Levites from Jerusalem to ask him, Who art thou?",pt:"E este foi o testemunho de Jo\xe3o, quando os judeus lhe enviaram de Jerusal\xe9m sacerdotes e levitas para que lhe perguntassem: Quem \xe9s tu?"},{verse:20,en:"And he confessed, and denied not; but confessed, I am not the Christ.",pt:"Ele, pois, confessou e n\xe3o negou; sim, confessou: Eu n\xe3o sou o Cristo."},{verse:21,en:"And they asked him, What then? Art thou Elias? And he saith, I am not. Art thou that prophet? And he answered, No.",pt:"Ao que lhe perguntaram: Pois que? \xc9s tu Elias? Respondeu ele: N\xe3o sou. \xc9s tu o profeta? E respondeu: N\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"Then said they unto him, Who art thou? that we may give an answer to them that sent us. What sayest thou of thyself?",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois: Quem \xe9s? para podermos dar resposta aos que nos enviaram; que dizes de ti mesmo?"},{verse:23,en:"He said, I am the voice of one crying in the wilderness, Make straight the way of the Lord, as said the prophet Esaias.",pt:"Respondeu ele: Eu sou a voz do que clama no deserto: Endireitai o caminho do Senhor, como disse o profeta Isa\xedas."},{verse:24,en:"And they which were sent were of the Pharisees.",pt:"E os que tinham sido enviados eram dos fariseus."},{verse:25,en:"And they asked him, and said unto him, Why baptizest thou then, if thou be not that Christ, nor Elias, neither that prophet?",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhe perguntaram: Por que batizas, pois, se tu n\xe3o \xe9s o Cristo, nem Elias, nem o profeta?"},{verse:26,en:"John answered them, saying, I baptize with water: but there standeth one among you, whom ye know not;",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jo\xe3o: Eu batizo em \xe1gua; no meio de v\xf3s est\xe1 um a quem v\xf3s n\xe3o conheceis."},{verse:27,en:"He it is, who coming after me is preferred before me, whose shoe\u2019s latchet I am not worthy to unloose.",pt:"aquele que vem depois de mim, de quem eu n\xe3o sou digno de desatar a correia da alparca."},{verse:28,en:"These things were done in Bethabara beyond Jordan, where John was baptizing.",pt:"Estas coisas aconteceram em Bet\xe2nia, al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, onde Jo\xe3o estava batizando."},{verse:29,en:"The next day John seeth Jesus coming unto him, and saith, Behold the Lamb of God, which taketh away the sin of the world.",pt:"No dia seguinte Jo\xe3o viu a Jesus, que vinha para ele, e disse: Eis o Cordeiro de Deus, que tira o pecado do mundo."},{verse:30,en:"This is he of whom I said, After me cometh a man which is preferred before me: for he was before me.",pt:"este \xe9 aquele de quem eu disse: Depois de mim vem um var\xe3o que passou adiante de mim, porque antes de mim ele j\xe1 existia."},{verse:31,en:"And I knew him not: but that he should be made manifest to Israel, therefore am I come baptizing with water.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o o conhecia; mas, para que ele fosse manifestado a Israel, \xe9 que vim batizando em \xe1gua."},{verse:32,en:"And John bare record, saying, I saw the Spirit descending from heaven like a dove, and it abode upon him.",pt:"E Jo\xe3o deu testemunho, dizendo: Vi o Esp\xedrito descer do c\xe9u como pomba, e repousar sobre ele."},{verse:33,en:"And I knew him not: but he that sent me to baptize with water, the same said unto me, Upon whom thou shalt see the Spirit descending, and remaining on him, the same is he which baptizeth with the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o o conhecia; mas o que me enviou a batizar em \xe1gua, esse me disse: Aquele sobre quem vires descer o Esp\xedrito, e sobre ele permanecer, esse \xe9 o que batiza no Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:34,en:"And I saw, and bare record that this is the Son of God.",pt:"Eu mesmo vi e j\xe1 vos dei testemunho de que este \xe9 o Filho de Deus."},{verse:35,en:"Again the next day after John stood, and two of his disciples;",pt:"No dia seguinte Jo\xe3o estava outra vez ali, com dois dos seus disc\xedpulos"},{verse:36,en:"And looking upon Jesus as he walked, he saith, Behold the Lamb of God!",pt:"e, olhando para Jesus, que passava, disse: Eis o Cordeiro de Deus!"},{verse:37,en:"And the two disciples heard him speak, and they followed Jesus.",pt:"Aqueles dois disc\xedpulos ouviram-no dizer isto, e seguiram a Jesus."},{verse:38,en:"Then Jesus turned, and saw them following, and saith unto them, What seek ye? They said unto him, Rabbi, (which is to say, being interpreted, Master,) where dwellest thou?",pt:"Voltando-se Jesus e vendo que o seguiam, perguntou-lhes: Que buscais? Disseram-lhe eles: rabi (que, traduzido, quer dizer Mestre), onde pousas?"},{verse:39,en:"He saith unto them, Come and see. They came and saw where he dwelt, and abode with him that day: for it was about the tenth hour.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: Vinde, e vereis. Foram, pois, e viram onde pousava; e passaram o dia com ele; era cerca da hora d\xe9cima."},{verse:40,en:"One of the two which heard John speak, and followed him, was Andrew, Simon Peter\u2019s brother.",pt:"Andr\xe9, irm\xe3o de Sim\xe3o Pedro, era um dos dois que ouviram Jo\xe3o falar, e que seguiram a Jesus."},{verse:41,en:"He first findeth his own brother Simon, and saith unto him, We have found the Messias, which is, being interpreted, the Christ.",pt:"Ele achou primeiro a seu irm\xe3o Sim\xe3o, e disse-lhe: Havemos achado o Messias (que, traduzido, quer dizer Cristo)."},{verse:42,en:"And he brought him to Jesus. And when Jesus beheld him, he said, Thou art Simon the son of Jona: thou shalt be called Cephas, which is by interpretation, A stone.",pt:"E o levou a Jesus. Jesus, fixando nele o olhar, disse: Tu \xe9s Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, tu ser\xe1s chamado Cefas (que quer dizer Pedro)."},{verse:43,en:"The day following Jesus would go forth into Galilee, and findeth Philip, and saith unto him, Follow me.",pt:"No dia seguinte Jesus resolveu partir para a Galil\xe9ia, e achando a Felipe disse-lhe: Segue-me."},{verse:44,en:"Now Philip was of Bethsaida, the city of Andrew and Peter.",pt:"Ora, Felipe era de Betsaida, cidade de Andr\xe9 e de Pedro."},{verse:45,en:"Philip findeth Nathanael, and saith unto him, We have found him, of whom Moses in the law, and the prophets, did write, Jesus of Nazareth, the son of Joseph.",pt:"Felipe achou a Natanael, e disse-lhe: Acabamos de achar aquele de quem escreveram Mois\xe9s na lei, e os profetas: Jesus de Nazar\xe9, filho de Jos\xe9."},{verse:46,en:"And Nathanael said unto him, Can there any good thing come out of Nazareth? Philip saith unto him, Come and see.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Natanael: Pode haver coisa bem vinda de Nazar\xe9? Disse-lhe Felipe: Vem e v\xea."},{verse:47,en:"Jesus saw Nathanael coming to him, and saith of him, Behold an Israelite indeed, in whom is no guile!",pt:"Jesus, vendo Natanael aproximar-se dele, disse a seu respeito: Eis um verdadeiro israelita, em quem n\xe3o h\xe1 dolo!"},{verse:48,en:"Nathanael saith unto him, Whence knowest thou me? Jesus answered and said unto him, Before that Philip called thee, when thou wast under the fig tree, I saw thee.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Natanael: Donde me conheces? Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Antes que Felipe te chamasse, eu te vi, quando estavas debaixo da figueira."},{verse:49,en:"Nathanael answered and saith unto him, Rabbi, thou art the Son of God; thou art the King of Israel.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Natanael: Rabi, tu \xe9s o Filho de Deus, tu \xe9s rei de Israel."},{verse:50,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, Because I said unto thee, I saw thee under the fig tree, believest thou? thou shalt see greater things than these.",pt:"Ao que lhe disse Jesus: Porque te disse: Vi-te debaixo da figueira, cr\xeas? coisas maiores do que estas ver\xe1s."},{verse:51,en:"And he saith unto him, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Hereafter ye shall see heaven open, and the angels of God ascending and descending upon the Son of man.",pt:"E acrescentou: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que vereis o c\xe9u aberto, e os anjos de Deus subindo e descendo sobre o Filho do homem."}]}}),664,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,t,o,n,i){o.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And the third day there was a marriage in Cana of Galilee; and the mother of Jesus was there:",pt:"Tr\xeas dias depois, houve um casamento em Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, e estava ali a m\xe3e de Jesus;"},{verse:2,en:"And both Jesus was called, and his disciples, to the marriage.",pt:"e foi tamb\xe9m convidado Jesus com seus disc\xedpulos para o casamento."},{verse:3,en:"And when they wanted wine, the mother of Jesus saith unto him, They have no wine.",pt:"E, tendo acabado o vinho, a m\xe3e de Jesus lhe disse: Eles n\xe3o t\xeam vinho."},{verse:4,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Woman, what have I to do with thee? mine hour is not yet come.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Mulher, que tenho eu contigo? Ainda n\xe3o \xe9 chegada a minha hora."},{verse:5,en:"His mother saith unto the servants, Whatsoever he saith unto you, do it.",pt:"Disse ent\xe3o sua m\xe3e aos serventes: Fazei tudo quanto ele vos disser."},{verse:6,en:"And there were set there six waterpots of stone, after the manner of the purifying of the Jews, containing two or three firkins apiece.",pt:"Ora, estavam ali postas seis talhas de pedra, para as purifica\xe7\xf5es dos judeus, e em cada uma cabiam duas ou tr\xeas metretas."},{verse:7,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Fill the waterpots with water. And they filled them up to the brim.",pt:"Ordenou-lhe Jesus: Enchei de \xe1gua essas talhas. E encheram- nas at\xe9 em cima."},{verse:8,en:"And he saith unto them, Draw out now, and bear unto the governor of the feast. And they bare it.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lhes disse: Tirai agora, e levai ao mestre-sala. E eles o fizeram."},{verse:9,en:"When the ruler of the feast had tasted the water that was made wine, and knew not whence it was: (but the servants which drew the water knew;) the governor of the feast called the bridegroom,",pt:"Quando o mestre-sala provou a \xe1gua tornada em vinho, n\xe3o sabendo donde era, se bem que o sabiam os serventes que tinham tirado a \xe1gua, chamou o mestre-sala ao noivo"},{verse:10,en:"And saith unto him, Every man at the beginning doth set forth good wine; and when men have well drunk, then that which is worse: but thou hast kept the good wine until now.",pt:"e lhe disse: Todo homem p\xf5e primeiro o vinho bom e, quando j\xe1 t\xeam bebido bem, ent\xe3o o inferior; mas tu guardaste at\xe9 agora o bom vinho."},{verse:11,en:"This beginning of miracles did Jesus in Cana of Galilee, and manifested forth his glory; and his disciples believed on him.",pt:"Assim deu Jesus in\xedcio aos seus sinais em Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, e manifestou a sua gl\xf3ria; e os seus disc\xedpulos creram nele."},{verse:12,en:"After this he went down to Capernaum, he, and his mother, and his brethren, and his disciples: and they continued there not many days.",pt:"Depois disso desceu a Cafarnaum, ele, sua m\xe3e, seus irm\xe3os, e seus disc\xedpulos; e ficaram ali n\xe3o muitos dias."},{verse:13,en:"And the Jews\u2019 passover was at hand, and Jesus went up to Jerusalem,",pt:"Estando pr\xf3xima a p\xe1scoa dos judeus, Jesus subiu a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:14,en:"And found in the temple those that sold oxen and sheep and doves, and the changers of money sitting:",pt:"E achou no templo os que vendiam bois, ovelhas e pombas, e tamb\xe9m os cambistas ali sentados;"},{verse:15,en:"And when he had made a scourge of small cords, he drove them all out of the temple, and the sheep, and the oxen; and poured out the changers\u2019 money, and overthrew the tables;",pt:"e tendo feito um azorrague de cordas, lan\xe7ou todos fora do templo, bem como as ovelhas e os bois; e espalhou o dinheiro dos cambistas, e virou-lhes as mesas;"},{verse:16,en:"And said unto them that sold doves, Take these things hence; make not my Father\u2019s house an house of merchandise.",pt:"e disse aos que vendiam as pombas: Tirai daqui estas coisas; n\xe3o fa\xe7ais da casa de meu Pai casa de neg\xf3cio."},{verse:17,en:"And his disciples remembered that it was written, The zeal of thine house hath eaten me up.",pt:"Lembraram-se ent\xe3o os seus disc\xedpulos de que est\xe1 escrito: O zelo da tua casa me devorar\xe1."},{verse:18,en:"Then answered the Jews and said unto him, What sign shewest thou unto us, seeing that thou doest these things?",pt:"Protestaram, pois, os judeus, perguntando-lhe: Que sinal de autoridade nos mostras, uma vez que fazes isto?"},{verse:19,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, Destroy this temple, and in three days I will raise it up.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Derribai este santu\xe1rio, e em tr\xeas dias o levantarei."},{verse:20,en:"Then said the Jews, Forty and six years was this temple in building, and wilt thou rear it up in three days?",pt:"Disseram, pois, os judeus: Em quarenta e seis anos foi edificado este santu\xe1rio, e tu o levantar\xe1s em tr\xeas dias?"},{verse:21,en:"But he spake of the temple of his body.",pt:"Mas ele falava do santu\xe1rio do seu corpo."},{verse:22,en:"When therefore he was risen from the dead, his disciples remembered that he had said this unto them; and they believed the scripture, and the word which Jesus had said.",pt:"Quando, pois ressurgiu dentre os mortos, seus disc\xedpulos se lembraram de que dissera isto, e creram na Escritura, e na palavra que Jesus havia dito."},{verse:23,en:"Now when he was in Jerusalem at the passover, in the feast day, many believed in his name, when they saw the miracles which he did.",pt:"Ora, estando ele em Jerusal\xe9m pela festa da p\xe1scoa, muitos, vendo os sinais que fazia, creram no seu nome."},{verse:24,en:"But Jesus did not commit himself unto them, because he knew all men,",pt:"Mas o pr\xf3prio Jesus n\xe3o confiava a eles, porque os conhecia a todos,"},{verse:25,en:"And needed not that any should testify of man: for he knew what was in man.",pt:"e n\xe3o necessitava de que algu\xe9m lhe desse testemunho do homem, pois bem sabia o que havia no homem."}]}}),665,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"There was a man of the Pharisees, named Nicodemus, a ruler of the Jews:",pt:"Ora, havia entre os fariseus um homem chamado Nicodemos, um dos principais dos judeus."},{verse:2,en:"The same came to Jesus by night, and said unto him, Rabbi, we know that thou art a teacher come from God: for no man can do these miracles that thou doest, except God be with him.",pt:"Este foi ter com Jesus, de noite, e disse-lhe: Rabi, sabemos que \xe9s Mestre, vindo de Deus; pois ningu\xe9m pode fazer estes sinais que tu fazes, se Deus n\xe3o estiver com ele."},{verse:3,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, Verily, verily, I say unto thee, Except a man be born again, he cannot see the kingdom of God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade te digo que se algu\xe9m n\xe3o nascer de novo, n\xe3o pode ver o reino de Deus."},{verse:4,en:"Nicodemus saith unto him, How can a man be born when he is old? can he enter the second time into his mother\u2019s womb, and be born?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Nicodemos: Como pode um homem nascer, sendo velho? porventura pode tornar a entrar no ventre de sua m\xe3e, e nascer?"},{verse:5,en:"Jesus answered, Verily, verily, I say unto thee, Except a man be born of water and of the Spirit, he cannot enter into the kingdom of God.",pt:"Jesus respondeu: Em verdade, em verdade te digo que se algu\xe9m n\xe3o nascer da \xe1gua e do Esp\xedrito, n\xe3o pode entrar no reino de Deus."},{verse:6,en:"That which is born of the flesh is flesh; and that which is born of the Spirit is spirit.",pt:"O que \xe9 nascido da carne \xe9 carne, e o que \xe9 nascido do Esp\xedrito \xe9 esp\xedrito."},{verse:7,en:"Marvel not that I said unto thee, Ye must be born again.",pt:"N\xe3o te admires de eu te haver dito: Necess\xe1rio vos \xe9 nascer de novo."},{verse:8,en:"The wind bloweth where it listeth, and thou hearest the sound thereof, but canst not tell whence it cometh, and whither it goeth: so is every one that is born of the Spirit.",pt:"O vento sopra onde quer, e ouves a sua voz; mas n\xe3o sabes donde vem, nem para onde vai; assim \xe9 todo aquele que \xe9 nascido do Esp\xedrito."},{verse:9,en:"Nicodemus answered and said unto him, How can these things be?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Nicodemos: Como pode ser isto?"},{verse:10,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, Art thou a master of Israel, and knowest not these things?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Tu \xe9s mestre em Israel, e n\xe3o entendes estas coisas?"},{verse:11,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto thee, We speak that we do know, and testify that we have seen; and ye receive not our witness.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade te digo que n\xf3s dizemos o que sabemos e testemunhamos o que temos visto; e n\xe3o aceitais o nosso testemunho!"},{verse:12,en:"If I have told you earthly things, and ye believe not, how shall ye believe, if I tell you of heavenly things?",pt:"Se vos falei de coisas terrestres, e n\xe3o credes, como crereis, se vos falar das celestiais?"},{verse:13,en:"And no man hath ascended up to heaven, but he that came down from heaven, even the Son of man which is in heaven.",pt:"Ora, ningu\xe9m subiu ao c\xe9u, sen\xe3o o que desceu do c\xe9u, o Filho do homem."},{verse:14,en:"And as Moses lifted up the serpent in the wilderness, even so must the Son of man be lifted up:",pt:"E como Mois\xe9s levantou a serpente no deserto, assim importa que o Filho do homem seja levantado;"},{verse:15,en:"That whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have eternal life.",pt:"para que todo aquele que nele cr\xea tenha a vida eterna."},{verse:16,en:"For God so loved the world, that he gave his only begotten Son, that whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have everlasting life.",pt:"Porque Deus amou o mundo de tal maneira que deu o seu Filho unig\xeanito, para que todo aquele que nele cr\xea n\xe3o pere\xe7a, mas tenha a vida eterna."},{verse:17,en:"For God sent not his Son into the world to condemn the world; but that the world through him might be saved.",pt:"Porque Deus enviou o seu Filho ao mundo, n\xe3o para que julgasse o mundo, mas para que o mundo fosse salvo por ele."},{verse:18,en:"He that believeth on him is not condemned: but he that believeth not is condemned already, because he hath not believed in the name of the only begotten Son of God.",pt:"Quem cr\xea nele n\xe3o \xe9 julgado; mas quem n\xe3o cr\xea, j\xe1 est\xe1 julgado; porquanto n\xe3o cr\xea no nome do unig\xeanito Filho de Deus."},{verse:19,en:"And this is the condemnation, that light is come into the world, and men loved darkness rather than light, because their deeds were evil.",pt:"E o julgamento \xe9 este: A luz veio ao mundo, e os homens amaram antes as trevas que a luz, porque as suas obras eram m\xe1s."},{verse:20,en:"For every one that doeth evil hateth the light, neither cometh to the light, lest his deeds should be reproved.",pt:"Porque todo aquele que faz o mal aborrece a luz, e n\xe3o vem para a luz, para que as suas obras n\xe3o sejam reprovadas."},{verse:21,en:"But he that doeth truth cometh to the light, that his deeds may be made manifest, that they are wrought in God.",pt:"Mas quem pratica a verdade vem para a luz, a fim de que seja manifesto que as suas obras s\xe3o feitas em Deus."},{verse:22,en:"After these things came Jesus and his disciples into the land of Judaea; and there he tarried with them, and baptized.",pt:"Depois disto foi Jesus com seus disc\xedpulos para a terra da Jud\xe9ia, onde se demorou com eles e batizava."},{verse:23,en:"And John also was baptizing in Aenon near to Salim, because there was much water there: and they came, and were baptized.",pt:"Ora, Jo\xe3o tamb\xe9m estava batizando em Enom, perto de Salim, porque havia ali muitas \xe1guas; e o povo \xeda e se batizava."},{verse:24,en:"For John was not yet cast into prison.",pt:"Pois Jo\xe3o ainda n\xe3o fora lan\xe7ado no c\xe1rcere."},{verse:25,en:"Then there arose a question between some of John\u2019s disciples and the Jews about purifying.",pt:"Surgiu ent\xe3o uma contenda entre os disc\xedpulos de Jo\xe3o e um judeu acerca da purifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"And they came unto John, and said unto him, Rabbi, he that was with thee beyond Jordan, to whom thou barest witness, behold, the same baptizeth, and all men come to him.",pt:"E foram ter com Jo\xe3o e disseram-lhe: Rabi, aquele que estava contigo al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, do qual tens dado testemunho, eis que est\xe1 batizando, e todos v\xe3o ter com ele."},{verse:27,en:"John answered and said, A man can receive nothing, except it be given him from heaven.",pt:"Respondeu Jo\xe3o: O homem n\xe3o pode receber coisa alguma, se n\xe3o lhe for dada do c\xe9u."},{verse:28,en:"Ye yourselves bear me witness, that I said, I am not the Christ, but that I am sent before him.",pt:"V\xf3s mesmos me sois testemunhas de que eu disse: N\xe3o sou o Cristo, mas sou enviado adiante dele."},{verse:29,en:"He that hath the bride is the bridegroom: but the friend of the bridegroom, which standeth and heareth him, rejoiceth greatly because of the bridegroom\u2019s voice: this my joy therefore is fulfilled.",pt:"Aquele que tem a noiva \xe9 o noivo; mas o amigo do noivo, que est\xe1 presente e o ouve, regozija-se muito com a voz do noivo. Assim, pois, este meu gozo est\xe1 completo."},{verse:30,en:"He must increase, but I must decrease.",pt:"\xc9 necess\xe1rio que ele cres\xe7a e que eu diminua."},{verse:31,en:"He that cometh from above is above all: he that is of the earth is earthly, and speaketh of the earth: he that cometh from heaven is above all.",pt:"Aquele que vem de cima \xe9 sobre todos; aquele que vem da terra \xe9 da terra, e fala da terra. Aquele que vem do c\xe9u \xe9 sobre todos."},{verse:32,en:"And what he hath seen and heard, that he testifieth; and no man receiveth his testimony.",pt:"Aquilo que ele tem visto e ouvido, isso testifica; e ningu\xe9m aceita o seu testemunho."},{verse:33,en:"He that hath received his testimony hath set to his seal that God is true.",pt:"Mas o que aceitar o seu testemunho, esse confirma que Deus \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:34,en:"For he whom God hath sent speaketh the words of God: for God giveth not the Spirit by measure unto him.",pt:"Pois aquele que Deus enviou fala as palavras de Deus; porque Deus n\xe3o d\xe1 o Esp\xedrito por medida."},{verse:35,en:"The Father loveth the Son, and hath given all things into his hand.",pt:"O Pai ama ao Filho, e todas as coisas entregou nas suas m\xe3os."},{verse:36,en:"He that believeth on the Son hath everlasting life: and he that believeth not the Son shall not see life; but the wrath of God abideth on him.",pt:"Quem cr\xea no Filho tem a vida eterna; o que, por\xe9m, desobedece ao Filho n\xe3o ver\xe1 a vida, mas sobre ele permanece a ira de Deus."}]}}),666,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,i,h){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When therefore the Lord knew how the Pharisees had heard that Jesus made and baptized more disciples than John,",pt:"Quando, pois, o Senhor soube que os fariseus tinham ouvido dizer que ele, Jesus, fazia e batizava mais disc\xedpulos do que Jo\xe3o"},{verse:2,en:"(Though Jesus himself baptized not, but his disciples,)",pt:"(ainda que Jesus mesmo n\xe3o batizava, mas os seus disc\xedpulos)"},{verse:3,en:"He left Judaea, and departed again into Galilee.",pt:"deixou a Jud\xe9ia, e foi outra vez para a Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:4,en:"And he must needs go through Samaria.",pt:"E era-lhe necess\xe1rio passar por Sam\xe1ria."},{verse:5,en:"Then cometh he to a city of Samaria, which is called Sychar, near to the parcel of ground that Jacob gave to his son Joseph.",pt:"Chegou, pois, a uma cidade de Sam\xe1ria, chamada Sicar, junto da herdade que Jac\xf3 dera a seu filho Jos\xe9;"},{verse:6,en:"Now Jacob\u2019s well was there. Jesus therefore, being wearied with his journey, sat thus on the well: and it was about the sixth hour.",pt:"achava-se ali o po\xe7o de Jac\xf3. Jesus, pois, cansado da viagem, sentou-se assim junto do po\xe7o; era cerca da hora sexta."},{verse:7,en:"There cometh a woman of Samaria to draw water: Jesus saith unto her, Give me to drink.",pt:"Veio uma mulher de Sam\xe1ria tirar \xe1gua. Disse-lhe Jesus: D\xe1- me de beber."},{verse:8,en:"(For his disciples were gone away unto the city to buy meat.)",pt:"Pois seus disc\xedpulos tinham ido \xe0 cidade comprar comida."},{verse:9,en:"Then saith the woman of Samaria unto him, How is it that thou, being a Jew, askest drink of me, which am a woman of Samaria? for the Jews have no dealings with the Samaritans.",pt:"Disse-lhe ent\xe3o a mulher samaritana: Como, sendo tu judeu, me pedes de beber a mim, que sou mulher samaritana? (Porque os judeus n\xe3o se comunicavam com os samaritanos.)"},{verse:10,en:"Jesus answered and said unto her, If thou knewest the gift of God, and who it is that saith to thee, Give me to drink; thou wouldest have asked of him, and he would have given thee living water.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se tivesses conhecido o dom de Deus e quem \xe9 o que te diz: D\xe1-me de beber, tu lhe terias pedido e ele te haveria dado \xe1gua viva."},{verse:11,en:"The woman saith unto him, Sir, thou hast nothing to draw with, and the well is deep: from whence then hast thou that living water?",pt:"Disse-lhe a mulher: Senhor, tu n\xe3o tens com que tir\xe1-la, e o po\xe7o \xe9 fundo; donde, pois, tens essa \xe1gua viva?"},{verse:12,en:"Art thou greater than our father Jacob, which gave us the well, and drank thereof himself, and his children, and his cattle?",pt:"\xc9s tu, porventura, maior do que o nosso pai Jac\xf3, que nos deu o po\xe7o, do qual tamb\xe9m ele mesmo bebeu, e os filhos, e o seu gado?."},{verse:13,en:"Jesus answered and said unto her, Whosoever drinketh of this water shall thirst again:",pt:"Replicou-lhe Jesus: Todo o que beber desta \xe1gua tornar\xe1 a ter sede;"},{verse:14,en:"But whosoever drinketh of the water that I shall give him shall never thirst; but the water that I shall give him shall be in him a well of water springing up into everlasting life.",pt:"mas aquele que beber da \xe1gua que eu lhe der nunca ter\xe1 sede; pelo contr\xe1rio, a \xe1gua que eu lhe der se far\xe1 nele uma fonte de \xe1gua que jorre para a vida eterna."},{verse:15,en:"The woman saith unto him, Sir, give me this water, that I thirst not, neither come hither to draw.",pt:"Disse-lhe a mulher: Senhor, d\xe1-me dessa \xe1gua, para que n\xe3o mais tenha sede, nem venha aqui tir\xe1-la."},{verse:16,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Go, call thy husband, and come hither.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Vai, chama o teu marido e vem c\xe1."},{verse:17,en:"The woman answered and said, I have no husband. Jesus said unto her, Thou hast well said, I have no husband:",pt:"Respondeu a mulher: N\xe3o tenho marido. Disse-lhe Jesus: Disseste bem: N\xe3o tenho marido;"},{verse:18,en:"For thou hast had five husbands; and he whom thou now hast is not thy husband: in that saidst thou truly.",pt:"porque cinco maridos tiveste, e o que agora tens n\xe3o \xe9 teu marido; isso disseste com verdade."},{verse:19,en:"The woman saith unto him, Sir, I perceive that thou art a prophet.",pt:"Disse-lhe a mulher: Senhor, vejo que \xe9s profeta."},{verse:20,en:"Our fathers worshipped in this mountain; and ye say, that in Jerusalem is the place where men ought to worship.",pt:"Nossos pais adoraram neste monte, e v\xf3s dizeis que em Jerusal\xe9m \xe9 o lugar onde se deve adorar."},{verse:21,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Woman, believe me, the hour cometh, when ye shall neither in this mountain, nor yet at Jerusalem, worship the Father.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Mulher, cr\xea-me, a hora vem, em que nem neste monte, nem em Jerusal\xe9m adorareis o Pai."},{verse:22,en:"Ye worship ye know not what: we know what we worship: for salvation is of the Jews.",pt:"V\xf3s adorais o que n\xe3o conheceis; n\xf3s adoramos o que conhecemos; porque a salva\xe7\xe3o vem dos judeus."},{verse:23,en:"But the hour cometh, and now is, when the true worshippers shall worship the Father in spirit and in truth: for the Father seeketh such to worship him.",pt:"Mas a hora vem, e agora \xe9, em que os verdadeiros adoradores adorar\xe3o o Pai em esp\xedrito e em verdade; porque o Pai procura a tais que assim o adorem."},{verse:24,en:"God is a Spirit: and they that worship him must worship him in spirit and in truth.",pt:"Deus \xe9 Esp\xedrito, e \xe9 necess\xe1rio que os que o adoram o adorem em esp\xedrito e em verdade."},{verse:25,en:"The woman saith unto him, I know that Messias cometh, which is called Christ: when he is come, he will tell us all things.",pt:"Replicou-lhe a mulher: Eu sei que vem o Messias (que se chama o Cristo); quando ele vier h\xe1 de nos anunciar todas as coisas."},{verse:26,en:"Jesus saith unto her, I that speak unto thee am he.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Eu o sou, eu que falo contigo."},{verse:27,en:"And upon this came his disciples, and marvelled that he talked with the woman: yet no man said, What seekest thou? or, Why talkest thou with her?",pt:"E nisto vieram os seus disc\xedpulos, e se admiravam de que estivesse falando com uma mulher; todavia nenhum lhe perguntou: Que \xe9 que procuras? ou: Por que falas com ela?"},{verse:28,en:"The woman then left her waterpot, and went her way into the city, and saith to the men,",pt:"Deixou, pois, a mulher o seu c\xe2ntaro, foi \xe0 cidade e disse \xe0queles homens:"},{verse:29,en:"Come, see a man, which told me all things that ever I did: is not this the Christ?",pt:"Vinde, vede um homem que me disse tudo quanto eu tenho feito; ser\xe1 este, porventura, o Cristo?"},{verse:30,en:"Then they went out of the city, and came unto him.",pt:"Sa\xedram, pois, da cidade e vinham ter com ele."},{verse:31,en:"In the mean while his disciples prayed him, saying, Master, eat.",pt:"Entrementes os seus disc\xedpulos lhe rogavam, dizendo: Rabi, come."},{verse:32,en:"But he said unto them, I have meat to eat that ye know not of.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, respondeu: Uma comida tenho para comer que v\xf3s n\xe3o conheceis."},{verse:33,en:"Therefore said the disciples one to another, Hath any man brought him ought to eat?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os disc\xedpulos diziam uns aos outros: Acaso algu\xe9m lhe trouxe de comer?"},{verse:34,en:"Jesus saith unto them, My meat is to do the will of him that sent me, and to finish his work.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: A minha comida \xe9 fazer a vontade daquele que me enviou, e completar a sua obra."},{verse:35,en:"Say not ye, There are yet four months, and then cometh harvest? behold, I say unto you, Lift up your eyes, and look on the fields; for they are white already to harvest.",pt:"N\xe3o dizeis v\xf3s: Ainda h\xe1 quatro meses at\xe9 que venha a ceifa? Ora, eu vos digo: levantai os vossos olhos, e vede os campos, que j\xe1 est\xe3o brancos para a ceifa."},{verse:36,en:"And he that reapeth receiveth wages, and gathereth fruit unto life eternal: that both he that soweth and he that reapeth may rejoice together.",pt:"Quem ceifa j\xe1 est\xe1 recebendo recompensa e ajuntando fruto para a vida eterna; para que o que semeia e o que ceifa juntamente se regozijem."},{verse:37,en:"And herein is that saying true, One soweth, and another reapeth.",pt:"Porque nisto \xe9 verdadeiro o ditado: Um \xe9 o que semeia, e outro o que ceifa."},{verse:38,en:"I sent you to reap that whereon ye bestowed no labour: other men laboured, and ye are entered into their labours.",pt:"Eu vos enviei a ceifar onde n\xe3o trabalhaste; outros trabalharam, e v\xf3s entrastes no seu trabalho."},{verse:39,en:"And many of the Samaritans of that city believed on him for the saying of the woman, which testified, He told me all that ever I did.",pt:"E muitos samaritanos daquela cidade creram nele, por causa da palavra da mulher, que testificava: Ele me disse tudo quanto tenho feito."},{verse:40,en:"So when the Samaritans were come unto him, they besought him that he would tarry with them: and he abode there two days.",pt:"Indo, pois, ter com ele os samaritanos, rogaram-lhe que ficasse com eles; e ficou ali dois dias."},{verse:41,en:"And many more believed because of his own word;",pt:"E muitos mais creram por causa da palavra dele;"},{verse:42,en:"And said unto the woman, Now we believe, not because of thy saying: for we have heard him ourselves, and know that this is indeed the Christ, the Saviour of the world.",pt:"e diziam \xe0 mulher: J\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9 pela tua palavra que n\xf3s cremos; pois agora n\xf3s mesmos temos ouvido e sabemos que este \xe9 verdadeiramente o Salvador do mundo."},{verse:43,en:"Now after two days he departed thence, and went into Galilee.",pt:"Passados os dois dias partiu dali para a Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:44,en:"For Jesus himself testified, that a prophet hath no honour in his own country.",pt:"Porque Jesus mesmo testificou que um profeta n\xe3o recebe honra na sua pr\xf3pria p\xe1tria."},{verse:45,en:"Then when he was come into Galilee, the Galilaeans received him, having seen all the things that he did at Jerusalem at the feast: for they also went unto the feast.",pt:"Assim, pois, que chegou \xe0 Galil\xe9ia, os galileus o receberam, porque tinham visto todas as coisas que fizera em Jerusal\xe9m na ocasi\xe3o da festa; pois tamb\xe9m eles tinham ido \xe0 festa."},{verse:46,en:"So Jesus came again into Cana of Galilee, where he made the water wine. And there was a certain nobleman, whose son was sick at Capernaum.",pt:"Foi, ent\xe3o, outra vez a Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, onde da \xe1gua fizera vinho. Ora, havia um oficial do rei, cujo filho estava enfermo em Cafarnaum."},{verse:47,en:"When he heard that Jesus was come out of Judaea into Galilee, he went unto him, and besought him that he would come down, and heal his son: for he was at the point of death.",pt:"Quando ele soube que Jesus tinha vindo da Jud\xe9ia para a Galil\xe9ia, foi ter com ele, e lhe rogou que descesse e lhe curasse o filho; pois estava \xe0 morte."},{verse:48,en:"Then said Jesus unto him, Except ye see signs and wonders, ye will not believe.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus lhe disse: Se n\xe3o virdes sinais e prod\xedgios, de modo algum crereis."},{verse:49,en:"The nobleman saith unto him, Sir, come down ere my child die.",pt:"Rogou-lhe o oficial: Senhor, desce antes que meu filho morra."},{verse:50,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Go thy way; thy son liveth. And the man believed the word that Jesus had spoken unto him, and he went his way.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Vai, o teu filho vive. E o homem creu na palavra que Jesus lhe dissera, e partiu."},{verse:51,en:"And as he was now going down, his servants met him, and told him, saying, Thy son liveth.",pt:"Quando ele j\xe1 ia descendo, sa\xedram-lhe ao encontro os seus servos, e lhe disseram que seu filho vivia."},{verse:52,en:"Then enquired he of them the hour when he began to amend. And they said unto him, Yesterday at the seventh hour the fever left him.",pt:"Perguntou-lhes, pois, a que hora come\xe7ara a melhorar; ao que lhe disseram: Ontem \xe0 hora s\xe9tima a febre o deixou."},{verse:53,en:"So the father knew that it was at the same hour, in the which Jesus said unto him, Thy son liveth: and himself believed, and his whole house.",pt:"Reconheceu, pois, o pai ser aquela hora a mesma em que Jesus lhe dissera: O teu filho vive; e creu ele e toda a sua casa."},{verse:54,en:"This is again the second miracle that Jesus did, when he was come out of Judaea into Galilee.",pt:"Foi esta a segunda vez que Jesus, ao voltar da Jud\xe9ia para a Galil\xe9ia, ali operou sinal."}]}}),667,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,h,n){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After this there was a feast of the Jews; and Jesus went up to Jerusalem.",pt:"Depois disso havia uma festa dos judeus; e Jesus subiu a Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:2,en:"Now there is at Jerusalem by the sheep market a pool, which is called in the Hebrew tongue Bethesda, having five porches.",pt:"Ora, em Jerusal\xe9m, pr\xf3ximo \xe0 porta das ovelhas, h\xe1 um tanque, chamado em hebraico Betesda, o qual tem cinco alpendres."},{verse:3,en:"In these lay a great multitude of impotent folk, of blind, halt, withered, waiting for the moving of the water.",pt:"Nestes jazia grande multid\xe3o de enfermos, cegos, mancos e ressicados [esperando o movimento da \xe1gua.]"},{verse:4,en:"For an angel went down at a certain season into the pool, and troubled the water: whosoever then first after the troubling of the water stepped in was made whole of whatsoever disease he had.",pt:"[Porquanto um anjo descia em certo tempo ao tanque, e agitava a \xe1gua; ent\xe3o o primeiro que ali descia, depois do movimento da \xe1gua, sarava de qualquer enfermidade que tivesse.]"},{verse:5,en:"And a certain man was there, which had an infirmity thirty and eight years.",pt:"Achava-se ali um homem que, havia trinta e oito anos, estava enfermo."},{verse:6,en:"When Jesus saw him lie, and knew that he had been now a long time in that case, he saith unto him, Wilt thou be made whole?",pt:"Jesus, vendo-o deitado e sabendo que estava assim havia muito tempo, perguntou-lhe: Queres ficar s\xe3o?"},{verse:7,en:"The impotent man answered him, Sir, I have no man, when the water is troubled, to put me into the pool: but while I am coming, another steppeth down before me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe o enfermo: Senhor, n\xe3o tenho ningu\xe9m que, ao ser agitada a \xe1gua, me ponha no tanque; assim, enquanto eu vou, desce outro antes de mim."},{verse:8,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Rise, take up thy bed, and walk.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Levanta-te, toma o teu leito e anda."},{verse:9,en:"And immediately the man was made whole, and took up his bed, and walked: and on the same day was the sabbath.",pt:"Imediatamente o homem ficou s\xe3o; e, tomando o seu leito, come\xe7ou a andar. Ora, aquele dia era s\xe1bado."},{verse:10,en:"The Jews therefore said unto him that was cured, It is the sabbath day: it is not lawful for thee to carry thy bed.",pt:"Pelo que disseram os judeus ao que fora curado: Hoje \xe9 s\xe1bado, e n\xe3o te \xe9 l\xedcito carregar o leito."},{verse:11,en:"He answered them, He that made me whole, the same said unto me, Take up thy bed, and walk.",pt:"Ele, por\xe9m, lhes respondeu: Aquele que me curou, esse mesmo me disse: Toma o teu leito e anda."},{verse:12,en:"Then asked they him, What man is that which said unto thee, Take up thy bed, and walk?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe, pois: Quem \xe9 o homem que te disse: Toma o teu leito e anda?"},{verse:13,en:"And he that was healed wist not who it was: for Jesus had conveyed himself away, a multitude being in that place.",pt:"Mas o que fora curado n\xe3o sabia quem era; porque Jesus se retirara, por haver muita gente naquele lugar."},{verse:14,en:"Afterward Jesus findeth him in the temple, and said unto him, Behold, thou art made whole: sin no more, lest a worse thing come unto thee.",pt:"Depois Jesus o encontrou no templo, e disse-lhe: Olha, j\xe1 est\xe1s curado; n\xe3o peques mais, para que n\xe3o te suceda coisa pior."},{verse:15,en:"The man departed, and told the Jews that it was Jesus, which had made him whole.",pt:"Retirou-se, ent\xe3o, o homem, e contou aos judeus que era Jesus quem o curara."},{verse:16,en:"And therefore did the Jews persecute Jesus, and sought to slay him, because he had done these things on the sabbath day.",pt:"Por isso os judeus perseguiram a Jesus, porque fazia estas coisas no s\xe1bado."},{verse:17,en:"But Jesus answered them, My Father worketh hitherto, and I work.",pt:"Mas Jesus lhes respondeu: Meu Pai trabalha at\xe9 agora, e eu trabalho tamb\xe9m."},{verse:18,en:"Therefore the Jews sought the more to kill him, because he not only had broken the sabbath, but said also that God was his Father, making himself equal with God.",pt:"Por isso, pois, os judeus ainda mais procuravam mat\xe1-lo, porque n\xe3o s\xf3 violava o s\xe1bado, mas tamb\xe9m dizia que Deus era seu pr\xf3prio Pai, fazendo-se igual a Deus."},{verse:19,en:"Then answered Jesus and said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, The Son can do nothing of himself, but what he seeth the Father do: for what things soever he doeth, these also doeth the Son likewise.",pt:"Disse-lhes, pois, Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que o Filho de si mesmo nada pode fazer, sen\xe3o o que vir o Pai fazer; porque tudo quanto ele faz, o Filho o faz igualmente."},{verse:20,en:"For the Father loveth the Son, and sheweth him all things that himself doeth: and he will shew him greater works than these, that ye may marvel.",pt:"Porque o Pai ama ao Filho, e mostra-lhe tudo o que ele mesmo faz; e maiores obras do que estas lhe mostrar\xe1, para que vos maravilheis."},{verse:21,en:"For as the Father raiseth up the dead, and quickeneth them; even so the Son quickeneth whom he will.",pt:"Pois, assim como o Pai levanta os mortos e lhes d\xe1 vida, assim tamb\xe9m o Filho d\xe1 vida a quem ele quer."},{verse:22,en:"For the Father judgeth no man, but hath committed all judgment unto the Son:",pt:"Porque o Pai a nigu\xe9m julga, mas deu ao Filho todo o julgamento,"},{verse:23,en:"That all men should honour the Son, even as they honour the Father. He that honoureth not the Son honoureth not the Father which hath sent him.",pt:"para que todos honrem o Filho, assim como honram o Pai. Quem n\xe3o honra o Filho, n\xe3o honra o Pai que o enviou."},{verse:24,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that heareth my word, and believeth on him that sent me, hath everlasting life, and shall not come into condemnation; but is passed from death unto life.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que quem ouve a minha palavra, e cr\xea naquele que me enviou, tem a vida eterna e n\xe3o entra em ju\xedzo, mas j\xe1 passou da morte para a vida."},{verse:25,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, The hour is coming, and now is, when the dead shall hear the voice of the Son of God: and they that hear shall live.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que vem a hora, e agora \xe9, em que os mortos ouvir\xe3o a voz do Filho de Deus, e os que a ouvirem viver\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"For as the Father hath life in himself; so hath he given to the Son to have life in himself;",pt:"Pois assim como o Pai tem vida em si mesmo, assim tamb\xe9m deu ao Filho ter vida em si mesmos;"},{verse:27,en:"And hath given him authority to execute judgment also, because he is the Son of man.",pt:"e deu-lhe autoridade para julgar, porque \xe9 o Filho do homem."},{verse:28,en:"Marvel not at this: for the hour is coming, in the which all that are in the graves shall hear his voice,",pt:"N\xe3o vos admireis disso, porque vem a hora em que todos os que est\xe3o nos sepulcros ouvir\xe3o a sua voz e sair\xe3o:"},{verse:29,en:"And shall come forth; they that have done good, unto the resurrection of life; and they that have done evil, unto the resurrection of damnation.",pt:"os que tiverem feito o bem, para a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o da vida, e os que tiverem praticado o mal, para a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o do ju\xedzo."},{verse:30,en:"I can of mine own self do nothing: as I hear, I judge: and my judgment is just; because I seek not mine own will, but the will of the Father which hath sent me.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o posso de mim mesmo fazer coisa alguma; como ou\xe7o, assim julgo; e o meu ju\xedzo \xe9 justo, porque n\xe3o procuro a minha vontade, mas a vontade daquele que me enviou."},{verse:31,en:"If I bear witness of myself, my witness is not true.",pt:"Se eu der testemunho de mim mesmo, o meu testemunho n\xe3o \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:32,en:"There is another that beareth witness of me; and I know that the witness which he witnesseth of me is true.",pt:"Outro \xe9 quem d\xe1 testemunho de mim; e sei que o testemunho que ele d\xe1 de mim \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:33,en:"Ye sent unto John, and he bare witness unto the truth.",pt:"V\xf3s mandastes mensageiros a Jo\xe3o, e ele deu testemunho da verdade;"},{verse:34,en:"But I receive not testimony from man: but these things I say, that ye might be saved.",pt:"eu, por\xe9m, n\xe3o recebo testemunho de homem; mas digo isto para que sejais salvos."},{verse:35,en:"He was a burning and a shining light: and ye were willing for a season to rejoice in his light.",pt:"Ele era a l\xe2mpada que ardia e alumiava; e v\xf3s quisestes alegrar-vos por um pouco de tempo com a sua luz."},{verse:36,en:"But I have greater witness than that of John: for the works which the Father hath given me to finish, the same works that I do, bear witness of me, that the Father hath sent me.",pt:"Mas o testemunho que eu tenho \xe9 maior do que o de Jo\xe3o; porque as obras que o Pai me deu para realizar, as mesmas obras que fa\xe7o d\xe3o testemunho de mim que o Pai me enviou."},{verse:37,en:"And the Father himself, which hath sent me, hath borne witness of me. Ye have neither heard his voice at any time, nor seen his shape.",pt:"E o Pai que me enviou, ele mesmo tem dado testemunho de mim. V\xf3s nunca ouvistes a sua voz, nem vistes a sua forma;"},{verse:38,en:"And ye have not his word abiding in you: for whom he hath sent, him ye believe not.",pt:"e a sua palavra n\xe3o permanece em v\xf3s; porque n\xe3o credes naquele que ele enviou."},{verse:39,en:"Search the scriptures; for in them ye think ye have eternal life: and they are they which testify of me.",pt:"Examinais as Escrituras, porque julgais ter nelas a vida eterna; e s\xe3o elas que d\xe3o testemunho de mim;"},{verse:40,en:"And ye will not come to me, that ye might have life.",pt:"mas n\xe3o quereis vir a mim para terdes vida!"},{verse:41,en:"I receive not honour from men.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o recebo gl\xf3ria da parte dos homens;"},{verse:42,en:"But I know you, that ye have not the love of God in you.",pt:"mas bem vos conhe\xe7o, que n\xe3o tendes em v\xf3s o amor de Deus."},{verse:43,en:"I am come in my Father\u2019s name, and ye receive me not: if another shall come in his own name, him ye will receive.",pt:"Eu vim em nome de meu Pai, e n\xe3o me recebeis; se outro vier em seu pr\xf3prio nome, a esse recebereis."},{verse:44,en:"How can ye believe, which receive honour one of another, and seek not the honour that cometh from God only?",pt:"Como podeis crer, v\xf3s que recebeis gl\xf3ria uns dos outros e n\xe3o buscais a gl\xf3ria que vem do \xfanico Deus?"},{verse:45,en:"Do not think that I will accuse you to the Father: there is one that accuseth you, even Moses, in whom ye trust.",pt:"N\xe3o penseis que eu vos hei de acusar perante o Pai. H\xe1 um que vos acusa, Mois\xe9s, em quem v\xf3s esperais."},{verse:46,en:"For had ye believed Moses, ye would have believed me: for he wrote of me.",pt:"Pois se cr\xeasseis em Mois\xe9s, crer\xedeis em mim; porque de mim ele escreveu."},{verse:47,en:"But if ye believe not his writings, how shall ye believe my words?",pt:"Mas, se n\xe3o credes nos escritos, como crereis nas minhas palavras?"}]}}),668,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,i,n){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things Jesus went over the sea of Galilee, which is the sea of Tiberias.",pt:"Depois disto partiu Jesus para o outro lado do mar da Galil\xe9ia, tamb\xe9m chamado de Tiber\xedades."},{verse:2,en:"And a great multitude followed him, because they saw his miracles which he did on them that were diseased.",pt:"E seguia-o uma grande multid\xe3o, porque via os sinais que operava sobre os enfermos."},{verse:3,en:"And Jesus went up into a mountain, and there he sat with his disciples.",pt:"Subiu, pois, Jesus ao monte e sentou-se ali com seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:4,en:"And the passover, a feast of the Jews, was nigh.",pt:"Ora, a p\xe1scoa, a festa dos judeus, estava pr\xf3xima."},{verse:5,en:"When Jesus then lifted up his eyes, and saw a great company come unto him, he saith unto Philip, Whence shall we buy bread, that these may eat?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus, levantando os olhos, e vendo que uma grande multid\xe3o vinha ter com ele, disse a Felipe: Onde compraremos p\xe3o, para estes comerem?"},{verse:6,en:"And this he said to prove him: for he himself knew what he would do.",pt:"Mas dizia isto para o experimentar; pois ele bem sabia o que ia fazer."},{verse:7,en:"Philip answered him, Two hundred pennyworth of bread is not sufficient for them, that every one of them may take a little.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Felipe: Duzentos den\xe1rios de p\xe3o n\xe3o lhes bastam, para que cada um receba um pouco."},{verse:8,en:"One of his disciples, Andrew, Simon Peter\u2019s brother, saith unto him,",pt:"Ao que lhe disse um dos seus disc\xedpulos, Andr\xe9, irm\xe3o de Sim\xe3o Pedro:"},{verse:9,en:"There is a lad here, which hath five barley loaves, and two small fishes: but what are they among so many?",pt:"Est\xe1 aqui um rapaz que tem cinco p\xe3es de cevada e dois peixinhos; mas que \xe9 isto para tantos?"},{verse:10,en:"And Jesus said, Make the men sit down. Now there was much grass in the place. So the men sat down, in number about five thousand.",pt:"Disse Jesus: Fazei reclinar-se o povo. Ora, naquele lugar havia muita relva. Reclinaram-se a\xed, pois, os homens em n\xfamero de quase cinco mil."},{verse:11,en:"And Jesus took the loaves; and when he had given thanks, he distributed to the disciples, and the disciples to them that were set down; and likewise of the fishes as much as they would.",pt:"Jesus, ent\xe3o, tomou os p\xe3es e, havendo dado gra\xe7as, repartiu-os pelos que estavam reclinados; e de igual modo os peixes, quanto eles queriam."},{verse:12,en:"When they were filled, he said unto his disciples, Gather up the fragments that remain, that nothing be lost.",pt:"E quando estavam saciados, disse aos seus disc\xedpulos: Recolhei os peda\xe7os que sobejaram, para que nada se perca."},{verse:13,en:"Therefore they gathered them together, and filled twelve baskets with the fragments of the five barley loaves, which remained over and above unto them that had eaten.",pt:"Recolheram-nos, pois e encheram doze cestos de peda\xe7os dos cinco p\xe3es de cevada, que sobejaram aos que haviam comido."},{verse:14,en:"Then those men, when they had seen the miracle that Jesus did, said, This is of a truth that prophet that should come into the world.",pt:"Vendo, pois, aqueles homens o sinal que Jesus operara, diziam: este \xe9 verdadeiramente o profeta que havia de vir ao mundo."},{verse:15,en:"When Jesus therefore perceived that they would come and take him by force, to make him a king, he departed again into a mountain himself alone.",pt:"Percebendo, pois, Jesus que estavam prestes a vir e lev\xe1-lo \xe0 for\xe7a para o fazerem rei, tornou a retirar-se para o monte, ele sozinho."},{verse:16,en:"And when even was now come, his disciples went down unto the sea,",pt:"Ao cair da tarde, desceram os seus disc\xedpulos ao mar;"},{verse:17,en:"And entered into a ship, and went over the sea toward Capernaum. And it was now dark, and Jesus was not come to them.",pt:"e, entrando num barco, atravessavam o mar em dire\xe7\xe3o a Cafarnaum; enquanto isso, escurecera e Jesus ainda n\xe3o tinha vindo ter com eles;"},{verse:18,en:"And the sea arose by reason of a great wind that blew.",pt:"ademais, o mar se empolava, porque soprava forte vento."},{verse:19,en:"So when they had rowed about five and twenty or thirty furlongs, they see Jesus walking on the sea, and drawing nigh unto the ship: and they were afraid.",pt:"Tendo, pois, remado uns vinte e cinco ou trinta est\xe1dios, viram a Jesus andando sobre o mar e aproximando-se do barco; e ficaram atemorizados."},{verse:20,en:"But he saith unto them, It is I; be not afraid.",pt:"Mas ele lhes disse: Sou eu; n\xe3o temais."},{verse:21,en:"Then they willingly received him into the ship: and immediately the ship was at the land whither they went.",pt:"Ent\xe3o eles de boa mente o receberam no barco; e logo o barco chegou \xe0 terra para onde iam."},{verse:22,en:"The day following, when the people which stood on the other side of the sea saw that there was none other boat there, save that one whereinto his disciples were entered, and that Jesus went not with his disciples into the boat, but that his disciples were gone away alone;",pt:"No dia seguinte, a multid\xe3o que ficara no outro lado do mar, sabendo que n\xe3o houvera ali sen\xe3o um barquinho, e que Jesus n\xe3o embarcara nele com seus disc\xedpulos, mas que estes tinham ido s\xf3s"},{verse:23,en:"(Howbeit there came other boats from Tiberias nigh unto the place where they did eat bread, after that the Lord had given thanks:)",pt:"(contudo, outros barquinhos haviam chegado a Tiber\xedades para perto do lugar onde comeram o p\xe3o, havendo o Senhor dado gra\xe7as);"},{verse:24,en:"When the people therefore saw that Jesus was not there, neither his disciples, they also took shipping, and came to Capernaum, seeking for Jesus.",pt:"quando, pois, viram que Jesus n\xe3o estava ali nem os seus disc\xedpulos, entraram eles tamb\xe9m nos barcos, e foram a Cafarnaum, em busca de Jesus."},{verse:25,en:"And when they had found him on the other side of the sea, they said unto him, Rabbi, when camest thou hither?",pt:"E, achando-o no outro lado do mar, perguntaram-lhe: Rabi, quando chegaste aqui?"},{verse:26,en:"Jesus answered them and said, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Ye seek me, not because ye saw the miracles, but because ye did eat of the loaves, and were filled.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que me buscais, n\xe3o porque vistes sinais, mas porque comestes do p\xe3o e vos saciastes."},{verse:27,en:"Labour not for the meat which perisheth, but for that meat which endureth unto everlasting life, which the Son of man shall give unto you: for him hath God the Father sealed.",pt:"Trabalhai, n\xe3o pela comida que perece, mas pela comida que permanece para a vida eterna, a qual o Filho do homem vos dar\xe1; pois neste, Deus, o Pai, imprimiu o seu selo."},{verse:28,en:"Then said they unto him, What shall we do, that we might work the works of God?",pt:"Pergutaram-lhe, pois: Que havemos de fazer para praticarmos as obras de Deus?"},{verse:29,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, This is the work of God, that ye believe on him whom he hath sent.",pt:"Jesus lhes respondeu: A obra de Deus \xe9 esta: Que creiais naquele que ele enviou."},{verse:30,en:"They said therefore unto him, What sign shewest thou then, that we may see, and believe thee? what dost thou work?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe, ent\xe3o: Que sinal, pois, fazes tu, para que o vejamos e te creiamos? Que operas tu?"},{verse:31,en:"Our fathers did eat manna in the desert; as it is written, He gave them bread from heaven to eat.",pt:"Nossos pais comeram o man\xe1 no deserto, como est\xe1 escrito: Do c\xe9u deu-lhes p\xe3o a comer."},{verse:32,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Moses gave you not that bread from heaven; but my Father giveth you the true bread from heaven.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: N\xe3o foi Mois\xe9s que vos deu o p\xe3o do c\xe9u; mas meu Pai vos d\xe1 o verdadeiro p\xe3o do c\xe9u."},{verse:33,en:"For the bread of God is he which cometh down from heaven, and giveth life unto the world.",pt:"Porque o p\xe3o de Deus \xe9 aquele que desce do c\xe9u e d\xe1 vida ao mundo."},{verse:34,en:"Then said they unto him, Lord, evermore give us this bread.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois: Senhor, d\xe1-nos sempre desse p\xe3o."},{verse:35,en:"And Jesus said unto them, I am the bread of life: he that cometh to me shall never hunger; and he that believeth on me shall never thirst.",pt:"Declarou-lhes Jesus. Eu sou o p\xe3o da vida; aquele que vem a mim, de modo algum ter\xe1 fome, e quem cr\xea em mim jamais tar\xe1 sede."},{verse:36,en:"But I said unto you, That ye also have seen me, and believe not.",pt:"Mas como j\xe1 vos disse, v\xf3s me tendes visto, e contudo n\xe3o credes."},{verse:37,en:"All that the Father giveth me shall come to me; and him that cometh to me I will in no wise cast out.",pt:"Todo o que o Pai me d\xe1 vir\xe1 a mim; e o que vem a mim de maneira nenhuma o lan\xe7arei fora."},{verse:38,en:"For I came down from heaven, not to do mine own will, but the will of him that sent me.",pt:"Porque eu desci do c\xe9u, n\xe3o para fazer a minha vontade, mas a vontade daquele que me enviou."},{verse:39,en:"And this is the Father\u2019s will which hath sent me, that of all which he hath given me I should lose nothing, but should raise it up again at the last day.",pt:"E a vontade do que me enviou \xe9 esta: Que eu n\xe3o perca nenhum de todos aqueles que me deu, mas que eu o ressuscite no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:40,en:"And this is the will of him that sent me, that every one which seeth the Son, and believeth on him, may have everlasting life: and I will raise him up at the last day.",pt:"Porquanto esta \xe9 a vontade de meu Pai: Que todo aquele que v\xea o Filho e cr\xea nele, tenha a vida eterna; e eu o ressuscitarei no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:41,en:"The Jews then murmured at him, because he said, I am the bread which came down from heaven.",pt:"Murmuravam, pois, dele os judeus, porque dissera: Eu sou o p\xe3o que desceu do c\xe9u;"},{verse:42,en:"And they said, Is not this Jesus, the son of Joseph, whose father and mother we know? how is it then that he saith, I came down from heaven?",pt:"e perguntavam: N\xe3o \xe9 Jesus, o filho de Jos\xe9, cujo pai e m\xe3e n\xf3s conhecemos? Como, pois, diz agora: Desci do c\xe9u?"},{verse:43,en:"Jesus therefore answered and said unto them, Murmur not among yourselves.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: N\xe3o murmureis entre v\xf3s."},{verse:44,en:"No man can come to me, except the Father which hath sent me draw him: and I will raise him up at the last day.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m pode vir a mim, se o Pai que me enviou n\xe3o o trouxer; e eu o ressuscitarei no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:45,en:"It is written in the prophets, And they shall be all taught of God. Every man therefore that hath heard, and hath learned of the Father, cometh unto me.",pt:"Est\xe1 escrito nos profetas: E ser\xe3o todos ensinados por Deus. Portanto todo aquele que do Pai ouviu e aprendeu vem a mim."},{verse:46,en:"Not that any man hath seen the Father, save he which is of God, he hath seen the Father.",pt:"N\xe3o que algu\xe9m tenha visto o Pai, sen\xe3o aquele que \xe9 vindo de Deus; s\xf3 ele tem visto o Pai."},{verse:47,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that believeth on me hath everlasting life.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Aquele que cr\xea tem a vida eterna."},{verse:48,en:"I am that bread of life.",pt:"Eu sou o p\xe3o da vida."},{verse:49,en:"Your fathers did eat manna in the wilderness, and are dead.",pt:"Vossos pais comeram o man\xe1 no deserto e morreram."},{verse:50,en:"This is the bread which cometh down from heaven, that a man may eat thereof, and not die.",pt:"Este \xe9 o p\xe3o que desce do c\xe9u, para que o que dele comer n\xe3o morra."},{verse:51,en:"I am the living bread which came down from heaven: if any man eat of this bread, he shall live for ever: and the bread that I will give is my flesh, which I will give for the life of the world.",pt:"Eu sou o p\xe3o vivo que desceu do c\xe9u; se algu\xe9m comer deste p\xe3o, viver\xe1 para sempre; e o p\xe3o que eu darei pela vida do mundo \xe9 a minha carne."},{verse:52,en:"The Jews therefore strove among themselves, saying, How can this man give us his flesh to eat?",pt:"Disputavam, pois, os judeus entre si, dizendo: Como pode este dar-nos a sua carne a comer?"},{verse:53,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Except ye eat the flesh of the Son of man, and drink his blood, ye have no life in you.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Se n\xe3o comerdes a carne do Filho do homem, e n\xe3o beberdes o seu sangue, n\xe3o tereis vida em v\xf3s mesmos."},{verse:54,en:"Whoso eateth my flesh, and drinketh my blood, hath eternal life; and I will raise him up at the last day.",pt:"Quem come a minha carne e bebe o meu sangue tem a vida eterna; e eu o ressuscitarei no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:55,en:"For my flesh is meat indeed, and my blood is drink indeed.",pt:"Porque a minha carne verdadeiramente \xe9 comida, e o meu sangue verdadeiramente \xe9 bebida."},{verse:56,en:"He that eateth my flesh, and drinketh my blood, dwelleth in me, and I in him.",pt:"Quem come a minha carne e bebe o meu sangue permanece em mim e eu nele."},{verse:57,en:"As the living Father hath sent me, and I live by the Father: so he that eateth me, even he shall live by me.",pt:"Assim como o Pai, que vive, me enviou, e eu vivo pelo Pai, assim, quem de mim se alimenta, tamb\xe9m viver\xe1 por mim."},{verse:58,en:"This is that bread which came down from heaven: not as your fathers did eat manna, and are dead: he that eateth of this bread shall live for ever.",pt:"Este \xe9 o p\xe3o que desceu do c\xe9u; n\xe3o \xe9 como o caso de vossos pais, que comeram o man\xe1 e morreram; quem comer este p\xe3o viver\xe1 para sempre."},{verse:59,en:"These things said he in the synagogue, as he taught in Capernaum.",pt:"Estas coisas falou Jesus quando ensinava na sinagoga em Cafarnaum."},{verse:60,en:"Many therefore of his disciples, when they had heard this, said, This is an hard saying; who can hear it?",pt:"Muitos, pois, dos seus disc\xedpulos, ouvindo isto, disseram: Duro \xe9 este discurso; quem o pode ouvir?"},{verse:61,en:"When Jesus knew in himself that his disciples murmured at it, he said unto them, Doth this offend you?",pt:"Mas, sabendo Jesus em si mesmo que murmuravam disto os seus disc\xedpulos, disse-lhes: Isto vos escandaliza?"},{verse:62,en:"What and if ye shall see the Son of man ascend up where he was before?",pt:"Que seria, pois, se v\xedsseis subir o Filho do homem para onde primeiro estava?"},{verse:63,en:"It is the spirit that quickeneth; the flesh profiteth nothing: the words that I speak unto you, they are spirit, and they are life.",pt:"O esp\xedrito \xe9 o que vivifica, a carne para nada aproveita; as palavras que eu vos tenho dito s\xe3o esp\xedrito e s\xe3o vida."},{verse:64,en:"But there are some of you that believe not. For Jesus knew from the beginning who they were that believed not, and who should betray him.",pt:"Mas h\xe1 alguns de v\xf3s que n\xe3o cr\xeaem. Pois Jesus sabia, desde o princ\xedpio, quem eram os que n\xe3o criam, e quem era o que o havia de entregar."},{verse:65,en:"And he said, Therefore said I unto you, that no man can come unto me, except it were given unto him of my Father.",pt:"E continuou: Por isso vos disse que ningu\xe9m pode vir a mim, se pelo Pai lhe n\xe3o for concedido."},{verse:66,en:"From that time many of his disciples went back, and walked no more with him.",pt:"Por causa disso muitos dos seus disc\xedpulos voltaram para tr\xe1s e n\xe3o andaram mais com ele."},{verse:67,en:"Then said Jesus unto the twelve, Will ye also go away?",pt:"Perguntou ent\xe3o Jesus aos doze: Quereis v\xf3s tamb\xe9m retirar-vos?"},{verse:68,en:"Then Simon Peter answered him, Lord, to whom shall we go? thou hast the words of eternal life.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Sim\xe3o Pedro: Senhor, para quem iremos n\xf3s? Tu tens as palavras da vida eterna."},{verse:69,en:"And we believe and are sure that thou art that Christ, the Son of the living God.",pt:"E n\xf3s j\xe1 temos crido e bem sabemos que tu \xe9s o Santo de Deus."},{verse:70,en:"Jesus answered them, Have not I chosen you twelve, and one of you is a devil?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: N\xe3o vos escolhi a v\xf3s os doze? Contudo um de v\xf3s \xe9 o diabo."},{verse:71,en:"He spake of Judas Iscariot the son of Simon: for he it was that should betray him, being one of the twelve.",pt:"Referia-se a Judas, filho de Sim\xe3o Iscariotes; porque era ele o que o havia de entregar, sendo um dos doze."}]}}),669,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things Jesus walked in Galilee: for he would not walk in Jewry, because the Jews sought to kill him.",pt:"Depois disto andava Jesus pela Galil\xe9ia; pois n\xe3o queria andar pela Jud\xe9ia, porque os judeus procuravam mat\xe1-lo."},{verse:2,en:"Now the Jews\u2019 feast of tabernacles was at hand.",pt:"Ora, estava pr\xf3xima a festa dos judeus, a dos tabern\xe1culos."},{verse:3,en:"His brethren therefore said unto him, Depart hence, and go into Judaea, that thy disciples also may see the works that thou doest.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, ent\xe3o, seus irm\xe3os: Retira-te daqui e vai para a Jud\xe9ia, para que tamb\xe9m os teus disc\xedpulos vejam as obras que fazes."},{verse:4,en:"For there is no man that doeth any thing in secret, and he himself seeketh to be known openly. If thou do these things, shew thyself to the world.",pt:"Porque ningu\xe9m faz coisa alguma em oculto, quando procura ser conhecido. J\xe1 que fazes estas coisas, manifesta-te ao mundo."},{verse:5,en:"For neither did his brethren believe in him.",pt:"Pois nem seus irm\xe3os criam nele."},{verse:6,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, My time is not yet come: but your time is alway ready.",pt:"Disse-lhes, ent\xe3o, Jesus: Ainda n\xe3o \xe9 chegado o meu tempo; mas o vosso tempo sempre est\xe1 presente."},{verse:7,en:"The world cannot hate you; but me it hateth, because I testify of it, that the works thereof are evil.",pt:"O mundo n\xe3o vos pode odiar; mas ele me odeia a mim, porquanto dele testifico que as suas obras s\xe3o m\xe1s."},{verse:8,en:"Go ye up unto this feast: I go not up yet unto this feast; for my time is not yet full come.",pt:"Subi v\xf3s \xe0 festa; eu n\xe3o subo ainda a esta festa, porque ainda n\xe3o \xe9 chegado o meu tempo."},{verse:9,en:"When he had said these words unto them, he abode still in Galilee.",pt:"E, havendo-lhes dito isto, ficou na Galil\xe9ia."},{verse:10,en:"But when his brethren were gone up, then went he also up unto the feast, not openly, but as it were in secret.",pt:"Mas quando seus irm\xe3os j\xe1 tinham subido \xe0 festa, ent\xe3o subiu ele tamb\xe9m, n\xe3o publicamente, mas como em secreto."},{verse:11,en:"Then the Jews sought him at the feast, and said, Where is he?",pt:"Ora, os judeus o procuravam na festa, e perguntavam: Onde est\xe1 ele?"},{verse:12,en:"And there was much murmuring among the people concerning him: for some said, He is a good man: others said, Nay; but he deceiveth the people.",pt:"E era grande a murmura\xe7\xe3o a respeito dele entre as multid\xf5es. Diziam alguns: Ele \xe9 bom. Mas outros diziam: n\xe3o, antes engana o povo."},{verse:13,en:"Howbeit no man spake openly of him for fear of the Jews.",pt:"Todavia ningu\xe9m falava dele abertamente, por medo dos judeus."},{verse:14,en:"Now about the midst of the feast Jesus went up into the temple, and taught.",pt:"Estando, pois, a festa j\xe1 em meio, subiu Jesus ao templo e come\xe7ou a ensinar."},{verse:15,en:"And the Jews marvelled, saying, How knoweth this man letters, having never learned?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os judeus se admiravam, dizendo: Como sabe este letras, sem ter estudado?"},{verse:16,en:"Jesus answered them, and said, My doctrine is not mine, but his that sent me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: A minha doutrina n\xe3o \xe9 minha, mas daquele que me enviou."},{verse:17,en:"If any man will do his will, he shall know of the doctrine, whether it be of God, or whether I speak of myself.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m quiser fazer a vontade de Deus, h\xe1 de saber se a doutrina \xe9 dele, ou se eu falo por mim mesmo."},{verse:18,en:"He that speaketh of himself seeketh his own glory: but he that seeketh his glory that sent him, the same is true, and no unrighteousness is in him.",pt:"Quem fala por si mesmo busca a sua pr\xf3pria gl\xf3ria; mas o que busca a gl\xf3ria daquele que o enviou, esse \xe9 verdadeiro, e n\xe3o h\xe1 nele injusti\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"Did not Moses give you the law, and yet none of you keepeth the law? Why go ye about to kill me?",pt:"N\xe3o vos deu Mois\xe9s a lei? no entanto nenhum de v\xf3s cumpre a lei. Por que procurais matar-me?"},{verse:20,en:"The people answered and said, Thou hast a devil: who goeth about to kill thee?",pt:"Respondeu a multid\xe3o: Tens dem\xf4nio; quem procura matar-te?"},{verse:21,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, I have done one work, and ye all marvel.",pt:"Replicou-lhes Jesus: Uma s\xf3 obra fiz, e todos v\xf3s admirais por causa disto."},{verse:22,en:"Moses therefore gave unto you circumcision; (not because it is of Moses, but of the fathers;) and ye on the sabbath day circumcise a man.",pt:"Mois\xe9s vos ordenou a circuncis\xe3o (n\xe3o que fosse de Mois\xe9s, mas dos pais), e no s\xe1bado circuncidais um homem."},{verse:23,en:"If a man on the sabbath day receive circumcision, that the law of Moses should not be broken; are ye angry at me, because I have made a man every whit whole on the sabbath day?",pt:"Ora, se um homem recebe a circuncis\xe3o no s\xe1bado, para que a lei de Mois\xe9s n\xe3o seja violada, como vos indignais contra mim, porque no s\xe1bado tornei um homem inteiramente s\xe3o?"},{verse:24,en:"Judge not according to the appearance, but judge righteous judgment.",pt:"N\xe3o julgueis pela apar\xeancia mas julgai segundo o reto ju\xedzo."},{verse:25,en:"Then said some of them of Jerusalem, Is not this he, whom they seek to kill?",pt:"Diziam ent\xe3o alguns dos de Jerusal\xe9m: N\xe3o \xe9 este o que procuram matar?"},{verse:26,en:"But, lo, he speaketh boldly, and they say nothing unto him. Do the rulers know indeed that this is the very Christ?",pt:"E eis que ele est\xe1 falando abertamente, e nada lhe dizem. Ser\xe1 que as autoridades realmente o reconhecem como o Cristo?"},{verse:27,en:"Howbeit we know this man whence he is: but when Christ cometh, no man knoweth whence he is.",pt:"Entretanto sabemos donde este \xe9; mas, quando vier o Cristo, ningu\xe9m saber\xe1 donde ele \xe9."},{verse:28,en:"Then cried Jesus in the temple as he taught, saying, Ye both know me, and ye know whence I am: and I am not come of myself, but he that sent me is true, whom ye know not.",pt:"Jesus, pois, levantou a voz no templo e ensinava, dizendo: Sim, v\xf3s me conheceis, e sabeis donde sou; contudo eu n\xe3o vim de mim mesmo, mas aquele que me enviou \xe9 verdadeiro, o qual v\xf3s n\xe3o conheceis."},{verse:29,en:"But I know him: for I am from him, and he hath sent me.",pt:"Mas eu o conhe\xe7o, porque dele venho, e ele me enviou."},{verse:30,en:"Then they sought to take him: but no man laid hands on him, because his hour was not yet come.",pt:"Procuravam, pois, prend\xea-lo; mas ningu\xe9m lhe deitou as m\xe3os, porque ainda n\xe3o era chegada a sua hora."},{verse:31,en:"And many of the people believed on him, and said, When Christ cometh, will he do more miracles than these which this man hath done?",pt:"Contudo muitos da multid\xe3o creram nele, e diziam: Ser\xe1 que o Cristo, quando vier, far\xe1 mais sinais do que este tem feito?"},{verse:32,en:"The Pharisees heard that the people murmured such things concerning him; and the Pharisees and the chief priests sent officers to take him.",pt:"Os fariseus ouviram a multid\xe3o murmurar estas coisas a respeito dele; e os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus mandaram guardas para o prenderem."},{verse:33,en:"Then said Jesus unto them, Yet a little while am I with you, and then I go unto him that sent me.",pt:"Disse, pois, Jesus: Ainda um pouco de tempo estou convosco, e depois vou para aquele que me enviou."},{verse:34,en:"Ye shall seek me, and shall not find me: and where I am, thither ye cannot come.",pt:"V\xf3s me buscareis, e n\xe3o me achareis; e onde eu estou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis vir."},{verse:35,en:"Then said the Jews among themselves, Whither will he go, that we shall not find him? will he go unto the dispersed among the Gentiles, and teach the Gentiles?",pt:"Disseram, pois, os judeus uns aos outros: Para onde ir\xe1 ele, que n\xe3o o acharemos? Ir\xe1, porventura, \xe0 Dispers\xe3o entre os gregos, e ensinar\xe1 os gregos?"},{verse:36,en:"What manner of saying is this that he said, Ye shall seek me, and shall not find me: and where I am, thither ye cannot come?",pt:"Que palavra \xe9 esta que disse: Buscar-me-eis, e n\xe3o me achareis; e, Onde eu estou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis vir?"},{verse:37,en:"In the last day, that great day of the feast, Jesus stood and cried, saying, If any man thirst, let him come unto me, and drink.",pt:"Ora, no seu \xfaltimo dia, o grande dia da festa, Jesus p\xf4s-se em p\xe9 e clamou, dizendo: Se algu\xe9m tem sede, venha a mim e beba."},{verse:38,en:"He that believeth on me, as the scripture hath said, out of his belly shall flow rivers of living water.",pt:"Quem cr\xea em mim, como diz a Escritura, do seu interior correr\xe3o rios de \xe1gua viva."},{verse:39,en:"(But this spake he of the Spirit, which they that believe on him should receive: for the Holy Ghost was not yet given; because that Jesus was not yet glorified.)",pt:"Ora, isto ele disse a respeito do Esp\xedrito que haviam de receber os que nele cressem; pois o Esp\xedrito ainda n\xe3o fora dado, porque Jesus ainda n\xe3o tinha sido glorificado."},{verse:40,en:"Many of the people therefore, when they heard this saying, said, Of a truth this is the Prophet.",pt:"Ent\xe3o alguns dentre o povo, ouvindo essas palavras, diziam: Verdadeiramente este \xe9 o profeta."},{verse:41,en:"Others said, This is the Christ. But some said, Shall Christ come out of Galilee?",pt:"Outros diziam: Este \xe9 o Cristo; mas outros replicavam: Vem, pois, o Cristo da Galil\xe9ia?"},{verse:42,en:"Hath not the scripture said, That Christ cometh of the seed of David, and out of the town of Bethlehem, where David was?",pt:"N\xe3o diz a Escritura que o Cristo vem da descend\xeancia de Davi, e de Bel\xe9m, a aldeia donde era Davi?"},{verse:43,en:"So there was a division among the people because of him.",pt:"Assim houve uma dissens\xe3o entre o povo por causa dele."},{verse:44,en:"And some of them would have taken him; but no man laid hands on him.",pt:"Alguns deles queriam prend\xea-lo; mas ningu\xe9m lhe p\xf4s as m\xe3os."},{verse:45,en:"Then came the officers to the chief priests and Pharisees; and they said unto them, Why have ye not brought him?",pt:"Os guardas, pois, foram ter com os principais dos sacerdotes e fariseus, e estes lhes perguntaram: Por que n\xe3o o trouxestes?"},{verse:46,en:"The officers answered, Never man spake like this man.",pt:"Responderam os guardas: Nunca homem algum falou assim como este homem."},{verse:47,en:"Then answered them the Pharisees, Are ye also deceived?",pt:"Replicaram-lhes, pois, os fariseus: Tamb\xe9m v\xf3s fostes enganados?"},{verse:48,en:"Have any of the rulers or of the Pharisees believed on him?",pt:"Creu nele porventura alguma das autoridades, ou algu\xe9m dentre os fariseus?"},{verse:49,en:"But this people who knoweth not the law are cursed.",pt:"Mas esta multid\xe3o, que n\xe3o sabe a lei, \xe9 maldita."},{verse:50,en:"Nicodemus saith unto them, (he that came to Jesus by night, being one of them,)",pt:"Nicodemos, um deles, que antes fora ter com Jesus, perguntou-lhes:"},{verse:51,en:"Doth our law judge any man, before it hear him, and know what he doeth?",pt:"A nossa lei, porventura, julga um homem sem primeiro ouvi-lo e ter conhecimento do que ele faz?"},{verse:52,en:"They answered and said unto him, Art thou also of Galilee? Search, and look: for out of Galilee ariseth no prophet.",pt:"Responderam-lhe eles: \xc9s tu tamb\xe9m da Galil\xe9ia? Examina e v\xea que da Galil\xe9ia n\xe3o surge profeta."},{verse:53,en:"And every man went unto his own house.",pt:"[E cada um foi para sua casa."}]}}),670,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Jesus went unto the mount of Olives.",pt:"Mas Jesus foi para o Monte das Oliveiras."},{verse:2,en:"And early in the morning he came again into the temple, and all the people came unto him; and he sat down, and taught them.",pt:"Pela manh\xe3 cedo voltou ao templo, e todo o povo vinha ter com ele; e Jesus, sentando-se o ensinava."},{verse:3,en:"And the scribes and Pharisees brought unto him a woman taken in adultery; and when they had set her in the midst,",pt:"Ent\xe3o os escribas e fariseus trouxeram-lhe uma mulher apanhada em adult\xe9rio; e pondo-a no meio,"},{verse:4,en:"They say unto him, Master, this woman was taken in adultery, in the very act.",pt:"disseram-lhe: Mestre, esta mulher foi apanhada em flagrante adult\xe9rio."},{verse:5,en:"Now Moses in the law commanded us, that such should be stoned: but what sayest thou?",pt:"Ora, Mois\xe9s nos ordena na lei que as tais sejam apedrejadas. Tu, pois, que dizes?"},{verse:6,en:"This they said, tempting him, that they might have to accuse him. But Jesus stooped down, and with his finger wrote on the ground, as though he heard them not.",pt:"Isto diziam eles, tentando-o, para terem de que o acusar. Jesus, por\xe9m, inclinando-se, come\xe7ou a escrever no ch\xe3o com o dedo."},{verse:7,en:"So when they continued asking him, he lifted up himself, and said unto them, He that is without sin among you, let him first cast a stone at her.",pt:"Mas, como insistissem em perguntar-lhe, ergueu-se e disse- lhes: Aquele dentre v\xf3s que est\xe1 sem pecado seja o primeiro que lhe atire uma pedra."},{verse:8,en:"And again he stooped down, and wrote on the ground.",pt:"E, tornando a inclinar-se, escrevia na terra."},{verse:9,en:"And they which heard it, being convicted by their own conscience, went out one by one, beginning at the eldest, even unto the last: and Jesus was left alone, and the woman standing in the midst.",pt:"Quando ouviram isto foram saindo um a um, a come\xe7ar pelos mais velhos, at\xe9 os \xfaltimos; ficou s\xf3 Jesus, e a mulher ali em p\xe9."},{verse:10,en:"When Jesus had lifted up himself, and saw none but the woman, he said unto her, Woman, where are those thine accusers? hath no man condemned thee?",pt:"Ent\xe3o, erguendo-se Jesus e n\xe3o vendo a ningu\xe9m sen\xe3o a mulher, perguntou-lhe: Mulher, onde est\xe3o aqueles teus acusadores? Ningu\xe9m te condenou?"},{verse:11,en:"She said, No man, Lord. And Jesus said unto her, Neither do I condemn thee: go, and sin no more.",pt:"Respondeu ela: Ningu\xe9m, Senhor. E disse-lhe Jesus: Nem eu te condeno; vai-te, e n\xe3o peques mais.]"},{verse:12,en:"Then spake Jesus again unto them, saying, I am the light of the world: he that followeth me shall not walk in darkness, but shall have the light of life.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus tornou a falar-lhes, dizendo: Eu sou a luz do mundo; quem me segue de modo algum andar\xe1 em trevas, mas ter\xe1 a luz da vida."},{verse:13,en:"The Pharisees therefore said unto him, Thou bearest record of thyself; thy record is not true.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois, os fariseus: Tu d\xe1s testemunho de ti mesmo; o teu testemunho n\xe3o \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:14,en:"Jesus answered and said unto them, Though I bear record of myself, yet my record is true: for I know whence I came, and whither I go; but ye cannot tell whence I come, and whither I go.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Ainda que eu dou testemunho de mim mesmo, o meu testemunho \xe9 verdadeiro; porque sei donde vim, e para onde vou; mas v\xf3s n\xe3o sabeis donde venho, nem para onde vou."},{verse:15,en:"Ye judge after the flesh; I judge no man.",pt:"V\xf3s julgais segundo a carne; eu a ningu\xe9m julgo."},{verse:16,en:"And yet if I judge, my judgment is true: for I am not alone, but I and the Father that sent me.",pt:"E, mesmo que eu julgue, o meu ju\xedzo \xe9 verdadeiro; porque n\xe3o sou eu s\xf3, mas eu e o Pai que me enviou."},{verse:17,en:"It is also written in your law, that the testimony of two men is true.",pt:"Ora, na vossa lei est\xe1 escrito que o testemunho de dois homens \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:18,en:"I am one that bear witness of myself, and the Father that sent me beareth witness of me.",pt:"Sou eu que dou testemunho de mim mesmo, e o Pai que me enviou, tamb\xe9m d\xe1 testemunho de mim."},{verse:19,en:"Then said they unto him, Where is thy Father? Jesus answered, Ye neither know me, nor my Father: if ye had known me, ye should have known my Father also.",pt:"Perguntavam-lhe, pois: Onde est\xe1 teu pai? Jesus respondeu: N\xe3o me conheceis a mim, nem a meu Pai; se v\xf3s me conhec\xeasseis a mim, tamb\xe9m conhecer\xedeis a meu Pai."},{verse:20,en:"These words spake Jesus in the treasury, as he taught in the temple: and no man laid hands on him; for his hour was not yet come.",pt:"Essas palavras proferiu Jesus no lugar do tesouro, quando ensinava no templo; e ningu\xe9m o prendeu, porque ainda n\xe3o era chegada a sua hora."},{verse:21,en:"Then said Jesus again unto them, I go my way, and ye shall seek me, and shall die in your sins: whither I go, ye cannot come.",pt:"Disse-lhes, pois, Jesus outra vez: Eu me retiro; buscar-me- eis, e morrereis no vosso pecado. Para onde eu vou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis ir."},{verse:22,en:"Then said the Jews, Will he kill himself? because he saith, Whither I go, ye cannot come.",pt:"Ent\xe3o diziam os judeus: Ser\xe1 que ele vai suicidar-se, pois diz: Para onde eu vou, v\xf3s n\xe3o podeis ir?"},{verse:23,en:"And he said unto them, Ye are from beneath; I am from above: ye are of this world; I am not of this world.",pt:"Disse-lhes ele: V\xf3s sois de baixo, eu sou de cima; v\xf3s sois deste mundo, eu n\xe3o sou deste mundo."},{verse:24,en:"I said therefore unto you, that ye shall die in your sins: for if ye believe not that I am he, ye shall die in your sins.",pt:"Por isso vos disse que morrereis em vossos pecados; porque, se n\xe3o crerdes que eu sou, morrereis em vossos pecados."},{verse:25,en:"Then said they unto him, Who art thou? And Jesus saith unto them, Even the same that I said unto you from the beginning.",pt:"Perguntavam-lhe ent\xe3o: Quem \xe9s tu? Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Exatamente o que venho dizendo que sou."},{verse:26,en:"I have many things to say and to judge of you: but he that sent me is true; and I speak to the world those things which I have heard of him.",pt:"Muitas coisas tenho que dizer e julgar acerca de v\xf3s; mas aquele que me enviou \xe9 verdadeiro; e o que dele ouvi, isso falo ao mundo."},{verse:27,en:"They understood not that he spake to them of the Father.",pt:"Eles n\xe3o perceberam que lhes falava do Pai."},{verse:28,en:"Then said Jesus unto them, When ye have lifted up the Son of man, then shall ye know that I am he, and that I do nothing of myself; but as my Father hath taught me, I speak these things.",pt:"Prosseguiu, pois, Jesus: Quando tiverdes levantado o Filho do homem, ent\xe3o conhecereis que eu sou, e que nada fa\xe7o de mim mesmo; mas como o Pai me ensinou, assim falo."},{verse:29,en:"And he that sent me is with me: the Father hath not left me alone; for I do always those things that please him.",pt:"E aquele que me enviou est\xe1 comigo; n\xe3o me tem deixado s\xf3; porque fa\xe7o sempre o que \xe9 do seu agrado."},{verse:30,en:"As he spake these words, many believed on him.",pt:"Falando ele estas coisas, muitos creram nele."},{verse:31,en:"Then said Jesus to those Jews which believed on him, If ye continue in my word, then are ye my disciples indeed;",pt:"Dizia, pois, Jesus aos judeus que nele creram: Se v\xf3s permanecerdes na minha palavra, verdadeiramente sois meus disc\xedpulos;"},{verse:32,en:"And ye shall know the truth, and the truth shall make you free.",pt:"e conhecereis a verdade, e a verdade vos libertar\xe1."},{verse:33,en:"They answered him, We be Abraham\u2019s seed, and were never in bondage to any man: how sayest thou, Ye shall be made free?",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Somos descendentes de Abra\xe3o, e nunca fomos escravos de ningu\xe9m; como dizes tu: Sereis livres?"},{verse:34,en:"Jesus answered them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Whosoever committeth sin is the servant of sin.",pt:"Replicou-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que todo aquele que comete pecado \xe9 escravo do pecado."},{verse:35,en:"And the servant abideth not in the house for ever: but the Son abideth ever.",pt:"Ora, o escravo n\xe3o fica para sempre na casa; o filho fica para sempre."},{verse:36,en:"If the Son therefore shall make you free, ye shall be free indeed.",pt:"Se, pois, o Filho vos libertar, verdadeiramente sereis livres."},{verse:37,en:"I know that ye are Abraham\u2019s seed; but ye seek to kill me, because my word hath no place in you.",pt:"Bem sei que sois descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o; contudo, procurais matar-me, porque a minha palavra n\xe3o encontra lugar em v\xf3s."},{verse:38,en:"I speak that which I have seen with my Father: and ye do that which ye have seen with your father.",pt:"Eu falo do que vi junto de meu Pai; e v\xf3s fazeis o que tamb\xe9m ouvistes de vosso pai."},{verse:39,en:"They answered and said unto him, Abraham is our father. Jesus saith unto them, If ye were Abraham\u2019s children, ye would do the works of Abraham.",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Nosso pai \xe9 Abra\xe3o. Disse-lhes Jesus: Se sois filhos de Abra\xe3o, fazei as obras de Abra\xe3o."},{verse:40,en:"But now ye seek to kill me, a man that hath told you the truth, which I have heard of God: this did not Abraham.",pt:"Mas agora procurais matar-me, a mim que vos falei a verdade que de Deus ouvi; isso Abra\xe3o n\xe3o fez."},{verse:41,en:"Ye do the deeds of your father. Then said they to him, We be not born of fornication; we have one Father, even God.",pt:"V\xf3s fazeis as obras de vosso pai. Replicaram-lhe eles: N\xf3s n\xe3o somos nascidos de prostitui\xe7\xe3o; temos um Pai, que \xe9 Deus."},{verse:42,en:"Jesus said unto them, If God were your Father, ye would love me: for I proceeded forth and came from God; neither came I of myself, but he sent me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Se Deus fosse o vosso Pai, v\xf3s me amar\xedeis, porque eu sa\xed e vim de Deus; pois n\xe3o vim de mim mesmo, mas ele me enviou."},{verse:43,en:"Why do ye not understand my speech? even because ye cannot hear my word.",pt:"Por que n\xe3o compreendeis a minha linguagem? \xe9 porque n\xe3o podeis ouvir a minha palavra."},{verse:44,en:"Ye are of your father the devil, and the lusts of your father ye will do. He was a murderer from the beginning, and abode not in the truth, because there is no truth in him. When he speaketh a lie, he speaketh of his own: for he is a liar, and the father of it.",pt:"V\xf3s tendes por pai o Diabo, e quereis satisfazer os desejos de vosso pai; ele \xe9 homicida desde o princ\xedpio, e nunca se firmou na verdade, porque nele n\xe3o h\xe1 verdade; quando ele profere mentira, fala do que lhe \xe9 pr\xf3prio; porque \xe9 mentiroso, e pai da mentira."},{verse:45,en:"And because I tell you the truth, ye believe me not.",pt:"Mas porque eu digo a verdade, n\xe3o me credes."},{verse:46,en:"Which of you convinceth me of sin? And if I say the truth, why do ye not believe me?",pt:"Quem dentre v\xf3s me convence de pecado? Se digo a verdade, por que n\xe3o me credes?"},{verse:47,en:"He that is of God heareth God\u2019s words: ye therefore hear them not, because ye are not of God.",pt:"Quem \xe9 de Deus ouve as palavras de Deus; por isso v\xf3s n\xe3o as ouvis, porque n\xe3o sois de Deus."},{verse:48,en:"Then answered the Jews, and said unto him, Say we not well that thou art a Samaritan, and hast a devil?",pt:"Responderam-lhe os judeus: N\xe3o dizemos com raz\xe3o que \xe9s samaritano, e que tens dem\xf4nio?"},{verse:49,en:"Jesus answered, I have not a devil; but I honour my Father, and ye do dishonour me.",pt:"Jesus respondeu: Eu n\xe3o tenho dem\xf4nio; antes honro a meu Pai, e v\xf3s me desonrais."},{verse:50,en:"And I seek not mine own glory: there is one that seeketh and judgeth.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o busco a minha gl\xf3ria; h\xe1 quem a busque, e julgue."},{verse:51,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, If a man keep my saying, he shall never see death.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que, se algu\xe9m guardar a minha palavra, nunca ver\xe1 a morte."},{verse:52,en:"Then said the Jews unto him, Now we know that thou hast a devil. Abraham is dead, and the prophets; and thou sayest, If a man keep my saying, he shall never taste of death.",pt:"Disseram-lhe os judeus: Agora sabemos que tens dem\xf4nios. Abra\xe3o morreu, e tamb\xe9m os profetas; e tu dizes: Se algu\xe9m guardar a minha palavra, nunca provar\xe1 a morte!"},{verse:53,en:"Art thou greater than our father Abraham, which is dead? and the prophets are dead: whom makest thou thyself?",pt:"Porventura \xe9s tu maior do que nosso pai Abra\xe3o, que morreu? Tamb\xe9m os profetas morreram; quem pretendes tu ser?"},{verse:54,en:"Jesus answered, If I honour myself, my honour is nothing: it is my Father that honoureth me; of whom ye say, that he is your God:",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Se eu me glorificar a mim mesmo, a minha gl\xf3ria n\xe3o \xe9 nada; quem me glorifica \xe9 meu Pai, do qual v\xf3s dizeis que \xe9 o vosso Deus;"},{verse:55,en:"Yet ye have not known him; but I know him: and if I should say, I know him not, I shall be a liar like unto you: but I know him, and keep his saying.",pt:"e v\xf3s n\xe3o o conheceis; mas eu o conhe\xe7o; e se disser que n\xe3o o conhe\xe7o, serei mentiroso como v\xf3s; mas eu o conhe\xe7o, e guardo a sua palavra."},{verse:56,en:"Your father Abraham rejoiced to see my day: and he saw it, and was glad.",pt:"Abra\xe3o, vosso pai, exultou por ver o meu dia; viu-o, e alegrou-se."},{verse:57,en:"Then said the Jews unto him, Thou art not yet fifty years old, and hast thou seen Abraham?",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois, os judeus: Ainda n\xe3o tens cinquenta anos, e viste Abra\xe3o?"},{verse:58,en:"Jesus said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, Before Abraham was, I am.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que antes que Abra\xe3o existisse, eu sou."},{verse:59,en:"Then took they up stones to cast at him: but Jesus hid himself, and went out of the temple, going through the midst of them, and so passed by.",pt:"Ent\xe3o pegaram em pedras para lhe atirarem; mas Jesus ocultou-se, e saiu do templo."}]}}),671,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,n,t,i){n.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"And as Jesus passed by, he saw a man which was blind from his birth.",pt:"E passando Jesus, viu um homem cego de nascen\xe7a."},{verse:2,en:"And his disciples asked him, saying, Master, who did sin, this man, or his parents, that he was born blind?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe os seus disc\xedpulos: Rabi, quem pecou, este ou seus pais, para que nascesse cego?"},{verse:3,en:"Jesus answered, Neither hath this man sinned, nor his parents: but that the works of God should be made manifest in him.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Nem ele pecou nem seus pais; mas foi para que nele se manifestem as obras de Deus."},{verse:4,en:"I must work the works of him that sent me, while it is day: the night cometh, when no man can work.",pt:"Importa que fa\xe7amos as obras daquele que me enviou, enquanto \xe9 dia; vem a noite, quando ningu\xe9m pode trabalhar."},{verse:5,en:"As long as I am in the world, I am the light of the world.",pt:"Enquanto estou no mundo, sou a luz do mundo."},{verse:6,en:"When he had thus spoken, he spat on the ground, and made clay of the spittle, and he anointed the eyes of the blind man with the clay,",pt:"Dito isto, cuspiu no ch\xe3o e com a saliva fez lodo, e untou com lodo os olhos do cego,"},{verse:7,en:"And said unto him, Go, wash in the pool of Siloam, (which is by interpretation, Sent.) He went his way therefore, and washed, and came seeing.",pt:"e disse-lhe: Vai, lava-te no tanque de Silo\xe9 (que significa Enviado). E ele foi, lavou-se, e voltou vendo."},{verse:8,en:"The neighbours therefore, and they which before had seen him that he was blind, said, Is not this he that sat and begged?",pt:"Ent\xe3o os vizinhos e aqueles que antes o tinham visto, quando mendigo, perguntavam: N\xe3o \xe9 este o mesmo que se sentava a mendigar?"},{verse:9,en:"Some said, This is he: others said, He is like him: but he said, I am he.",pt:"Uns diziam: \xc9 ele. E outros: N\xe3o \xe9, mas se parece com ele. Ele dizia: Sou eu."},{verse:10,en:"Therefore said they unto him, How were thine eyes opened?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe, pois: Como se te abriram os olhos?"},{verse:11,en:"He answered and said, A man that is called Jesus made clay, and anointed mine eyes, and said unto me, Go to the pool of Siloam, and wash: and I went and washed, and I received sight.",pt:"Respondeu ele: O homem que se chama Jesus fez lodo, untou-me os olhos, e disse-me: Vai a Silo\xe9 e lava-te. Fui, pois, lavei-me, e fiquei vendo."},{verse:12,en:"Then said they unto him, Where is he? He said, I know not.",pt:"E perguntaram-lhe: Onde est\xe1 ele? Respondeu: N\xe3o sei."},{verse:13,en:"They brought to the Pharisees him that aforetime was blind.",pt:"Levaram aos fariseus o que fora cego."},{verse:14,en:"And it was the sabbath day when Jesus made the clay, and opened his eyes.",pt:"Ora, era s\xe1bado o dia em que Jesus fez o lodo e lhe abriu os olhos."},{verse:15,en:"Then again the Pharisees also asked him how he had received his sight. He said unto them, He put clay upon mine eyes, and I washed, and do see.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os fariseus tamb\xe9m se puseram a perguntar-lhe como recebera a vista. Respondeu-lhes ele: P\xf4s-me lodo sobre os olhos, lavei-me e vejo."},{verse:16,en:"Therefore said some of the Pharisees, This man is not of God, because he keepeth not the sabbath day. Others said, How can a man that is a sinner do such miracles? And there was a division among them.",pt:"Por isso alguns dos fariseus diziam: Este homem n\xe3o \xe9 de Deus; pois n\xe3o guarda o s\xe1bado. Diziam outros: Como pode um homem pecador fazer tais sinais? E havia dissens\xe3o entre eles."},{verse:17,en:"They say unto the blind man again, What sayest thou of him, that he hath opened thine eyes? He said, He is a prophet.",pt:"Tornaram, pois, a perguntar ao cego: Que dizes tu a respeito dele, visto que te abriu os olhos? E ele respondeu: \xc9 profeta."},{verse:18,en:"But the Jews did not believe concerning him, that he had been blind, and received his sight, until they called the parents of him that had received his sight.",pt:"Os judeus, por\xe9m, n\xe3o acreditaram que ele tivesse sido cego e recebido a vista, enquanto n\xe3o chamaram os pais do que fora curado,"},{verse:19,en:"And they asked them, saying, Is this your son, who ye say was born blind? how then doth he now see?",pt:"e lhes perguntaram: \xc9 este o vosso filho, que dizeis ter nascido cego? Como, pois, v\xea agora?"},{verse:20,en:"His parents answered them and said, We know that this is our son, and that he was born blind:",pt:"Responderam seus pais: Sabemos que este \xe9 o nosso filho, e que nasceu cego;"},{verse:21,en:"But by what means he now seeth, we know not; or who hath opened his eyes, we know not: he is of age; ask him: he shall speak for himself.",pt:"mas como agora v\xea, n\xe3o sabemos; ou quem lhe abriu os olhos, n\xf3s n\xe3o sabemos; perguntai a ele mesmo; tem idade; ele falar\xe1 por si mesmo."},{verse:22,en:"These words spake his parents, because they feared the Jews: for the Jews had agreed already, that if any man did confess that he was Christ, he should be put out of the synagogue.",pt:"Isso disseram seus pais, porque temiam os judeus, porquanto j\xe1 tinham estes combinado que se algu\xe9m confessasse ser Jesus o Cristo, fosse expulso da sinagoga."},{verse:23,en:"Therefore said his parents, He is of age; ask him.",pt:"Por isso \xe9 que seus pais disseram: Tem idade, perguntai-lho a ele mesmo."},{verse:24,en:"Then again called they the man that was blind, and said unto him, Give God the praise: we know that this man is a sinner.",pt:"Ent\xe3o chamaram pela segunda vez o homem que fora cego, e lhe disseram: D\xe1 gl\xf3ria a Deus; n\xf3s sabemos que esse homem \xe9 pecador."},{verse:25,en:"He answered and said, Whether he be a sinner or no, I know not: one thing I know, that, whereas I was blind, now I see.",pt:"Respondeu ele: Se \xe9 pecador, n\xe3o sei; uma coisa sei: eu era cego, e agora vejo."},{verse:26,en:"Then said they to him again, What did he to thee? how opened he thine eyes?",pt:"Perguntaram-lhe pois: Que foi que te fez? Como te abriu os olhos?"},{verse:27,en:"He answered them, I have told you already, and ye did not hear: wherefore would ye hear it again? will ye also be his disciples?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes: J\xe1 vo-lo disse, e n\xe3o atendestes; para que o quereis tornar a ouvir? Acaso tamb\xe9m v\xf3s quereis tornar-vos disc\xedpulos dele?"},{verse:28,en:"Then they reviled him, and said, Thou art his disciple; but we are Moses\u2019 disciples.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o injuriaram, e disseram: Disc\xedpulo dele \xe9s tu; n\xf3s por\xe9m, somos disc\xedpulos de Mois\xe9s."},{verse:29,en:"We know that God spake unto Moses: as for this fellow, we know not from whence he is.",pt:"Sabemos que Deus falou a Mois\xe9s; mas quanto a este, n\xe3o sabemos donde \xe9."},{verse:30,en:"The man answered and said unto them, Why herein is a marvellous thing, that ye know not from whence he is, and yet he hath opened mine eyes.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes o homem: Nisto, pois, est\xe1 a maravilha: n\xe3o sabeis donde ele \xe9, e entretanto ele me abriu os olhos;"},{verse:31,en:"Now we know that God heareth not sinners: but if any man be a worshipper of God, and doeth his will, him he heareth.",pt:"sabemos que Deus n\xe3o ouve a pecadores; mas, se algu\xe9m for temente a Deus, e fizer a sua vontade, a esse ele ouve."},{verse:32,en:"Since the world began was it not heard that any man opened the eyes of one that was born blind.",pt:"Desde o princ\xedpio do mundo nunca se ouviu que algu\xe9m abrisse os olhos a um cego de nascen\xe7a."},{verse:33,en:"If this man were not of God, he could do nothing.",pt:"Se este n\xe3o fosse de Deus, nada poderia fazer."},{verse:34,en:"They answered and said unto him, Thou wast altogether born in sins, and dost thou teach us? And they cast him out.",pt:"Replicaram-lhe eles: Tu nasceste todo em pecados, e vens nos ensinar a n\xf3s? E expulsaram-no."},{verse:35,en:"Jesus heard that they had cast him out; and when he had found him, he said unto him, Dost thou believe on the Son of God?",pt:"Soube Jesus que o haviam expulsado; e achando-o perguntou- lhe: Cr\xeas tu no Filho do homem?"},{verse:36,en:"He answered and said, Who is he, Lord, that I might believe on him?",pt:"Respondeu ele: Quem \xe9, senhor, para que nele creia?"},{verse:37,en:"And Jesus said unto him, Thou hast both seen him, and it is he that talketh with thee.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: J\xe1 o viste, e \xe9 ele quem fala contigo."},{verse:38,en:"And he said, Lord, I believe. And he worshipped him.",pt:"Disse o homem: Creio, Senhor! E o adorou."},{verse:39,en:"And Jesus said, For judgment I am come into this world, that they which see not might see; and that they which see might be made blind.",pt:"Prosseguiu ent\xe3o Jesus: Eu vim a este mundo para ju\xedzo, a fim de que os que n\xe3o v\xeaem vejam, e os que v\xeaem se tornem cegos."},{verse:40,en:"And some of the Pharisees which were with him heard these words, and said unto him, Are we blind also?",pt:"Alguns fariseus que ali estavam com ele, ouvindo isso, perguntaram-lhe: Porventura somos n\xf3s tamb\xe9m cegos?"},{verse:41,en:"Jesus said unto them, If ye were blind, ye should have no sin: but now ye say, We see; therefore your sin remaineth.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Se fosseis cegos, n\xe3o ter\xedeis pecado; mas como agora dizeis: N\xf3s vemos, permanece o vosso pecado."}]}}),672,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that entereth not by the door into the sheepfold, but climbeth up some other way, the same is a thief and a robber.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: quem n\xe3o entra pela porta no aprisco das ovelhas, mas sobe por outra parte, esse \xe9 ladr\xe3o e salteador."},{verse:2,en:"But he that entereth in by the door is the shepherd of the sheep.",pt:"Mas o que entra pela porta \xe9 o pastor das ovelhas."},{verse:3,en:"To him the porter openeth; and the sheep hear his voice: and he calleth his own sheep by name, and leadeth them out.",pt:"A este o porteiro abre; e as ovelhas ouvem a sua voz; e ele chama pelo nome as suas ovelhas, e as conduz para fora."},{verse:4,en:"And when he putteth forth his own sheep, he goeth before them, and the sheep follow him: for they know his voice.",pt:"Depois de conduzir para fora todas as que lhe pertencem, vai adiante delas, e as ovelhas o seguem, porque conhecem a sua voz;"},{verse:5,en:"And a stranger will they not follow, but will flee from him: for they know not the voice of strangers.",pt:"mas de modo algum seguir\xe3o o estranho, antes fugir\xe3o dele, porque n\xe3o conhecem a voz dos estranhos."},{verse:6,en:"This parable spake Jesus unto them: but they understood not what things they were which he spake unto them.",pt:"Jesus prop\xf4s-lhes esta par\xe1bola, mas eles n\xe3o entenderam o que era que lhes dizia."},{verse:7,en:"Then said Jesus unto them again, Verily, verily, I say unto you, I am the door of the sheep.",pt:"Tornou, pois, Jesus a dizer-lhes: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: eu sou a porta das ovelhas."},{verse:8,en:"All that ever came before me are thieves and robbers: but the sheep did not hear them.",pt:"Todos quantos vieram antes de mim s\xe3o ladr\xf5es e salteadores; mas as ovelhas n\xe3o os ouviram."},{verse:9,en:"I am the door: by me if any man enter in, he shall be saved, and shall go in and out, and find pasture.",pt:"Eu sou a porta; se algu\xe9m entrar a casa; o filho fica entrar\xe1 e sair\xe1, e achar\xe1 pastagens."},{verse:10,en:"The thief cometh not, but for to steal, and to kill, and to destroy: I am come that they might have life, and that they might have it more abundantly.",pt:"O ladr\xe3o n\xe3o vem sen\xe3o para roubar, matar e destruir; eu vim para que tenham vida e a tenham em abund\xe2ncia."},{verse:11,en:"I am the good shepherd: the good shepherd giveth his life for the sheep.",pt:"Eu sou o bom pastor; o bom pastor d\xe1 a sua vida pelas ovelhas."},{verse:12,en:"But he that is an hireling, and not the shepherd, whose own the sheep are not, seeth the wolf coming, and leaveth the sheep, and fleeth: and the wolf catcheth them, and scattereth the sheep.",pt:"Mas o que \xe9 mercen\xe1rio, e n\xe3o pastor, de quem n\xe3o s\xe3o as ovelhas, vendo vir o lobo, deixa as ovelhas e foge; e o lobo as arrebata e dispersa."},{verse:13,en:"The hireling fleeth, because he is an hireling, and careth not for the sheep.",pt:"Ora, o mercen\xe1rio foge porque \xe9 mercen\xe1rio, e n\xe3o se importa com as ovelhas."},{verse:14,en:"I am the good shepherd, and know my sheep, and am known of mine.",pt:"Eu sou o bom pastor; conhe\xe7o as minhas ovelhas, e elas me conhecem,"},{verse:15,en:"As the Father knoweth me, even so know I the Father: and I lay down my life for the sheep.",pt:"assim como o Pai me conhece e eu conhe\xe7o o Pai; e dou a minha vida pelas ovelhas."},{verse:16,en:"And other sheep I have, which are not of this fold: them also I must bring, and they shall hear my voice; and there shall be one fold, and one shepherd.",pt:"Tenho ainda outras ovelhas que n\xe3o s\xe3o deste aprisco; a essas tamb\xe9m me importa conduzir, e elas ouvir\xe3o a minha voz; e haver\xe1 um rebanho e um pastor."},{verse:17,en:"Therefore doth my Father love me, because I lay down my life, that I might take it again.",pt:"Por isto o Pai me ama, porque dou a minha vida para a retomar."},{verse:18,en:"No man taketh it from me, but I lay it down of myself. I have power to lay it down, and I have power to take it again. This commandment have I received of my Father.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m ma tira de mim, mas eu de mim mesmo a dou; tenho autoridade para a dar, e tenho autoridade para retom\xe1-la. Este mandamento recebi de meu Pai."},{verse:19,en:"There was a division therefore again among the Jews for these sayings.",pt:"Por causa dessas palavras, houve outra dissens\xe3o entre os judeus."},{verse:20,en:"And many of them said, He hath a devil, and is mad; why hear ye him?",pt:"E muitos deles diziam: Tem dem\xf4nio, e perdeu o ju\xedzo; por que o escutais?"},{verse:21,en:"Others said, These are not the words of him that hath a devil. Can a devil open the eyes of the blind?",pt:"Diziam outros: Essas palavras n\xe3o s\xe3o de quem est\xe1 endemoninhado; pode porventura um dem\xf4nio abrir os olhos aos cegos?"},{verse:22,en:"And it was at Jerusalem the feast of the dedication, and it was winter.",pt:"Celebrava-se ent\xe3o em Jerusal\xe9m a festa da dedica\xe7\xe3o. E era inverno."},{verse:23,en:"And Jesus walked in the temple in Solomon\u2019s porch.",pt:"Andava Jesus passeando no templo, no p\xf3rtico de Salom\xe3o."},{verse:24,en:"Then came the Jews round about him, and said unto him, How long dost thou make us to doubt? If thou be the Christ, tell us plainly.",pt:"Rodearam-no, pois, os judeus e lhe perguntavam: At\xe9 quando nos deixar\xe1s perplexos? Se tu \xe9s o Cristo, dize-no-lo abertamente."},{verse:25,en:"Jesus answered them, I told you, and ye believed not: the works that I do in my Father\u2019s name, they bear witness of me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: J\xe1 vo-lo disse, e n\xe3o credes. As obras que eu fa\xe7o em nome de meu Pai, essas d\xe3o testemunho de mim."},{verse:26,en:"But ye believe not, because ye are not of my sheep, as I said unto you.",pt:"Mas v\xf3s n\xe3o credes, porque n\xe3o sois das minhas ovelhas."},{verse:27,en:"My sheep hear my voice, and I know them, and they follow me:",pt:"As minhas ovelhas ouvem a minha voz, e eu as conhe\xe7o, e elas me seguem;"},{verse:28,en:"And I give unto them eternal life; and they shall never perish, neither shall any man pluck them out of my hand.",pt:"eu lhes dou a vida eterna, e jamais perecer\xe3o; e ningu\xe9m as arrebatar\xe1 da minha m\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"My Father, which gave them me, is greater than all; and no man is able to pluck them out of my Father\u2019s hand.",pt:"Meu Pai, que mas deu, \xe9 maior do que todos; e ningu\xe9m pode arrebat\xe1-las da m\xe3o de meu Pai."},{verse:30,en:"I and my Father are one.",pt:"Eu e o Pai somos um."},{verse:31,en:"Then the Jews took up stones again to stone him.",pt:"Os judeus pegaram ent\xe3o outra vez em pedras para o apedrejar."},{verse:32,en:"Jesus answered them, Many good works have I shewed you from my Father; for which of those works do ye stone me?",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Muitas obras boas da parte de meu Pai vos tenho mostrado; por qual destas obras ides apedrejar-me?"},{verse:33,en:"The Jews answered him, saying, For a good work we stone thee not; but for blasphemy; and because that thou, being a man, makest thyself God.",pt:"Responderam-lhe os judeus: N\xe3o \xe9 por nenhuma obra boa que vamos apedrejar-te, mas por blasf\xeamia; e porque, sendo tu homem, te fazes Deus."},{verse:34,en:"Jesus answered them, Is it not written in your law, I said, Ye are gods?",pt:"Tornou-lhes Jesus: N\xe3o est\xe1 escrito na vossa lei: Eu disse: V\xf3s sois deuses?"},{verse:35,en:"If he called them gods, unto whom the word of God came, and the scripture cannot be broken;",pt:"Se a lei chamou deuses \xe0queles a quem a palavra de Deus foi dirigida (e a Escritura n\xe3o pode ser anulada),"},{verse:36,en:"Say ye of him, whom the Father hath sanctified, and sent into the world, Thou blasphemest; because I said, I am the Son of God?",pt:"\xe0quele a quem o Pai santificou, e enviou ao mundo, dizeis v\xf3s: Blasfemas; porque eu disse: Sou Filho de Deus?"},{verse:37,en:"If I do not the works of my Father, believe me not.",pt:"Se n\xe3o fa\xe7o as obras de meu Pai, n\xe3o me acrediteis."},{verse:38,en:"But if I do, though ye believe not me, believe the works: that ye may know, and believe, that the Father is in me, and I in him.",pt:"Mas se as fa\xe7o, embora n\xe3o me creiais a mim, crede nas obras; para que entendais e saibais que o Pai est\xe1 em mim e eu no Pai."},{verse:39,en:"Therefore they sought again to take him: but he escaped out of their hand,",pt:"Outra vez, pois, procuravam prend\xea-lo; mas ele lhes escapou das m\xe3os."},{verse:40,en:"And went away again beyond Jordan into the place where John at first baptized; and there he abode.",pt:"E retirou-se de novo para al\xe9m do Jord\xe3o, para o lugar onde Jo\xe3o batizava no princ\xedpio; e ali ficou."},{verse:41,en:"And many resorted unto him, and said, John did no miracle: but all things that John spake of this man were true.",pt:"Muitos foram ter com ele, e diziam: Jo\xe3o, na verdade, n\xe3o fez sinal algum, mas tudo quanto disse deste homem era verdadeiro."},{verse:42,en:"And many believed on him there.",pt:"E muitos ali creram nele."}]}}),673,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,r,h){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now a certain man was sick, named Lazarus, of Bethany, the town of Mary and her sister Martha.",pt:"Ora, estava enfermo um homem chamado L\xe1zaro, de Bet\xe2nia, aldeia de Maria e de sua irm\xe3 Marta."},{verse:2,en:"(It was that Mary which anointed the Lord with ointment, and wiped his feet with her hair, whose brother Lazarus was sick.)",pt:"E Maria, cujo irm\xe3o L\xe1zaro se achava enfermo, era a mesma que ungiu o Senhor com b\xe1lsamo, e lhe enxugou os p\xe9s com os seus cabelos."},{verse:3,en:"Therefore his sisters sent unto him, saying, Lord, behold, he whom thou lovest is sick.",pt:"Mandaram, pois, as irm\xe3s dizer a Jesus: Senhor, eis que est\xe1 enfermo aquele que tu amas."},{verse:4,en:"When Jesus heard that, he said, This sickness is not unto death, but for the glory of God, that the Son of God might be glorified thereby.",pt:"Jesus, por\xe9m, ao ouvir isto, disse: Esta enfermidade n\xe3o \xe9 para a morte, mas para gl\xf3ria de Deus, para que o Filho de Deus seja glorificado por ela."},{verse:5,en:"Now Jesus loved Martha, and her sister, and Lazarus.",pt:"Ora, Jesus amava a Marta, e a sua irm\xe3, e a L\xe1zaro."},{verse:6,en:"When he had heard therefore that he was sick, he abode two days still in the same place where he was.",pt:"Quando, pois, ouviu que estava enfermo, ficou ainda dois dias no lugar onde se achava."},{verse:7,en:"Then after that saith he to his disciples, Let us go into Judaea again.",pt:"Depois disto, disse a seus disc\xedpulos: Vamos outra vez para Jud\xe9ia."},{verse:8,en:"His disciples say unto him, Master, the Jews of late sought to stone thee; and goest thou thither again?",pt:"Disseram-lhe eles: Rabi, ainda agora os judeus procuravam apedrejar-te, e voltas para l\xe1?"},{verse:9,en:"Jesus answered, Are there not twelve hours in the day? If any man walk in the day, he stumbleth not, because he seeth the light of this world.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: N\xe3o s\xe3o doze as horas do dia? Se algu\xe9m andar de dia, n\xe3o trope\xe7a, porque v\xea a luz deste mundo;"},{verse:10,en:"But if a man walk in the night, he stumbleth, because there is no light in him.",pt:"mas se andar de noite, trope\xe7a, porque nele n\xe3o h\xe1 luz."},{verse:11,en:"These things said he: and after that he saith unto them, Our friend Lazarus sleepeth; but I go, that I may awake him out of sleep.",pt:"E, tendo assim falado, acrescentou: L\xe1zaro, o nosso amigo, dorme, mas vou despert\xe1-lo do sono."},{verse:12,en:"Then said his disciples, Lord, if he sleep, he shall do well.",pt:"Disseram-lhe, pois, os disc\xedpulos: Senhor, se dorme, ficar\xe1 bom."},{verse:13,en:"Howbeit Jesus spake of his death: but they thought that he had spoken of taking of rest in sleep.",pt:"Mas Jesus falara da sua morte; eles, por\xe9m, entenderam que falava do repouso do sono."},{verse:14,en:"Then said Jesus unto them plainly, Lazarus is dead.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus lhes disse claramente: L\xe1zaro morreu;"},{verse:15,en:"And I am glad for your sakes that I was not there, to the intent ye may believe; nevertheless let us go unto him.",pt:"e, por vossa causa, folgo de que eu l\xe1 n\xe3o estivesse, para para que creiais; mas vamos ter com ele."},{verse:16,en:"Then said Thomas, which is called Didymus, unto his fellowdisciples, Let us also go, that we may die with him.",pt:"Disse, pois, Tom\xe9, chamado D\xeddimo, aos seus condisc\xedpulos: Vamos n\xf3s tamb\xe9m, para morrermos com ele."},{verse:17,en:"Then when Jesus came, he found that he had lain in the grave four days already.",pt:"Chegando pois Jesus, encontrou-o j\xe1 com quatro dias de sepultura."},{verse:18,en:"Now Bethany was nigh unto Jerusalem, about fifteen furlongs off:",pt:"Ora, Bet\xe2nia distava de Jerusal\xe9m cerca de quinze est\xe1dios."},{verse:19,en:"And many of the Jews came to Martha and Mary, to comfort them concerning their brother.",pt:"E muitos dos judeus tinham vindo visitar Marta e Maria, para as consolar acerca de seu irm\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"Then Martha, as soon as she heard that Jesus was coming, went and met him: but Mary sat still in the house.",pt:"Marta, pois, ao saber que Jesus chegava, saiu-lhe ao encontro; Maria, por\xe9m, ficou sentada em casa."},{verse:21,en:"Then said Martha unto Jesus, Lord, if thou hadst been here, my brother had not died.",pt:"Disse, pois, Marta a Jesus: Senhor, se meu irm\xe3o n\xe3o teria morrido."},{verse:22,en:"But I know, that even now, whatsoever thou wilt ask of God, God will give it thee.",pt:"E mesmo agora sei que tudo quanto pedires a Deus, Deus to conceder\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Thy brother shall rise again.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Teu irm\xe3o h\xe1 de ressurgir."},{verse:24,en:"Martha saith unto him, I know that he shall rise again in the resurrection at the last day.",pt:"Disse-lhe Marta: Sei que ele h\xe1 de ressurgir na ressurrei\xe7\xe3o, no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:25,en:"Jesus said unto her, I am the resurrection, and the life: he that believeth in me, though he were dead, yet shall he live:",pt:"Declarou-lhe Jesus: Eu sou a ressurrei\xe7\xe3o e a vida; quem cr\xea em mim, ainda que morra, viver\xe1;"},{verse:26,en:"And whosoever liveth and believeth in me shall never die. Believest thou this?",pt:"e todo aquele que vive, e cr\xea em mim, jamais morrer\xe1. Cr\xeas isto?"},{verse:27,en:"She saith unto him, Yea, Lord: I believe that thou art the Christ, the Son of God, which should come into the world.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Marta: Sim, Senhor, eu creio que tu \xe9s o Cristo, o Filho de Deus, que havia de vir ao mundo."},{verse:28,en:"And when she had so said, she went her way, and called Mary her sister secretly, saying, The Master is come, and calleth for thee.",pt:"Dito isto, retirou-se e foi chamar em segredo a Maria, sua irm\xe3, e lhe disse: O Mestre est\xe1 a\xed, e te chama."},{verse:29,en:"As soon as she heard that, she arose quickly, and came unto him.",pt:"Ela, ouvindo isto, levantou-se depressa, e foi ter com ele."},{verse:30,en:"Now Jesus was not yet come into the town, but was in that place where Martha met him.",pt:"Pois Jesus ainda n\xe3o havia entrado na aldeia, mas estava no lugar onde Marta o encontrara."},{verse:31,en:"The Jews then which were with her in the house, and comforted her, when they saw Mary, that she rose up hastily and went out, followed her, saying, She goeth unto the grave to weep there.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os judeus que estavam com Maria em casa e a consolavam, vendo-a levantar-se apressadamente e sair, seguiram-na, pensando que ia ao sepulcro para chorar ali."},{verse:32,en:"Then when Mary was come where Jesus was, and saw him, she fell down at his feet, saying unto him, Lord, if thou hadst been here, my brother had not died.",pt:"Tendo, pois, Maria chegado ao lugar onde Jesus estava, e vendo-a, lan\xe7ou-se-lhe aos p\xe9s e disse: Senhor, se tu estiveras aqui, meu irm\xe3o n\xe3o teria morrido."},{verse:33,en:"When Jesus therefore saw her weeping, and the Jews also weeping which came with her, he groaned in the spirit, and was troubled,",pt:"Jesus, pois, quando a viu chorar, e chorarem tamb\xe9m os judeus que com ela vinham, comoveu-se em esp\xedrito, e perturbou-se,"},{verse:34,en:"And said, Where have ye laid him? They said unto him, Lord, come and see.",pt:"e perguntou: Onde o puseste? Responderam-lhe: Senhor, vem e v\xea."},{verse:35,en:"Jesus wept.",pt:"Jesus chorou."},{verse:36,en:"Then said the Jews, Behold how he loved him!",pt:"Disseram ent\xe3o os judeus: Vede como o amava."},{verse:37,en:"And some of them said, Could not this man, which opened the eyes of the blind, have caused that even this man should not have died?",pt:"Mas alguns deles disseram: N\xe3o podia ele, que abriu os olhos ao cego, fazer tamb\xe9m que este n\xe3o morreste?"},{verse:38,en:"Jesus therefore again groaning in himself cometh to the grave. It was a cave, and a stone lay upon it.",pt:"Jesus, pois, comovendo-se outra vez, profundamente, foi ao sepulcro; era uma gruta, e tinha uma pedra posta sobre ela."},{verse:39,en:"Jesus said, Take ye away the stone. Martha, the sister of him that was dead, saith unto him, Lord, by this time he stinketh: for he hath been dead four days.",pt:"Disse Jesus: Tirai a pedra. Marta, irm\xe3 do defunto, disse- lhe: Senhor, j\xe1 cheira mal, porque est\xe1 morto h\xe1 quase quatro dias."},{verse:40,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Said I not unto thee, that, if thou wouldest believe, thou shouldest see the glory of God?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: N\xe3o te disse que, se creres, ver\xe1s a gl\xf3ria de Deus?"},{verse:41,en:"Then they took away the stone from the place where the dead was laid. And Jesus lifted up his eyes, and said, Father, I thank thee that thou hast heard me.",pt:"Tiraram ent\xe3o a pedra. E Jesus, levantando os olhos ao c\xe9u, disse: Pai, gra\xe7as te dou, porque me ouviste."},{verse:42,en:"And I knew that thou hearest me always: but because of the people which stand by I said it, that they may believe that thou hast sent me.",pt:"Eu sabia que sempre me ouves; mas por causa da multid\xe3o que est\xe1 em redor \xe9 que assim falei, para que eles creiam que tu me enviaste."},{verse:43,en:"And when he thus had spoken, he cried with a loud voice, Lazarus, come forth.",pt:"E, tendo dito isso, clamou em alta voz: L\xe1zaro, vem para fora!"},{verse:44,en:"And he that was dead came forth, bound hand and foot with graveclothes: and his face was bound about with a napkin. Jesus saith unto them, Loose him, and let him go.",pt:"Saiu o que estivera morto, ligados os p\xe9s e as m\xe3os com faixas, e o seu rosto envolto num len\xe7o. Disse-lhes Jesus: Desligai-o e deixai-o ir."},{verse:45,en:"Then many of the Jews which came to Mary, and had seen the things which Jesus did, believed on him.",pt:"Muitos, pois, dentre os judeus que tinham vindo visitar Maria, e que tinham visto o que Jesus fizera, creram nele."},{verse:46,en:"But some of them went their ways to the Pharisees, and told them what things Jesus had done.",pt:"Mas alguns deles foram ter com os fariseus e disseram-lhes o que Jesus tinha feito."},{verse:47,en:"Then gathered the chief priests and the Pharisees a council, and said, What do we? for this man doeth many miracles.",pt:"Ent\xe3o os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus reuniram o sin\xe9drio e diziam: Que faremos? porquanto este homem vem operando muitos sinais."},{verse:48,en:"If we let him thus alone, all men will believe on him: and the Romans shall come and take away both our place and nation.",pt:"Se o deixarmos assim, todos crer\xe3o nele, e vir\xe3o os romanos, e nos tirar\xe3o tanto o nosso lugar como a nossa na\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:49,en:"And one of them, named Caiaphas, being the high priest that same year, said unto them, Ye know nothing at all,",pt:"Um deles, por\xe9m, chamado Caif\xe1s, que era sumo sacerdote naquele ano, disse-lhes: V\xf3s nada sabeis,"},{verse:50,en:"Nor consider that it is expedient for us, that one man should die for the people, and that the whole nation perish not.",pt:"nem considerais que vos conv\xe9m que morra um s\xf3 homem pelo povo, e que n\xe3o pere\xe7a a na\xe7\xe3o toda."},{verse:51,en:"And this spake he not of himself: but being high priest that year, he prophesied that Jesus should die for that nation;",pt:"Ora, isso n\xe3o disse ele por si mesmo; mas, sendo o sumo sacerdote naquele ano, profetizou que Jesus havia de morrer pela na\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:52,en:"And not for that nation only, but that also he should gather together in one the children of God that were scattered abroad.",pt:"e n\xe3o somente pela na\xe7\xe3o, mas tamb\xe9m para congregar num s\xf3 corpo os filhos de Deus que est\xe3o dispersos."},{verse:53,en:"Then from that day forth they took counsel together for to put him to death.",pt:"Desde aquele dia, pois, tomavam conselho para o matarem."},{verse:54,en:"Jesus therefore walked no more openly among the Jews; but went thence unto a country near to the wilderness, into a city called Ephraim, and there continued with his disciples.",pt:"De sorte que Jesus j\xe1 n\xe3o andava manifestamente entre os judeus, mas retirou-se dali para a regi\xe3o vizinha ao deserto, a uma cidade chamada Efraim; e ali demorou com os seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:55,en:"And the Jews\u2019 passover was nigh at hand: and many went out of the country up to Jerusalem before the passover, to purify themselves.",pt:"Ora, estava pr\xf3xima a p\xe1scoa dos judeus, e dessa regi\xe3o subiram muitos a Jerusal\xe9m, antes da p\xe1scoa, para se purificarem."},{verse:56,en:"Then sought they for Jesus, and spake among themselves, as they stood in the temple, What think ye, that he will not come to the feast?",pt:"Buscavam, pois, a Jesus e diziam uns aos outros, estando no templo: Que vos parece? N\xe3o vir\xe1 ele \xe0 festa?"},{verse:57,en:"Now both the chief priests and the Pharisees had given a commandment, that, if any man knew where he were, he should shew it, that they might take him.",pt:"Ora, os principais sacerdotes e os fariseus tinham dado ordem que, se algu\xe9m soubesse onde ele estava, o denunciasse, para que o prendessem."}]}}),674,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then Jesus six days before the passover came to Bethany, where Lazarus was which had been dead, whom he raised from the dead.",pt:"Veio, pois, Jesus seis dias antes da p\xe1scoa, a Bet\xe2nia, onde estava L\xe1zaro, a quem ele ressuscitara dentre os mortos."},{verse:2,en:"There they made him a supper; and Martha served: but Lazarus was one of them that sat at the table with him.",pt:"Deram-lhe ali uma ceia; Marta servia, e L\xe1zaro era um dos que estavam \xe0 mesa com ele."},{verse:3,en:"Then took Mary a pound of ointment of spikenard, very costly, and anointed the feet of Jesus, and wiped his feet with her hair: and the house was filled with the odour of the ointment.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Maria, tomando uma libra de b\xe1lsamo de nardo puro, de grande pre\xe7o, ungiu os p\xe9s de Jesus, e os enxugou com os seus cabelos; e encheu-se a casa do cheiro do b\xe1lsamo."},{verse:4,en:"Then saith one of his disciples, Judas Iscariot, Simon\u2019s son, which should betray him,",pt:"Mas Judas Iscariotes, um dos seus disc\xedpulos, aquele que o havia de trair disse:"},{verse:5,en:"Why was not this ointment sold for three hundred pence, and given to the poor?",pt:"Por que n\xe3o se vendeu este b\xe1lsamo por trezentos den\xe1rios e n\xe3o se deu aos pobres?"},{verse:6,en:"This he said, not that he cared for the poor; but because he was a thief, and had the bag, and bare what was put therein.",pt:"Ora, ele disse isto, n\xe3o porque tivesse cuidado dos pobres, mas porque era ladr\xe3o e, tendo a bolsa, subtra\xeda o que nela se lan\xe7ava."},{verse:7,en:"Then said Jesus, Let her alone: against the day of my burying hath she kept this.",pt:"Respondeu, pois Jesus: Deixa-a; para o dia da minha prepara\xe7\xe3o para a sepultura o guardou;"},{verse:8,en:"For the poor always ye have with you; but me ye have not always.",pt:"porque os pobres sempre os tendes convosco; mas a mim nem sempre me tendes."},{verse:9,en:"Much people of the Jews therefore knew that he was there: and they came not for Jesus\u2019 sake only, but that they might see Lazarus also, whom he had raised from the dead.",pt:"E grande n\xfamero dos judeus chegou a saber que ele estava ali: e afluiram, n\xe3o s\xf3 por causa de Jesus mas tamb\xe9m para verem a L\xe1zaro, a quem ele ressuscitara dentre os mortos."},{verse:10,en:"But the chief priests consulted that they might put Lazarus also to death;",pt:"Mas os principais sacerdotes deliberaram matar tamb\xe9m a L\xe1zaro;"},{verse:11,en:"Because that by reason of him many of the Jews went away, and believed on Jesus.",pt:"porque muitos, por causa dele, deixavam os judeus e criam em Jesus."},{verse:12,en:"On the next day much people that were come to the feast, when they heard that Jesus was coming to Jerusalem,",pt:"No dia seguinte, as grandes multid\xf5es que tinham vindo \xe0 festa, ouvindo dizer que Jesus vinha a Jerusal\xe9m,"},{verse:13,en:"Took branches of palm trees, and went forth to meet him, and cried, Hosanna: Blessed is the King of Israel that cometh in the name of the Lord.",pt:"tomaram ramos de palmeiras, e sa\xedram-lhe ao encontro, e clamavam: Hosana! Bendito o que vem em nome do Senhor! Bendito o rei de Israel!"},{verse:14,en:"And Jesus, when he had found a young ass, sat thereon; as it is written,",pt:"E achou Jesus um jumentinho e montou nele, conforme est\xe1 escrito:"},{verse:15,en:"Fear not, daughter of Sion: behold, thy King cometh, sitting on an ass\u2019s colt.",pt:"N\xe3o temas, \xf3 filha de Si\xe3o; eis que vem teu Rei, montado sobre o filho de uma jumenta."},{verse:16,en:"These things understood not his disciples at the first: but when Jesus was glorified, then remembered they that these things were written of him, and that they had done these things unto him.",pt:"Os seus disc\xedpulos, por\xe9m, a princ\xedpio n\xe3o entenderam isto; mas quando Jesus foi glorificado, ent\xe3o eles se lembraram de que estas coisas estavam escritas a respeito dele, e de que assim lhe fizeram."},{verse:17,en:"The people therefore that was with him when he called Lazarus out of his grave, and raised him from the dead, bare record.",pt:"Dava-lhe, pois, testemunho a multid\xe3o que estava com ele quando chamara a L\xe1zaro da sepultura e o ressuscitara dentre os mortos;"},{verse:18,en:"For this cause the people also met him, for that they heard that he had done this miracle.",pt:"e foi por isso que a multid\xe3o lhe saiu ao encontro, por ter ouvido que ele fizera este sinal."},{verse:19,en:"The Pharisees therefore said among themselves, Perceive ye how ye prevail nothing? behold, the world is gone after him.",pt:"De sorte que os fariseus disseram entre si: Vedes que nada aproveitais? eis que o mundo inteiro vai ap\xf3s ele."},{verse:20,en:"And there were certain Greeks among them that came up to worship at the feast:",pt:"Ora, entre os que tinham subido a adorar na festa havia alguns gregos."},{verse:21,en:"The same came therefore to Philip, which was of Bethsaida of Galilee, and desired him, saying, Sir, we would see Jesus.",pt:"Estes, pois, dirigiram-se a Felipe, que era de Betsaida da Galil\xe9ia, e rogaram-lhe, dizendo: Senhor, quer\xedamos ver a Jesus."},{verse:22,en:"Philip cometh and telleth Andrew: and again Andrew and Philip tell Jesus.",pt:"Felipe foi diz\xea-lo a Andr\xe9, e ent\xe3o Andr\xe9 e Felipe foram diz\xea-lo a Jesus."},{verse:23,en:"And Jesus answered them, saying, The hour is come, that the Son of man should be glorified.",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: \xc9 chegada a hora de ser glorificado o Filho do homem."},{verse:24,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, Except a corn of wheat fall into the ground and die, it abideth alone: but if it die, it bringeth forth much fruit.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Se o gr\xe3o de trigo caindo na terra n\xe3o morrer, fica ele s\xf3; mas se morrer, d\xe1 muito fruto."},{verse:25,en:"He that loveth his life shall lose it; and he that hateth his life in this world shall keep it unto life eternal.",pt:"Quem ama a sua vida, perd\xea-la-\xe1; e quem neste mundo odeia a a sua vida, guard\xe1-la-\xe1 para a vida eterna."},{verse:26,en:"If any man serve me, let him follow me; and where I am, there shall also my servant be: if any man serve me, him will my Father honour.",pt:"Se algu\xe9m me quiser servir, siga-me; e onde eu estiver, ali estar\xe1 tamb\xe9m o meu servo; se algu\xe9m me servir, o Pai o honrar\xe1."},{verse:27,en:"Now is my soul troubled; and what shall I say? Father, save me from this hour: but for this cause came I unto this hour.",pt:"Agora a minha alma est\xe1 perturbada; e que direi eu? Pai, salva-me desta hora? Mas para isto vim a esta hora."},{verse:28,en:"Father, glorify thy name. Then came there a voice from heaven, saying, I have both glorified it, and will glorify it again.",pt:"Pai, glorifica o teu nome. Veio, ent\xe3o, do c\xe9u esta voz: J\xe1 o tenho glorificado, e outra vez o glorificarei."},{verse:29,en:"The people therefore, that stood by, and heard it, said that it thundered: others said, An angel spake to him.",pt:"A multid\xe3o, pois, que ali estava, e que a ouvira, dizia ter havido um trov\xe3o; outros diziam: Um anjo lhe falou."},{verse:30,en:"Jesus answered and said, This voice came not because of me, but for your sakes.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: N\xe3o veio esta voz por minha causa, mas por causa de v\xf3s."},{verse:31,en:"Now is the judgment of this world: now shall the prince of this world be cast out.",pt:"Agora \xe9 o ju\xedzo deste mundo; agora ser\xe1 expulso o pr\xedncipe deste mundo."},{verse:32,en:"And I, if I be lifted up from the earth, will draw all men unto me.",pt:"E eu, quando for levantado da terra, todos atrairei a mim."},{verse:33,en:"This he said, signifying what death he should die.",pt:"Isto dizia, significando de que modo havia de morrer."},{verse:34,en:"The people answered him, We have heard out of the law that Christ abideth for ever: and how sayest thou, The Son of man must be lifted up? who is this Son of man?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe a multid\xe3o: N\xf3s temos ouvido da lei que o Cristo permanece para sempre; e como dizes tu: Importa que o Filho do homem seja levantado? Quem \xe9 esse Filho do homem?"},{verse:35,en:"Then Jesus said unto them, Yet a little while is the light with you. Walk while ye have the light, lest darkness come upon you: for he that walketh in darkness knoweth not whither he goeth.",pt:"Disse-lhes ent\xe3o Jesus: Ainda por um pouco de tempo a luz est\xe1 entre v\xf3s. Andai enquanto tendes a luz, para que as trevas n\xe3o vos apanhem; pois quem anda nas trevas n\xe3o sabe para onde vai."},{verse:36,en:"While ye have light, believe in the light, that ye may be the children of light. These things spake Jesus, and departed, and did hide himself from them.",pt:"Enquanto tendes a luz, crede na luz, para que vos torneis filhos da luz. Havendo Jesus assim falado, retirou-se e escondeu-se deles."},{verse:37,en:"But though he had done so many miracles before them, yet they believed not on him:",pt:"E embora tivesse operado tantos sinais diante deles, n\xe3o criam nele;"},{verse:38,en:"That the saying of Esaias the prophet might be fulfilled, which he spake, Lord, who hath believed our report? and to whom hath the arm of the Lord been revealed?",pt:"para que se cumprisse a palavra do profeta Isa\xedas: Senhor, quem creu em nossa prega\xe7\xe3o? e aquem foi revelado o bra\xe7o do Senhor?"},{verse:39,en:"Therefore they could not believe, because that Esaias said again,",pt:"Por isso n\xe3o podiam crer, porque, como disse ainda Isa\xedas:"},{verse:40,en:"He hath blinded their eyes, and hardened their heart; that they should not see with their eyes, nor understand with their heart, and be converted, and I should heal them.",pt:"Cegou-lhes os olhos e endureceu-lhes o cora\xe7\xe3o, para que n\xe3o vejam com os olhos e entendam com o cora\xe7\xe3o, e se convertam, e eu os cure."},{verse:41,en:"These things said Esaias, when he saw his glory, and spake of him.",pt:"Estas coisas disse Isa\xedas, porque viu a sua gl\xf3ria, e dele falou."},{verse:42,en:"Nevertheless among the chief rulers also many believed on him; but because of the Pharisees they did not confess him, lest they should be put out of the synagogue:",pt:"Contudo, muitos dentre as pr\xf3prias autoridades creram nele; mas por causa dos fariseus n\xe3o o confessavam, para n\xe3o serem expulsos da sinagoga;"},{verse:43,en:"For they loved the praise of men more than the praise of God.",pt:"porque amaram mais a gl\xf3ria dos homens do que a gl\xf3ria de Deus."},{verse:44,en:"Jesus cried and said, He that believeth on me, believeth not on me, but on him that sent me.",pt:"Clamou Jesus, dizendo: Quem cr\xea em mim, cr\xea, n\xe2o em mim, mas naquele que me enviou."},{verse:45,en:"And he that seeth me seeth him that sent me.",pt:"E quem me v\xea a mim, v\xea aquele que me enviou."},{verse:46,en:"I am come a light into the world, that whosoever believeth on me should not abide in darkness.",pt:"Eu, que sou a luz, vim ao mundo, para que todo aquele que cr\xea em mim n\xe3o permane\xe7a nas trevas."},{verse:47,en:"And if any man hear my words, and believe not, I judge him not: for I came not to judge the world, but to save the world.",pt:"E, se algu\xe9m ouvir as minhas palavras, e n\xe3o as guardar, eu n\xe3o o julgo; pois eu vim, n\xe3o para julgar o mundo, mas para salvar o mundo."},{verse:48,en:"He that rejecteth me, and receiveth not my words, hath one that judgeth him: the word that I have spoken, the same shall judge him in the last day.",pt:"Quem me rejeita, e n\xe3o recebe as minhas palavras, j\xe1 tem quem o julgue; a palavra que tenho pregado, essa o julgar\xe1 no \xfaltimo dia."},{verse:49,en:"For I have not spoken of myself; but the Father which sent me, he gave me a commandment, what I should say, and what I should speak.",pt:"Porque eu n\xe3o falei por mim mesmo; mas o Pai, que me enviou, esse me deu mandamento quanto ao que dizer e como falar."},{verse:50,en:"And I know that his commandment is life everlasting: whatsoever I speak therefore, even as the Father said unto me, so I speak.",pt:"E sei que o seu mandamento \xe9 vida eterna. Aquilo, pois, que eu falo, falo-o exatamente como o Pai me ordenou."}]}}),675,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now before the feast of the passover, when Jesus knew that his hour was come that he should depart out of this world unto the Father, having loved his own which were in the world, he loved them unto the end.",pt:"Antes da festa da p\xe1scoa, sabendo Jesus que era chegada a sua hora de passar deste mundo para o Pai, e havendo amado os seus que estavam no mundo, amou-os at\xe9 o fim."},{verse:2,en:"And supper being ended, the devil having now put into the heart of Judas Iscariot, Simon\u2019s son, to betray him;",pt:"Enquanto ceavam, tendo j\xe1 o Diabo posto no cora\xe7\xe3o de Judas, filho de Sim\xe3o Iscariotes, que o tra\xedsse,"},{verse:3,en:"Jesus knowing that the Father had given all things into his hands, and that he was come from God, and went to God;",pt:"Jesus, sabendo que o Pai lhe entregara tudo nas m\xe3os, e que viera de Deus e para Deus voltava,"},{verse:4,en:"He riseth from supper, and laid aside his garments; and took a towel, and girded himself.",pt:"levantou-se da ceia, tirou o manto e, tomando uma toalha, cingiu-se."},{verse:5,en:"After that he poureth water into a bason, and began to wash the disciples\u2019 feet, and to wipe them with the towel wherewith he was girded.",pt:"Depois deitou \xe1gua na bacia e come\xe7ou a lavar os p\xe9s aos disc\xedpulos, e a enxugar-lhos com a toalha com que estava cingido."},{verse:6,en:"Then cometh he to Simon Peter: and Peter saith unto him, Lord, dost thou wash my feet?",pt:"Chegou, pois, a Sim\xe3o Pedro, que lhe disse: Senhor, lavas-me os p\xe9s a mim?"},{verse:7,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, What I do thou knowest not now; but thou shalt know hereafter.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: O que eu fa\xe7o, tu n\xe3o o sabes agora; mas depois o entender\xe1s."},{verse:8,en:"Peter saith unto him, Thou shalt never wash my feet. Jesus answered him, If I wash thee not, thou hast no part with me.",pt:"Tornou-lhe Pedro: Nunca me lavar\xe1s os p\xe9s. Replicou-lhe Jesus: Se eu n\xe3o te lavar, n\xe3o tens parte comigo."},{verse:9,en:"Simon Peter saith unto him, Lord, not my feet only, but also my hands and my head.",pt:"Disse-lhe Sim\xe3o Pedro: Senhor, n\xe3o somente os meus p\xe9s, mas tamb\xe9m as m\xe3os e a cabe\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"Jesus saith to him, He that is washed needeth not save to wash his feet, but is clean every whit: and ye are clean, but not all.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Aquele que se banhou n\xe3o necessita de lavar sen\xe3o os p\xe9s, pois no mais est\xe1 todo limpo; e v\xf3s estais limpos, mas n\xe3o todos."},{verse:11,en:"For he knew who should betray him; therefore said he, Ye are not all clean.",pt:"Pois ele sabia quem o estava traindo; por isso disse: Nem todos estais limpos."},{verse:12,en:"So after he had washed their feet, and had taken his garments, and was set down again, he said unto them, Know ye what I have done to you?",pt:"Ora, depois de lhes ter lavado os p\xe9s, tomou o manto, tornou a reclinar-se \xe0 mesa e perguntou-lhes: Entendeis o que vos tenho feito?"},{verse:13,en:"Ye call me Master and Lord: and ye say well; for so I am.",pt:"V\xf3s me chamais Mestre e Senhor; e dizeis bem, porque eu o sou."},{verse:14,en:"If I then, your Lord and Master, have washed your feet; ye also ought to wash one another\u2019s feet.",pt:"Ora, se eu, o Senhor e Mestre, vos lavei os p\xe9s, tamb\xe9m v\xf3s deveis lavar os p\xe9s uns aos outros."},{verse:15,en:"For I have given you an example, that ye should do as I have done to you.",pt:"Porque eu vos dei exemplo, para que, como eu vos fiz, fa\xe7ais v\xf3s tamb\xe9m."},{verse:16,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, The servant is not greater than his lord; neither he that is sent greater than he that sent him.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: N\xe3o \xe9 o servo maior do que o seu senhor, nem o enviado maior do que aquele que o enviou."},{verse:17,en:"If ye know these things, happy are ye if ye do them.",pt:"Se sabeis estas coisas, bem-aventurados sois se as praticardes."},{verse:18,en:"I speak not of you all: I know whom I have chosen: but that the scripture may be fulfilled, He that eateth bread with me hath lifted up his heel against me.",pt:"N\xe3o falo de todos v\xf3s; eu conhe\xe7o aqueles que escolhi; mas para que se cumprisse a escritura: O que comia do meu p\xe3o, levantou contra mim o seu calcanhar."},{verse:19,en:"Now I tell you before it come, that, when it is come to pass, ye may believe that I am he.",pt:"Desde j\xe1 no-lo digo, antes que suceda, para que, quando suceder, creiais que eu sou."},{verse:20,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that receiveth whomsoever I send receiveth me; and he that receiveth me receiveth him that sent me.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Quem receber aquele que eu enviar, a mim me recebe; e quem me recebe a mim, recebe aquele que me enviou."},{verse:21,en:"When Jesus had thus said, he was troubled in spirit, and testified, and said, Verily, verily, I say unto you, that one of you shall betray me.",pt:"Tendo Jesus dito isto, turbou-se em esp\xedrito, e declarou: Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que um de v\xf3s me h\xe1 de trair."},{verse:22,en:"Then the disciples looked one on another, doubting of whom he spake.",pt:"Os disc\xedpulos se entreolhavam, perplexos, sem saber de quem ele falava."},{verse:23,en:"Now there was leaning on Jesus\u2019 bosom one of his disciples, whom Jesus loved.",pt:"Ora, achava-se reclinado sobre o peito de Jesus um de seus disc\xedpulos, aquele a quem Jesus amava."},{verse:24,en:"Simon Peter therefore beckoned to him, that he should ask who it should be of whom he spake.",pt:"A esse, pois, fez Sim\xe3o Pedro sinal, e lhe pediu: Pergunta- lhe de quem \xe9 que fala."},{verse:25,en:"He then lying on Jesus\u2019 breast saith unto him, Lord, who is it?",pt:"Aquele disc\xedpulo, recostando-se assim ao peito de Jesus, perguntou-lhe: Senhor, quem \xe9?"},{verse:26,en:"Jesus answered, He it is, to whom I shall give a sop, when I have dipped it. And when he had dipped the sop, he gave it to Judas Iscariot, the son of Simon.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: \xc9 aquele a quem eu der o peda\xe7o de p\xe3o molhado. Tendo, pois, molhado um bocado de p\xe3o, deu-o a Judas, filho de Sim\xe3o Iscariotes."},{verse:27,en:"And after the sop Satan entered into him. Then said Jesus unto him, That thou doest, do quickly.",pt:"E, logo ap\xf3s o bocado, entrou nele Satan\xe1s. Disse-lhe, pois, Jesus: O que fazes, faze-o depressa."},{verse:28,en:"Now no man at the table knew for what intent he spake this unto him.",pt:"E nenhum dos que estavam \xe0 mesa percebeu a que prop\xf3sito lhe disse isto;"},{verse:29,en:"For some of them thought, because Judas had the bag, that Jesus had said unto him, Buy those things that we have need of against the feast; or, that he should give something to the poor.",pt:"pois, como Judas tinha a bolsa, pensavam alguns que Jesus lhe queria dizer: Compra o que nos \xe9 necess\xe1rio para a festa; ou, que desse alguma coisa aos pobres."},{verse:30,en:"He then having received the sop went immediately out: and it was night.",pt:"Ent\xe3o ele, tendo recebido o bocado saiu logo. E era noite."},{verse:31,en:"Therefore, when he was gone out, Jesus said, Now is the Son of man glorified, and God is glorified in him.",pt:"Tendo ele, pois, sa\xeddo, disse Jesus: Agora \xe9 glorificado o Filho do homem, e Deus \xe9 glorificado nele;"},{verse:32,en:"If God be glorified in him, God shall also glorify him in himself, and shall straightway glorify him.",pt:"se Deus \xe9 glorificado nele, tamb\xe9m Deus o glorificar\xe1 em si mesmo, e logo o h\xe1 de glorificar."},{verse:33,en:"Little children, yet a little while I am with you. Ye shall seek me: and as I said unto the Jews, Whither I go, ye cannot come; so now I say to you.",pt:"Filhinhos, ainda por um pouco estou convosco. Procurar-me- eis; e, como eu disse aos judeus, tamb\xe9m a v\xf3s o digo agora: Para onde eu vou, n\xe3o podeis v\xf3s ir."},{verse:34,en:"A new commandment I give unto you, That ye love one another; as I have loved you, that ye also love one another.",pt:"Um novo mandamento vos dou: que vos ameis uns aos outros; assim como eu vos amei a v\xf3s, que tamb\xe9m v\xf3s vos ameis uns aos outros."},{verse:35,en:"By this shall all men know that ye are my disciples, if ye have love one to another.",pt:"Nisto conhecer\xe3o todos que sois meus disc\xedpulos, se tiverdes amor uns aos outros."},{verse:36,en:"Simon Peter said unto him, Lord, whither goest thou? Jesus answered him, Whither I go, thou canst not follow me now; but thou shalt follow me afterwards.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Sim\xe3o Pedro: Senhor, para onde vais? Respondeu Jesus; Para onde eu vou, n\xe3o podes agora seguir-me; mais tarde, por\xe9m, me seguir\xe1s."},{verse:37,en:"Peter said unto him, Lord, why cannot I follow thee now? I will lay down my life for thy sake.",pt:"Disse-lhe Pedro: Por que n\xe3o posso seguir-te agora? Por ti darei a minha vida."},{verse:38,en:"Jesus answered him, Wilt thou lay down thy life for my sake? Verily, verily, I say unto thee, The cock shall not crow, till thou hast denied me thrice.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Dar\xe1s a tua vida por mim? Em verdade, em verdade te digo: N\xe3o cantar\xe1 o galo at\xe9 que me tenhas negado tr\xeas vezes."}]}}),676,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Let not your heart be troubled: ye believe in God, believe also in me.",pt:"N\xe3o se turbe o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o; credes em Deus, crede tamb\xe9m em mim."},{verse:2,en:"In my Father\u2019s house are many mansions: if it were not so, I would have told you. I go to prepare a place for you.",pt:"Na casa de meu Pai h\xe1 muitas moradas; se n\xe3o fosse assim, eu vo-lo teria dito; vou preparar-vos lugar."},{verse:3,en:"And if I go and prepare a place for you, I will come again, and receive you unto myself; that where I am, there ye may be also.",pt:"E, se eu for e vos preparar lugar, virei outra vez, e vos tomarei para mim mesmo, para que onde eu estiver estejais v\xf3s tamb\xe9m."},{verse:4,en:"And whither I go ye know, and the way ye know.",pt:"E para onde eu vou v\xf3s conheceis o caminho."},{verse:5,en:"Thomas saith unto him, Lord, we know not whither thou goest; and how can we know the way?",pt:"Disse-lhe Tom\xe9: Senhor, n\xe3o sabemos para onde vais; e como podemos saber o caminho?"},{verse:6,en:"Jesus saith unto him, I am the way, the truth, and the life: no man cometh unto the Father, but by me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Eu sou o caminho, e a verdade, e a vida; ningu\xe9m vem ao Pai, sen\xe3o por mim."},{verse:7,en:"If ye had known me, ye should have known my Father also: and from henceforth ye know him, and have seen him.",pt:"Se v\xf3s me conhec\xeasseis a mim, tamb\xe9m conhecer\xedeis a meu Pai; e j\xe1 desde agora o conheceis, e o tendes visto."},{verse:8,en:"Philip saith unto him, Lord, shew us the Father, and it sufficeth us.",pt:"Disse-lhe Felipe: Senhor, mostra-nos o Pai, e isso nos basta."},{verse:9,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Have I been so long time with you, and yet hast thou not known me, Philip? he that hath seen me hath seen the Father; and how sayest thou then, Shew us the Father?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: H\xe1 tanto tempo que estou convosco, e ainda n\xe3o me conheces, Felipe? Quem me viu a mim, viu o Pai; como dizes tu: Mostra-nos o Pai?"},{verse:10,en:"Believest thou not that I am in the Father, and the Father in me? the words that I speak unto you I speak not of myself: but the Father that dwelleth in me, he doeth the works.",pt:"N\xe3o cr\xeas tu que eu estou no Pai, e que o Pai est\xe1 em mim? As palavras que eu vos digo, n\xe3o as digo por mim mesmo; mas o Pai, que permanece em mim, \xe9 quem faz as suas obras."},{verse:11,en:"Believe me that I am in the Father, and the Father in me: or else believe me for the very works\u2019 sake.",pt:"Crede-me que eu estou no Pai, e que o Pai est\xe1 em mim; crede ao menos por causa das mesmas obras."},{verse:12,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that believeth on me, the works that I do shall he do also; and greater works than these shall he do; because I go unto my Father.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade vos digo: Aquele que cr\xea em mim, esse tamb\xe9m far\xe1 as obras que eu fa\xe7o, e as far\xe1 maiores do que estas; porque eu vou para o Pai;"},{verse:13,en:"And whatsoever ye shall ask in my name, that will I do, that the Father may be glorified in the Son.",pt:"e tudo quanto pedirdes em meu nome, eu o farei, para que o Pai seja glorificado no Filho."},{verse:14,en:"If ye shall ask any thing in my name, I will do it.",pt:"Se me pedirdes alguma coisa em meu nome, eu a farei."},{verse:15,en:"If ye love me, keep my commandments.",pt:"Se me amardes, guardareis os meus mandamentos."},{verse:16,en:"And I will pray the Father, and he shall give you another Comforter, that he may abide with you for ever;",pt:"E eu rogarei ao Pai, e ele vos dar\xe1 outro Ajudador, para que fique convosco para sempre."},{verse:17,en:"Even the Spirit of truth; whom the world cannot receive, because it seeth him not, neither knoweth him: but ye know him; for he dwelleth with you, and shall be in you.",pt:"a saber, o Esp\xedrito da verdade, o qual o mundo n\xe3o pode receber; porque n\xe3o o v\xea nem o conhece; mas v\xf3s o conheceis, porque ele habita convosco, e estar\xe1 em v\xf3s."},{verse:18,en:"I will not leave you comfortless: I will come to you.",pt:"N\xe3o vos deixarei \xf3rf\xe3os; voltarei a v\xf3s."},{verse:19,en:"Yet a little while, and the world seeth me no more; but ye see me: because I live, ye shall live also.",pt:"Ainda um pouco, e o mundo n\xe3o me ver\xe1 mais; mas v\xf3s me vereis, porque eu vivo, e v\xf3s vivereis."},{verse:20,en:"At that day ye shall know that I am in my Father, and ye in me, and I in you.",pt:"Naquele dia conhecereis que estou em meu Pai, e v\xf3s em mim, e eu em v\xf3s."},{verse:21,en:"He that hath my commandments, and keepeth them, he it is that loveth me: and he that loveth me shall be loved of my Father, and I will love him, and will manifest myself to him.",pt:"Aquele que tem os meus mandamentos e os guarda, esse \xe9 o que me ama; e aquele que me ama ser\xe1 amado de meu Pai, e eu o amarei, e me manifestarei a ele."},{verse:22,en:"Judas saith unto him, not Iscariot, Lord, how is it that thou wilt manifest thyself unto us, and not unto the world?",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Judas (n\xe3o o Iscariotes): O que houve, Senhor, que te h\xe1s de manifestar a n\xf3s, e n\xe3o ao mundo?"},{verse:23,en:"Jesus answered and said unto him, If a man love me, he will keep my words: and my Father will love him, and we will come unto him, and make our abode with him.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se algu\xe9m me amar, guardar\xe1 a minha palavra; e meu Pai o amar\xe1, e viremos a ele, e faremos nele morada."},{verse:24,en:"He that loveth me not keepeth not my sayings: and the word which ye hear is not mine, but the Father\u2019s which sent me.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o me ama, n\xe3o guarda as minhas palavras; ora, a palavra que estais ouvindo n\xe3o \xe9 minha, mas do Pai que me enviou."},{verse:25,en:"These things have I spoken unto you, being yet present with you.",pt:"Estas coisas vos tenho falado, estando ainda convosco."},{verse:26,en:"But the Comforter, which is the Holy Ghost, whom the Father will send in my name, he shall teach you all things, and bring all things to your remembrance, whatsoever I have said unto you.",pt:"Mas o Ajudador, o Esp\xedrito Santo a quem o Pai enviar\xe1 em meu nome, esse vos ensinar\xe1 todas as coisas, e vos far\xe1 lembrar de tudo quanto eu vos tenho dito."},{verse:27,en:"Peace I leave with you, my peace I give unto you: not as the world giveth, give I unto you. Let not your heart be troubled, neither let it be afraid.",pt:"Deixo-vos a paz, a minha paz vos dou; eu n\xe3o vo-la dou como o mundo a d\xe1. N\xe3o se turbe o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o, nem se atemorize."},{verse:28,en:"Ye have heard how I said unto you, I go away, and come again unto you. If ye loved me, ye would rejoice, because I said, I go unto the Father: for my Father is greater than I.",pt:"Ouvistes que eu vos disse: Vou, e voltarei a v\xf3s. Se me am\xe1sseis, alegrar-vos-\xedeis de que eu v\xe1 para o Pai; porque o Pai \xe9 maior do que eu."},{verse:29,en:"And now I have told you before it come to pass, that, when it is come to pass, ye might believe.",pt:"Eu vo-lo disse agora, antes que aconte\xe7a, para que, quando acontecer, v\xf3s creiais."},{verse:30,en:"Hereafter I will not talk much with you: for the prince of this world cometh, and hath nothing in me.",pt:"J\xe1 n\xe3o falarei muito convosco, porque vem o pr\xedncipe deste mundo, e ele nada tem em mim;"},{verse:31,en:"But that the world may know that I love the Father; and as the Father gave me commandment, even so I do. Arise, let us go hence.",pt:"mas, assim como o Pai me ordenou, assim mesmo fa\xe7o, para que o mundo saiba que eu amo o Pai. Levantai-vos, vamo-nos daqui."}]}}),677,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I am the true vine, and my Father is the husbandman.",pt:"Eu sou a videira verdadeira, e meu Pai \xe9 o viticultor."},{verse:2,en:"Every branch in me that beareth not fruit he taketh away: and every branch that beareth fruit, he purgeth it, that it may bring forth more fruit.",pt:"Toda vara em mim que n\xe3o d\xe1 fruto, ele a corta; e toda vara que d\xe1 fruto, ele a limpa, para que d\xea mais fruto."},{verse:3,en:"Now ye are clean through the word which I have spoken unto you.",pt:"V\xf3s j\xe1 estais limpos pela palavra que vos tenho falado."},{verse:4,en:"Abide in me, and I in you. As the branch cannot bear fruit of itself, except it abide in the vine; no more can ye, except ye abide in me.",pt:"Permanecei em mim, e eu permanecerei em v\xf3s; como a vara de si mesma n\xe3o pode dar fruto, se n\xe3o permanecer na videira, assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, se n\xe3o permanecerdes em mim."},{verse:5,en:"I am the vine, ye are the branches: He that abideth in me, and I in him, the same bringeth forth much fruit: for without me ye can do nothing.",pt:"Eu sou a videira; v\xf3s sois as varas. Quem permanece em mim e eu nele, esse d\xe1 muito fruto; porque sem mim nada podeis fazer."},{verse:6,en:"If a man abide not in me, he is cast forth as a branch, and is withered; and men gather them, and cast them into the fire, and they are burned.",pt:"Quem n\xe3o permanece em mim \xe9 lan\xe7ado fora, como a vara, e seca; tais varas s\xe3o recolhidas, lan\xe7adas no fogo e queimadas."},{verse:7,en:"If ye abide in me, and my words abide in you, ye shall ask what ye will, and it shall be done unto you.",pt:"Se v\xf3s permanecerdes em mim, e as minhas palavras permanecerem em v\xf3s, pedi o que quiserdes, e vos ser\xe1 feito."},{verse:8,en:"Herein is my Father glorified, that ye bear much fruit; so shall ye be my disciples.",pt:"Nisto \xe9 glorificado meu Pai, que deis muito fruto; e assim sereis meus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:9,en:"As the Father hath loved me, so have I loved you: continue ye in my love.",pt:"Como o Pai me amou, assim tamb\xe9m eu vos amei; permanecei no meu amor."},{verse:10,en:"If ye keep my commandments, ye shall abide in my love; even as I have kept my Father\u2019s commandments, and abide in his love.",pt:"Se guardardes os meus mandamentos, permanecereis no meu amor; do mesmo modo que eu tenho guardado os mandamentos de meu Pai, e permane\xe7o no seu amor."},{verse:11,en:"These things have I spoken unto you, that my joy might remain in you, and that your joy might be full.",pt:"Estas coisas vos tenho dito, para que o meu gozo permane\xe7a em v\xf3s, e o vosso gozo seja completo."},{verse:12,en:"This is my commandment, That ye love one another, as I have loved you.",pt:"O meu mandamento \xe9 este: Que vos ameis uns aos outros, assim como eu vos amei."},{verse:13,en:"Greater love hath no man than this, that a man lay down his life for his friends.",pt:"Ningu\xe9m tem maior amor do que este, de dar algu\xe9m a sua vida pelos seus amigos."},{verse:14,en:"Ye are my friends, if ye do whatsoever I command you.",pt:"V\xf3s sois meus amigos, se fizerdes o que eu vos mando."},{verse:15,en:"Henceforth I call you not servants; for the servant knoweth not what his lord doeth: but I have called you friends; for all things that I have heard of my Father I have made known unto you.",pt:"J\xe1 n\xe3o vos chamo servos, porque o servo n\xe3o sabe o que faz o seu senhor; mas chamei-vos amigos, porque tudo quanto ouvi de meu Pai vos dei a conhecer."},{verse:16,en:"Ye have not chosen me, but I have chosen you, and ordained you, that ye should go and bring forth fruit, and that your fruit should remain: that whatsoever ye shall ask of the Father in my name, he may give it you.",pt:"V\xf3s n\xe3o me escolhestes a mim mas eu vos escolhi a v\xf3s, e vos designei, para que vades e deis frutos, e o vosso fruto permane\xe7a, a fim de que tudo quanto pedirdes ao Pai em meu nome, ele vo-lo conceda."},{verse:17,en:"These things I command you, that ye love one another.",pt:"Isto vos mando: que vos ameis uns aos outros."},{verse:18,en:"If the world hate you, ye know that it hated me before it hated you.",pt:"Se o mundo vos odeia, sabei que, primeiro do que a v\xf3s, me odiou a mim."},{verse:19,en:"If ye were of the world, the world would love his own: but because ye are not of the world, but I have chosen you out of the world, therefore the world hateth you.",pt:"Se f\xf4sseis do mundo, o mundo amaria o que era seu; mas, porque n\xe3o sois do mundo, antes eu vos escolhi do mundo, por isso \xe9 que o mundo vos odeia."},{verse:20,en:"Remember the word that I said unto you, The servant is not greater than his lord. If they have persecuted me, they will also persecute you; if they have kept my saying, they will keep yours also.",pt:"Lembrai-vos da palavra que eu vos disse: N\xe3o \xe9 o servo maior do que o seu senhor. Se a mim me perseguiram, tamb\xe9m vos perseguir\xe3o a v\xf3s; se guardaram a minha palavra, guardar\xe3o tamb\xe9m a vossa."},{verse:21,en:"But all these things will they do unto you for my name\u2019s sake, because they know not him that sent me.",pt:"Mas tudo isto vos far\xe3o por causa do meu nome, porque n\xe3o conhecem aquele que me enviou."},{verse:22,en:"If I had not come and spoken unto them, they had not had sin: but now they have no cloke for their sin.",pt:"Se eu n\xe3o viera e n\xe3o lhes falara, n\xe3o teriam pecado; agora, por\xe9m, n\xe3o t\xeam desculpa do seu pecado."},{verse:23,en:"He that hateth me hateth my Father also.",pt:"Aquele que me odeia a mim, odeia tamb\xe9m a meu Pai."},{verse:24,en:"If I had not done among them the works which none other man did, they had not had sin: but now have they both seen and hated both me and my Father.",pt:"Se eu entre eles n\xe3o tivesse feito tais obras, quais nenhum outro fez, n\xe3o teriam pecado; mas agora, n\xe3o somente viram, mas tamb\xe9m odiaram tanto a mim como a meu Pai."},{verse:25,en:"But this cometh to pass, that the word might be fulfilled that is written in their law, They hated me without a cause.",pt:"Mas isto \xe9 para que se cumpra a palavra que est\xe1 escrita na sua lei: Odiaram-me sem causa."},{verse:26,en:"But when the Comforter is come, whom I will send unto you from the Father, even the Spirit of truth, which proceedeth from the Father, he shall testify of me:",pt:"Quando vier o Ajudador, que eu vos enviarei da parte do Pai, o Esp\xedrito da verdade, que do Pai procede, esse dar\xe1 testemunho de mim;"},{verse:27,en:"And ye also shall bear witness, because ye have been with me from the beginning.",pt:"e tamb\xe9m v\xf3s dareis testemunho, porque estais comigo desde o princ\xedpio."}]}}),678,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"These things have I spoken unto you, that ye should not be offended.",pt:"Tenho-vos dito estas coisas para que n\xe3o vos escandalizeis."},{verse:2,en:"They shall put you out of the synagogues: yea, the time cometh, that whosoever killeth you will think that he doeth God service.",pt:"Expulsar-vos-\xe3o das sinagogas; ainda mais, vem a hora em que qualquer que vos matar julgar\xe1 prestar um servi\xe7o a Deus."},{verse:3,en:"And these things will they do unto you, because they have not known the Father, nor me.",pt:"E isto vos far\xe3o, porque n\xe3o conheceram ao Pai nem a mim."},{verse:4,en:"But these things have I told you, that when the time shall come, ye may remember that I told you of them. And these things I said not unto you at the beginning, because I was with you.",pt:"Mas tenho-vos dito estas coisas, a fim de que, quando chegar aquela hora, vos lembreis de que eu vo-las tinha dito. N\xe3o vo-las disse desde o princ\xedpio, porque estava convosco."},{verse:5,en:"But now I go my way to him that sent me; and none of you asketh me, Whither goest thou?",pt:"Agora, por\xe9m, vou para aquele que me enviou; e nenhum de v\xf3s me pergunta: Para onde vais?"},{verse:6,en:"But because I have said these things unto you, sorrow hath filled your heart.",pt:"Antes, porque vos disse isto, o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o se encheu de tristeza."},{verse:7,en:"Nevertheless I tell you the truth; It is expedient for you that I go away: for if I go not away, the Comforter will not come unto you; but if I depart, I will send him unto you.",pt:"Todavia, digo-vos a verdade, conv\xe9m-vos que eu v\xe1; pois se eu n\xe3o for, o Ajudador n\xe3o vir\xe1 a v\xf3s; mas, se eu for, vo-lo enviarei."},{verse:8,en:"And when he is come, he will reprove the world of sin, and of righteousness, and of judgment:",pt:"E quando ele vier, convencer\xe1 o mundo do pecado, da justi\xe7a e do ju\xedzo:"},{verse:9,en:"Of sin, because they believe not on me;",pt:"do pecado, porque n\xe3o cr\xeaem em mim;"},{verse:10,en:"Of righteousness, because I go to my Father, and ye see me no more;",pt:"da justi\xe7a, porque vou para meu Pai, e n\xe3o me vereis mais,"},{verse:11,en:"Of judgment, because the prince of this world is judged.",pt:"e do ju\xedzo, porque o pr\xedncipe deste mundo j\xe1 est\xe1 julgado."},{verse:12,en:"I have yet many things to say unto you, but ye cannot bear them now.",pt:"Ainda tenho muito que vos dizer; mas v\xf3s n\xe3o o podeis suportar agora."},{verse:13,en:"Howbeit when he, the Spirit of truth, is come, he will guide you into all truth: for he shall not speak of himself; but whatsoever he shall hear, that shall he speak: and he will shew you things to come.",pt:"Quando vier, por\xe9m, aquele, o Esp\xedrito da verdade, ele vos guiar\xe1 a toda a verdade; porque n\xe3o falar\xe1 por si mesmo, mas dir\xe1 o que tiver ouvido, e vos anunciar\xe1 as coisas vindouras."},{verse:14,en:"He shall glorify me: for he shall receive of mine, and shall shew it unto you.",pt:"Ele me glorificar\xe1, porque receber\xe1 do que \xe9 meu, e vo-lo anunciar\xe1."},{verse:15,en:"All things that the Father hath are mine: therefore said I, that he shall take of mine, and shall shew it unto you.",pt:"Tudo quanto o Pai tem \xe9 meu; por isso eu vos disse que ele, recebendo do que \xe9 meu, vo-lo anunciar\xe1."},{verse:16,en:"A little while, and ye shall not see me: and again, a little while, and ye shall see me, because I go to the Father.",pt:"Um pouco, e j\xe1 n\xe3o me vereis; e outra vez um pouco, e ver-me-eis."},{verse:17,en:"Then said some of his disciples among themselves, What is this that he saith unto us, A little while, and ye shall not see me: and again, a little while, and ye shall see me: and, Because I go to the Father?",pt:"Ent\xe3o alguns dos seus disc\xedpulos perguntaram uns para os outros: Que \xe9 isto que nos diz? Um pouco, e n\xe3o me vereis; e outra vez um pouco, e ver-me-eis; e: Porquanto vou para o Pai?"},{verse:18,en:"They said therefore, What is this that he saith, A little while? we cannot tell what he saith.",pt:"Diziam pois: Que quer dizer isto: Um pouco? N\xe3o compreendemos o que ele est\xe1 dizendo."},{verse:19,en:"Now Jesus knew that they were desirous to ask him, and said unto them, Do ye enquire among yourselves of that I said, A little while, and ye shall not see me: and again, a little while, and ye shall see me?",pt:"Percebeu Jesus que o queriam interrogar, e disse-lhes: Indagais entre v\xf3s acerca disto que disse: Um pouco, e n\xe3o me vereis; e outra vez um pouco, e ver-me-eis?"},{verse:20,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto you, That ye shall weep and lament, but the world shall rejoice: and ye shall be sorrowful, but your sorrow shall be turned into joy.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade, vos digo que v\xf3s chorareis e vos lamentareis, mas o mundo se alegrar\xe1; v\xf3s estareis tristes, por\xe9m a vossa tristeza se converter\xe1 em alegria."},{verse:21,en:"A woman when she is in travail hath sorrow, because her hour is come: but as soon as she is delivered of the child, she remembereth no more the anguish, for joy that a man is born into the world.",pt:"A mulher, quando est\xe1 para dar \xe0 luz, sente tristeza porque \xe9 chegada a sua hora; mas, depois de ter dado \xe0 luz a crian\xe7a, j\xe1 n\xe3o se lembra da afli\xe7\xe3o, pelo gozo de haver um homem nascido ao mundo."},{verse:22,en:"And ye now therefore have sorrow: but I will see you again, and your heart shall rejoice, and your joy no man taketh from you.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s agora, na verdade, tendes tristeza; mas eu vos tornarei a ver, e alegrar-se-\xe1 o vosso cora\xe7\xe3o, e a vossa alegria ningu\xe9m vo-la tirar\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"And in that day ye shall ask me nothing. Verily, verily, I say unto you, Whatsoever ye shall ask the Father in my name, he will give it you.",pt:"Naquele dia nada me perguntareis. Em verdade, em verdade vos digo que tudo quanto pedirdes ao Pai, ele vo-lo conceder\xe1 em meu nome."},{verse:24,en:"Hitherto have ye asked nothing in my name: ask, and ye shall receive, that your joy may be full.",pt:"At\xe9 agora nada pedistes em meu nome; pedi, e recebereis, para que o vosso gozo seja completo."},{verse:25,en:"These things have I spoken unto you in proverbs: but the time cometh, when I shall no more speak unto you in proverbs, but I shall shew you plainly of the Father.",pt:"Disse-vos estas coisas por figuras; chega, por\xe9m, a hora em que vos n\xe3o falarei mais por figuras, mas abertamente vos falarei acerca do Pai."},{verse:26,en:"At that day ye shall ask in my name: and I say not unto you, that I will pray the Father for you:",pt:"Naquele dia pedireis em meu nome, e n\xe3o vos digo que eu rogarei por v\xf3s ao Pai;"},{verse:27,en:"For the Father himself loveth you, because ye have loved me, and have believed that I came out from God.",pt:"pois o Pai mesmo vos ama; visto que v\xf3s me amastes e crestes que eu sa\xed de Deus."},{verse:28,en:"I came forth from the Father, and am come into the world: again, I leave the world, and go to the Father.",pt:"Sa\xed do Pai, e vim ao mundo; outra vez deixo o mundo, e vou para o Pai."},{verse:29,en:"His disciples said unto him, Lo, now speakest thou plainly, and speakest no proverb.",pt:"Disseram os seus disc\xedpulos: Eis que agora falas abertamente, e n\xe3o por figura alguma."},{verse:30,en:"Now are we sure that thou knowest all things, and needest not that any man should ask thee: by this we believe that thou camest forth from God.",pt:"Agora conhecemos que sabes todas as coisas, e n\xe3o necessitas de que algu\xe9m te interrogue. Por isso cremos que sa\xedste de Deus."},{verse:31,en:"Jesus answered them, Do ye now believe?",pt:"Respondeu-lhes Jesus: Credes agora?"},{verse:32,en:"Behold, the hour cometh, yea, is now come, that ye shall be scattered, every man to his own, and shall leave me alone: and yet I am not alone, because the Father is with me.",pt:"Eis que vem a hora, e j\xe1 \xe9 chegada, em que v\xf3s sereis dispersos cada um para o seu lado, e me deixareis s\xf3; mas n\xe3o estou s\xf3, porque o Pai est\xe1 comigo."},{verse:33,en:"These things I have spoken unto you, that in me ye might have peace. In the world ye shall have tribulation: but be of good cheer; I have overcome the world.",pt:"Tenho-vos dito estas coisas, para que em mim tenhais paz. No mundo tereis tribula\xe7\xf5es; mas tende bom \xe2nimo, eu venci o mundo."}]}}),679,[]);
__d((function(e,t,a,o,s,h,n){s.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"These words spake Jesus, and lifted up his eyes to heaven, and said, Father, the hour is come; glorify thy Son, that thy Son also may glorify thee:",pt:"Depois de assim falar, Jesus, levantando os olhos ao c\xe9u, disse: Pai, \xe9 chegada a hora; glorifica a teu Filho, para que tamb\xe9m o Filho te glorifique;"},{verse:2,en:"As thou hast given him power over all flesh, that he should give eternal life to as many as thou hast given him.",pt:"assim como lhe deste autoridade sobre toda a carne, para que d\xea a vida eterna a todos aqueles que lhe tens dado."},{verse:3,en:"And this is life eternal, that they might know thee the only true God, and Jesus Christ, whom thou hast sent.",pt:"E a vida eterna \xe9 esta: que te conhe\xe7am a ti, como o \xfanico Deus verdadeiro, e a Jesus Cristo, aquele que tu enviaste."},{verse:4,en:"I have glorified thee on the earth: I have finished the work which thou gavest me to do.",pt:"Eu te glorifiquei na terra, completando a obra que me deste para fazer."},{verse:5,en:"And now, O Father, glorify thou me with thine own self with the glory which I had with thee before the world was.",pt:"Agora, pois, glorifica-me tu, \xf3 Pai, junto de ti mesmo, com aquela gl\xf3ria que eu tinha contigo antes que o mundo existisse."},{verse:6,en:"I have manifested thy name unto the men which thou gavest me out of the world: thine they were, and thou gavest them me; and they have kept thy word.",pt:"Manifestei o teu nome aos homens que do mundo me deste. Eram teus, e tu mos deste; e guardaram a tua palavra."},{verse:7,en:"Now they have known that all things whatsoever thou hast given me are of thee.",pt:"Agora sabem que tudo quanto me deste prov\xe9m de ti;"},{verse:8,en:"For I have given unto them the words which thou gavest me; and they have received them, and have known surely that I came out from thee, and they have believed that thou didst send me.",pt:"porque eu lhes dei as palavras que tu me deste, e eles as receberam, e verdadeiramente conheceram que sa\xed de ti, e creram que tu me enviaste."},{verse:9,en:"I pray for them: I pray not for the world, but for them which thou hast given me; for they are thine.",pt:"Eu rogo por eles; n\xe3o rogo pelo mundo, mas por aqueles que me tens dado, porque s\xe3o teus;"},{verse:10,en:"And all mine are thine, and thine are mine; and I am glorified in them.",pt:"todas as minhas coisas s\xe3o tuas, e as tuas coisas s\xe3o minhas; e neles sou glorificado."},{verse:11,en:"And now I am no more in the world, but these are in the world, and I come to thee. Holy Father, keep through thine own name those whom thou hast given me, that they may be one, as we are.",pt:"Eu n\xe3o estou mais no mundo; mas eles est\xe3o no mundo, e eu vou para ti. Pai santo, guarda-os no teu nome, o qual me deste, para que eles sejam um, assim como n\xf3s."},{verse:12,en:"While I was with them in the world, I kept them in thy name: those that thou gavest me I have kept, and none of them is lost, but the son of perdition; that the scripture might be fulfilled.",pt:"Enquanto eu estava com eles, eu os guardava no teu nome que me deste; e os conservei, e nenhum deles se perdeu, sen\xe3o o filho da perdi\xe7\xe3o, para que se cumprisse a Escritura."},{verse:13,en:"And now come I to thee; and these things I speak in the world, that they might have my joy fulfilled in themselves.",pt:"Mas agora vou para ti; e isto falo no mundo, para que eles tenham a minha alegria completa em si mesmos."},{verse:14,en:"I have given them thy word; and the world hath hated them, because they are not of the world, even as I am not of the world.",pt:"Eu lhes dei a tua palavra; e o mundo os odiou, porque n\xe3o s\xe3o do mundo, assim como eu n\xe3o sou do mundo."},{verse:15,en:"I pray not that thou shouldest take them out of the world, but that thou shouldest keep them from the evil.",pt:"N\xe3o rogo que os tires do mundo, mas que os guardes do Maligno."},{verse:16,en:"They are not of the world, even as I am not of the world.",pt:"Eles n\xe3o s\xe3o do mundo, assim como eu n\xe3o sou do mundo."},{verse:17,en:"Sanctify them through thy truth: thy word is truth.",pt:"Santifica-os na verdade, a tua palavra \xe9 a verdade."},{verse:18,en:"As thou hast sent me into the world, even so have I also sent them into the world.",pt:"Assim como tu me enviaste ao mundo, tamb\xe9m eu os enviarei ao mundo."},{verse:19,en:"And for their sakes I sanctify myself, that they also might be sanctified through the truth.",pt:"E por eles eu me santifico, para que tamb\xe9m eles sejam santificados na verdade."},{verse:20,en:"Neither pray I for these alone, but for them also which shall believe on me through their word;",pt:"E rogo n\xe3o somente por estes, mas tamb\xe9m por aqueles que pela sua palavra h\xe3o de crer em mim;"},{verse:21,en:"That they all may be one; as thou, Father, art in me, and I in thee, that they also may be one in us: that the world may believe that thou hast sent me.",pt:"para que todos sejam um; assim como tu, \xf3 Pai, \xe9s em mim, e eu em ti, que tamb\xe9m eles sejam um em n\xf3s; para que o mundo creia que tu me enviaste."},{verse:22,en:"And the glory which thou gavest me I have given them; that they may be one, even as we are one:",pt:"E eu lhes dei a gl\xf3ria que a mim me deste, para que sejam um, como n\xf3s somos um;"},{verse:23,en:"I in them, and thou in me, that they may be made perfect in one; and that the world may know that thou hast sent me, and hast loved them, as thou hast loved me.",pt:"eu neles, e tu em mim, para que eles sejam perfeitos em unidade, a fim de que o mundo conhe\xe7a que tu me enviaste, e que os amaste a eles, assim como me amaste a mim."},{verse:24,en:"Father, I will that they also, whom thou hast given me, be with me where I am; that they may behold my glory, which thou hast given me: for thou lovedst me before the foundation of the world.",pt:"Pai, desejo que onde eu estou, estejam comigo tamb\xe9m aqueles que me tens dado, para verem a minha gl\xf3ria, a qual me deste; pois que me amaste antes da funda\xe7\xe3o do mundo."},{verse:25,en:"O righteous Father, the world hath not known thee: but I have known thee, and these have known that thou hast sent me.",pt:"Pai justo, o mundo n\xe3o te conheceu, mas eu te conhe\xe7o; conheceram que tu me enviaste;"},{verse:26,en:"And I have declared unto them thy name, and will declare it: that the love wherewith thou hast loved me may be in them, and I in them.",pt:"e eu lhes fiz conhecer o teu nome, e lho farei conhecer ainda; para que haja neles aquele amor com que me amaste, e tamb\xe9m eu neles esteja."}]}}),680,[]);
__d((function(e,s,a,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When Jesus had spoken these words, he went forth with his disciples over the brook Cedron, where was a garden, into the which he entered, and his disciples.",pt:"Tendo Jesus dito isto, saiu com seus disc\xedpulos para o outro lado do ribeiro de Cedrom, onde havia um jardim, e com eles ali entrou."},{verse:2,en:"And Judas also, which betrayed him, knew the place: for Jesus ofttimes resorted thither with his disciples.",pt:"Ora, Judas, que o tra\xeda, tamb\xe9m conhecia aquele lugar, porque muitas vezes Jesus se reunira ali com os disc\xedpulos."},{verse:3,en:"Judas then, having received a band of men and officers from the chief priests and Pharisees, cometh thither with lanterns and torches and weapons.",pt:"Tendo, pois, Judas tomado a coorte e uns guardas da parte dos principais sacerdotes e fariseus, chegou ali com lanternas archotes e armas."},{verse:4,en:"Jesus therefore, knowing all things that should come upon him, went forth, and said unto them, Whom seek ye?",pt:"Sabendo, pois, Jesus tudo o que lhe havia de suceder, adiantou-se e perguntou-lhes: A quem buscais?"},{verse:5,en:"They answered him, Jesus of Nazareth. Jesus saith unto them, I amhe. And Judas also, which betrayed him, stood with them.",pt:"Responderam-lhe: A Jesus, o nazareno. Disse-lhes Jesus: Sou eu. E Judas, que o tra\xeda, tamb\xe9m estava com eles."},{verse:6,en:"As soon then as he had said unto them, I am he, they went backward, and fell to the ground.",pt:"Quando Jesus lhes disse: Sou eu, recuaram, e cairam por terra."},{verse:7,en:"Then asked he them again, Whom seek ye? And they said, Jesus of Nazareth.",pt:"Tornou-lhes ent\xe3o a perguntar: A quem buscais? e responderam: A Jesus, o nazareno."},{verse:8,en:"Jesus answered, I have told you that I am he: if therefore ye seek me, let these go their way:",pt:"Replicou-lhes Jesus: J\xe1 vos disse que sou eu; se, pois, \xe9 a mim que buscais, deixai ir estes;"},{verse:9,en:"That the saying might be fulfilled, which he spake, Of them which thou gavest me have I lost none.",pt:"para que se cumprisse a palavra que dissera: Dos que me tens dado, nenhum deles perdi."},{verse:10,en:"Then Simon Peter having a sword drew it, and smote the high priest\u2019s servant, and cut off his right ear. The servant\u2019s name was Malchus.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Sim\xe3o Pedro, que tinha uma espada, desembainhou-a e feriu o servo do sumo sacerdote, cortando-lhe a orelha direita. O nome do servo era Malco."},{verse:11,en:"Then said Jesus unto Peter, Put up thy sword into the sheath: the cup which my Father hath given me, shall I not drink it?",pt:"Disse, pois, Jesus a Pedro: Mete a tua espada na bainha; n\xe3o hei de beber o c\xe1lice que o Pai me deu?"},{verse:12,en:"Then the band and the captain and officers of the Jews took Jesus, and bound him,",pt:"Ent\xe3o a coorte, e o comandante, e os guardas dos judeus prenderam a Jesus, e o maniataram."},{verse:13,en:"And led him away to Annas first; for he was father in law to Caiaphas, which was the high priest that same year.",pt:"E conduziram-no primeiramente a An\xe1s; pois era sogro de Caif\xe1s, sumo sacerdote naquele ano."},{verse:14,en:"Now Caiaphas was he, which gave counsel to the Jews, that it was expedient that one man should die for the people.",pt:"Ora, Caif\xe1s era quem aconselhara aos judeus que convinha morrer um homem pelo povo."},{verse:15,en:"And Simon Peter followed Jesus, and so did another disciple: that disciple was known unto the high priest, and went in with Jesus into the palace of the high priest.",pt:"Sim\xe3o Pedro e outro disc\xedpulo seguiam a Jesus. Este disc\xedpulo era conhecido do sumo sacerdote, e entrou com Jesus no p\xe1tio do sumo sacerdote,"},{verse:16,en:"But Peter stood at the door without. Then went out that other disciple, which was known unto the high priest, and spake unto her that kept the door, and brought in Peter.",pt:"enquanto Pedro ficava da parte de fora, \xe0 porta. Saiu, ent\xe3o, o outro disc\xedpulo que era conhecido do sumo sacerdote, falou \xe0 porteira, e levou Pedro para dentro."},{verse:17,en:"Then saith the damsel that kept the door unto Peter, Art not thou also one of this man\u2019s disciples? He saith, I am not.",pt:"Ent\xe3o a porteira perguntou a Pedro: N\xe3o \xe9s tu tamb\xe9m um dos disc\xedpulos deste homem? Respondeu ele: N\xe3o sou."},{verse:18,en:"And the servants and officers stood there, who had made a fire of coals; for it was cold: and they warmed themselves: and Peter stood with them, and warmed himself.",pt:"Ora, estavam ali os servos e os guardas, que tinham acendido um braseiro e se aquentavam, porque fazia frio; e tamb\xe9m Pedro estava ali em p\xe9 no meio deles, aquentando-se."},{verse:19,en:"The high priest then asked Jesus of his disciples, and of his doctrine.",pt:"Ent\xe3o o sumo sacerdote interrogou Jesus acerca dos seus disc\xedpulos e da sua doutrina."},{verse:20,en:"Jesus answered him, I spake openly to the world; I ever taught in the synagogue, and in the temple, whither the Jews always resort; and in secret have I said nothing.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Eu tenho falado abertamente ao mundo; eu sempre ensinei nas sinagogas e no templo, onde todos os judeus se congregam, e nada falei em oculto."},{verse:21,en:"Why askest thou me? ask them which heard me, what I have said unto them: behold, they know what I said.",pt:"Por que me perguntas a mim? pergunta aos que me ouviram o que \xe9 que lhes falei; eis que eles sabem o que eu disse."},{verse:22,en:"And when he had thus spoken, one of the officers which stood by struck Jesus with the palm of his hand, saying, Answerest thou the high priest so?",pt:"E, havendo ele dito isso, um dos guardas que ali estavam deu uma bofetada em Jesus, dizendo: \xc9 assim que respondes ao sumo sacerdote?"},{verse:23,en:"Jesus answered him, If I have spoken evil, bear witness of the evil: but if well, why smitest thou me?",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se falei mal, d\xe1 testemunho do mal; mas, se bem, por que me feres?"},{verse:24,en:"Now Annas had sent him bound unto Caiaphas the high priest.",pt:"Ent\xe3o An\xe1s o enviou, maniatado, a Caif\xe1s, o sumo sacerdote."},{verse:25,en:"And Simon Peter stood and warmed himself. They said therefore unto him, Art not thou also one of his disciples? He denied it, and said, I am not.",pt:"E Sim\xe3o Pedro ainda estava ali, aquentando-se. Perguntaram- lhe, pois: N\xe3o \xe9s tamb\xe9m tu um dos seus disc\xedpulos? Ele negou, e disse: N\xe3o sou."},{verse:26,en:"One of the servants of the high priest, being his kinsman whose ear Peter cut off, saith, Did not I see thee in the garden with him?",pt:"Um dos servos do sumo sacerdote, parente daquele a quem Pedro cortara a orelha, disse: N\xe3o te vi eu no jardim com ele?"},{verse:27,en:"Peter then denied again: and immediately the cock crew.",pt:"Pedro negou outra vez, e imediatamente o galo cantou."},{verse:28,en:"Then led they Jesus from Caiaphas unto the hall of judgment: and it was early; and they themselves went not into the judgment hall, lest they should be defiled; but that they might eat the passover.",pt:"Depois conduziram Jesus da presen\xe7a de Caif\xe1s para o pret\xf3rio; era de manh\xe3 cedo; e eles n\xe3o entraram no pret\xf3rio, para n\xe3o se contaminarem, mas poderem comer a p\xe1scoa."},{verse:29,en:"Pilate then went out unto them, and said, What accusation bring ye against this man?",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos saiu a ter com eles, e perguntou: Que acusa\xe7\xe3o trazeis contra este homem?"},{verse:30,en:"They answered and said unto him, If he were not a malefactor, we would not have delivered him up unto thee.",pt:"Responderam-lhe: Se ele n\xe3o fosse malfeitor, n\xe3o to entregar\xedamos."},{verse:31,en:"Then said Pilate unto them, Take ye him, and judge him according to your law. The Jews therefore said unto him, It is not lawful for us to put any man to death:",pt:"Disse-lhes, ent\xe3o, Pilatos: Tomai-o v\xf3s, e julgai-o segundo a vossa lei. Disseram-lhe os judeus: A n\xf3s n\xe3o nos \xe9 l\xedcito tirar a vida a ningu\xe9m."},{verse:32,en:"That the saying of Jesus might be fulfilled, which he spake, signifying what death he should die.",pt:"Isso foi para que se cumprisse a palavra que dissera Jesus, significando de que morte havia de morrer."},{verse:33,en:"Then Pilate entered into the judgment hall again, and called Jesus, and said unto him, Art thou the King of the Jews?",pt:"Pilatos, pois, tornou a entrar no pret\xf3rio, chamou a Jesus e perguntou-lhe: \xc9s tu o rei dos judeus?"},{verse:34,en:"Jesus answered him, Sayest thou this thing of thyself, or did others tell it thee of me?",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: Dizes isso de ti mesmo, ou foram outros que to disseram de mim?"},{verse:35,en:"Pilate answered, Am I a Jew? Thine own nation and the chief priests have delivered thee unto me: what hast thou done?",pt:"Replicou Pilatos: Porventura sou eu judeu? O teu povo e os principais sacerdotes entregaram-te a mim; que fizeste?"},{verse:36,en:"Jesus answered, My kingdom is not of this world: if my kingdom were of this world, then would my servants fight, that I should not be delivered to the Jews: but now is my kingdom not from hence.",pt:"Respondeu Jesus: O meu reino n\xe3o \xe9 deste mundo; se o meu reino fosse deste mundo, pelejariam os meus servos, para que eu n\xe3o fosse entregue aos judeus; entretanto o meu reino n\xe3o \xe9 daqui."},{verse:37,en:"Pilate therefore said unto him, Art thou a king then? Jesus answered, Thou sayest that I am a king. To this end was I born, and for this cause came I into the world, that I should bear witness unto the truth. Every one that is of the truth heareth my voice.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe, pois, Pilatos: Logo tu \xe9s rei? Respondeu Jesus: Tu dizes que eu sou rei. Eu para isso nasci, e para isso vim ao mundo, a fim de dar testemunho da verdade. Todo aquele que \xe9 da verdade ouve a minha voz."},{verse:38,en:"Pilate saith unto him, What is truth? And when he had said this, he went out again unto the Jews, and saith unto them, I find in him no fault at all.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Pilatos: Que \xe9 a verdade? E dito isto, de novo saiu a ter com os judeus, e disse-lhes: N\xe3o acho nele crime algum."},{verse:39,en:"But ye have a custom, that I should release unto you one at the passover: will ye therefore that I release unto you the King of the Jews?",pt:"Tendes, por\xe9m, por costume que eu vos solte algu\xe9m por ocasi\xe3o da p\xe1scoa; quereis, pois, que vos solte o rei dos judeus?"},{verse:40,en:"Then cried they all again, saying, Not this man, but Barabbas. Now Barabbas was a robber.",pt:"Ent\xe3o todos tornaram a clamar dizendo: Este n\xe3o, mas Barrab\xe1s. Ora, Barrab\xe1s era salteador."}]}}),681,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then Pilate therefore took Jesus, and scourged him.",pt:"Nisso, pois, Pilatos tomou a Jesus, e mandou a\xe7oit\xe1-lo."},{verse:2,en:"And the soldiers platted a crown of thorns, and put it on his head, and they put on him a purple robe,",pt:"E os soldados, tecendo uma coroa de espinhos, puseram-lha sobre a cabe\xe7a, e lhe vestiram um manto de p\xfarpura;"},{verse:3,en:"And said, Hail, King of the Jews! and they smote him with their hands.",pt:"e chegando-se a ele, diziam: Salve, rei dos judeus! e e davam-lhe bofetadas."},{verse:4,en:"Pilate therefore went forth again, and saith unto them, Behold, I bring him forth to you, that ye may know that I find no fault in him.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Pilatos saiu outra vez, e disse-lhes: Eis aqui vo-lo trago fora, para que saibais que n\xe3o acho nele crime algum."},{verse:5,en:"Then came Jesus forth, wearing the crown of thorns, and the purple robe. And Pilate saith unto them, Behold the man!",pt:"Saiu, pois, Jesus, trazendo a coroa de espinhos e o manto de p\xfarpura. E disse-lhes Pilatos: Eis o homem!"},{verse:6,en:"When the chief priests therefore and officers saw him, they cried out, saying, Crucify him, crucify him. Pilate saith unto them, Take ye him, and crucify him: for I find no fault in him.",pt:"Quando o viram os principais sacerdotes e os guardas, clamaram, dizendo: Crucifica-o! Crucifica-o! Disse-lhes Pilatos: Tomai-o v\xf3s, e crucificai-o; porque nenhum crime acho nele."},{verse:7,en:"The Jews answered him, We have a law, and by our law he ought to die, because he made himself the Son of God.",pt:"Responderam-lhe os judeus: N\xf3s temos uma lei, e segundo esta lei ele deve morrer, porque se fez Filho de Deus."},{verse:8,en:"When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he was the more afraid;",pt:"Ora, Pilatos, quando ouviu esta palavra, mais atemorizado ficou;"},{verse:9,en:"And went again into the judgment hall, and saith unto Jesus, Whence art thou? But Jesus gave him no answer.",pt:"e entrando outra vez no pret\xf3rio, perguntou a Jesus: Donde \xe9s tu? Mas Jesus n\xe3o lhe deu resposta."},{verse:10,en:"Then saith Pilate unto him, Speakest thou not unto me? knowest thou not that I have power to crucify thee, and have power to release thee?",pt:"Disse-lhe, ent\xe3o, Pilatos: N\xe3o me respondes? n\xe3o sabes que tenho autoridade para te soltar, e autoridade para te crucificar?"},{verse:11,en:"Jesus answered, Thou couldest have no power at all against me, except it were given thee from above: therefore he that delivered me unto thee hath the greater sin.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Nenhuma autoridade terias sobre mim, se de cima n\xe3o te fora dado; por isso aquele que me entregou a ti, maior pecado tem."},{verse:12,en:"And from thenceforth Pilate sought to release him: but the Jews cried out, saying, If thou let this man go, thou art not Caesar\u2019s friend: whosoever maketh himself a king speaketh against Caesar.",pt:"Da\xed em diante Pilatos procurava solt\xe1-lo; mas os judeus clamaram: Se soltares a este, n\xe3o \xe9s amigo de C\xe9sar; todo aquele que se faz rei \xe9 contra C\xe9sar."},{verse:13,en:"When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he brought Jesus forth, and sat down in the judgment seat in a place that is called the Pavement, but in the Hebrew, Gabbatha.",pt:"Pilatos, pois, quando ouviu isto, trouxe Jesus para fora e sentou-se no tribunal, no lugar chamado Pavimento, e em hebraico Gabat\xe1."},{verse:14,en:"And it was the preparation of the passover, and about the sixth hour: and he saith unto the Jews, Behold your King!",pt:"Ora, era a prepara\xe7\xe3o da p\xe1scoa, e cerca da hora sexta. E disse aos judeus: Eis o vosso rei."},{verse:15,en:"But they cried out, Away with him, away with him, crucify him. Pilate saith unto them, Shall I crucify your King? The chief priests answered, We have no king but Caesar.",pt:"Mas eles clamaram: Tira-o! tira-o! crucifica-o! Disse-lhes Pilatos: Hei de crucificar o vosso rei? responderam, os principais sacerdotes: N\xe3o temos rei, sen\xe3o C\xe9sar."},{verse:16,en:"Then delivered he him therefore unto them to be crucified. And they took Jesus, and led him away.",pt:"Ent\xe3o lho entregou para ser crucificado."},{verse:17,en:"And he bearing his cross went forth into a place called the place of a skull, which is called in the Hebrew Golgotha:",pt:"Tomaram, pois, a Jesus; e ele, carregando a sua pr\xf3pria cruz, saiu para o lugar chamado Caveira, que em hebraico se chama G\xf3lgota,"},{verse:18,en:"Where they crucified him, and two others with him, on either side one, and Jesus in the midst.",pt:"onde o crucificaram, e com ele outros dois, um de cada lado, e Jesus no meio."},{verse:19,en:"And Pilate wrote a title, and put it on the cross. And the writing was, JESUS OF NAZARETH THE KING OF THE JEWS.",pt:"E Pilatos escreveu tamb\xe9m um t\xedtulo, e o colocou sobre a cruz; e nele estava escrito: JESUS O NAZARENO, O REI DOS JUDEUS."},{verse:20,en:"This title then read many of the Jews: for the place where Jesus was crucified was nigh to the city: and it was written in Hebrew, and Greek, and Latin.",pt:"Muitos dos judeus, pois, leram este t\xedtulo; porque o lugar onde Jesus foi crucificado era pr\xf3ximo da cidade; e estava escrito em hebraico, latim e grego."},{verse:21,en:"Then said the chief priests of the Jews to Pilate, Write not, The King of the Jews; but that he said, I am King of the Jews.",pt:"Diziam ent\xe3o a Pilatos os principais sacerdotes dos judeus: N\xe3o escrevas: O rei dos judeus; mas que ele disse: Sou rei dos judeus."},{verse:22,en:"Pilate answered, What I have written I have written.",pt:"Respondeu Pilatos: O que escrevi, escrevi."},{verse:23,en:"Then the soldiers, when they had crucified Jesus, took his garments, and made four parts, to every soldier a part; and also his coat: now the coat was without seam, woven from the top throughout.",pt:"Tendo, pois, os soldados crucificado a Jesus, tomaram as suas vestes, e fizeram delas quatro partes, para cada soldado uma parte. Tomaram tamb\xe9m a t\xfanica; ora a t\xfanica n\xe3o tinha costura, sendo toda tecida de alto a baixo."},{verse:24,en:"They said therefore among themselves, Let us not rend it, but cast lots for it, whose it shall be: that the scripture might be fulfilled, which saith, They parted my raiment among them, and for my vesture they did cast lots. These things therefore the soldiers did.",pt:"Pelo que disseram uns aos outros: N\xe3o a rasguemos, mas lancemos sortes sobre ela, para ver de quem ser\xe1 (para que se cumprisse a escritura que diz: Repartiram entre si as minhas vestes, e lan\xe7aram sortes). E, de fato, os soldados assim fizeram."},{verse:25,en:"Now there stood by the cross of Jesus his mother, and his mother\u2019s sister, Mary the wife of Cleophas, and Mary Magdalene.",pt:"Estavam em p\xe9, junto \xe0 cruz de Jesus, sua m\xe3e, e a irm\xe3 de sua m\xe3e, e Maria, mulher de Cl\xf4pas, e Maria Madalena."},{verse:26,en:"When Jesus therefore saw his mother, and the disciple standing by, whom he loved, he saith unto his mother, Woman, behold thy son!",pt:"Ora, Jesus, vendo ali sua m\xe3e, e ao lado dela o disc\xedpulo a quem ele amava, disse a sua m\xe3e: Mulher, eis a\xed o teu filho."},{verse:27,en:"Then saith he to the disciple, Behold thy mother! And from that hour that disciple took her unto his own home.",pt:"Ent\xe3o disse ao disc\xedpulo: Eis a\xed tua m\xe3e. E desde aquela hora o disc\xedpulo a recebeu em sua casa."},{verse:28,en:"After this, Jesus knowing that all things were now accomplished, that the scripture might be fulfilled, saith, I thirst.",pt:"Depois, sabendo Jesus que todas as coisas j\xe1 estavam consumadas, para que se cumprisse a Escritura, disse: Tenho sede."},{verse:29,en:"Now there was set a vessel full of vinegar: and they filled a spunge with vinegar, and put it upon hyssop, and put it to his mouth.",pt:"Estava ali um vaso cheio de vinagre. Puseram, pois, numa cana de hissopo uma esponja ensopada de vinagre, e lha chegaram \xe0 boca."},{verse:30,en:"When Jesus therefore had received the vinegar, he said, It is finished: and he bowed his head, and gave up the ghost.",pt:"Ent\xe3o Jesus, depois de ter tomado o vinagre, disse: est\xe1 consumado. E, inclinando a cabe\xe7a, entregou o esp\xedrito."},{verse:31,en:"The Jews therefore, because it was the preparation, that the bodies should not remain upon the cross on the sabbath day, (for that sabbath day was an high day,) besought Pilate that their legs might be broken, and that they might be taken away.",pt:"Ora, os judeus, como era a prepara\xe7\xe3o, e para que no s\xe1bado n\xe3o ficassem os corpos na cruz, pois era grande aquele dia de s\xe1bado, rogaram a Pilatos que se lhes quebrassem as pernas, e fossem tirados dali."},{verse:32,en:"Then came the soldiers, and brake the legs of the first, and of the other which was crucified with him.",pt:"Foram ent\xe3o os soldados e, na verdade, quebraram as pernas ao primeiro e ao outro que com ele fora crucificado;"},{verse:33,en:"But when they came to Jesus, and saw that he was dead already, they brake not his legs:",pt:"mas vindo a Jesus, e vendo que j\xe1 estava morto, n\xe3o lhe quebraram as pernas;"},{verse:34,en:"But one of the soldiers with a spear pierced his side, and forthwith came there out blood and water.",pt:"contudo um dos soldados lhe furou o lado com uma lan\xe7a, e logo saiu sangue e \xe1gua."},{verse:35,en:"And he that saw it bare record, and his record is true: and he knoweth that he saith true, that ye might believe.",pt:"E \xe9 quem viu isso que d\xe1 testemunho, e o seu testemunho \xe9 verdadeiro; e sabe que diz a verdade, para que tamb\xe9m v\xf3s creiais."},{verse:36,en:"For these things were done, that the scripture should be fulfilled, A bone of him shall not be broken.",pt:"Porque isto aconteceu para que se cumprisse a escritura: Nenhum dos seus ossos ser\xe1 quebrado."},{verse:37,en:"And again another scripture saith, They shall look on him whom they pierced.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m h\xe1 outra escritura que diz: Olhar\xe3o para aquele que traspassaram."},{verse:38,en:"And after this Joseph of Arimathaea, being a disciple of Jesus, but secretly for fear of the Jews, besought Pilate that he might take away the body of Jesus: and Pilate gave him leave. He came therefore, and took the body of Jesus.",pt:"Depois disto, Jos\xe9 de Arimat\xe9ia, que era disc\xedpulo de Jesus, embora oculto por medo dos judeus, rogou a Pilatos que lhe permitisse tirar o corpo de Jesus; e Pilatos lho permitiu. Ent\xe3o foi e o tirou."},{verse:39,en:"And there came also Nicodemus, which at the first came to Jesus by night, and brought a mixture of myrrh and aloes, about an hundred pound weight.",pt:"E Nicodemos, aquele que anteriormente viera ter com Jesus de noite, foi tamb\xe9m, levando cerca de cem libras duma mistura de mirra e alo\xe9s."},{verse:40,en:"Then took they the body of Jesus, and wound it in linen clothes with the spices, as the manner of the Jews is to bury.",pt:"Tomaram, pois, o corpo de Jesus, e o envolveram em panos de linho com as especiarias, como os judeus costumavam fazer na prepara\xe7\xe3o para a sepultura."},{verse:41,en:"Now in the place where he was crucified there was a garden; and in the garden a new sepulchre, wherein was never man yet laid.",pt:"No lugar onde Jesus foi crucificado havia um jardim, e nesse jardim um sepulcro novo, em que ningu\xe9m ainda havia sido posto."},{verse:42,en:"There laid they Jesus therefore because of the Jews\u2019 preparation day; for the sepulchre was nigh at hand.",pt:"Ali, pois, por ser a vespera do s\xe1bado dos judeus, e por estar perto aquele sepulcro, puseram a Jesus."}]}}),682,[]);
__d((function(e,s,o,a,t,n,h){t.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The first day of the week cometh Mary Magdalene early, when it was yet dark, unto the sepulchre, and seeth the stone taken away from the sepulchre.",pt:"No primeiro dia da semana Maria Madalena foi ao sepulcro de madrugada, sendo ainda escuro, e viu que a pedra fora removida do sepulcro."},{verse:2,en:"Then she runneth, and cometh to Simon Peter, and to the other disciple, whom Jesus loved, and saith unto them, They have taken away the Lord out of the sepulchre, and we know not where they have laid him.",pt:"Correu, pois, e foi ter com Sim\xe3o Pedro, e o outro disc\xedpulo, a quem Jesus amava, e disse-lhes: Tiraram do sepulcro o Senhor, e n\xe3o sabemos onde o puseram."},{verse:3,en:"Peter therefore went forth, and that other disciple, and came to the sepulchre.",pt:"Sa\xedram ent\xe3o Pedro e o outro disc\xedpulo e foram ao sepulcro."},{verse:4,en:"So they ran both together: and the other disciple did outrun Peter, and came first to the sepulchre.",pt:"Corriam os dois juntos, mas o outro disc\xedpulo correu mais ligeiro do que Pedro, e chegou primeiro ao sepulcro;"},{verse:5,en:"And he stooping down, and looking in, saw the linen clothes lying; yet went he not in.",pt:"e, abaixando-se viu os panos de linho ali deixados, todavia n\xe3o entrou."},{verse:6,en:"Then cometh Simon Peter following him, and went into the sepulchre, and seeth the linen clothes lie,",pt:"Chegou, pois, Sim\xe3o Pedro, que o seguia, e entrou no sepulcro e viu os panos de linho ali deixados,"},{verse:7,en:"And the napkin, that was about his head, not lying with the linen clothes, but wrapped together in a place by itself.",pt:"e que o len\xe7o, que estivera sobre a cabe\xe7a de Jesus, n\xe3o estava com os panos, mas enrolado num lugar \xe0 parte."},{verse:8,en:"Then went in also that other disciple, which came first to the sepulchre, and he saw, and believed.",pt:"Ent\xe3o entrou tamb\xe9m o outro disc\xedpulo, que chegara primeiro ao sepulcro, e viu e creu."},{verse:9,en:"For as yet they knew not the scripture, that he must rise again from the dead.",pt:"Porque ainda n\xe3o entendiam a escritura, que era necess\xe1rio que ele ressurgisse dentre os mortos."},{verse:10,en:"Then the disciples went away again unto their own home.",pt:"Tornaram, pois, os disc\xedpulos para casa."},{verse:11,en:"But Mary stood without at the sepulchre weeping: and as she wept, she stooped down, and looked into the sepulchre,",pt:"Maria, por\xe9m, estava em p\xe9, diante do sepulcro, a chorar. Enquanto chorava, abaixou-se a olhar para dentro do sepulcro,"},{verse:12,en:"And seeth two angels in white sitting, the one at the head, and the other at the feet, where the body of Jesus had lain.",pt:"e viu dois anjos vestidos de branco sentados onde jazera o corpo de Jesus, um \xe0 cabeceira e outro aos p\xe9s."},{verse:13,en:"And they say unto her, Woman, why weepest thou? She saith unto them, Because they have taken away my Lord, and I know not where they have laid him.",pt:"E perguntaram-lhe eles: Mulher, por que choras? Respondeu- lhes: Porque tiraram o meu Senhor, e n\xe3o sei onde o puseram."},{verse:14,en:"And when she had thus said, she turned herself back, and saw Jesus standing, and knew not that it was Jesus.",pt:"Ao dizer isso, voltou-se para tr\xe1s, e viu a Jesus ali em p\xe9, mas n\xe3o sabia que era Jesus."},{verse:15,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Woman, why weepest thou? whom seekest thou? She, supposing him to be the gardener, saith unto him, Sir, if thou have borne him hence, tell me where thou hast laid him, and I will take him away.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe Jesus: Mulher, por que choras? A quem procuras? Ela, julgando que fosse o jardineiro, respondeu-lhe: Senhor, se tu o levaste, dize-me onde o puseste, e eu o levarei."},{verse:16,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Mary. She turned herself, and saith unto him, Rabboni; which is to say, Master.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Maria! Ela, virando-se, disse-lhe em hebraico: Raboni! - que quer dizer, Mestre."},{verse:17,en:"Jesus saith unto her, Touch me not; for I am not yet ascended to my Father: but go to my brethren, and say unto them, I ascend unto my Father, and your Father; and to my God, and your God.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Deixa de me tocar, porque ainda n\xe3o subi ao Pai; mas vai a meus irm\xe3os e dize-lhes que eu subo para meu Pai e vosso Pai, meu Deus e vosso Deus."},{verse:18,en:"Mary Magdalene came and told the disciples that she had seen the Lord, and that he had spoken these things unto her.",pt:"E foi Maria Madalena anunciar aos disc\xedpulos: Vi o Senhor! - e que ele lhe dissera estas coisas."},{verse:19,en:"Then the same day at evening, being the first day of the week, when the doors were shut where the disciples were assembled for fear of the Jews, came Jesus and stood in the midst, and saith unto them, Peace be unto you.",pt:"Chegada, pois, a tarde, naquele dia, o primeiro da semana, e estando os disc\xedpulos reunidos com as portas cerradas por medo dos judeus, chegou Jesus, p\xf4s-se no meio e disse-lhes: Paz seja convosco."},{verse:20,en:"And when he had so said, he shewed unto them his hands and his side. Then were the disciples glad, when they saw the Lord.",pt:"Dito isto, mostrou-lhes as m\xe3os e o lado. Alegraram-se, pois, os disc\xedpulos ao verem o Senhor."},{verse:21,en:"Then said Jesus to them again, Peace be unto you: as my Father hath sent me, even so send I you.",pt:"Disse-lhes, ent\xe3o, Jesus segunda vez: Paz seja convosco; assim como o Pai me enviou, tamb\xe9m eu vos envio a v\xf3s."},{verse:22,en:"And when he had said this, he breathed on them, and saith unto them, Receive ye the Holy Ghost:",pt:"E havendo dito isso, assoprou sobre eles, e disse-lhes: Recebei o Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:23,en:"Whose soever sins ye remit, they are remitted unto them; and whose soever sins ye retain, they are retained.",pt:"\xc2queles a quem perdoardes os pecados, s\xe3o-lhes perdoados; e \xe0queles a quem os retiverdes, s\xe3o-lhes retidos."},{verse:24,en:"But Thomas, one of the twelve, called Didymus, was not with them when Jesus came.",pt:"Ora, Tom\xe9, um dos doze, chamado D\xeddimo, n\xe3o estava com eles quando veio Jesus."},{verse:25,en:"The other disciples therefore said unto him, We have seen the Lord. But he said unto them, Except I shall see in his hands the print of the nails, and put my finger into the print of the nails, and thrust my hand into his side, I will not believe.",pt:"Diziam-lhe, pois, ou outros disc\xedpulos: Vimos o Senhor. Ele, por\xe9m, lhes respondeu: Se eu n\xe3o vir o sinal dos cravos nas m\xe3os, e n\xe3o meter a m\xe3o no seu lado, de maneira nenhuma crerei."},{verse:26,en:"And after eight days again his disciples were within, and Thomas with them: then came Jesus, the doors being shut, and stood in the midst, and said, Peace be unto you.",pt:"Oito dias depois estavam os disc\xedpulos outra vez ali reunidos, e Tom\xe9 com eles. Chegou Jesus, estando as portas fechadas, p\xf4s-se no meio deles e disse: Paz seja convosco."},{verse:27,en:"Then saith he to Thomas, reach hither thy finger, and behold my hands; and reach hither thy hand, and thrust it into my side: and be not faithless, but believing.",pt:"Depois disse a Tom\xe9: Chega aqui o teu dedo, e v\xea as minhas m\xe3os; chega a tua m\xe3o, e mete-a no meu lado; e n\xe3o mais sejas incr\xe9dulo, mas crente."},{verse:28,en:"And Thomas answered and said unto him, My Lord and my God.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Tom\xe9: Senhor meu, e Deus meu!"},{verse:29,en:"Jesus saith unto him, Thomas, because thou hast seen me, thou hast believed: blessed are they that have not seen, and yet have believed.",pt:"Disse-lhe Jesus: Porque me viste, creste? Bem-aventurados os que n\xe3o viram e creram."},{verse:30,en:"And many other signs truly did Jesus in the presence of his disciples, which are not written in this book:",pt:"Jesus, na verdade, operou na presen\xe7a de seus disc\xedpulos ainda muitos outros sinais que n\xe3o est\xe3o escritos neste livro;"},{verse:31,en:"But these are written, that ye might believe that Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God; and that believing ye might have life through his name.",pt:"estes, por\xe9m, est\xe3o escritos para que creiais que Jesus \xe9 o Cristo, o Filho de Deus, e para que, crendo, tenhais vida em seu nome."}]}}),683,[]);
__d((function(e,s,t,o,a,i,h){a.exports={book:"John",bookPt:"Jo\xe3o",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"After these things Jesus shewed himself again to the disciples at the sea of Tiberias; and on this wise shewed he himself.",pt:"Depois disto manifestou-se Jesus outra vez aos disc\xedpulos junto do mar de Tiber\xedades; e manifestou-se deste modo:"},{verse:2,en:"There were together Simon Peter, and Thomas called Didymus, and Nathanael of Cana in Galilee, and the sons of Zebedee, and two other of his disciples.",pt:"Estavam juntos Sim\xe3o Pedro, Tom\xe9, chamado D\xeddimo, Natanael, que era de Can\xe1 da Galil\xe9ia, os filhos de Zebedeu, e outros dois dos seus disc\xedpulos."},{verse:3,en:"Simon Peter saith unto them, I go a fishing. They say unto him, We also go with thee. They went forth, and entered into a ship immediately; and that night they caught nothing.",pt:"Disse-lhes Sim\xe3o Pedro: Vou pescar. Responderam-lhe: N\xf3s tamb\xe9m vamos contigo. Sa\xedram e entraram no barco; e naquela noite nada apanharam."},{verse:4,en:"But when the morning was now come, Jesus stood on the shore: but the disciples knew not that it was Jesus.",pt:"Mas ao romper da manh\xe3, Jesus se apresentou na praia; todavia os disc\xedpulos n\xe3o sabiam que era ele."},{verse:5,en:"Then Jesus saith unto them, Children, have ye any meat? They answered him, No.",pt:"Disse-lhes, pois, Jesus: Filhos, n\xe3o tendes nada que comer? Responderam-lhe: N\xe3o."},{verse:6,en:"And he said unto them, Cast the net on the right side of the ship, and ye shall find. They cast therefore, and now they were not able to draw it for the multitude of fishes.",pt:"Disse-lhes ele: Lan\xe7ai a rede \xe0 direita do barco, e achareis. Lan\xe7aram-na, pois, e j\xe1 n\xe3o a podiam puxar por causa da grande quantidade de peixes."},{verse:7,en:"Therefore that disciple whom Jesus loved saith unto Peter, It is the Lord. Now when Simon Peter heard that it was the Lord, he girt his fisher\u2019s coat unto him, (for he was naked,) and did cast himself into the sea.",pt:"Ent\xe3o aquele disc\xedpulo a quem Jesus amava disse a Pedro: Senhor. Quando, pois, Sim\xe3o Pedro ouviu que era o Senhor, cingiu-se com a t\xfanica, porque estava despido, e lan\xe7ou-se ao mar;"},{verse:8,en:"And the other disciples came in a little ship; (for they were not far from land, but as it were two hundred cubits,) dragging the net with fishes.",pt:"mas os outros disc\xedpulos vieram no barquinho, puxando a rede com os peixes, porque n\xe3o estavam distantes da terra sen\xe3o cerca de duzentos c\xf4vados."},{verse:9,en:"As soon then as they were come to land, they saw a fire of coals there, and fish laid thereon, and bread.",pt:"Ora, ao saltarem em terra, viram ali brasas, e um peixe posto em cima delas, e p\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Bring of the fish which ye have now caught.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Trazei alguns dos peixes que agora apanhastes."},{verse:11,en:"Simon Peter went up, and drew the net to land full of great fishes, and hundred and fifty and three: and for all there were so many, yet was not the net broken.",pt:"Entrou Sim\xe3o Pedro no barco e puxou a rede para terra, cheia de cento e cinquenta e tr\xeas grandes peixes; e, apesar de serem tantos, n\xe3o se rompeu a rede."},{verse:12,en:"Jesus saith unto them, Come and dine. And none of the disciples durst ask him, Who art thou? knowing that it was the Lord.",pt:"Disse-lhes Jesus: Vinde, comei. Nenhum dos disc\xedpulos ousava perguntar-lhe: Quem \xe9s tu? sabendo que era o Senhor."},{verse:13,en:"Jesus then cometh, and taketh bread, and giveth them, and fish likewise.",pt:"Chegou Jesus, tomou o p\xe3o e deu-lho, e semelhantemente o peixe."},{verse:14,en:"This is now the third time that Jesus shewed himself to his disciples, after that he was risen from the dead.",pt:"Foi esta a terceira vez que Jesus se manifestou aos seus disc\xedpulos, depois de ter ressurgido dentre os mortos."},{verse:15,en:"So when they had dined, Jesus saith to Simon Peter, Simon, son of Jonas, lovest thou me more than these? He saith unto him, Yea, Lord; thou knowest that I love thee. He saith unto him, Feed my lambs.",pt:"Depois de terem comido, perguntou Jesus a Sim\xe3o Pedro: Sim\xe3o Pedro: Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, amas-me mais do que estes? Respondeu- lhe: Sim, Senhor; tu sabes que te amo. Disse-lhe: Apascenta os meus cordeirinhos."},{verse:16,en:"He saith to him again the second time, Simon, son of Jonas, lovest thou me? He saith unto him, Yea, Lord; thou knowest that I love thee. He saith unto him, Feed my sheep.",pt:"Tornou a perguntar-lhe: Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, amas-me? Respondeu-lhe: Sim, Senhor; tu sabes que te amo. Disse-lhe: Pastoreia as minhas ovelhas."},{verse:17,en:"He saith unto him the third time, Simon, son of Jonas, lovest thou me? Peter was grieved because he said unto him the third time, Lovest thou me? And he said unto him, Lord, thou knowest all things; thou knowest that I love thee. Jesus saith unto him, Feed my sheep.",pt:"Perguntou-lhe terceira vez: Sim\xe3o, filho de Jo\xe3o, amas-me? Entristeceu-se Pedro por lhe ter perguntado pela terceira vez: Amas- me? E respondeu-lhe: Senhor, tu sabes todas as coisas; tu sabes que te amo. Disse-lhe Jesus: Apascenta as minhas ovelhas."},{verse:18,en:"Verily, verily, I say unto thee, When thou wast young, thou girdedst thyself, and walkedst whither thou wouldest: but when thou shalt be old, thou shalt stretch forth thy hands, and another shall gird thee, and carry thee whither thou wouldest not.",pt:"Em verdade, em verdade te digo que, quando eras mais mo\xe7o, te cingias a ti mesmo, e andavas por onde querias; mas, quando fores velho, estender\xe1s as m\xe3os e outro te cingir\xe1, e te levar\xe1 para onde tu n\xe3o queres."},{verse:19,en:"This spake he, signifying by what death he should glorify God. And when he had spoken this, he saith unto him, Follow me.",pt:"Ora, isto ele disse, significando com que morte havia Pedro de glorificar a Deus. E, havendo dito isto, ordenou-lhe: Segue-me."},{verse:20,en:"Then Peter, turning about, seeth the disciple whom Jesus loved following; which also leaned on his breast at supper, and said, Lord, which is he that betrayeth thee?",pt:"E Pedro, virando-se, viu que o seguia aquele disc\xedpulo a quem Jesus amava, o mesmo que na ceia se recostara sobre o peito de Jesus e perguntara: Senhor, quem \xe9 o que te trai?"},{verse:21,en:"Peter seeing him saith to Jesus, Lord, and what shall this man do?",pt:"Ora, vendo Pedro a este, perguntou a Jesus: Senhor, e deste que ser\xe1?"},{verse:22,en:"Jesus saith unto him, If I will that he tarry till I come, what is that to thee? follow thou me.",pt:"Respondeu-lhe Jesus: Se eu quiser que ele fique at\xe9 que eu venha, que tens tu com isso? Segue-me tu."},{verse:23,en:"Then went this saying abroad among the brethren, that that disciple should not die: yet Jesus said not unto him, He shall not die; but, If I will that he tarry till I come, what is that to thee?",pt:"Divulgou-se, pois, entre os irm\xe3os este dito, que aquele disc\xedpulo n\xe3o havia de morrer. Jesus, por\xe9m, n\xe3o disse que n\xe3o morreria, mas: se eu quiser que ele fique at\xe9 que eu venha, que tens tu com isso?"},{verse:24,en:"This is the disciple which testifieth of these things, and wrote these things: and we know that his testimony is true.",pt:"Este \xe9 o disc\xedpulo que d\xe1 testemunho destas coisas e as escreveu; e sabemos que o seu testemunho \xe9 verdadeiro."},{verse:25,en:"And there are also many other things which Jesus did, the which, if they should be written every one, I suppose that even the world itself could not contain the books that should be written. Amen.",pt:"E ainda muitas outras coisas h\xe1 que Jesus fez; as quais, se fossem escritas uma por uma, creio que nem ainda no mundo inteiro caberiam os livros que se escrevessem."}]}}),684,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The proverbs of Solomon the son of David, king of Israel;",pt:"Prov\xe9rbios de Salom\xe3o, filho de Davi, rei de Israel:"},{verse:2,en:"To know wisdom and instruction; to perceive the words of understanding;",pt:"Para se conhecer a sabedoria e a instru\xe7\xe3o; para se entenderem as palavras de intelig\xeancia;"},{verse:3,en:"To receive the instruction of wisdom, justice, and judgment, and equity;",pt:"para se instruir em s\xe1bio procedimento, em retid\xe3o, justi\xe7a e eq\xfcidade;"},{verse:4,en:"To give subtilty to the simple, to the young man knowledge and discretion.",pt:"para se dar aos simples prud\xeancia, e aos jovens conhecimento e bom siso."},{verse:5,en:"A wise man will hear, and will increase learning; and a man of understanding shall attain unto wise counsels:",pt:"Ou\xe7a tamb\xe9m, o s\xe1bio e cres\xe7a em ci\xeancia, e o entendido adquira habilidade,"},{verse:6,en:"To understand a proverb, and the interpretation; the words of the wise, and their dark sayings.",pt:"para entender prov\xe9rbios e par\xe1bolas, as palavras dos s\xe1bios, e seus enigmas."},{verse:7,en:"The fear of the LORD is the beginning of knowledge: but fools despise wisdom and instruction.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 o princ\xedpio do conhecimento; mas os insensatos desprezam a sabedoria e a instru\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:8,en:"My son, hear the instruction of thy father, and forsake not the law of thy mother:",pt:"Filho meu, ouve a instru\xe7\xe3o de teu pai, e n\xe3o deixes o ensino de tua m\xe3e."},{verse:9,en:"For they shall be an ornament of grace unto thy head, and chains about thy neck.",pt:"Porque eles ser\xe3o uma grinalda de gra\xe7a para a tua cabe\xe7a, e colares para o teu pesco\xe7o."},{verse:10,en:"My son, if sinners entice thee, consent thou not.",pt:"Filho meu, se os pecadores te quiserem seduzir, n\xe3o consintas."},{verse:11,en:"If they say, Come with us, let us lay wait for blood, let us lurk privily for the innocent without cause:",pt:"Se disserem: Vem conosco; embosquemo-nos para derramar sangue; espreitemos sem raz\xe3o o inocente;"},{verse:12,en:"Let us swallow them up alive as the grave; and whole, as those that go down into the pit:",pt:"traguemo-los vivos, como o Seol, e inteiros como os que descem \xe0 cova;"},{verse:13,en:"We shall find all precious substance, we shall fill our houses with spoil:",pt:"acharemos toda sorte de bens preciosos; encheremos as nossas casas de despojos;"},{verse:14,en:"Cast in thy lot among us; let us all have one purse:",pt:"lan\xe7ar\xe1s a tua sorte entre n\xf3s; teremos todos uma s\xf3 bolsa;"},{verse:15,en:"My son, walk not thou in the way with them; refrain thy foot from their path:",pt:"filho meu, n\xe3o andes no caminho com eles; guarda da sua vereda o teu p\xe9,"},{verse:16,en:"For their feet run to evil, and make haste to shed blood.",pt:"porque os seus p\xe9s correm para o mal, e eles se apressam a derramar sangue."},{verse:17,en:"Surely in vain the net is spread in the sight of any bird.",pt:"Pois debalde se estende a rede \xe0 vista de qualquer ave."},{verse:18,en:"And they lay wait for their own blood; they lurk privily for their own lives.",pt:"Mas estes se p\xf5em em emboscadas contra o seu pr\xf3prio sangue, e as suas pr\xf3prias vidas espreitam."},{verse:19,en:"So are the ways of every one that is greedy of gain; which taketh away the life of the owners thereof.",pt:"Tais s\xe3o as veredas de todo aquele que se entrega \xe0 cobi\xe7a; ela tira a vida dos que a possuem."},{verse:20,en:"Wisdom crieth without; she uttereth her voice in the streets:",pt:"A suprema sabedoria altissonantemente clama nas ruas; nas pra\xe7as levanta a sua voz."},{verse:21,en:"She crieth in the chief place of concourse, in the openings of the gates: in the city she uttereth her words, saying,",pt:"Do alto dos muros clama; \xe0s entradas das portas e na cidade profere as suas palavras:"},{verse:22,en:"How long, ye simple ones, will ye love simplicity? and the scorners delight in their scorning, and fools hate knowledge?",pt:"At\xe9 quando, \xf3 est\xfapidos, amareis a estupidez? e at\xe9 quando se deleitar\xe3o no esc\xe1rnio os escarnecedores, e odiar\xe3o os insensatos o conhecimento?"},{verse:23,en:"Turn you at my reproof: behold, I will pour out my spirit unto you, I will make known my words unto you.",pt:"Convertei-vos pela minha repreens\xe3o; eis que derramarei sobre v\xf3s o meu; esp\xedrito e vos farei saber as minhas palavras."},{verse:24,en:"Because I have called, and ye refused; I have stretched out my hand, and no man regarded;",pt:"Mas, porque clamei, e v\xf3s recusastes; porque estendi a minha m\xe3o, e nao houve quem desse aten\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:25,en:"But ye have set at nought all my counsel, and would none of my reproof:",pt:"antes desprezastes todo o meu conselho, e n\xe3o fizestes caso da minha repreens\xe3o;"},{verse:26,en:"I also will laugh at your calamity; I will mock when your fear cometh;",pt:"tamb\xe9m eu me rirei no dia da vossa calamidade; zombarei, quando sobrevier o vosso terror,"},{verse:27,en:"When your fear cometh as desolation, and your destruction cometh as a whirlwind; when distress and anguish cometh upon you.",pt:"quando o terror vos sobrevier como tempestade, e a vossa calamidade passar como redemoinho, e quando vos sobrevierem aperto e ang\xfastia."},{verse:28,en:"Then shall they call upon me, but I will not answer; they shall seek me early, but they shall not find me:",pt:"Ent\xe3o a mim clamar\xe3o, mas eu n\xe3o responderei; diligentemente me buscar\xe3o, mas n\xe3o me achar\xe3o."},{verse:29,en:"For that they hated knowledge, and did not choose the fear of the LORD:",pt:"Porquanto aborreceram o conhecimento, e n\xe3o preferiram o temor do Senhor;"},{verse:30,en:"They would none of my counsel: they despised all my reproof.",pt:"n\xe3o quiseram o meu conselho e desprezaram toda a minha repreens\xe3o;"},{verse:31,en:"Therefore shall they eat of the fruit of their own way, and be filled with their own devices.",pt:"portanto comer\xe3o do fruto do seu caminho e se fartar\xe3o dos seus pr\xf3prios conselhos."},{verse:32,en:"For the turning away of the simple shall slay them, and the prosperity of fools shall destroy them.",pt:"Porque o desvio dos n\xe9scios os matar\xe1, e a prosperidade dos loucos os destruir\xe1."},{verse:33,en:"But whoso hearkeneth unto me shall dwell safely, and shall be quiet from fear of evil.",pt:"Mas o que me der ouvidos habitar\xe1 em seguran\xe7a, e estar\xe1 tranq\xfcilo, sem receio do mal."}]}}),685,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, if thou wilt receive my words, and hide my commandments with thee;",pt:"Filho meu, se aceitares as minhas palavras, e entesourares contigo os meus mandamentos,"},{verse:2,en:"So that thou incline thine ear unto wisdom, and apply thine heart to understanding;",pt:"para fazeres atento \xe0 sabedoria o teu ouvido, e para inclinares o teu cora\xe7\xe3o ao entendimento;"},{verse:3,en:"Yea, if thou criest after knowledge, and liftest up thy voice for understanding;",pt:"sim, se clamares por discernimento, e por entendimento al\xe7ares a tua voz;"},{verse:4,en:"If thou seekest her as silver, and searchest for her as for hid treasures;",pt:"se o buscares como a prata e o procurares como a tesouros escondidos;"},{verse:5,en:"Then shalt thou understand the fear of the LORD, and find the knowledge of God.",pt:"ent\xe3o entender\xe1s o temor do Senhor, e achar\xe1s o conhecimento de Deus."},{verse:6,en:"For the LORD giveth wisdom: out of his mouth cometh knowledge and understanding.",pt:"Porque o Senhor d\xe1 a sabedoria; da sua boca procedem o conhecimento e o entendimento;"},{verse:7,en:"He layeth up sound wisdom for the righteous: he is a buckler to them that walk uprightly.",pt:"ele reserva a verdadeira sabedoria para os retos; e escudo para os que caminham em integridade,"},{verse:8,en:"He keepeth the paths of judgment, and preserveth the way of his saints.",pt:"guardando-lhes as veredas da justi\xe7a, e preservando o caminho dos seus santos."},{verse:9,en:"Then shalt thou understand righteousness, and judgment, and equity; yea, every good path.",pt:"Ent\xe3o entender\xe1s a retid\xe3o, a justi\xe7a, a eq\xfcidade, e todas as boas veredas."},{verse:10,en:"When wisdom entereth into thine heart, and knowledge is pleasant unto thy soul;",pt:"Pois a sabedoria entrar\xe1 no teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e o conhecimento ser\xe1 apraz\xedvel \xe0 tua alma;"},{verse:11,en:"Discretion shall preserve thee, understanding shall keep thee:",pt:"o bom siso te proteger\xe1, e o discernimento e guardar\xe1;"},{verse:12,en:"To deliver thee from the way of the evil man, from the man that speaketh froward things;",pt:"para te livrar do mau caminho, e do homem que diz coisas perversas;"},{verse:13,en:"Who leave the paths of uprightness, to walk in the ways of darkness;",pt:"dos que deixam as veredas da retid\xe3o, para andarem pelos caminhos das trevas;"},{verse:14,en:"Who rejoice to do evil, and delight in the frowardness of the wicked;",pt:"que se alegram de fazer o mal, e se deleitam nas perversidades dos maus;"},{verse:15,en:"Whose ways are crooked, and they froward in their paths:",pt:"dos que s\xe3o tortuosos nas suas veredas; e in\xedquos nas suas carreiras;"},{verse:16,en:"To deliver thee from the strange woman, even from the stranger which flattereth with her words;",pt:"e para te livrar da mulher estranha, da estrangeira que lisonjeia com suas palavras;"},{verse:17,en:"Which forsaketh the guide of her youth, and forgetteth the covenant of her God.",pt:"a qual abandona o companheiro da sua mocidade e se esquece do concerto do seu Deus;"},{verse:18,en:"For her house inclineth unto death, and her paths unto the dead.",pt:"pois a sua casa se inclina para a morte, e as suas veredas para as sombras."},{verse:19,en:"None that go unto her return again, neither take they hold of the paths of life.",pt:"Nenhum dos que se dirigirem a ela, tornara a sair, nem retomar\xe1 as veredas da vida."},{verse:20,en:"That thou mayest walk in the way of good men, and keep the paths of the righteous.",pt:"Assim andar\xe1s pelo caminho dos bons, e guardar\xe1s as veredas dos justos."},{verse:21,en:"For the upright shall dwell in the land, and the perfect shall remain in it.",pt:"Porque os retos habitar\xe3o a terra, e os \xedntegros permanecer\xe3o nela."},{verse:22,en:"But the wicked shall be cut off from the earth, and the transgressors shall be rooted out of it.",pt:"Mas os \xedmpios ser\xe3o exterminados da terra, e dela os aleivosos ser\xe3o desarraigados."}]}}),686,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, forget not my law; but let thine heart keep my commandments:",pt:"Filho meu, n\xe3o te esque\xe7as da minha instru\xe7\xe3o, e o teu cora\xe7\xe3o guarde os meus mandamentos;"},{verse:2,en:"For length of days, and long life, and peace, shall they add to thee.",pt:"porque eles te dar\xe3o longura de dias, e anos de vida e paz."},{verse:3,en:"Let not mercy and truth forsake thee: bind them about thy neck; write them upon the table of thine heart:",pt:"N\xe3o se afastem de ti a benignidade e a fidelidade; ata-as ao teu pesco\xe7o, escreve-as na t\xe1bua do teu cora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:4,en:"So shalt thou find favour and good understanding in the sight of God and man.",pt:"assim achar\xe1s favor e bom entendimento \xe0 vista de Deus e dos homens."},{verse:5,en:"Trust in the LORD with all thine heart; and lean not unto thine own understanding.",pt:"Confia no Senhor de todo o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e n\xe3o te estribes no teu pr\xf3prio entendimento."},{verse:6,en:"In all thy ways acknowledge him, and he shall direct thy paths.",pt:"Reconhece-o em todos os teus caminhos, e ele endireitar\xe1 as tuas veredas."},{verse:7,en:"Be not wise in thine own eyes: fear the LORD, and depart from evil.",pt:"N\xe3o sejas s\xe1bio a teus pr\xf3prios olhos; teme ao Senhor e aparta-te do mal."},{verse:8,en:"It shall be health to thy navel, and marrow to thy bones.",pt:"Isso ser\xe1 sa\xfade para a tua carne; e refrig\xe9rio para os teus ossos."},{verse:9,en:"Honour the LORD with thy substance, and with the firstfruits of all thine increase:",pt:"Honra ao Senhor com os teus bens, e com as prim\xedcias de toda a tua renda;"},{verse:10,en:"So shall thy barns be filled with plenty, and thy presses shall burst out with new wine.",pt:"assim se encher\xe3o de fartura os teus celeiros, e trasbordar\xe3o de mosto os teus lagares."},{verse:11,en:"My son, despise not the chastening of the LORD; neither be weary of his correction:",pt:"Filho meu, n\xe3o rejeites a disciplina do Senhor, nem te enojes da sua repreens\xe3o;"},{verse:12,en:"For whom the LORD loveth he correcteth; even as a father the son in whom he delighteth.",pt:"porque o Senhor repreende aquele a quem ama, assim como o pai ao filho a quem quer bem."},{verse:13,en:"Happy is the man that findeth wisdom, and the man that getteth understanding.",pt:"Feliz \xe9 o homem que acha sabedoria, e o homem que adquire entendimento;"},{verse:14,en:"For the merchandise of it is better than the merchandise of silver, and the gain thereof than fine gold.",pt:"pois melhor \xe9 o lucro que ela d\xe1 do que o lucro da prata, e a sua renda do que o ouro."},{verse:15,en:"She is more precious than rubies: and all the things thou canst desire are not to be compared unto her.",pt:"Mais preciosa \xe9 do que as j\xf3ias, e nada do que possas desejar \xe9 compar\xe1vel a ela."},{verse:16,en:"Length of days is in her right hand; and in her left hand riches and honour.",pt:"Longura de dias h\xe1 na sua m\xe3o direita; na sua esquerda riquezas e honra."},{verse:17,en:"Her ways are ways of pleasantness, and all her paths are peace.",pt:"Os seus caminhos s\xe3o caminhos de del\xedcias, e todas as suas veredas s\xe3o paz."},{verse:18,en:"She is a tree of life to them that lay hold upon her: and happy is every one that retaineth her.",pt:"\xc9 \xe1rvore da vida para os que dela lan\xe7am m\xe3o, e bem-aventurado \xe9 todo aquele que a ret\xe9m."},{verse:19,en:"The LORD by wisdom hath founded the earth; by understanding hath he established the heavens.",pt:"O Senhor pela sabedoria fundou a terra; pelo entendimento estabeleceu o c\xe9u."},{verse:20,en:"By his knowledge the depths are broken up, and the clouds drop down the dew.",pt:"Pelo seu conhecimento se fendem os abismos, e as nuvens destilam o orvalho."},{verse:21,en:"My son, let not them depart from thine eyes: keep sound wisdom and discretion:",pt:"Filho meu, n\xe3o se apartem estas coisas dos teus olhos: guarda a verdadeira sabedoria e o bom siso;"},{verse:22,en:"So shall they be life unto thy soul, and grace to thy neck.",pt:"assim ser\xe3o elas vida para a tua alma, e adorno para o teu pesco\xe7o."},{verse:23,en:"Then shalt thou walk in thy way safely, and thy foot shall not stumble.",pt:"Ent\xe3o andar\xe1s seguro pelo teu caminho, e n\xe3o trope\xe7ar\xe1 o teu p\xe9."},{verse:24,en:"When thou liest down, thou shalt not be afraid: yea, thou shalt lie down, and thy sleep shall be sweet.",pt:"Quando te deitares, n\xe3o temer\xe1s; sim, tu te deitar\xe1s e o teu sono ser\xe1 suave."},{verse:25,en:"Be not afraid of sudden fear, neither of the desolation of the wicked, when it cometh.",pt:"N\xe3o temas o pavor repentino, nem a assola\xe7\xe3o dos \xedmpios quando vier."},{verse:26,en:"For the LORD shall be thy confidence, and shall keep thy foot from being taken.",pt:"Porque o Senhor ser\xe1 a tua confian\xe7a, e guardar\xe1 os teus p\xe9s de serem presos."},{verse:27,en:"Withhold not good from them to whom it is due, when it is in the power of thine hand to do it.",pt:"N\xe3o negues o bem a quem de direito, estando no teu poder faz\xea-lo."},{verse:28,en:"Say not unto thy neighbour, Go, and come again, and to morrow I will give; when thou hast it by thee.",pt:"N\xe3o digas ao teu pr\xf3ximo: Vai, e volta, amanh\xe3 to darei; tendo-o tu contigo."},{verse:29,en:"Devise not evil against thy neighbour, seeing he dwelleth securely by thee.",pt:"N\xe3o maquines o mal contra o teu pr\xf3ximo, que habita contigo confiadamente."},{verse:30,en:"Strive not with a man without cause, if he have done thee no harm.",pt:"N\xe3o contendas com um homem, sem motivo, n\xe3o te havendo ele feito o mal."},{verse:31,en:"Envy thou not the oppressor, and choose none of his ways.",pt:"N\xe3o tenhas inveja do homem violento, nem escolhas nenhum de seus caminhos."},{verse:32,en:"For the froward is abomination to the LORD: but his secret is with the righteous.",pt:"Porque o perverso \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor, mas com os retos est\xe1 o seu segredo."},{verse:33,en:"The curse of the LORD is in the house of the wicked: but he blesseth the habitation of the just.",pt:"A maldi\xe7\xe3o do Senhor habita na casa do \xedmpio, mas ele aben\xe7oa a habita\xe7\xe3o dos justos."},{verse:34,en:"Surely he scorneth the scorners: but he giveth grace unto the lowly.",pt:"Ele escarnece dos escarnecedores, mas d\xe1 gra\xe7a aos humildes."},{verse:35,en:"The wise shall inherit glory: but shame shall be the promotion of fools.",pt:"Os s\xe1bios herdar\xe3o honra, mas a exalta\xe7\xe3o dos loucos se converte em ignom\xednia."}]}}),687,[]);
__d((function(e,a,t,o,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Hear, ye children, the instruction of a father, and attend to know understanding.",pt:"Ouvi, filhos, a instru\xe7\xe3o do pai, e estai atentos para conhecerdes o entendimento."},{verse:2,en:"For I give you good doctrine, forsake ye not my law.",pt:"Pois eu vos dou boa doutrina; n\xe3o abandoneis o meu ensino."},{verse:3,en:"For I was my father\u2019s son, tender and only beloved in the sight of my mother.",pt:"Quando eu era filho aos p\xe9s de meu, pai, tenro e \xfanico em estima diante de minha m\xe3e,"},{verse:4,en:"He taught me also, and said unto me, Let thine heart retain my words: keep my commandments, and live.",pt:"ele me ensinava, e me dizia: Retenha o teu cora\xe7\xe3o as minhas palavras; guarda os meus mandamentos, e vive."},{verse:5,en:"Get wisdom, get understanding: forget it not; neither decline from the words of my mouth.",pt:"Adquire a sabedoria, adquire o entendimento; n\xe3o te esque\xe7as nem te desvies das palavras da minha boca."},{verse:6,en:"Forsake her not, and she shall preserve thee: love her, and she shall keep thee.",pt:"N\xe3o a abandones, e ela te guardar\xe1; ama-a, e ela te preservar\xe1."},{verse:7,en:"Wisdom is the principal thing; therefore get wisdom: and with all thy getting get understanding.",pt:"A sabedoria \xe9 a coisa principal; adquire, pois, a sabedoria; sim, com tudo o que possuis adquire o entendimento."},{verse:8,en:"Exalt her, and she shall promote thee: she shall bring thee to honour, when thou dost embrace her.",pt:"Estima-a, e ela te exaltar\xe1; se a abra\xe7ares, ela te honrar\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"She shall give to thine head an ornament of grace: a crown of glory shall she deliver to thee.",pt:"Ela dar\xe1 \xe0 tua cabe\xe7a uma grinalda de gra\xe7a; e uma coroa de gl\xf3ria te entregar\xe1."},{verse:10,en:"Hear, O my son, and receive my sayings; and the years of thy life shall be many.",pt:"Ouve, filho meu, e aceita as minhas palavras, para que se multipliquem os anos da tua vida."},{verse:11,en:"I have taught thee in the way of wisdom; I have led thee in right paths.",pt:"Eu te ensinei o caminho da sabedoria; guiei-te pelas veredas da retid\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"When thou goest, thy steps shall not be straitened; and when thou runnest, thou shalt not stumble.",pt:"Quando andares, n\xe3o se embara\xe7ar\xe3o os teus passos; e se correres, n\xe3o trope\xe7ar\xe1s."},{verse:13,en:"Take fast hold of instruction; let her not go: keep her; for she is thy life.",pt:"Apega-te \xe0 instru\xe7\xe3o e n\xe3o a largues; guarda-a, porque ela \xe9 a tua vida."},{verse:14,en:"Enter not into the path of the wicked, and go not in the way of evil men.",pt:"N\xe3o entres na vereda dos \xedmpios, nem andes pelo caminho dos maus."},{verse:15,en:"Avoid it, pass not by it, turn from it, and pass away.",pt:"Evita-o, n\xe3o passes por ele; desvia-te dele e passa de largo."},{verse:16,en:"For they sleep not, except they have done mischief; and their sleep is taken away, unless they cause some to fall.",pt:"Pois n\xe3o dormem, se n\xe3o fizerem o mal, e foge deles o sono se n\xe3o fizerem trope\xe7ar algu\xe9m."},{verse:17,en:"For they eat the bread of wickedness, and drink the wine of violence.",pt:"Porque comem o p\xe3o da impiedade, e bebem o vinho da viol\xeancia."},{verse:18,en:"But the path of the just is as the shining light, that shineth more and more unto the perfect day.",pt:"Mas a vereda dos justos \xe9 como a luz da aurora que vai brilhando mais e mais at\xe9 ser dia perfeito."},{verse:19,en:"The way of the wicked is as darkness: they know not at what they stumble.",pt:"O caminho dos \xedmpios \xe9 como a escurid\xe3o: n\xe3o sabem eles em que trope\xe7am."},{verse:20,en:"My son, attend to my words; incline thine ear unto my sayings.",pt:"Filho meu, atenta para as minhas palavras; inclina o teu ouvido \xe0s minhas instro\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:21,en:"Let them not depart from thine eyes; keep them in the midst of thine heart.",pt:"N\xe3o se apartem elas de diante dos teus olhos; guarda-as dentro do teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"For they are life unto those that find them, and health to all their flesh.",pt:"Porque s\xe3o vida para os que as encontram, e sa\xfade para todo o seu corpo."},{verse:23,en:"Keep thy heart with all diligence; for out of it are the issues of life.",pt:"Guarda com toda a dilig\xeancia o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, porque dele procedem as fontes da vida."},{verse:24,en:"Put away from thee a froward mouth, and perverse lips put far from thee.",pt:"Desvia de ti a malignidade da boca, e alonga de ti a perversidade dos l\xe1bios."},{verse:25,en:"Let thine eyes look right on, and let thine eyelids look straight before thee.",pt:"Dirijam-se os teus olhos para a frente, e olhem as tuas p\xe1lpebras diretamente diante de ti."},{verse:26,en:"Ponder the path of thy feet, and let all thy ways be established.",pt:"Pondera a vereda de teus p\xe9s, e ser\xe3o seguros todos os teus caminhos."},{verse:27,en:"Turn not to the right hand nor to the left: remove thy foot from evil.",pt:"N\xe3o declines nem para a direita nem para a esquerda; retira o teu p\xe9 do mal."}]}}),688,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, attend unto my wisdom, and bow thine ear to my understanding:",pt:"Filho meu, atende \xe0 minha sabedoria; inclin\xe3o teu ouvido \xe0 minha prud\xeancia;"},{verse:2,en:"That thou mayest regard discretion, and that thy lips may keep knowledge.",pt:"para que observes a discri\xe7\xe3o, e os teus l\xe1bios guardem o conhecimento."},{verse:3,en:"For the lips of a strange woman drop as an honeycomb, and her mouth is smoother than oil:",pt:"Porque os l\xe1bios da mulher licenciosa destilam mel, e a sua boca e mais macia do que o azeite;"},{verse:4,en:"But her end is bitter as wormwood, sharp as a twoedged sword.",pt:"mas o seu fim \xe9 amargoso como o absinto, agudo como a espada de dois gumes."},{verse:5,en:"Her feet go down to death; her steps take hold on hell.",pt:"Os seus p\xe9s descem \xe0 morte; os seus passos seguem no caminho do Seol."},{verse:6,en:"Lest thou shouldest ponder the path of life, her ways are moveable, that thou canst not know them.",pt:"Ela n\xe3o pondera a vereda da vida; incertos s\xe3o os seus caminhos, e ela o ignora."},{verse:7,en:"Hear me now therefore, O ye children, and depart not from the words of my mouth.",pt:"Agora, pois, filhos, dai-me ouvidos, e n\xe3o vos desvieis das palavras da minha boca."},{verse:8,en:"Remove thy way far from her, and come not nigh the door of her house:",pt:"Afasta para longe dela o teu caminho, e n\xe3o te aproximes da porta da sua casa;"},{verse:9,en:"Lest thou give thine honour unto others, and thy years unto the cruel:",pt:"para que n\xe3o d\xeas a outros a tua honra, nem os teus anos a cru\xe9is;"},{verse:10,en:"Lest strangers be filled with thy wealth; and thy labours be in the house of a stranger;",pt:"para que n\xe3o se fartem os estranhos dos teus bens, e n\xe3o entrem os teus trabalhos na casa do estrangeiro,"},{verse:11,en:"And thou mourn at the last, when thy flesh and thy body are consumed,",pt:"e gemas no teu fim, quando se consumirem a tua carne e o teu corpo,"},{verse:12,en:"And say, How have I hated instruction, and my heart despised reproof;",pt:"e digas: Como detestei a disciplina! e desprezou o meu cora\xe7\xe3o a repreens\xe3o!"},{verse:13,en:"And have not obeyed the voice of my teachers, nor inclined mine ear to them that instructed me!",pt:"e n\xe3o escutei a voz dos que me ensinavam, nem aos que me instru\xedam inclinei o meu ouvido!"},{verse:14,en:"I was almost in all evil in the midst of the congregation and assembly.",pt:"Quase cheguei \xe0 ru\xedna completa, no meio da congrega\xe7\xe3o e da assembl\xe9ia."},{verse:15,en:"Drink waters out of thine own cistern, and running waters out of thine own well.",pt:"Bebe a \xe1gua da tua pr\xf3pria cisterna, e das correntes do teu po\xe7o."},{verse:16,en:"Let thy fountains be dispersed abroad, and rivers of waters in the streets.",pt:"Derramar-se-iam as tuas fontes para fora, e pelas ruas os ribeiros de \xe1guas?"},{verse:17,en:"Let them be only thine own, and not strangers\u2019 with thee.",pt:"Sejam para ti s\xf3, e n\xe3o para os estranhos juntamente contigo."},{verse:18,en:"Let thy fountain be blessed: and rejoice with the wife of thy youth.",pt:"Seja bendito o teu manancial; e regozija-te na mulher da tua mocidade."},{verse:19,en:"Let her be as the loving hind and pleasant roe; let her breasts satisfy thee at all times; and be thou ravished always with her love.",pt:"Como cor\xe7a amorosa, e graciosa cabra montesa saciem-te os seus seios em todo o tempo; e pelo seu amor s\xea encantado perpetuamente."},{verse:20,en:"And why wilt thou, my son, be ravished with a strange woman, and embrace the bosom of a stranger?",pt:"E por que, filho meu, andarias atra\xeddo pela mulher licenciosa, e abra\xc7arias o seio da ad\xfaltera?"},{verse:21,en:"For the ways of man are before the eyes of the LORD, and he pondereth all his goings.",pt:"Porque os caminhos do homem est\xe3o diante dos olhos do Senhor, o qual observa todas as suas veredas."},{verse:22,en:"His own iniquities shall take the wicked himself, and he shall be holden with the cords of his sins.",pt:"Quanto ao \xedmpio, as suas pr\xf3prias iniq\xfcidades o prender\xe3o, e pelas cordas do seu pecado ser\xe1 detido."},{verse:23,en:"He shall die without instruction; and in the greatness of his folly he shall go astray.",pt:"Ele morre pela falta de disciplina; e pelo excesso da sua loucura anda errado."}]}}),689,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, if thou be surety for thy friend, if thou hast stricken thy hand with a stranger,",pt:"Filho meu, se ficaste por fiador do teu pr\xf3ximo, se te empenhaste por um estranho,"},{verse:2,en:"Thou art snared with the words of thy mouth, thou art taken with the words of thy mouth.",pt:"est\xe1s enredado pelos teus l\xe1bios; est\xe1s preso pelas palavras da tua boca."},{verse:3,en:"Do this now, my son, deliver thyself, when thou art come into the hand of thy friend; go, humble thyself, and make sure thy friend.",pt:"Faze pois isto agora, filho meu, e livra-te, pois j\xe1 ca\xedste nas m\xe3os do teu pr\xf3ximo; vai, humilha-te, e importuna o teu pr\xf3ximo;"},{verse:4,en:"Give not sleep to thine eyes, nor slumber to thine eyelids.",pt:"n\xe3o d\xeas sono aos teus olhos, nem adormecimento \xe0s tuas p\xe1lpebras;"},{verse:5,en:"Deliver thyself as a roe from the hand of the hunter, and as a bird from the hand of the fowler.",pt:"livra-te como a gazela da m\xe3o do ca\xe7ador, e como a ave da m\xe3o do passarinheiro."},{verse:6,en:"Go to the ant, thou sluggard; consider her ways, and be wise:",pt:"Vai ter com a formiga, \xf3 pregui\xe7oso, considera os seus caminhos, e s\xea s\xe1bio;"},{verse:7,en:"Which having no guide, overseer, or ruler,",pt:"a qual, n\xe3o tendo chefe, nem superintendente, nem governador,"},{verse:8,en:"Provideth her meat in the summer, and gathereth her food in the harvest.",pt:"no ver\xe3o faz a provis\xe3o do seu mantimento, e ajunta o seu alimento no tempo da ceifa."},{verse:9,en:"How long wilt thou sleep, O sluggard? when wilt thou arise out of thy sleep?",pt:"o pregui\xe7oso, at\xe9 quando ficar\xe1s deitador? quando te levantar\xe1s do teu sono?"},{verse:10,en:"Yet a little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to sleep:",pt:"um pouco para dormir, um pouco para toscanejar, um pouco para cruzar as m\xe3os em repouso;"},{verse:11,en:"So shall thy poverty come as one that travelleth, and thy want as an armed man.",pt:"assim te sobrevir\xe1 a tua pobreza como um ladr\xe3o, e a tua necessidade como um homem armado."},{verse:12,en:"A naughty person, a wicked man, walketh with a froward mouth.",pt:"O homem vil, o homem in\xedquo, anda com a perversidade na boca,"},{verse:13,en:"He winketh with his eyes, he speaketh with his feet, he teacheth with his fingers;",pt:"pisca os olhos, faz sinais com os p\xe9s, e acena com os dedos;"},{verse:14,en:"Frowardness is in his heart, he deviseth mischief continually; he soweth discord.",pt:"perversidade h\xe1 no seu cora\xe7\xe3o; todo o tempo maquina o mal; anda semeando contendas."},{verse:15,en:"Therefore shall his calamity come suddenly; suddenly shall he be broken without remedy.",pt:"Pelo que a sua destrui\xe7\xe3o vir\xe1 repentinamente; subitamente ser\xe1 quebrantado, sem que haja cura."},{verse:16,en:"These six things doth the LORD hate: yea, seven are an abomination unto him:",pt:"H\xe1 seis coisas que o Senhor detesta; sim, h\xe1 sete que ele abomina:"},{verse:17,en:"A proud look, a lying tongue, and hands that shed innocent blood,",pt:"olhos altivos, l\xedngua mentirosa, e m\xe3os que derramam sangue inocente;"},{verse:18,en:"An heart that deviseth wicked imaginations, feet that be swift in running to mischief,",pt:"cora\xe7\xe3o que maquina projetos in\xedquos, p\xe9s que se apressam a correr para o mal;"},{verse:19,en:"A false witness that speaketh lies, and he that soweth discord among brethren.",pt:"testemunha falsa que profere mentiras, e o que semeia contendas entre irm\xe3os."},{verse:20,en:"My son, keep thy father\u2019s commandment, and forsake not the law of thy mother:",pt:"Filho meu, guarda o mandamento de, teu pai, e n\xe3o abandones a instru\xe7\xe3o de tua m\xe3e;"},{verse:21,en:"Bind them continually upon thine heart, and tie them about thy neck.",pt:"ata-os perpetuamente ao teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e pendura-os ao teu pesco\xe7o."},{verse:22,en:"When thou goest, it shall lead thee; when thou sleepest, it shall keep thee; and when thou awakest, it shall talk with thee.",pt:"Quando caminhares, isso te guiar\xe1; quando te deitares, te guardar\xe1; quando acordares, falar\xe1 contigo."},{verse:23,en:"For the commandment is a lamp; and the law is light; and reproofs of instruction are the way of life:",pt:"Porque o mandamento \xe9 uma l\xe2mpada, e a instru\xe7\xe3o uma luz; e as repreens\xf5es da disciplina s\xe3o o caminho da vida,"},{verse:24,en:"To keep thee from the evil woman, from the flattery of the tongue of a strange woman.",pt:"para te guardarem da mulher m\xe1, e das lisonjas da l\xedngua da ad\xfaltera."},{verse:25,en:"Lust not after her beauty in thine heart; neither let her take thee with her eyelids.",pt:"N\xe3o cobices no teu cora\xe7\xe3o a sua formosura, nem te deixes prender pelos seus olhares."},{verse:26,en:"For by means of a whorish woman a man is brought to a piece of bread: and the adulteress will hunt for the precious life.",pt:"Porque o pre\xe7o da prostituta \xe9 apenas um bocado de p\xe3o, mas a ad\xfaltera anda \xe0 ca\xe7a da pr\xf3pria vida do homem."},{verse:27,en:"Can a man take fire in his bosom, and his clothes not be burned?",pt:"Pode algu\xe9m tomar fogo no seu seio, sem que os seus vestidos se queimem?"},{verse:28,en:"Can one go upon hot coals, and his feet not be burned?",pt:"Ou andar\xe1 sobre as brasas sem que se queimem os seus p\xe9s?"},{verse:29,en:"So he that goeth in to his neighbour\u2019s wife; whosoever toucheth her shall not be innocent.",pt:"Assim ser\xe1 o que entrar \xe0 mulher do seu proximo; n\xe3o ficar\xe1 inocente quem a tocar."},{verse:30,en:"Men do not despise a thief, if he steal to satisfy his soul when he is hungry;",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 desprezado o ladr\xe3o, mesmo quando furta para saciar a fome?"},{verse:31,en:"But if he be found, he shall restore sevenfold; he shall give all the substance of his house.",pt:"E, se for apanhado, pagar\xe1 sete vezes tanto, dando at\xe9 todos os bens de sua casa."},{verse:32,en:"But whoso committeth adultery with a woman lacketh understanding: he that doeth it destroyeth his own soul.",pt:"O que adultera com uma mulher \xe9 falto de entendimento; destr\xf3i-se a si mesmo, quem assim procede."},{verse:33,en:"A wound and dishonour shall he get; and his reproach shall not be wiped away.",pt:"Receber\xe1 feridas e ignom\xednia, e o seu opr\xf3brio nunca se apagar\xe1;"},{verse:34,en:"For jealousy is the rage of a man: therefore he will not spare in the day of vengeance.",pt:"porque o ci\xfame enfurece ao marido, que de maneira nenhuma poupar\xe1 no dia da vingan\xe7a."},{verse:35,en:"He will not regard any ransom; neither will he rest content, though thou givest many gifts.",pt:"N\xe3o aceitar\xe1 resgate algum, nem se aplacar\xe1, ainda que multipliques os presentes."}]}}),690,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"My son, keep my words, and lay up my commandments with thee.",pt:"Filho meu, guarda as minhas palavras, e entesoura contigo os meus mandamentos."},{verse:2,en:"Keep my commandments, and live; and my law as the apple of thine eye.",pt:"Observa os meus mandamentos e vive; guarda a minha lei, como a menina dos teus olhos."},{verse:3,en:"Bind them upon thy fingers, write them upon the table of thine heart.",pt:"Ata-os aos teus dedos, escreve-os na t\xe1bua do teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"Say unto wisdom, Thou art my sister; and call understanding thy kinswoman:",pt:"Dize \xe0 sabedoria: Tu \xe9s minha irm\xe3; e chama ao entendimento teu amigo \xedntimo,"},{verse:5,en:"That they may keep thee from the strange woman, from the stranger which flattereth with her words.",pt:"para te guardarem da mulher alheia, da ad\xfaltera, que lisonjeia com as suas palavras."},{verse:6,en:"For at the window of my house I looked through my casement,",pt:"Porque da janela da minha casa, por minhas grades olhando eu,"},{verse:7,en:"And beheld among the simple ones, I discerned among the youths, a young man void of understanding,",pt:"vi entre os simples, divisei entre os jovens, um mancebo falto de ju\xedzo,"},{verse:8,en:"Passing through the street near her corner; and he went the way to her house,",pt:"que passava pela rua junto \xe0 esquina da mulher ad\xfaltera e que seguia o caminho da sua casa,"},{verse:9,en:"In the twilight, in the evening, in the black and dark night:",pt:"no crep\xfasculo, \xe0 tarde do dia, \xe0 noite fechada e na escurid\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"And, behold, there met him a woman with the attire of an harlot, and subtil of heart.",pt:"e eis que uma mulher lhe saiu ao encontro, ornada \xe0 moda das prostitutas, e astuta de cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"(She is loud and stubborn; her feet abide not in her house:",pt:"Ela \xe9 turbulenta e obstinada; n\xe3o param em casa os seus p\xe9s;"},{verse:12,en:"Now is she without, now in the streets, and lieth in wait at every corner.)",pt:"ora est\xe1 ela pelas ruas, ora pelas pra\xe7as, espreitando por todos os cantos."},{verse:13,en:"So she caught him, and kissed him, and with an impudent face said unto him,",pt:"Pegou dele, pois, e o beijou; e com semblante impudico lhe disse:"},{verse:14,en:"I have peace offerings with me; this day have I payed my vows.",pt:"Sacrif\xedcios pac\xedficos tenho comigo; hoje paguei os meus votos."},{verse:15,en:"Therefore came I forth to meet thee, diligently to seek thy face, and I have found thee.",pt:"Por isso sa\xed ao teu encontro a buscar-te diligentemente, e te achei."},{verse:16,en:"I have decked my bed with coverings of tapestry, with carved works, with fine linen of Egypt.",pt:"J\xe1 cobri a minha cama de cobertas, de colchas de linho do Egito."},{verse:17,en:"I have perfumed my bed with myrrh, aloes, and cinnamon.",pt:"J\xe1 perfumei o meu leito com mirra, alo\xe9s e cinamomo."},{verse:18,en:"Come, let us take our fill of love until the morning: let us solace ourselves with loves.",pt:"Vem, saciemo-nos de amores at\xe9 pela manh\xe3; alegremo-nos com amores."},{verse:19,en:"For the goodman is not at home, he is gone a long journey:",pt:"Porque meu marido n\xe3o est\xe1 em casa; foi fazer uma jornada ao longe;"},{verse:20,en:"He hath taken a bag of money with him, and will come home at the day appointed.",pt:"um saquitel de dinheiro levou na m\xe3o; s\xf3 l\xe1 para o dia da lua cheia voltar\xe1 para casa."},{verse:21,en:"With her much fair speech she caused him to yield, with the flattering of her lips she forced him.",pt:"Ela o faz ceder com a multid\xe3o das suas palavras sedutoras, com as lisonjas dos seus l\xe1bios o arrasta."},{verse:22,en:"He goeth after her straightway, as an ox goeth to the slaughter, or as a fool to the correction of the stocks;",pt:"Ele a segue logo, como boi que vai ao matadouro, e como o louco ao castigo das pris\xf5es;"},{verse:23,en:"Till a dart strike through his liver; as a bird hasteth to the snare, and knoweth not that it is for his life.",pt:"at\xe9 que uma flecha lhe atravesse o f\xedgado, como a ave que se apressa para o la\xe7o, sem saber que est\xe1 armado contra a sua vida."},{verse:24,en:"Hearken unto me now therefore, O ye children, and attend to the words of my mouth.",pt:"Agora, pois, filhos, ouvi-me, e estai atentos \xe0s palavras da minha boca."},{verse:25,en:"Let not thine heart decline to her ways, go not astray in her paths.",pt:"N\xe3o se desvie para os seus caminhos o teu cora\xe7\xe3o, e n\xe3o andes perdido nas suas veredas."},{verse:26,en:"For she hath cast down many wounded: yea, many strong men have been slain by her.",pt:"Porque ela a muitos tem feito cair feridos; e s\xe3o muit\xedssimos os que por ela foram mortos."},{verse:27,en:"Her house is the way to hell, going down to the chambers of death.",pt:"Caminho de Seol \xe9 a sua casa, o qual desce \xe0s c\xe2maras da morte."}]}}),691,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Doth not wisdom cry? and understanding put forth her voice?",pt:"N\xe3o clama porventura a sabedoria, e n\xe3o faz o entendimento soar a sua voz?"},{verse:2,en:"She standeth in the top of high places, by the way in the places of the paths.",pt:"No cume das alturas, junto ao caminho, nas encruzilhadas das veredas ela se coloca."},{verse:3,en:"She crieth at the gates, at the entry of the city, at the coming in at the doors.",pt:"Junto \xe0s portas, \xe0 entrada da cidade, e \xe0 entrada das portas est\xe1 clamando:"},{verse:4,en:"Unto you, O men, I call; and my voice is to the sons of man.",pt:"A v\xf3s, \xf3 homens, clamo; e a minha voz se dirige aos filhos dos homens."},{verse:5,en:"O ye simple, understand wisdom: and, ye fools, be ye of an understanding heart.",pt:"Aprendei, \xf3 simples, a prud\xeancia; entendei, \xf3 loucos, a sabedoria."},{verse:6,en:"Hear; for I will speak of excellent things; and the opening of my lips shall be right things.",pt:"Ouvi v\xf3s, porque profiro coisas excelentes; os meus l\xe1bios se abrem para a eq\xfcidade."},{verse:7,en:"For my mouth shall speak truth; and wickedness is an abomination to my lips.",pt:"Porque a minha boca profere a verdade, os meus l\xe1bios abominam a impiedade."},{verse:8,en:"All the words of my mouth are in righteousness; there is nothing froward or perverse in them.",pt:"Justas s\xe3o todas as palavras da minha boca; n\xe3o h\xe1 nelas nenhuma coisa tortuosa nem perversa."},{verse:9,en:"They are all plain to him that understandeth, and right to them that find knowledge.",pt:"Todas elas s\xe3o retas para o que bem as entende, e justas para os que acham o conhecimento."},{verse:10,en:"Receive my instruction, and not silver; and knowledge rather than choice gold.",pt:"Aceitai antes a minha corre\xe7\xe3o, e n\xe3o a prata; e o conhecimento, antes do que o ouro escolhido."},{verse:11,en:"For wisdom is better than rubies; and all the things that may be desired are not to be compared to it.",pt:"Porque melhor \xe9 a sabedoria do que as j\xf3ias; e de tudo o que se deseja nada se pode comparar com ela."},{verse:12,en:"I wisdom dwell with prudence, and find out knowledge of witty inventions.",pt:"Eu, a sabedoria, habito com a prud\xeancia, e possuo o conhecimento e a discri\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"The fear of the LORD is to hate evil: pride, and arrogancy, and the evil way, and the froward mouth, do I hate.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 odiar o mal; a soberba, e a arrog\xe2ncia, e o mau caminho, e a boca perversa, eu os odeio."},{verse:14,en:"Counsel is mine, and sound wisdom: I am understanding; I have strength.",pt:"Meu \xe9 o conselho, e a verdadeira sabedoria; eu sou o entendimento; minha \xe9 a fortaleza."},{verse:15,en:"By me kings reign, and princes decree justice.",pt:"Por mim reinam os reis, e os pr\xedncipes decretam o que justo."},{verse:16,en:"By me princes rule, and nobles, even all the judges of the earth.",pt:"Por mim governam os pr\xedncipes e os nobres, sim, todos os ju\xedzes da terra."},{verse:17,en:"I love them that love me; and those that seek me early shall find me.",pt:"Eu amo aos que me amam, e os que diligentemente me buscam me achar\xe3o."},{verse:18,en:"Riches and honour are with me; yea, durable riches and righteousness.",pt:"Riquezas e honra est\xe3o comigo; sim, riquezas dur\xe1veis e justi\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"My fruit is better than gold, yea, than fine gold; and my revenue than choice silver.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o meu fruto do que o ouro, sim, do que o ouro refinado; e a minha renda melhor do que a prata escolhida."},{verse:20,en:"I lead in the way of righteousness, in the midst of the paths of judgment:",pt:"Ando pelo caminho da retid\xe3o, no meio das veredas da justi\xe7a,"},{verse:21,en:"That I may cause those that love me to inherit substance; and I will fill their treasures.",pt:"dotando de bens permanentes os que me amam, e enchendo os seus tesouros."},{verse:22,en:"The LORD possessed me in the beginning of his way, before his works of old.",pt:"O Senhor me criou como a primeira das suas obras, o princ\xedpio dos seus feitos mais antigos."},{verse:23,en:"I was set up from everlasting, from the beginning, or ever the earth was.",pt:"Desde a eternidade fui constitu\xedda, desde o princ\xedpio, antes de existir a terra."},{verse:24,en:"When there were no depths, I was brought forth; when there were no fountains abounding with water.",pt:"Antes de haver abismos, fui gerada, e antes ainda de haver fontes cheias d'\xe1gua."},{verse:25,en:"Before the mountains were settled, before the hills was I brought forth:",pt:"Antes que os montes fossem firmados, antes dos outeiros eu nasci,"},{verse:26,en:"While as yet he had not made the earth, nor the fields, nor the highest part of the dust of the world.",pt:"quando ele ainda n\xe3o tinha feito a terra com seus campos, nem sequer o princ\xedpio do p\xf3 do mundo."},{verse:27,en:"When he prepared the heavens, I was there: when he set a compass upon the face of the depth:",pt:"Quando ele preparava os c\xe9us, a\xed estava eu; quando tra\xe7ava um c\xedrculo sobre a face do abismo,"},{verse:28,en:"When he established the clouds above: when he strengthened the fountains of the deep:",pt:"quando estabelecia o firmamento em cima, quando se firmavam as fontes do abismo,"},{verse:29,en:"When he gave to the sea his decree, that the waters should not pass his commandment: when he appointed the foundations of the earth:",pt:"quando ele fixava ao mar o seu termo, para que as \xe1guas n\xe3o traspassassem o seu mando, quando tra\xe7ava os fundamentos da terra,"},{verse:30,en:"Then I was by him, as one brought up with him: and I was daily his delight, rejoicing always before him;",pt:"ent\xe3o eu estava ao seu lado como arquiteto; e era cada dia as suas del\xedcias, alegrando-me perante ele em todo o tempo;"},{verse:31,en:"Rejoicing in the habitable part of his earth; and my delights were with the sons of men.",pt:"folgando no seu mundo habit\xe1vel, e achando as minhas del\xedcias com os filhos dos homens."},{verse:32,en:"Now therefore hearken unto me, O ye children: for blessed are they that keep my ways.",pt:"Agora, pois, filhos, ouvi-me; porque felizes s\xe3o os que guardam os meus caminhos."},{verse:33,en:"Hear instruction, and be wise, and refuse it not.",pt:"Ouvi a corre\xe7\xe3o, e sede s\xe1bios; e n\xe3o a rejeiteis."},{verse:34,en:"Blessed is the man that heareth me, watching daily at my gates, waiting at the posts of my doors.",pt:"Feliz \xe9 o homem que me d\xe1 ouvidos, velando cada dia \xe0s minhas entradas, esperando junto \xe0s ombreiras da minha porta."},{verse:35,en:"For whoso findeth me findeth life, and shall obtain favour of the LORD.",pt:"Porque o que me achar achar\xe1 a vida, e alcan\xe7ar\xe1 o favor do Senhor."},{verse:36,en:"But he that sinneth against me wrongeth his own soul: all they that hate me love death.",pt:"Mas o que pecar contra mim far\xe1 mal \xe0 sua pr\xf3pria alma; todos os que me odeiam amam a morte."}]}}),692,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,n,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Wisdom hath builded her house, she hath hewn out her seven pillars:",pt:"A sabedoria j\xe1 edificou a sua casa, j\xe1 lavrou as suas sete colunas;"},{verse:2,en:"She hath killed her beasts; she hath mingled her wine; she hath also furnished her table.",pt:"j\xe1 imolou as suas v\xedtimas, misturou o seu vinho, e preparou a sua mesa."},{verse:3,en:"She hath sent forth her maidens: she crieth upon the highest places of the city,",pt:"J\xe1 enviou as suas criadas a clamar sobre as alturas da cidade, dizendo:"},{verse:4,en:"Whoso is simple, let him turn in hither: as for him that wanteth understanding, she saith to him,",pt:"Quem \xe9 simples, volte-se para c\xe1. Aos faltos de entendimento diz:"},{verse:5,en:"Come, eat of my bread, and drink of the wine which I have mingled.",pt:"Vinde, comei do meu p\xe3o, e bebei do vinho que tenho misturado."},{verse:6,en:"Forsake the foolish, and live; and go in the way of understanding.",pt:"Deixai a insensatez, e vivei; e andai pelo caminho do entendimento."},{verse:7,en:"He that reproveth a scorner getteth to himself shame: and he that rebuketh a wicked man getteth himself a blot.",pt:"O que repreende ao escarnecedor, traz afronta sobre si; e o que censura ao \xedmpio, recebe a sua mancha."},{verse:8,en:"Reprove not a scorner, lest he hate thee: rebuke a wise man, and he will love thee.",pt:"N\xe3o repreendas ao escarnecedor, para que n\xe3o te odeie; repreende ao s\xe1bio, e amar-te-\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"Give instruction to a wise man, and he will be yet wiser: teach a just man, and he will increase in learning.",pt:"Instrui ao s\xe1bio, e ele se far\xe1 mais, s\xe1bio; ensina ao justo, e ele crescer\xe1 em entendimento."},{verse:10,en:"The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom: and the knowledge of the holy is understanding.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 o princ\xedpio sabedoria; e o conhecimento do Santo \xe9 o entendimento."},{verse:11,en:"For by me thy days shall be multiplied, and the years of thy life shall be increased.",pt:"Porque por mim se multiplicam os teus dias, e anos de vida se te acrescentar\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"If thou be wise, thou shalt be wise for thyself: but if thou scornest, thou alone shalt bear it.",pt:"Se fores s\xe1bio, para ti mesmo o ser\xe1s; e, se fores escarnecedor, tu s\xf3 o suportar\xe1s."},{verse:13,en:"A foolish woman is clamorous: she is simple, and knoweth nothing.",pt:"A mulher tola \xe9 alvoro\xe7adora; \xe9 insensata, e n\xe3o conhece o pudor."},{verse:14,en:"For she sitteth at the door of her house, on a seat in the high places of the city,",pt:"Senta-se \xe0 porta da sua casa ou numa cadeira, nas alturas da cidade,"},{verse:15,en:"To call passengers who go right on their ways:",pt:"chamando aos que passam e seguem direitos o seu caminho:"},{verse:16,en:"Whoso is simple, let him turn in hither: and as for him that wanteth understanding, she saith to him,",pt:"Quem \xe9 simples, volte-se para c\xe1! E aos faltos de entendimento diz:"},{verse:17,en:"Stolen waters are sweet, and bread eaten in secret is pleasant.",pt:"As \xe1guas roubadas s\xe3o doces, e o p\xe3o comido \xe0s ocultas \xe9 agrad\xe1vel."},{verse:18,en:"But he knoweth not that the dead are there; and that her guests are in the depths of hell.",pt:"Mas ele n\xe3o sabe que ali est\xe3o os mortos; que os seus convidados est\xe3o nas profundezas do Seol."}]}}),693,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The proverbs of Solomon. A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish son is the heaviness of his mother.",pt:"Prov\xe9rbios de Salom\xe3o. Um filho s\xe1bio alegra a seu pai; mas um filho insensato \xe9 a tristeza de sua mae."},{verse:2,en:"Treasures of wickedness profit nothing: but righteousness delivereth from death.",pt:"Os tesouros da impiedade de nada aproveitam; mas a justi\xe7a livra da morte."},{verse:3,en:"The LORD will not suffer the soul of the righteous to famish: but he casteth away the substance of the wicked.",pt:"O Senhor n\xe3o deixa o justo passar fome; mas o desejo dos \xedmpios ele recha\xe7a."},{verse:4,en:"He becometh poor that dealeth with a slack hand: but the hand of the diligent maketh rich.",pt:"O que trabalha com m\xe3o remissa empobrece; mas a m\xe3o do diligente enriquece."},{verse:5,en:"He that gathereth in summer is a wise son: but he that sleepeth in harvest is a son that causeth shame.",pt:"O que ajunta no ver\xe3o \xe9 filho prudente; mas o que dorme na sega \xe9 filho que envergonha."},{verse:6,en:"Blessings are upon the head of the just: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",pt:"B\xean\xe7\xe3os caem sobre a cabe\xe7a do justo; por\xe9m a boca dos \xedmpios esconde a viol\xeancia."},{verse:7,en:"The memory of the just is blessed: but the name of the wicked shall rot.",pt:"A mem\xf3ria do justo \xe9 aben\xe7oada; mas o nome dos \xedmpios apodrecer\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"The wise in heart will receive commandments: but a prating fool shall fall.",pt:"O s\xe1bio de cora\xe7\xe3o aceita os mandamentos; mas o insensato palra dor cair\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"He that walketh uprightly walketh surely: but he that perverteth his ways shall be known.",pt:"Quem anda em integridade anda seguro; mas o que perverte os seus caminhos ser\xe1 conhecido."},{verse:10,en:"He that winketh with the eye causeth sorrow: but a prating fool shall fall.",pt:"O que acena com os olhos d\xe1 dores; e o insensato palrador cair\xe1."},{verse:11,en:"The mouth of a righteous man is a well of life: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",pt:"A boca do justo \xe9 manancial de vida, por\xe9m a boca dos \xedmpios esconde a viol\xeancia."},{verse:12,en:"Hatred stirreth up strifes: but love covereth all sins.",pt:"O \xf3dio excita contendas; mas o amor cobre todas as transgress\xf5es."},{verse:13,en:"In the lips of him that hath understanding wisdom is found: but a rod is for the back of him that is void of understanding.",pt:"Nos l\xe1bios do entendido se acha a sabedoria; mas a vara \xe9 para as costas do que \xe9 falto de entendimento."},{verse:14,en:"Wise men lay up knowledge: but the mouth of the foolish is near destruction.",pt:"Os s\xe1bios entesouram o conhecimento; por\xe9m a boca do insensato \xe9 uma destrui\xe7\xe3o iminente."},{verse:15,en:"The rich man\u2019s wealth is his strong city: the destruction of the poor is their poverty.",pt:"Os bens do rico s\xe3o a sua cidade forte; a ru\xedna dos pobres \xe9 a sua pobreza."},{verse:16,en:"The labour of the righteous tendeth to life: the fruit of the wicked to sin.",pt:"O trabalho do justo conduz \xe0 vida; a renda do \xedmpio, para o pecado."},{verse:17,en:"He is in the way of life that keepeth instruction: but he that refuseth reproof erreth.",pt:"O que atende \xe0 instru\xe7\xe3o est\xe1 na vereda da vida; mas o que rejeita a repreens\xe3o anda errado."},{verse:18,en:"He that hideth hatred with lying lips, and he that uttereth a slander, is a fool.",pt:"O que encobre o \xf3dio tem l\xe1bios falsos; e o que espalha a cal\xfania \xe9 um insensato."},{verse:19,en:"In the multitude of words there wanteth not sin: but he that refraineth his lips is wise.",pt:"Na multid\xe3o de palavras n\xe3o falta transgress\xe3o; mas o que refreia os seus l\xe1bios \xe9 prudente."},{verse:20,en:"The tongue of the just is as choice silver: the heart of the wicked is little worth.",pt:"A l\xedngua do justo \xe9 prata escolhida; o cora\xe7\xe3o dos \xedmpios \xe9 de pouco valor."},{verse:21,en:"The lips of the righteous feed many: but fools die for want of wisdom.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios do justo apascentam a muitos; mas os insensatos, por falta de entendimento, morrem."},{verse:22,en:"The blessing of the LORD, it maketh rich, and he addeth no sorrow with it.",pt:"A b\xean\xe7\xe3o do Senhor \xe9 que enriquece; e ele n\xe3o a faz seguir de dor alguma."},{verse:23,en:"It is as sport to a fool to do mischief: but a man of understanding hath wisdom.",pt:"E um divertimento para o insensato o praticar a iniq\xfcidade; mas a conduta s\xe1bia \xe9 o prazer do homem entendido."},{verse:24,en:"The fear of the wicked, it shall come upon him: but the desire of the righteous shall be granted.",pt:"O que o \xedmpio teme, isso vir\xe1 sobre ele; mas aos justos se lhes conceder\xe1 o seu desejo."},{verse:25,en:"As the whirlwind passeth, so is the wicked no more: but the righteous is an everlasting foundation.",pt:"Como passa a tempestade, assim desaparece o impio; mas o justo tem fundamentos eternos."},{verse:26,en:"As vinegar to the teeth, and as smoke to the eyes, so is the sluggard to them that send him.",pt:"Como vinagre para os dentes, como fuma\xe7a para os olhos, assim \xe9 o pregui\xe7oso para aqueles que o mandam."},{verse:27,en:"The fear of the LORD prolongeth days: but the years of the wicked shall be shortened.",pt:"O temor do Senhor aumenta os dias; mas os anos os impios ser\xe3o abreviados."},{verse:28,en:"The hope of the righteous shall be gladness: but the expectation of the wicked shall perish.",pt:"A esperan\xe7a dos justos \xe9 alegria; mas a expecta\xe7\xe3o dos \xedmpios perecer\xe1."},{verse:29,en:"The way of the LORD is strength to the upright: but destruction shall be to the workers of iniquity.",pt:"O caminho do Senhor \xe9 fortaleza para os retos; mas \xe9 destrui\xe7\xe3o para os que praticam a iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:30,en:"The righteous shall never be removed: but the wicked shall not inhabit the earth.",pt:"O justo nunca ser\xe1 abalado; mas os \xedmpios n\xe3o habitar\xe3o a terra."},{verse:31,en:"The mouth of the just bringeth forth wisdom: but the froward tongue shall be cut out.",pt:"A boca do justo produz sabedoria; por\xe9m a l\xedngua perversa ser\xe1 desarraigada."},{verse:32,en:"The lips of the righteous know what is acceptable: but the mouth of the wicked speaketh frowardness.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios do justo sabem o que agrada; por\xe9m a boca dos \xedmpios fala perversidades."}]}}),694,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,t,a,r,i){a.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A false balance is abomination to the LORD: but a just weight is his delight.",pt:"A balan\xe7a enganosa \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor; mas o peso justo \xe9 o seu prazer."},{verse:2,en:"When pride cometh, then cometh shame: but with the lowly is wisdom.",pt:"Quando vem a soberba, ent\xe3o vem a desonra; mas com os humildes est\xe1 a sabedoria."},{verse:3,en:"The integrity of the upright shall guide them: but the perverseness of transgressors shall destroy them.",pt:"A integridade dos retos os guia; por\xe9m a perversidade dos desleais os destr\xf3i."},{verse:4,en:"Riches profit not in the day of wrath: but righteousness delivereth from death.",pt:"De nada aproveitam as riquezas no dia da ira; por\xe9m a justi\xe7a livra da morte."},{verse:5,en:"The righteousness of the perfect shall direct his way: but the wicked shall fall by his own wickedness.",pt:"A justi\xe7a dos perfeitos endireita o seu caminho; mas o \xedmpio cai pela sua impiedade."},{verse:6,en:"The righteousness of the upright shall deliver them: but transgressors shall be taken in their own naughtiness.",pt:"A justi\xe7a dos retos os livra; mas os trai\xe7oeiros s\xe3o apanhados nas, suas pr\xf3prias cobi\xe7as."},{verse:7,en:"When a wicked man dieth, his expectation shall perish: and the hope of unjust men perisheth.",pt:"Morrendo o \xedmpio, perece a sua esperan\xe7a; e a expectativa da iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:8,en:"The righteous is delivered out of trouble, and the wicked cometh in his stead.",pt:"O justo \xe9 libertado da ang\xfastia; e o \xedmpio fica em seu lugar."},{verse:9,en:"An hypocrite with his mouth destroyeth his neighbour: but through knowledge shall the just be delivered.",pt:"O hip\xf3crita com a boca arru\xedna o seu proximo; mas os justos s\xe3o libertados pelo conhecimento."},{verse:10,en:"When it goeth well with the righteous, the city rejoiceth: and when the wicked perish, there is shouting.",pt:"Quando os justos prosperam, exulta a cidade; e quando perecem os \xedmpios, h\xe1 j\xfabilo."},{verse:11,en:"By the blessing of the upright the city is exalted: but it is overthrown by the mouth of the wicked.",pt:"Pela b\xean\xe7\xe3o dos retos se exalta a cidade; mas pela boca dos \xedmpios \xe9 derrubada."},{verse:12,en:"He that is void of wisdom despiseth his neighbour: but a man of understanding holdeth his peace.",pt:"Quem despreza o seu pr\xf3ximo \xe9 falto de senso; mas o homem de entendimento se cala."},{verse:13,en:"A talebearer revealeth secrets: but he that is of a faithful spirit concealeth the matter.",pt:"O que anda mexericando revela segredos; mas o fiel de esp\xedrito encobre o neg\xf3cio."},{verse:14,en:"Where no counsel is, the people fall: but in the multitude of counsellors there is safety.",pt:"Quando n\xe3o h\xe1 s\xe1bia dire\xe7\xe3o, o povo cai; mas na multid\xe3o de conselheiros h\xe1 seguran\xe7a."},{verse:15,en:"He that is surety for a stranger shall smart for it: and he that hateth suretiship is sure.",pt:"Decerto sofrer\xe1 preju\xedzo aquele que fica por fiador do estranho; mas o que aborrece a fian\xe7a estar\xe1 seguro."},{verse:16,en:"A gracious woman retaineth honour: and strong men retain riches.",pt:"A mulher apraz\xedvel obt\xe9m honra, e os homens violentos obt\xeam riquezas."},{verse:17,en:"The merciful man doeth good to his own soul: but he that is cruel troubleth his own flesh.",pt:"O homem bondoso faz bem \xe0 sua, pr\xf3pria alma; mas o cruel faz mal a si mesmo."},{verse:18,en:"The wicked worketh a deceitful work: but to him that soweth righteousness shall be a sure reward.",pt:"O \xedmpio recebe um sal\xe1rio ilus\xf3rio; mas o que semeia justi\xe7a recebe galard\xe3o seguro."},{verse:19,en:"As righteousness tendeth to life: so he that pursueth evil pursueth it to his own death.",pt:"Quem \xe9 fiel na retid\xe3o encaminha, para a vida, e aquele que segue o mal encontra a morte."},{verse:20,en:"They that are of a froward heart are abomination to the LORD: but such as are upright in their way are his delight.",pt:"Abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor s\xe3o os perversos de cora\xe7\xe3o; mas os que s\xe3o perfeitos em seu caminho s\xe3o o seu deleite."},{verse:21,en:"Though hand join in hand, the wicked shall not be unpunished: but the seed of the righteous shall be delivered.",pt:"Decerto o homem mau n\xe3o ficar\xe1 sem castigo; por\xe9m a descend\xeancia dos justos ser\xe1 livre."},{verse:22,en:"As a jewel of gold in a swine\u2019s snout, so is a fair woman which is without discretion.",pt:"Como j\xf3ia de ouro em focinho de porca, assim \xe9 a mulher formosa que se aparta da discri\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:23,en:"The desire of the righteous is only good: but the expectation of the wicked is wrath.",pt:"O desejo dos justos \xe9 somente o bem; por\xe9m a expectativa dos \xedmpios \xe9 a ira."},{verse:24,en:"There is that scattereth, and yet increaseth; and there is that withholdeth more than is meet, but it tendeth to poverty.",pt:"Um d\xe1 liberalmente, e se torna mais rico; outro ret\xe9m mais do que \xe9 justo, e se empobrece."},{verse:25,en:"The liberal soul shall be made fat: and he that watereth shall be watered also himself.",pt:"A alma generosa prosperar\xe1, e o que regar tamb\xe9m ser\xe1 regado."},{verse:26,en:"He that withholdeth corn, the people shall curse him: but blessing shall be upon the head of him that selleth it.",pt:"Ao que ret\xe9m o trigo o povo o amaldi\xe7oa; mas b\xean\xe7\xe3o haver\xe1 sobre a cabe\xe7a do que o vende."},{verse:27,en:"He that diligently seeketh good procureth favour: but he that seeketh mischief, it shall come unto him.",pt:"O que busca diligentemente o bem, busca favor; mas ao que procura o mal, este lhe sobrevir\xe1."},{verse:28,en:"He that trusteth in his riches shall fall: but the righteous shall flourish as a branch.",pt:"Aquele que confia nas suas riquezas, cair\xe1; mas os justos reverdecer\xe3o como a folhagem."},{verse:29,en:"He that troubleth his own house shall inherit the wind: and the fool shall be servant to the wise of heart.",pt:"O que perturba a sua casa herdar\xe1 o vento; e o insensato ser\xe1 servo do entendido de cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:30,en:"The fruit of the righteous is a tree of life; and he that winneth souls is wise.",pt:"O fruto do justo \xe9 \xe1rvore de vida; e o que ganha almas s\xe1bio \xe9."},{verse:31,en:"Behold, the righteous shall be recompensed in the earth: much more the wicked and the sinner.",pt:"Eis que o justo \xe9 castigado na terra; quanto mais o \xedmpio e o pecador!"}]}}),695,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Whoso loveth instruction loveth knowledge: but he that hateth reproof is brutish.",pt:"O que ama a corre\xe7\xe3o ama o conhecimento; mas o que aborrece a repreens\xe3o \xe9 insensato."},{verse:2,en:"A good man obtaineth favour of the LORD: but a man of wicked devices will he condemn.",pt:"O homem de bem alcan\xe7ar\xe1 o favor do Senhor; mas ao homem de perversos des\xedgnios ele condenar\xe1."},{verse:3,en:"A man shall not be established by wickedness: but the root of the righteous shall not be moved.",pt:"O homem n\xe3o se estabelece pela impiedade; a raiz dos justos, por\xe9m, nunca ser\xe1, removida."},{verse:4,en:"A virtuous woman is a crown to her husband: but she that maketh ashamed is as rottenness in his bones.",pt:"A mulher virtuosa \xe9 a coroa do seu marido; por\xe9m a que procede vergonhosamente \xe9 como apodrecimento nos seus ossos."},{verse:5,en:"The thoughts of the righteous are right: but the counsels of the wicked are deceit.",pt:"Os pensamentos do justo s\xe3o retos; mas os conselhos do \xedmpio s\xe3o falsos."},{verse:6,en:"The words of the wicked are to lie in wait for blood: but the mouth of the upright shall deliver them.",pt:"As palavras dos \xedmpios s\xe3o emboscadas para derramarem sangue; a boca dos retos, por\xe9m, os livrar\xe1."},{verse:7,en:"The wicked are overthrown, and are not: but the house of the righteous shall stand.",pt:"Transtornados ser\xe3o os \xedmpios, e n\xe3o ser\xe3o mais; por\xe9m a casa dos justos permanecer\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"A man shall be commended according to his wisdom: but he that is of a perverse heart shall be despised.",pt:"Segundo o seu entendimento \xe9 louvado o homem; mas o perverso decora\xe7\xe3o \xe9 desprezado."},{verse:9,en:"He that is despised, and hath a servant, is better than he that honoureth himself, and lacketh bread.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o que \xe9 estimado em pouco e tem servo, do que quem se honra a si mesmo e tem falta de p\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"A righteous man regardeth the life of his beast: but the tender mercies of the wicked are cruel.",pt:"O justo olha pela vida dos seus animais; por\xe9m as entranhas dos \xedmpios s\xe3o crueis."},{verse:11,en:"He that tilleth his land shall be satisfied with bread: but he that followeth vain persons is void of understanding.",pt:"O que lavra a sua terra se fartar\xe1 de p\xe3o; mas o que segue os ociosos \xe9 falto de entendimento."},{verse:12,en:"The wicked desireth the net of evil men: but the root of the righteous yieldeth fruit.",pt:"Deseja o \xedmpio o despojo dos maus; por\xe9m a raiz dos justos produz o seu pr\xf3prio fruto."},{verse:13,en:"The wicked is snared by the transgression of his lips: but the just shall come out of trouble.",pt:"Pela transgress\xe3o dos l\xe1bios se enla\xe7a o mau; mas o justo escapa da ang\xfastia."},{verse:14,en:"A man shall be satisfied with good by the fruit of his mouth: and the recompense of a man\u2019s hands shall be rendered unto him.",pt:"Do fruto das suas palavras o homem se farta de bem; e das obras das suas m\xe3os se lhe retribui."},{verse:15,en:"The way of a fool is right in his own eyes: but he that hearkeneth unto counsel is wise.",pt:"O caminho do insensato \xe9 reto aos seus olhos; mas o que d\xe1 ouvidos ao conselho \xe9 s\xe1bio."},{verse:16,en:"A fool\u2019s wrath is presently known: but a prudent man covereth shame.",pt:"A ira do insensato logo se revela; mas o prudente encobre a afronta."},{verse:17,en:"He that speaketh truth sheweth forth righteousness: but a false witness deceit.",pt:"Quem fala a verdade manifesta a justi\xe7a; por\xe9m a testemunha falsa produz a fraude."},{verse:18,en:"There is that speaketh like the piercings of a sword: but the tongue of the wise is health.",pt:"H\xe1 palrador cujas palavras ferem como espada; por\xe9m a l\xedngua dos s\xe1bios traz sa\xfade."},{verse:19,en:"The lip of truth shall be established for ever: but a lying tongue is but for a moment.",pt:"O l\xe1bio veraz permanece para sempre; mas a l\xedngua mentirosa dura s\xf3 um momento."},{verse:20,en:"Deceit is in the heart of them that imagine evil: but to the counsellors of peace is joy.",pt:"Engano h\xe1 no cora\xe7\xe3o dos que maquinam o mal; mas h\xe1 gozo para os que aconselham a paz."},{verse:21,en:"There shall no evil happen to the just: but the wicked shall be filled with mischief.",pt:"Nenhuma desgra\xe7a sobrev\xe9m ao justo; mas os \xedmpios ficam cheios de males."},{verse:22,en:"Lying lips are abomination to the LORD: but they that deal truly are his delight.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios mentirosos s\xe3o abomin\xe1veis ao Senhor; mas os que praticam a verdade s\xe3o o seu deleite."},{verse:23,en:"A prudent man concealeth knowledge: but the heart of fools proclaimeth foolishness.",pt:"O homem prudente encobre o conhecimento; mas o cora\xe7\xe3o dos tolos proclama a estult\xedcia."},{verse:24,en:"The hand of the diligent shall bear rule: but the slothful shall be under tribute.",pt:"A m\xe3o dos diligentes dominar\xe1; mas o indolente ser\xe1 tribut\xe1rio servil."},{verse:25,en:"Heaviness in the heart of man maketh it stoop: but a good word maketh it glad.",pt:"A ansiedade no cora\xe7\xe3o do homem o abate; mas uma boa palavra o alegra."},{verse:26,en:"The righteous is more excellent than his neighbour: but the way of the wicked seduceth them.",pt:"O justo \xe9 um guia para o seu pr\xf3ximo; mas o caminho dos \xedmpios os faz errar."},{verse:27,en:"The slothful man roasteth not that which he took in hunting: but the substance of a diligent man is precious.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso n\xe3o apanha a sua ca\xe7a; mas o bem precioso do homem \xe9 para o diligente."},{verse:28,en:"In the way of righteousness is life; and in the pathway thereof there is no death.",pt:"Na vereda da justi\xe7a est\xe1 a vida; e no seu caminho n\xe3o h\xe1 morte."}]}}),696,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A wise son heareth his father\u2019s instruction: but a scorner heareth not rebuke.",pt:"O filho s\xe1bio ouve a instru\xe7\xe3o do pai; mas o escarnecedor n\xe3o escuta a repreens\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"A man shall eat good by the fruit of his mouth: but the soul of the transgressors shall eat violence.",pt:"Do fruto da boca o homem come o bem; mas o apetite dos prevaricadores alimenta-se da viol\xeancia."},{verse:3,en:"He that keepeth his mouth keepeth his life: but he that openeth wide his lips shall have destruction.",pt:"O que guarda a sua boca preserva a sua vida; mas o que muito abre os seus l\xe1bios traz sobre si a ru\xedna."},{verse:4,en:"The soul of the sluggard desireth, and hath nothing: but the soul of the diligent shall be made fat.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso deseja, e coisa nenhuma alcan\xe7a; mas o desejo do diligente ser\xe1 satisfeito."},{verse:5,en:"A righteous man hateth lying: but a wicked man is loathsome, and cometh to shame.",pt:"O justo odeia a palavra mentirosa, mas o \xedmpio se faz odioso e se cobre de vergonha."},{verse:6,en:"Righteousness keepeth him that is upright in the way: but wickedness overthroweth the sinner.",pt:"A justi\xe7a guarda ao que \xe9 reto no seu caminho; mas a perversidade transtorna o pecador."},{verse:7,en:"There is that maketh himself rich, yet hath nothing: there is that maketh himself poor, yet hath great riches.",pt:"H\xe1 quem se fa\xe7a rico, n\xe3o tendo coisa alguma; e quem se fa\xe7a pobre, tendo grande riqueza."},{verse:8,en:"The ransom of a man\u2019s life are his riches: but the poor heareth not rebuke.",pt:"O resgate da vida do homem s\xe3o as suas riquezas; mas o pobre n\xe3o tem meio de se resgatar."},{verse:9,en:"The light of the righteous rejoiceth: but the lamp of the wicked shall be put out.",pt:"A luz dos justos alegra; porem a l\xe2mpada dos impios se apagar\xe1."},{verse:10,en:"Only by pride cometh contention: but with the well advised is wisdom.",pt:"Da soberba s\xf3 prov\xe9m a contenda; mas com os que se aconselham se acha a sabedoria."},{verse:11,en:"Wealth gotten by vanity shall be diminished: but he that gathereth by labour shall increase.",pt:"A riqueza adquirida \xe0s pressas diminuira; mas quem a ajunta pouco a pouco ter\xe1 aumento."},{verse:12,en:"Hope deferred maketh the heart sick: but when the desire cometh, it is a tree of life.",pt:"A esperan\xe7a adiada entristece o cora\xe7\xe3o; mas o desejo cumprido \xe9 \xe1rvore devida."},{verse:13,en:"Whoso despiseth the word shall be destroyed: but he that feareth the commandment shall be rewarded.",pt:"O que despreza a palavra traz sobre si a destrui\xe7\xe3o; mas o que teme o mandamento ser\xe1 galardoado."},{verse:14,en:"The law of the wise is a fountain of life, to depart from the snares of death.",pt:"O ensino do s\xe1bio \xe9 uma fonte devida para desviar dos la\xe7os da morte."},{verse:15,en:"Good understanding giveth favour: but the way of transgressors is hard.",pt:"O bom senso alcan\xe7a favor; mas o caminho dos prevaricadores \xe9 aspero:"},{verse:16,en:"Every prudent man dealeth with knowledge: but a fool layeth open his folly.",pt:"Em tudo o homem prudente procede com conhecimento; mas o tolo espraia a sua insensatez."},{verse:17,en:"A wicked messenger falleth into mischief: but a faithful ambassador is health.",pt:"O mensageiro perverso faz cair no mal; mas o embaixador fiel traz sa\xfade."},{verse:18,en:"Poverty and shame shall be to him that refuseth instruction: but he that regardeth reproof shall be honoured.",pt:"Pobreza e afronta vir\xe3o ao que rejeita a corre\xe7\xe3o; mas o que guarda a repreens\xe3o ser\xe1 honrado."},{verse:19,en:"The desire accomplished is sweet to the soul: but it is abomination to fools to depart from evil.",pt:"O desejo que se cumpre deleita a alma; mas apartar-se do ma e abomina\xe7\xe3o para os tolos."},{verse:20,en:"He that walketh with wise men shall be wise: but a companion of fools shall be destroyed.",pt:"Quem anda com os s\xe1bios ser\xe1 s\xe1bio; mas o companheiro dos tolos sofre afli\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:21,en:"Evil pursueth sinners: but to the righteous good shall be repaid.",pt:"O mal persegue os pecadores; mas os justos s\xe3o galardoados com o bem."},{verse:22,en:"A good man leaveth an inheritance to his children\u2019s children: and the wealth of the sinner is laid up for the just.",pt:"O homem de bem deixa uma heran\xe7a aos filhos de seus filhos; a riqueza do pecador, por\xe9m, \xe9 reservada para o justo."},{verse:23,en:"Much food is in the tillage of the poor: but there is that is destroyed for want of judgment.",pt:"Abund\xe2ncia de mantimento h\xe1, na lavoura do pobre; mas se perde por falta de ju\xedzo."},{verse:24,en:"He that spareth his rod hateth his son: but he that loveth him chasteneth him betimes.",pt:"Aquele que poupa a vara aborrece a seu filho; mas quem o ama, a seu tempo o castiga."},{verse:25,en:"The righteous eateth to the satisfying of his soul: but the belly of the wicked shall want.",pt:"O justo come e fica satisfeito; mas o apetite dos \xedmpios nunca se satisfaz."}]}}),697,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Every wise woman buildeth her house: but the foolish plucketh it down with her hands.",pt:"Toda mulher s\xe1bia edifica a sua casa; a insensata, por\xe9m, derruba-a com as suas m\xe3os."},{verse:2,en:"He that walketh in his uprightness feareth the LORD: but he that is perverse in his ways despiseth him.",pt:"Quem anda na sua retid\xe3o teme ao Senhor; mas aquele que \xe9 perverso nos seus caminhos despreza-o."},{verse:3,en:"In the mouth of the foolish is a rod of pride: but the lips of the wise shall preserve them.",pt:"Na boca do tolo est\xe1 a vara da soberba, mas os l\xe1bios do s\xe1bio preserv\xe1-lo-\xe3o."},{verse:4,en:"Where no oxen are, the crib is clean: but much increase is by the strength of the ox.",pt:"Onde n\xe3o h\xe1 bois, a manjedoura est\xe1 vazia; mas pela for\xe7a do boi h\xe1 abund\xe2ncia de colheitas."},{verse:5,en:"A faithful witness will not lie: but a false witness will utter lies.",pt:"A testemunha verdadeira n\xe3o mentir\xe1; a testemunha falsa, por\xe9m, se desboca em mentiras."},{verse:6,en:"A scorner seeketh wisdom, and findeth it not: but knowledge is easy unto him that understandeth.",pt:"O escarnecedor busca sabedoria, e n\xe3o a encontra; mas para o prudente o conhecimento \xe9 f\xe1cil."},{verse:7,en:"Go from the presence of a foolish man, when thou perceivest not in him the lips of knowledge.",pt:"Vai-te da presen\xe7a do homem insensato, pois nele n\xe3o achar\xe1s palavras de ci\xeancia."},{verse:8,en:"The wisdom of the prudent is to understand his way: but the folly of fools is deceit.",pt:"A sabedoria do prudente \xe9 entender o seu caminho; por\xe9m a estult\xedcia dos tolos \xe9 enganar."},{verse:9,en:"Fools make a mock at sin: but among the righteous there is favour.",pt:"A culpa zomba dos insensatos; mas os retos t\xeam o favor de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"The heart knoweth his own bitterness; and a stranger doth not intermeddle with his joy.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o conhece a sua pr\xf3pria amargura; e o estranho n\xe3o participa da sua alegria."},{verse:11,en:"The house of the wicked shall be overthrown: but the tabernacle of the upright shall flourish.",pt:"A casa dos \xedmpios se desfar\xe1; por\xe9m a tenda dos retos florescer\xe1."},{verse:12,en:"There is a way which seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof are the ways of death.",pt:"H\xe1 um caminho que ao homem parece direito, mas o fim dele conduz \xe0 morte."},{verse:13,en:"Even in laughter the heart is sorrowful; and the end of that mirth is heaviness.",pt:"At\xe9 no riso ter\xe1 dor o cora\xe7\xe3o; e o fim da alegria \xe9 tristeza."},{verse:14,en:"The backslider in heart shall be filled with his own ways: and a good man shall be satisfied from himself.",pt:"Dos seus pr\xf3prios caminhos se fartar\xe1 o infiel de cora\xe7\xe3o, como tamb\xe9m o homem bom se contentar\xe1 dos seus."},{verse:15,en:"The simple believeth every word: but the prudent man looketh well to his going.",pt:"O simples d\xe1 cr\xe9dito a tudo; mas o prudente atenta para os seus passos."},{verse:16,en:"A wise man feareth, and departeth from evil: but the fool rageth, and is confident.",pt:"O s\xe1bio teme e desvia-se do mal, mas o tolo \xe9 arrogante e d\xe1-se por seguro."},{verse:17,en:"He that is soon angry dealeth foolishly: and a man of wicked devices is hated.",pt:"Quem facilmente se ira far\xe1 doidices; mas o homem discreto \xe9 paciente;"},{verse:18,en:"The simple inherit folly: but the prudent are crowned with knowledge.",pt:"Os simples herdam a estult\xedcia; mas os prudentes se coroam de conhecimento."},{verse:19,en:"The evil bow before the good; and the wicked at the gates of the righteous.",pt:"Os maus inclinam-se perante os bons; e os \xedmpios diante das portas dos justos."},{verse:20,en:"The poor is hated even of his own neighbour: but the rich hath many friends.",pt:"O pobre \xe9 odiado at\xe9 pelo seu vizinho; mas os amigos dos ricos s\xe3o muitos."},{verse:21,en:"He that despiseth his neighbour sinneth: but he that hath mercy on the poor, happy is he.",pt:"O que despreza ao seu vizinho peca; mas feliz \xe9 aquele que se compadece dos pobres."},{verse:22,en:"Do they not err that devise evil? but mercy and truth shall be to them that devise good.",pt:"Porventura n\xe3o erram os que maquinam o mal? mas h\xe1 benefic\xeancia e fidelidade para os que planejam o bem."},{verse:23,en:"In all labour there is profit: but the talk of the lips tendeth only to penury.",pt:"Em todo trabalho h\xe1 proveito; meras palavras, por\xe9m, s\xf3 encaminham para a pen\xfaria."},{verse:24,en:"The crown of the wise is their riches: but the foolishness of fools is folly.",pt:"A coroa dos s\xe1bios \xe9 a sua riqueza; por\xe9m a estult\xedcia dos tolos n\xe3o passa de estult\xedcia."},{verse:25,en:"A true witness delivereth souls: but a deceitful witness speaketh lies.",pt:"A testemunha verdadeira livra as almas; mas o que fala mentiras \xe9 traidor."},{verse:26,en:"In the fear of the LORD is strong confidence: and his children shall have a place of refuge.",pt:"No temor do Senhor h\xe1 firme confian\xe7a; e os seus filhos ter\xe3o um lugar de ref\xfagio."},{verse:27,en:"The fear of the LORD is a fountain of life, to depart from the snares of death.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 uma fonte de vida, para o homem se desviar dos la\xe7os da morte."},{verse:28,en:"In the multitude of people is the king\u2019s honour: but in the want of people is the destruction of the prince.",pt:"Na multid\xe3o do povo est\xe1 a gl\xf3ria do rei; mas na falta de povo est\xe1 a ru\xedna do pr\xedncipe."},{verse:29,en:"He that is slow to wrath is of great understanding: but he that is hasty of spirit exalteth folly.",pt:"Quem \xe9 tardio em irar-se \xe9 grande em entendimento; mas o que \xe9 de \xe2nimo precipitado exalta a loucura."},{verse:30,en:"A sound heart is the life of the flesh: but envy the rottenness of the bones.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o tranq\xfcilo \xe9 a vida da carne; a inveja, por\xe9m, \xe9 a podrid\xe3o dos ossos."},{verse:31,en:"He that oppresseth the poor reproacheth his Maker: but he that honoureth him hath mercy on the poor.",pt:"O que oprime ao pobre insulta ao seu Criador; mas honra-o aquele que se compadece do necessitado."},{verse:32,en:"The wicked is driven away in his wickedness: but the righteous hath hope in his death.",pt:"O \xedmpio \xe9 derrubado pela sua mal\xedcia; mas o justo at\xe9 na sua morte acha ref\xfagio."},{verse:33,en:"Wisdom resteth in the heart of him that hath understanding: but that which is in the midst of fools is made known.",pt:"No cora\xe7\xe3o do prudente repousa a sabedoria; mas no cora\xe7\xe3o dos tolos n\xe3o \xe9 conhecida."},{verse:34,en:"Righteousness exalteth a nation: but sin is a reproach to any people.",pt:"A justi\xe7a exalta as na\xe7\xf5es; mas o pecado \xe9 o opr\xf3brio dos povos."},{verse:35,en:"The king\u2019s favour is toward a wise servant: but his wrath is against him that causeth shame.",pt:"O favor do rei \xe9 concedido ao servo que procede sabiamente; mas sobre o que procede indignamente cair\xe1 o seu furor."}]}}),698,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,h){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A soft answer turneth away wrath: but grievous words stir up anger.",pt:"A resposta branda desvia o furor, mas a palavra dura suscita a ira."},{verse:2,en:"The tongue of the wise useth knowledge aright: but the mouth of fools poureth out foolishness.",pt:"A l\xedngua dos s\xe1bios destila o conhecimento; por\xe9m a boca dos tolos derrama a estult\xedcia."},{verse:3,en:"The eyes of the LORD are in every place, beholding the evil and the good.",pt:"Os olhos do Senhor est\xe3o em todo lugar, vigiando os maus e os bons."},{verse:4,en:"A wholesome tongue is a tree of life: but perverseness therein is a breach in the spirit.",pt:"Uma l\xedngua suave \xe9 \xe1rvore de vida; mas a l\xedngua perversa quebranta o esp\xedrito."},{verse:5,en:"A fool despiseth his father\u2019s instruction: but he that regardeth reproof is prudent.",pt:"O insensato despreza a corre\xe7\xe3o e seu pai; mas o que atende \xe0 admoesta\xe7\xe3o prudentemente se haver\xe1."},{verse:6,en:"In the house of the righteous is much treasure: but in the revenues of the wicked is trouble.",pt:"Na casa do justo h\xe1 um grande tesouro; mas nos lucros do \xedmpio h\xe1 perturba\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:7,en:"The lips of the wise disperse knowledge: but the heart of the foolish doeth not so.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios dos s\xe1bios difundem conhecimento; mas n\xe3o o faz o cora\xe7\xe3o dos tolos."},{verse:8,en:"The sacrifice of the wicked is an abomination to the LORD: but the prayer of the upright is his delight.",pt:"O sacrif\xedcio dos \xedmpios \xe9 abomin\xe1vel ao Senhor; mas a ora\xe7\xe3o dos retos lhe \xe9 agrad\xe1vel."},{verse:9,en:"The way of the wicked is an abomination unto the LORD: but he loveth him that followeth after righteousness.",pt:"O caminho do \xedmpio \xe9 abomin\xe1vel ao Senhor; mas ele ama ao que segue a justi\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"Correction is grievous unto him that forsaketh the way: and he that hateth reproof shall die.",pt:"H\xe1 disciplina severa para o que abandona a vereda; e o que aborrece a repreens\xe3o morrer\xe1."},{verse:11,en:"Hell and destruction are before the LORD: how much more then the hearts of the children of men?",pt:"O Seol e o Abadom est\xe3o abertos perante o Senhor; quanto mais o cora\xe7\xe3o dos filhos dos homens!"},{verse:12,en:"A scorner loveth not one that reproveth him: neither will he go unto the wise.",pt:"O escarnecedor n\xe3o gosta daquele que o repreende; n\xe3o ir\xe1 ter com os s\xe1bios."},{verse:13,en:"A merry heart maketh a cheerful countenance: but by sorrow of the heart the spirit is broken.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o alegre aformoseia o rosto; mas pela dor do cora\xe7\xe3o o esp\xedrito se abate."},{verse:14,en:"The heart of him that hath understanding seeketh knowledge: but the mouth of fools feedeth on foolishness.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do inteligente busca o conhecimento; mas a boca dos tolos se apascenta de estult\xedcia."},{verse:15,en:"All the days of the afflicted are evil: but he that is of a merry heart hath a continual feast.",pt:"Todos os dias do aflito s\xe3o maus; mas o cora\xe7\xe3o contente tem um banquete cont\xednuo."},{verse:16,en:"Better is little with the fear of the LORD than great treasure and trouble therewith.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pouco com o temor do Senhor, do que um grande tesouro, e com ele a inquieta\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"Better is a dinner of herbs where love is, than a stalled ox and hatred therewith.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 um prato de hortali\xe7a, onde h\xe1 amor, do que o boi gordo, e com ele o \xf3dio."},{verse:18,en:"A wrathful man stirreth up strife: but he that is slow to anger appeaseth strife.",pt:"O homem iracundo suscita contendas; mas o long\xe2nimo apazigua a luta."},{verse:19,en:"The way of the slothful man is as an hedge of thorns: but the way of the righteous is made plain.",pt:"O caminho do pregui\xe7oso \xe9 como a sebe de espinhos; por\xe9m a vereda dos justos \xe9 uma estrada real."},{verse:20,en:"A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish man despiseth his mother.",pt:"O filho s\xe1bio alegra a seu pai; mas o homem insensato despreza a sua m\xe3e."},{verse:21,en:"Folly is joy to him that is destitute of wisdom: but a man of understanding walketh uprightly.",pt:"A estult\xedcia \xe9 alegria para o insensato; mas o homem de entendimento anda retamente."},{verse:22,en:"Without counsel purposes are disappointed: but in the multitude of counsellors they are established.",pt:"Onde n\xe3o h\xe1 conselho, frustram-se os projetos; mas com a multid\xe3o de conselheiros se estabelecem."},{verse:23,en:"A man hath joy by the answer of his mouth: and a word spoken in due season, how good is it!",pt:"O homem alegra-se em dar uma resposta adequada; e a palavra a seu tempo qu\xe3o boa \xe9!"},{verse:24,en:"The way of life is above to the wise, that he may depart from hell beneath.",pt:"Para o s\xe1bio o caminho da vida \xe9 para cima, a fim de que ele se desvie do Seol que \xe9 em baixo."},{verse:25,en:"The LORD will destroy the house of the proud: but he will establish the border of the widow.",pt:"O Senhor desarraiga a casa dos soberbos, mas estabelece a heran\xe7a da vi\xfava."},{verse:26,en:"The thoughts of the wicked are an abomination to the LORD: but the words of the pure are pleasant words.",pt:"Os des\xedgnios dos maus s\xe3o abomina\xe7\xe3o para o Senhor; mas as palavras dos limpos lhe s\xe3o apraz\xedveis."},{verse:27,en:"He that is greedy of gain troubleth his own house; but he that hateth gifts shall live.",pt:"O que se d\xe1 \xe0 cobi\xe7a perturba a sua pr\xf3pria casa; mas o que aborrece a peita viver\xe1."},{verse:28,en:"The heart of the righteous studieth to answer: but the mouth of the wicked poureth out evil things.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do justo medita no que h\xe1 de responder; mas a boca dos \xedmpios derrama coisas m\xe1s."},{verse:29,en:"The LORD is far from the wicked: but he heareth the prayer of the righteous.",pt:"Longe est\xe1 o Senhor dos \xedmpios, mas ouve a ora\xe7\xe3o dos justos."},{verse:30,en:"The light of the eyes rejoiceth the heart: and a good report maketh the bones fat.",pt:"A luz dos olhos alegra o cora\xe7\xe3o, e boas-novas engordam os ossos."},{verse:31,en:"The ear that heareth the reproof of life abideth among the wise.",pt:"O ouvido que escuta a advert\xeancia da vida ter\xe1 a sua morada entre os s\xe1bios."},{verse:32,en:"He that refuseth instruction despiseth his own soul: but he that heareth reproof getteth understanding.",pt:"Quem rejeita a corre\xe7\xe3o menospreza a sua alma; mas aquele que escuta a advert\xeancia adquire entendimento."},{verse:33,en:"The fear of the LORD is the instruction of wisdom; and before honour is humility.",pt:"O temor do Senhor \xe9 a instru\xe7\xe3o da sabedoria; e adiante da honra vai a humildade."}]}}),699,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The preparations of the heart in man, and the answer of the tongue, is from the LORD.",pt:"Ao homem pertencem os planos do cora\xe7\xe3o; mas a resposta da l\xedngua \xe9 do Senhor."},{verse:2,en:"All the ways of a man are clean in his own eyes; but the LORD weigheth the spirits.",pt:"Todos os caminhos do homem s\xe3o limpos aos seus olhos; mas o Senhor pesa os esp\xedritos."},{verse:3,en:"Commit thy works unto the LORD, and thy thoughts shall be established.",pt:"Entrega ao Senhor as tuas obras, e teus des\xedgnios ser\xe3o estabelecidos."},{verse:4,en:"The LORD hath made all things for himself: yea, even the wicked for the day of evil.",pt:"O Senhor fez tudo para um fim; sim, at\xe9 o \xedmpio para o dia do mal."},{verse:5,en:"Every one that is proud in heart is an abomination to the LORD: though hand join in hand, he shall not be unpunished.",pt:"Todo homem arrogante \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o ao Senhor; certamente n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune."},{verse:6,en:"By mercy and truth iniquity is purged: and by the fear of the LORD men depart from evil.",pt:"Pela miseric\xf3rdia e pela verdade expia-se a iniq\xfcidade; e pelo temor do Senhor os homens se desviam do mal."},{verse:7,en:"When a man\u2019s ways please the LORD, he maketh even his enemies to be at peace with him.",pt:"Quando os caminhos do homem agradam ao Senhor, faz que at\xe9 os seus inimigos tenham paz com ele."},{verse:8,en:"Better is a little with righteousness than great revenues without right.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pouco com justi\xe7a, do que grandes rendas com injusti\xe7a."},{verse:9,en:"A man\u2019s heart deviseth his way: but the LORD directeth his steps.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do homem prop\xf5e o seu caminho; mas o Senhor lhe dirige os passos."},{verse:10,en:"A divine sentence is in the lips of the king: his mouth transgresseth not in judgment.",pt:"Nos l\xe1bios do rei acham-se or\xe1culos; em ju\xedzo a sua boca n\xe3o prevarica."},{verse:11,en:"A just weight and balance are the LORD\u2019S: all the weights of the bag are his work.",pt:"O peso e a balan\xe7a justos s\xe3o do Senhor; obra sua s\xe3o todos os pesos da bolsa."},{verse:12,en:"It is an abomination to kings to commit wickedness: for the throne is established by righteousness.",pt:"Abomina\xe7\xe3o \xe9 para os reis o praticarem a impiedade; porque com justi\xe7a se estabelece o trono."},{verse:13,en:"Righteous lips are the delight of kings; and they love him that speaketh right.",pt:"L\xe1bios justos s\xe3o o prazer dos reis; e eles amam aquele que fala coisas retas."},{verse:14,en:"The wrath of a king is as messengers of death: but a wise man will pacify it.",pt:"O furor do rei \xe9 mensageiro da morte; mas o homem s\xe1bio o aplacar\xe1."},{verse:15,en:"In the light of the king\u2019s countenance is life; and his favour is as a cloud of the latter rain.",pt:"Na luz do semblante do rei est\xe1 a vida; e o seu favor \xe9 como a nuvem de chuva ser\xf4dia."},{verse:16,en:"How much better is it to get wisdom than gold! and to get understanding rather to be chosen than silver!",pt:"Quanto melhor \xe9 adquirir a sabedoria do que o ouro! e quanto mais excelente \xe9 escolher o entendimento do que a prata!"},{verse:17,en:"The highway of the upright is to depart from evil: he that keepeth his way preserveth his soul.",pt:"A estrada dos retos desvia-se do mal; o que guarda o seu caminho preserva a sua vida."},{verse:18,en:"Pride goeth before destruction, and an haughty spirit before a fall.",pt:"A soberba precede a destrui\xe7\xe3o, e a altivez do esp\xedrito precede a queda."},{verse:19,en:"Better it is to be of an humble spirit with the lowly, than to divide the spoil with the proud.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 ser humilde de esp\xedrito com os mansos, do que repartir o despojo com os soberbos."},{verse:20,en:"He that handleth a matter wisely shall find good: and whoso trusteth in the LORD, happy is he.",pt:"O que atenta prudentemente para a palavra prosperar\xe1; e feliz \xe9 aquele que confia no Senhor."},{verse:21,en:"The wise in heart shall be called prudent: and the sweetness of the lips increaseth learning.",pt:"O s\xe1bio de cora\xe7\xe3o ser\xe1 chamado prudente; e a do\xe7ura dos l\xe1bios aumenta o saber."},{verse:22,en:"Understanding is a wellspring of life unto him that hath it: but the instruction of fools is folly.",pt:"O entendimento, para aquele que o possui, \xe9 uma fonte de vida, por\xe9m a estult\xedcia \xe9 o castigo dos insensatos."},{verse:23,en:"The heart of the wise teacheth his mouth, and addeth learning to his lips.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do s\xe1bio instrui a sua boca, e aumenta o saber nos seus l\xe1bios."},{verse:24,en:"Pleasant words are as an honeycomb, sweet to the soul, and health to the bones.",pt:"Palavras suaves s\xe3o como favos de mel, do\xe7ura para a alma e sa\xfade para o corpo."},{verse:25,en:"There is a way that seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof are the ways of death.",pt:"H\xe1 um caminho que ao homem parece direito, mas o fim dele conduz \xe0 morte."},{verse:26,en:"He that laboureth laboureth for himself; for his mouth craveth it of him.",pt:"O apetite do trabalhador trabalha por ele, porque a sua fome o incita a isso."},{verse:27,en:"An ungodly man diggeth up evil: and in his lips there is as a burning fire.",pt:"O homem vil suscita o mal; e nos seus l\xe1bios h\xe1 como que um fogo ardente."},{verse:28,en:"A froward man soweth strife: and a whisperer separateth chief friends.",pt:"O homem perverso espalha contendas; e o difamador separa amigos \xedntimos."},{verse:29,en:"A violent man enticeth his neighbour, and leadeth him into the way that is not good.",pt:"O homem violento alicia o seu vizinho, e guia-o por um caminho que n\xe3o \xe9 bom."},{verse:30,en:"He shutteth his eyes to devise froward things: moving his lips he bringeth evil to pass.",pt:"Quando fecha os olhos f\xe1-lo para maquinar perversidades; quando morde os l\xe1bios, efetua o mal."},{verse:31,en:"The hoary head is a crown of glory, if it be found in the way of righteousness.",pt:"Coroa de honra s\xe3o as c\xe3s, a qual se obt\xe9m no caminho da justi\xe7a."},{verse:32,en:"He that is slow to anger is better than the mighty; and he that ruleth his spirit than he that taketh a city.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o long\xe2nimo do que o valente; e o que domina o seu esp\xedrito do que o que toma uma cidade."},{verse:33,en:"The lot is cast into the lap; but the whole disposing thereof is of the LORD.",pt:"A sorte se lan\xe7a no rega\xe7o; mas do Senhor procede toda a disposi\xe7\xe3o dela."}]}}),700,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,r,s,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:17,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Better is a dry morsel, and quietness therewith, than an house full of sacrifices with strife.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 um bocado seco, e com ele a tranq\xfcilidade, do que a casa cheia de festins, com rixas."},{verse:2,en:"A wise servant shall have rule over a son that causeth shame, and shall have part of the inheritance among the brethren.",pt:"O servo prudente dominar\xe1 sobre o filho que procede indignamente; e entre os irm\xe3os receber\xe1 da heran\xe7a."},{verse:3,en:"The fining pot is for silver, and the furnace for gold: but the LORD trieth the hearts.",pt:"O crisol \xe9 para a prata, e o forno para o ouro; mas o Senhor \xe9 que prova os cora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:4,en:"A wicked doer giveth heed to false lips; and a liar giveth ear to a naughty tongue.",pt:"O malfazejo atenta para o l\xe1bio in\xedquo; o mentiroso inclina os ouvidos para a l\xedngua maligna."},{verse:5,en:"Whoso mocketh the poor reproacheth his Maker: and he that is glad at calamities shall not be unpunished.",pt:"O que escarnece do pobre insulta ao seu Criador; o que se alegra da calamidade n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune."},{verse:6,en:"Children\u2019s children are the crown of old men; and the glory of children are their fathers.",pt:"Coroa dos velhos s\xe3o os filhos dos filhos; e a gl\xf3ria dos filhos s\xe3o seus pais."},{verse:7,en:"Excellent speech becometh not a fool: much less do lying lips a prince.",pt:"N\xe3o conv\xe9m ao tolo a fala excelente; quanto menos ao pr\xedncipe o l\xe1bio mentiroso!"},{verse:8,en:"A gift is as a precious stone in the eyes of him that hath it: whithersoever it turneth, it prospereth.",pt:"Pedra preciosa \xe9 a peita aos olhos de quem a oferece; para onde quer que ele se volte, serve-lhe de proveito."},{verse:9,en:"He that covereth a transgression seeketh love; but he that repeateth a matter separateth very friends.",pt:"O que perdoa a transgress\xe3o busca a amizade; mas o que renova a quest\xe3o, afastam amigos \xedntimos."},{verse:10,en:"A reproof entereth more into a wise man than an hundred stripes into a fool.",pt:"Mais profundamente entra a repreens\xe3o no prudente, do que cem a\xe7oites no insensato."},{verse:11,en:"An evil man seeketh only rebellion: therefore a cruel messenger shall be sent against him.",pt:"O rebelde n\xe3o busca sen\xe3o o mal; portanto um mensageiro cruel ser\xe1 enviado contra ele."},{verse:12,en:"Let a bear robbed of her whelps meet a man, rather than a fool in his folly.",pt:"Encontre-se o homem com a ursa roubada dos filhotes, mas n\xe3o com o insensato na sua estult\xedcia."},{verse:13,en:"Whoso rewardeth evil for good, evil shall not depart from his house.",pt:"Quanto \xe0quele que torna mal por bem, n\xe3o se apartar\xe1 o mal da sua casa."},{verse:14,en:"The beginning of strife is as when one letteth out water: therefore leave off contention, before it be meddled with.",pt:"O princ\xedpio da contenda \xe9 como o soltar de \xe1guas represadas; deixa por isso a porfia, antes que haja rixas."},{verse:15,en:"He that justifieth the wicked, and he that condemneth the just, even they both are abomination to the LORD.",pt:"O que justifica o \xedmpio, e o que condena o justo, s\xe3o abomin\xe1veis ao Senhor, tanto um como o outro."},{verse:16,en:"Wherefore is there a price in the hand of a fool to get wisdom, seeing he hath no heart to it?",pt:"De que serve o pre\xe7o na m\xe3o do tolo para comprar a sabedoria, visto que ele n\xe3o tem entendimento?"},{verse:17,en:"A friend loveth at all times, and a brother is born for adversity.",pt:"O amigo ama em todo o tempo; e para a ang\xfastia nasce o irm\xe3o."},{verse:18,en:"A man void of understanding striketh hands, and becometh surety in the presence of his friend.",pt:"O homem falto de entendimento compromete-se, tornando-se fiador na presen\xe7a do seu vizinho."},{verse:19,en:"He loveth transgression that loveth strife: and he that exalteth his gate seeketh destruction.",pt:"O que ama a contenda ama a transgressao; o que faz alta a sua porta busca a ru\xedna."},{verse:20,en:"He that hath a froward heart findeth no good: and he that hath a perverse tongue falleth into mischief.",pt:"O perverso de cora\xe7\xe3o nunca achar\xe1 o bem; e o que tem a l\xedngua dobre vir\xe1 a cair no mal."},{verse:21,en:"He that begetteth a fool doeth it to his sorrow: and the father of a fool hath no joy.",pt:"O que gera um tolo, para sua tristeza o faz; e o pai do insensato n\xe3o se alegrar\xe1."},{verse:22,en:"A merry heart doeth good like a medicine: but a broken spirit drieth the bones.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o alegre serve de bom rem\xe9dio; mas o esp\xedrito abatido seca os ossos."},{verse:23,en:"A wicked man taketh a gift out of the bosom to pervert the ways of judgment.",pt:"O \xedmpio recebe do rega\xe7o a peita, para perverter as veredas da justi\xe7a."},{verse:24,en:"Wisdom is before him that hath understanding; but the eyes of a fool are in the ends of the earth.",pt:"O alvo do inteligente \xe9 a sabedoria; mas os olhos do insensato est\xe3o nas extremidades da terra."},{verse:25,en:"A foolish son is a grief to his father, and bitterness to her that bare him.",pt:"O filho insensato \xe9 tristeza para seu, pai, e amargura para quem o deu \xe0 luz."},{verse:26,en:"Also to punish the just is not good, nor to strike princes for equity.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 bom punir ao justo, nem ferir aos nobres por causa da sua retid\xe3o."},{verse:27,en:"He that hath knowledge spareth his words: and a man of understanding is of an excellent spirit.",pt:"Refreia as suas palavras aquele que possui o conhecimento; e o homem de entendimento \xe9 de esp\xedrito sereno."},{verse:28,en:"Even a fool, when he holdeth his peace, is counted wise: and he that shutteth his lips is esteemed a man of understanding.",pt:"At\xe9 o tolo, estando calado, \xe9 tido por s\xe1bio; e o que cerra os seus l\xe1bios, por entendido."}]}}),701,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:18,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Through desire a man, having separated himself, seeketh and intermeddleth with all wisdom.",pt:"Aquele que vive isolado busca seu pr\xf3prio desejo; insurge-se contra a verdadeira sabedoria."},{verse:2,en:"A fool hath no delight in understanding, but that his heart may discover itself.",pt:"O tolo n\xe3o toma prazer no entendimento, mas t\xe3o somente em revelar a sua opini\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"When the wicked cometh, then cometh also contempt, and with ignominy reproach.",pt:"Quando vem o \xedmpio, vem tamb\xe9m o desprezo; e com a desonra vem o opr\xf3brio."},{verse:4,en:"The words of a man\u2019s mouth are as deep waters, and the wellspring of wisdom as a flowing brook.",pt:"Aguas profundas s\xe3o as palavras da boca do homem; e a fonte da sabedoria \xe9 um ribeiro que corre."},{verse:5,en:"It is not good to accept the person of the wicked, to overthrow the righteous in judgment.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 bom ter respeito \xe0 pessoa do impio, nem privar o justo do seu direito."},{verse:6,en:"A fool\u2019s lips enter into contention, and his mouth calleth for strokes.",pt:"Os l\xe1bios do tolo entram em contendas, e a sua boca clama por a\xe7oites."},{verse:7,en:"A fool\u2019s mouth is his destruction, and his lips are the snare of his soul.",pt:"A boca do tolo \xe9 a sua pr\xf3pria destrui\xe7\xe3o, e os seus l\xe1bios um la\xe7o para a sua alma."},{verse:8,en:"The words of a talebearer are as wounds, and they go down into the innermost parts of the belly.",pt:"As palavras do difamador s\xe3o como bocados doces, que penetram at\xe9 o \xedntimo das entranhas."},{verse:9,en:"He also that is slothful in his work is brother to him that is a great waster.",pt:"Aquele que \xe9 remisso na sua obra \xe9 irm\xe3o do que \xe9 destruidor."},{verse:10,en:"The name of the LORD is a strong tower: the righteous runneth into it, and is safe.",pt:"Torre forte \xe9 o nome do Senhor; para ela corre o justo, e est\xe1 seguro."},{verse:11,en:"The rich man\u2019s wealth is his strong city, and as an high wall in his own conceit.",pt:"Os bens do rico s\xe3o a sua cidade forte, e como um muro alto na sua imagina\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Before destruction the heart of man is haughty, and before honour is humility.",pt:"Antes da ru\xedna eleva-se o cora\xe7\xe3o do homem; e adiante da honra vai a humildade."},{verse:13,en:"He that answereth a matter before he heareth it, it is folly and shame unto him.",pt:"Responder antes de ouvir, \xe9 estult\xedcia e vergonha."},{verse:14,en:"The spirit of a man will sustain his infirmity; but a wounded spirit who can bear?",pt:"O esp\xedrito do homem o sustentar\xe1 na sua enfermidade; mas ao esp\xedrito abatido quem o levantar\xe1?"},{verse:15,en:"The heart of the prudent getteth knowledge; and the ear of the wise seeketh knowledge.",pt:"O cora\xe7\xe3o do entendido adquire conhecimento; e o ouvido dos s\xe1bios busca conhecimento;"},{verse:16,en:"A man\u2019s gift maketh room for him, and bringeth him before great men.",pt:"O presente do homem alarga-lhe o caminho, e leva-o \xe0 presen\xe7a dos grandes."},{verse:17,en:"He that is first in his own cause seemeth just; but his neighbour cometh and searcheth him.",pt:"O que primeiro come\xe7a o seu pleito parece justo; at\xe9 que vem o outro e o examina."},{verse:18,en:"The lot causeth contentions to cease, and parteth between the mighty.",pt:"A sorte faz cessar os pleitos, e decide entre os poderosos."},{verse:19,en:"A brother offended is harder to be won than a strong city: and their contentions are like the bars of a castle.",pt:"um irm\xe3o ajudado pelo irm\xe3o \xe9 como uma cidade fortificada; \xe9 forte como os ferrolhos dum castelo."},{verse:20,en:"A man\u2019s belly shall be satisfied with the fruit of his mouth; and with the increase of his lips shall he be filled.",pt:"O homem se fartar\xe1 do fruto da sua boca; dos renovos dos seus l\xe1bios se fartar\xe1."},{verse:21,en:"Death and life are in the power of the tongue: and they that love it shall eat the fruit thereof.",pt:"A morte e a vida est\xe3o no poder da l\xedngua; e aquele que a ama comer\xe1 do seu fruto."},{verse:22,en:"Whoso findeth a wife findeth a good thing, and obtaineth favour of the LORD.",pt:"Quem encontra uma esposa acha uma coisa boa; e alcan\xe7a o favor do Senhor."},{verse:23,en:"The poor useth intreaties; but the rich answereth roughly.",pt:"O pobre fala com rogos; mas o rico responde com durezas."},{verse:24,en:"A man that hath friends must shew himself friendly: and there is a friend that sticketh closer than a brother.",pt:"O homem que tem muitos amigos, tem-nos para a sua ru\xedna; mas h\xe1 um amigo que \xe9 mais chegado do que um irm\xe3o."}]}}),702,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:19,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Better is the poor that walketh in his integrity, than he that is perverse in his lips, and is a fool.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pobre que anda na sua integridade, do que aquele que \xe9 perverso de l\xe1bios e tolo."},{verse:2,en:"Also, that the soul be without knowledge, it is not good; and he that hasteth with his feet sinneth.",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 bom agir sem refletir; e o que se apressa com seus p\xe9s erra o caminho."},{verse:3,en:"The foolishness of man perverteth his way: and his heart fretteth against the LORD.",pt:"A estult\xedcia do homem perverte o seu caminho, e o seu cora\xe7\xe3o se irrita contra o Senhor."},{verse:4,en:"Wealth maketh many friends; but the poor is separated from his neighbour.",pt:"As riquezas granjeiam muitos amigos; mas do pobre o seu pr\xf3prio amigo se separa."},{verse:5,en:"A false witness shall not be unpunished, and he that speaketh lies shall not escape.",pt:"A testemunha falsa n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune; e o que profere mentiras n\xe3o escapar\xe1."},{verse:6,en:"Many will intreat the favour of the prince: and every man is a friend to him that giveth gifts.",pt:"Muitos procurar\xe3o o favor do liberal; e cada um \xe9 amigo daquele que d\xe1 presentes."},{verse:7,en:"All the brethren of the poor do hate him: how much more do his friends go far from him? he pursueth them with words, yet they are wanting to him.",pt:"Todos os irm\xe3os do pobre o aborrecem; quanto mais se afastam dele os seus amigos! persegue-os com s\xfaplicas, mas eles j\xe1 se foram."},{verse:8,en:"He that getteth wisdom loveth his own soul: he that keepeth understanding shall find good.",pt:"O que adquire a sabedoria \xe9 amigo de si mesmo; o que guarda o entendimento prosperar\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"A false witness shall not be unpunished, and he that speaketh lies shall perish.",pt:"A testemunha falsa n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune, e o que profere mentiras perecer\xe1."},{verse:10,en:"Delight is not seemly for a fool; much less for a servant to have rule over princes.",pt:"Ao tolo n\xe3o conv\xe9m o luxo; quanto menos ao servo dominar os pr\xedncipes!"},{verse:11,en:"The discretion of a man deferreth his anger; and it is his glory to pass over a transgression.",pt:"A discri\xe7\xe3o do homem f\xe1-lo tardio em irar-se; e sua gl\xf3ria est\xe1 em esquecer ofensas."},{verse:12,en:"The king\u2019s wrath is as the roaring of a lion; but his favour is as dew upon the grass.",pt:"A ira do rei \xe9 como o bramido o le\xe3o; mas o seu favor \xe9 como o orvalho sobre a erva."},{verse:13,en:"A foolish son is the calamity of his father: and the contentions of a wife are a continual dropping.",pt:"O filho insensato \xe9 a calamidade do pai; e as rixas da mulher s\xe3o uma goteira cont\xednua."},{verse:14,en:"House and riches are the inheritance of fathers and a prudent wife is from the LORD.",pt:"Casa e riquezas s\xe3o herdadas dos pais; mas a mulher prudente vem do Senhor."},{verse:15,en:"Slothfulness casteth into a deep sleep; and an idle soul shall suffer hunger.",pt:"A pregui\xe7a faz cair em profundo sono; e o ocioso padecer\xe1 fome."},{verse:16,en:"He that keepeth the commandment keepeth his own soul; but he that despiseth his ways shall die.",pt:"Quem guarda o mandamento guarda a sua alma; mas aquele que n\xe3o faz caso dos seus caminhos morrer\xe1."},{verse:17,en:"He that hath pity upon the poor lendeth unto the LORD; and that which he hath given will he pay him again.",pt:"O que se compadece do pobre empresta ao Senhor, que lhe retribuir\xe1 o seu benef\xedcio."},{verse:18,en:"Chasten thy son while there is hope, and let not thy soul spare for his crying.",pt:"Corrige a teu filho enquanto h\xe1 esperan\xe7a; mas n\xe3o te incites a destru\xed-lo."},{verse:19,en:"A man of great wrath shall suffer punishment: for if thou deliver him, yet thou must do it again.",pt:"Homem de grande ira tem de sofrer o castigo; porque se o livrares, ter\xe1s de o fazer de novo."},{verse:20,en:"Hear counsel, and receive instruction, that thou mayest be wise in thy latter end.",pt:"Ouve o conselho, e recebe a corre\xe7\xe3o, para que sejas s\xe1bio nos teus \xfaltimos dias."},{verse:21,en:"There are many devices in a man\u2019s heart; nevertheless the counsel of the LORD, that shall stand.",pt:"Muitos s\xe3o os planos no cora\xe7\xe3o do homem; mas o des\xedgnio do Senhor, esse prevalecer\xe1."},{verse:22,en:"The desire of a man is his kindness: and a poor man is better than a liar.",pt:"O que faz um homem desej\xe1vel \xe9 a sua benignidade; e o pobre \xe9 melhor do que o mentiroso."},{verse:23,en:"The fear of the LORD tendeth to life: and he that hath it shall abide satisfied; he shall not be visited with evil.",pt:"O temor do Senhor encaminha para a vida; aquele que o tem ficar\xe1 satisfeito, e mal nenhum o visitar\xe1."},{verse:24,en:"A slothful man hideth his hand in his bosom, and will not so much as bring it to his mouth again.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso esconde a sua m\xe3o no prato, e nem ao menos quer lev\xe1-la de novo \xe0 boca."},{verse:25,en:"Smite a scorner, and the simple will beware: and reprove one that hath understanding, and he will understand knowledge.",pt:"Fere ao escarnecedor, e o simples aprender\xe1 a prud\xeancia; repreende ao que tem entendimento, e ele crescer\xe1 na ciencia."},{verse:26,en:"He that wasteth his father, and chaseth away his mother, is a son that causeth shame, and bringeth reproach.",pt:"O que aflige a seu pai, e faz fugir a sua m\xe3e, \xe9 filho que envergonha e desonra."},{verse:27,en:"Cease, my son, to hear the instruction that causeth to err from the words of knowledge.",pt:"Cessa, filho meu, de ouvir a instru\xe7\xe3o, e logo te desviar\xe1s das palavras do conhecimento."},{verse:28,en:"An ungodly witness scorneth judgment: and the mouth of the wicked devoureth iniquity.",pt:"A testemunha vil escarnece da justi\xe7a; e a boca dos \xedmpios engole a iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:29,en:"Judgments are prepared for scorners, and stripes for the back of fools.",pt:"A condena\xe7\xe3o est\xe1 preparada para os escarnecedores, e os a\xe7oites para as costas dos tolos."}]}}),703,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:20,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Wine is a mocker, strong drink is raging: and whosoever is deceived thereby is not wise.",pt:"O vinho \xe9 escarnecedor, e a bebida forte alvoro\xe7adora; e todo aquele que neles errar n\xe3o e s\xe1bio."},{verse:2,en:"The fear of a king is as the roaring of a lion: whoso provoketh him to anger sinneth against his own soul.",pt:"Como o bramido do le\xe3o \xe9 o terror do rei; quem o provoca a ira peca contra a sua pr\xf3pria vida."},{verse:3,en:"It is an honour for a man to cease from strife: but every fool will be meddling.",pt:"Honroso \xe9 para o homem o desviar-se de quest\xf5es; mas todo insensato se entremete nelas."},{verse:4,en:"The sluggard will not plow by reason of the cold; therefore shall he beg in harvest, and have nothing.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso n\xe3o lavra no outono; pelo que mendigar\xe1 na sega, e nada receber\xe1."},{verse:5,en:"Counsel in the heart of man is like deep water; but a man of understanding will draw it out.",pt:"Como \xe1guas profundas \xe9 o prop\xf3sito no cora\xe7\xe3o do homem; mas o homem inteligente o descobrir\xe1."},{verse:6,en:"Most men will proclaim every one his own goodness: but a faithful man who can find?",pt:"Muitos h\xe1 que proclamam a sua pr\xf3pria bondade; mas o homem fiel, quem o achar\xe1?"},{verse:7,en:"The just man walketh in his integrity: his children are blessed after him.",pt:"O justo anda na sua integridade; bem-aventurados ser\xe3o os seus filhos depois dele."},{verse:8,en:"A king that sitteth in the throne of judgment scattereth away all evil with his eyes.",pt:"Assentando-se o rei no trono do ju\xedzo, com os seus olhos joeira a todo malfeitor."},{verse:9,en:"Who can say, I have made my heart clean, I am pure from my sin?",pt:"Quem pode dizer: Purifiquei o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, limpo estou de meu pecado?"},{verse:10,en:"Divers weights, and divers measures, both of them are alike abomination to the LORD.",pt:"O peso fraudulento e a medida falsa s\xe3o abomina\xe7\xe3o ao Senhor, tanto uma como outra coisa."},{verse:11,en:"Even a child is known by his doings, whether his work be pure, and whether it be right.",pt:"At\xe9 a crian\xe7a se d\xe1 a conhecer pelas suas a\xe7\xf5es, se a sua conduta \xe9 pura e reta."},{verse:12,en:"The hearing ear, and the seeing eye, the LORD hath made even both of them.",pt:"O ouvido que ouve, e o olho que v\xea, o Senhor os fez a ambos."},{verse:13,en:"Love not sleep, lest thou come to poverty; open thine eyes, and thou shalt be satisfied with bread.",pt:"N\xe3o ames o sono, para que n\xe3o empobre\xe7as; abre os teus olhos, e te fartar\xe1s de p\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"It is naught, it is naught, saith the buyer: but when he is gone his way, then he boasteth.",pt:"Nada vale, nada vale, diz o comprador; mas, depois de retirar-se, ent\xe3o se gaba."},{verse:15,en:"There is gold, and a multitude of rubies: but the lips of knowledge are a precious jewel.",pt:"H\xe1 ouro e abund\xe2ncia de pedras preciosas; mas os l\xe1bios do conhecimento s\xe3o j\xf3ia de grande valor."},{verse:16,en:"Take his garment that is surety for a stranger: and take a pledge of him for a strange woman.",pt:"Tira a roupa \xe0quele que fica por fiador do estranho; e toma penhor daquele que se obriga por estrangeiros."},{verse:17,en:"Bread of deceit is sweet to a man; but afterwards his mouth shall be filled with gravel.",pt:"Suave \xe9 ao homem o p\xe3o da mentira; mas depois a sua boca se enche de pedrinhas."},{verse:18,en:"Every purpose is established by counsel: and with good advice make war.",pt:"Os projetos se confirmam pelos conselhos; assim, pois, com prudencia faze a guerra."},{verse:19,en:"He that goeth about as a talebearer revealeth secrets: therefore meddle not with him that flattereth with his lips.",pt:"O que anda mexericando revela segredos; pelo que n\xe3o te metas com quem muito abre os seus l\xe1bios."},{verse:20,en:"Whoso curseth his father or his mother, his lamp shall be put out in obscure darkness.",pt:"O que amaldi\xe7oa a seu pai ou a sua m\xe3e, apagar-se-lhe-\xe1 a sua l\xe2mpada nas, mais densas trevas."},{verse:21,en:"An inheritance may be gotten hastily at the beginning; but the end thereof shall not be blessed.",pt:"A heran\xe7a que no princ\xedpio \xe9 adquirida \xe0s pressas, n\xe3o ser\xe1 aben\xe7oada no seu fim."},{verse:22,en:"Say not thou, I will recompense evil; but wait on the LORD, and he shall save thee.",pt:"N\xe3o digas: vingar-me-ei do mal; espera pelo Senhor e ele te livrar\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"Divers weights are an abomination unto the LORD; and a false balance is not good.",pt:"Pesos fraudulentos s\xe3o abomin\xe1veis ao Senhor; e balan\xe7as enganosas n\xe3o s\xe3o boas."},{verse:24,en:"Man\u2019s goings are of the LORD; how can a man then understand his own way?",pt:"Os passos do homem s\xe3o dirigidos pelo Senhor; como, pois, poder\xe1 o homem entender o seu caminho?"},{verse:25,en:"It is a snare to the man who devoureth that which is holy, and after vows to make enquiry.",pt:"La\xe7o \xe9 para o homem dizer precipitadamente: \xc9 santo; e, feitos os votos, ent\xe3o refletir."},{verse:26,en:"A wise king scattereth the wicked, and bringeth the wheel over them.",pt:"O rei s\xe1bio joeira os \xedmpios e faz girar sobre eles a roda."},{verse:27,en:"The spirit of man is the candle of the LORD, searching all the inward parts of the belly.",pt:"O esp\xedrito do homem \xe9 a l\xe2mpada do Senhor, a qual esquadrinha todo o mais \xedntimo do cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:28,en:"Mercy and truth preserve the king: and his throne is upholden by mercy.",pt:"A benignidade e a verdade guardam o rei; e com a benignidade sust\xe9m ele o seu trono."},{verse:29,en:"The glory of young men is their strength: and the beauty of old men is the grey head.",pt:"A gl\xf3ria dos jovens \xe9 a sua for\xe7a; e a beleza dos velhos s\xe3o as c\xe3s."},{verse:30,en:"The blueness of a wound cleanseth away evil: so do stripes the inward parts of the belly.",pt:"Os a\xe7oites que ferem purificam do mal; e as feridas penetram at\xe9 o mais \xedntimo do corpo."}]}}),704,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:21,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The king\u2019s heart is in the hand of the LORD, as the rivers of water: he turneth it whithersoever he will.",pt:"Como corrente de \xe1guas \xe9 o cora\xe7\xe3o do rei na m\xe3o do Senhor; ele o inclina para onde quer."},{verse:2,en:"Every way of a man is right in his own eyes: but the LORD pondereth the hearts.",pt:"Todo caminho do homem \xe9 reto aos seus olhos; mas o Senhor pesa os cora\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:3,en:"To do justice and judgment is more acceptable to the LORD than sacrifice.",pt:"Fazer justi\xe7a e julgar com retid\xe3o \xe9 mais aceit\xe1vel ao Senhor do que oferecer-lhe sacrif\xedcio."},{verse:4,en:"An high look, and a proud heart, and the plowing of the wicked, is sin.",pt:"Olhar altivo e cora\xe7\xe3o orgulhoso, tal l\xe2mpada dos \xedmpios \xe9 pecado."},{verse:5,en:"The thoughts of the diligent tend only to plenteousness; but of every one that is hasty only to want.",pt:"Os planos do diligente conduzem \xe0 abund\xe2ncia; mas todo precipitado apressa-se para a pen\xfaria."},{verse:6,en:"The getting of treasures by a lying tongue is a vanity tossed to and fro of them that seek death.",pt:"Ajuntar tesouros com l\xedngua falsa \xe9 uma vaidade fugitiva; aqueles que os buscam, buscam a morte."},{verse:7,en:"The robbery of the wicked shall destroy them; because they refuse to do judgment.",pt:"A viol\xeancia dos \xedmpios arrebat\xe1-los-\xe1, porquanto recusam praticar a justi\xe7a."},{verse:8,en:"The way of man is froward and strange: but as for the pure, his work is right.",pt:"O caminho do homem perverso \xe9 tortuoso; mas o proceder do puro \xe9 reto."},{verse:9,en:"It is better to dwell in a corner of the housetop, than with a brawling woman in a wide house.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 morar num canto do eirado, do que com a mulher rixosa numa casa ampla."},{verse:10,en:"The soul of the wicked desireth evil: his neighbour findeth no favour in his eyes.",pt:"A alma do \xedmpio deseja o mal; o seu pr\xf3ximo n\xe3o agrada aos seus olhos."},{verse:11,en:"When the scorner is punished, the simple is made wise: and when the wise is instructed, he receiveth knowledge.",pt:"Quando o escarnecedor \xe9 castigado, o simples torna-se s\xe1bio; e, quando o s\xe1bio \xe9 instru\xeddo, recebe o conhecimento."},{verse:12,en:"The righteous man wisely considereth the house of the wicked: but God overthroweth the wicked for their wickedness.",pt:"O justo observa a casa do \xedmpio; precipitam-se os \xedmpios na ru\xedna."},{verse:13,en:"Whoso stoppeth his ears at the cry of the poor, he also shall cry himself, but shall not be heard.",pt:"Quem tapa o seu ouvido ao clamor do pobre, tamb\xe9m clamar\xe1 e n\xe3o ser\xe1 ouvido."},{verse:14,en:"A gift in secret pacifieth anger: and a reward in the bosom strong wrath.",pt:"O presente que se d\xe1 em segredo aplaca a ira; e a d\xe1diva \xe0s escondidas, a forte indigna\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"It is joy to the just to do judgment: but destruction shall be to the workers of iniquity.",pt:"A execu\xe7\xe3o da justi\xe7a \xe9 motivo de alegria para o justo; mas \xe9 espanto para os que praticam a iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:16,en:"The man that wandereth out of the way of understanding shall remain in the congregation of the dead.",pt:"O homem que anda desviado do caminho do entendimento repousar\xe1 na congrega\xe7\xe3o dos mortos."},{verse:17,en:"He that loveth pleasure shall be a poor man: he that loveth wine and oil shall not be rich.",pt:"Quem ama os prazeres empobrecer\xe1; quem ama o vinho e o azeite nunca enriquecera."},{verse:18,en:"The wicked shall be a ransom for the righteous, and the transgressor for the upright.",pt:"Resgate para o justo \xe9 o \xedmpio; e em lugar do reto ficar\xe1 o prevaricador."},{verse:19,en:"It is better to dwell in the wilderness, than with a contentious and an angry woman.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 morar numa terra deserta do que com a mulher rixosa e iracunda."},{verse:20,en:"There is treasure to be desired and oil in the dwelling of the wise; but a foolish man spendeth it up.",pt:"H\xe1 tesouro precioso e azeite na casa do s\xe1bio; mas o homem insensato os devora."},{verse:21,en:"He that followeth after righteousness and mercy findeth life, righteousness, and honour.",pt:"Aquele que segue a justi\xe7a e a bondade achar\xe1 a vida, a justi\xe7a e a honra."},{verse:22,en:"A wise man scaleth the city of the mighty, and casteth down the strength of the confidence thereof.",pt:"O s\xe1bio escala a cidade dos valentes, e derriba a fortaleza em que ela confia."},{verse:23,en:"Whoso keepeth his mouth and his tongue keepeth his soul from troubles.",pt:"O que guarda a sua boca e a sua l\xedngua, guarda das ang\xfastias a sua alma."},{verse:24,en:"Proud and haughty scorner is his name, who dealeth in proud wrath.",pt:"Quanto ao soberbo e presumido, zombador \xe9 seu nome; ele procede com insolente orgulho."},{verse:25,en:"The desire of the slothful killeth him; for his hands refuse to labour.",pt:"O desejo do pregui\xe7oso o mata; porque as suas m\xe3os recusam-se a trabalhar."},{verse:26,en:"He coveteth greedily all the day long: but the righteous giveth and spareth not.",pt:"Todo o dia o \xedmpio cobi\xe7a; mas o justo d\xe1, e n\xe3o ret\xe9m."},{verse:27,en:"The sacrifice of the wicked is abomination: how much more, when he bringeth it with a wicked mind?",pt:"O sacrif\xedcio dos \xedmpios \xe9 abomina\xe7ao; quanto mais oferecendo-o com inten\xe7\xe3o maligna!"},{verse:28,en:"A false witness shall perish: but the man that heareth speaketh constantly.",pt:"A testemunha mentirosa perecer\xe1; mas o homem que ouve falar\xe1 sem ser contestado."},{verse:29,en:"A wicked man hardeneth his face: but as for the upright, he directeth his way.",pt:"O homem \xedmpio endurece o seu rosto; mas o reto considera os seus caminhos."},{verse:30,en:"There is no wisdom nor understanding nor counsel against the LORD.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 sabedoria, nem entendimento, nem conselho contra o Senhor."},{verse:31,en:"The horse is prepared against the day of battle: but safety is of the LORD.",pt:"O cavalo prepara-se para o dia da batalha; mas do Senhor vem a vit\xf3ria."}]}}),705,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:22,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"A good name is rather to be chosen than great riches, and loving favour rather than silver and gold.",pt:"Mais digno de ser escolhido \xe9 o bom nome do que as muitas riquezas; e o favor \xe9 melhor do que a prata e o ouro."},{verse:2,en:"The rich and poor meet together: the LORD is the maker of them all.",pt:"O rico e o pobre se encontram; quem os faz a ambos \xe9 o Senhor."},{verse:3,en:"A prudent man foreseeth the evil, and hideth himself: but the simple pass on, and are punished.",pt:"O prudente v\xea o perigo e esconde-se; mas os simples passam adiante e sofrem a pena."},{verse:4,en:"By humility and the fear of the LORD are riches, and honour, and life.",pt:"O galard\xe3o da humildade e do temor do Senhor \xe9 riquezas, e honra e vida."},{verse:5,en:"Thorns and snares are in the way of the froward: he that doth keep his soul shall be far from them.",pt:"Espinhos e la\xe7os h\xe1 no caminho do perverso; o que guarda a sua alma retira-se para longe deles."},{verse:6,en:"Train up a child in the way he should go: and when he is old, he will not depart from it.",pt:"Instrui o menino no caminho em que deve andar, e at\xe9 quando envelhecer n\xe3o se desviar\xe1 dele."},{verse:7,en:"The rich ruleth over the poor, and the borrower is servant to the lender.",pt:"O rico domina sobre os pobres; e o que toma emprestado \xe9 servo do que empresta."},{verse:8,en:"He that soweth iniquity shall reap vanity: and the rod of his anger shall fail.",pt:"O que semear a perversidade segar\xe1 males; e a vara da sua indigna\xe7\xe3o falhar\xe1."},{verse:9,en:"He that hath a bountiful eye shall be blessed; for he giveth of his bread to the poor.",pt:"Quem v\xea com olhos bondosos ser\xe1 aben\xe7oado; porque d\xe1 do seu p\xe3o ao pobre."},{verse:10,en:"Cast out the scorner, and contention shall go out; yea, strife and reproach shall cease.",pt:"Lan\xe7a fora ao escarnecedor, e a contenda se ir\xe1; cessarao a rixa e a inj\xfaria."},{verse:11,en:"He that loveth pureness of heart, for the grace of his lips the king shall be his friend.",pt:"O que ama a pureza do cora\xe7\xe3o, e que tem gra\xe7a nos seus l\xe1bios, ter\xe1 por seu amigo o rei."},{verse:12,en:"The eyes of the LORD preserve knowledge, and he overthroweth the words of the transgressor.",pt:"Os olhos do Senhor preservam o que tem conhecimento; mas ele transtorna as palavras do prevaricador."},{verse:13,en:"The slothful man saith, There is a lion without, I shall be slain in the streets.",pt:"Diz o pregui\xe7oso: um le\xe3o est\xe1 l\xe1 fora; serei morto no meio das ruas."},{verse:14,en:"The mouth of strange women is a deep pit: he that is abhorred of the LORD shall fall therein.",pt:"Cova profunda \xe9 a boca da ad\xfaltera; aquele contra quem o Senhor est\xe1 irado cair\xe1 nela."},{verse:15,en:"Foolishness is bound in the heart of a child; but the rod of correction shall drive it far from him.",pt:"A estult\xedcia est\xe1 ligada ao cora\xe7\xe3o do menino; mas a vara da corre\xe7\xe3o a afugentar\xe1 dele."},{verse:16,en:"He that oppresseth the poor to increase his riches, and he that giveth to the rich, shall surely come to want.",pt:"O que para aumentar o seu lucro oprime o pobre, e d\xe1 ao rico, certamente chegar\xe1 \xe0: penuria."},{verse:17,en:"Bow down thine ear, and hear the words of the wise, and apply thine heart unto my knowledge.",pt:"Inclina o teu ouvido e ouve as palavras dos s\xe1bios, e aplica o teu cora\xe7\xe3o ao meu conhecimento."},{verse:18,en:"For it is a pleasant thing if thou keep them within thee; they shall withal be fitted in thy lips.",pt:"Porque ser\xe1 coisa suave, se os guardares no teu peito, se estiverem todos eles prontos nos teus l\xe1bios."},{verse:19,en:"That thy trust may be in the LORD, I have made known to thee this day, even to thee.",pt:"Para que a tua confian\xe7a esteja no senhor, a ti tos fiz saber hoje, sim, a ti mesmo."},{verse:20,en:"Have not I written to thee excellent things in counsels and knowledge,",pt:"Porventura n\xe3o te escrevi excelentes coisas acerca dos conselhos e do conhecimento,"},{verse:21,en:"That I might make thee know the certainty of the words of truth; that thou mightest answer the words of truth to them that send unto thee?",pt:"para te fazer saber a certeza das palavras de verdade, para que possas responder com palavras de verdade aos que te enviarem?"},{verse:22,en:"Rob not the poor, because he is poor: neither oppress the afflicted in the gate:",pt:"N\xe3o roubes ao pobre, porque \xe9 pobre; nem oprimas ao aflito na porta;"},{verse:23,en:"For the LORD will plead their cause, and spoil the soul of those that spoiled them.",pt:"porque o Senhor defender\xe1 a sua causa em ju\xedzo, e aos que os roubam lhes tirar\xe1 a vida."},{verse:24,en:"Make no friendship with an angry man; and with a furious man thou shalt not go:",pt:"N\xe3o fa\xe7as amizade com o iracundo; nem andes com o homem col\xe9rico;"},{verse:25,en:"Lest thou learn his ways, and get a snare to thy soul.",pt:"para que n\xe3o aprendas as suas veredas, e tomes um la\xe7o para a tua alma."},{verse:26,en:"Be not thou one of them that strike hands, or of them that are sureties for debts.",pt:"N\xe3o estejas entre os que se comprometem, que ficam por fiadores de d\xedvidas."},{verse:27,en:"If thou hast nothing to pay, why should he take away thy bed from under thee?",pt:"Se n\xe3o tens com que pagar, por que tirariam a tua cama de debaixo de ti?"},{verse:28,en:"Remove not the ancient landmark, which thy fathers have set.",pt:"N\xe3o removas os limites antigos que teus pais fixaram."},{verse:29,en:"Seest thou a man diligent in his business? he shall stand before kings; he shall not stand before mean men.",pt:"V\xeas um homem h\xe1bil na sua obrar? esse perante reis assistir\xe1; e n\xe3o assistir\xe1 perante homens obscuros."}]}}),706,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:23,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"When thou sittest to eat with a ruler, consider diligently what is before thee:",pt:"Quando te assentares a comer com um governador, atenta bem para aquele que est\xe1 diante de ti;"},{verse:2,en:"And put a knife to thy throat, if thou be a man given to appetite.",pt:"e p\xf5e uma faca \xe0 tua garganta, se fores homem de grande apetite."},{verse:3,en:"Be not desirous of his dainties: for they are deceitful meat.",pt:"N\xe3o cobices os seus manjares gostosos, porque \xe9 comida enganadora."},{verse:4,en:"Labour not to be rich: cease from thine own wisdom.",pt:"N\xe3o te fatigues para seres rico; d\xe1 de m\xe3o \xe0 tua pr\xf3pria sabedoria:"},{verse:5,en:"Wilt thou set thine eyes upon that which is not? for riches certainly make themselves wings; they fly away as an eagle toward heaven.",pt:"Fitando tu os olhos nas riquezas, elas se v\xe3o; pois fazem para si asas, como a \xe1guia, voam para o c\xe9u."},{verse:6,en:"Eat thou not the bread of him that hath an evil eye, neither desire thou his dainty meats:",pt:"N\xe3o comas o p\xe3o do avarento, nem cobices os seus manjares gostosos."},{verse:7,en:"For as he thinketh in his heart, so is he: Eat and drink, saith he to thee; but his heart is not with thee.",pt:"Porque, como ele pensa consigo mesmo, assim \xe9; ele te diz: Come e bebe; mas o seu cora\xe7\xe3o n\xe3o est\xe1 contigo."},{verse:8,en:"The morsel which thou hast eaten shalt thou vomit up, and lose thy sweet words.",pt:"Vomitar\xe1s o bocado que comeste, e perder\xe1s as tuas suaves palavras."},{verse:9,en:"Speak not in the ears of a fool: for he will despise the wisdom of thy words.",pt:"N\xe3o fales aos ouvidos do tolo; porque desprezar\xe1 a sabedoria das tuas palavras."},{verse:10,en:"Remove not the old landmark; and enter not into the fields of the fatherless:",pt:"N\xe3o removas os limites antigos; nem entres nos campos dos \xf3rf\xe3os,"},{verse:11,en:"For their redeemer is mighty; he shall plead their cause with thee.",pt:"porque o seu redentor \xe9 forte; ele lhes pleitear\xe1 a causa contra ti."},{verse:12,en:"Apply thine heart unto instruction, and thine ears to the words of knowledge.",pt:"Aplica o teu cora\xe7\xe3o \xe0 instru\xe7\xe3o, e os teus ouvidos \xe0s palavras do conhecimento."},{verse:13,en:"Withhold not correction from the child: for if thou beatest him with the rod, he shall not die.",pt:"N\xe3o retires da crian\xe7a a disciplina; porque, fustigando-a tu com a vara, nem por isso morrer\xe1."},{verse:14,en:"Thou shalt beat him with the rod, and shalt deliver his soul from hell.",pt:"Tu a fustigar\xe1s com a vara e livrar\xe1s a sua alma do Seol."},{verse:15,en:"My son, if thine heart be wise, my heart shall rejoice, even mine.",pt:"Filho meu, se o teu cora\xe7\xe3o for s\xe1bio, alegrar-se-\xe1 o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, sim, \xf3, meu pr\xf3prio;"},{verse:16,en:"Yea, my reins shall rejoice, when thy lips speak right things.",pt:"e exultar\xe1 o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, quando os teus l\xe1bios falarem coisas retas."},{verse:17,en:"Let not thine heart envy sinners: but be thou in the fear of the LORD all the day long.",pt:"N\xe3o tenhas inveja dos pecadores; antes conserva-te no temor do Senhor todo o dia."},{verse:18,en:"For surely there is an end; and thine expectation shall not be cut off.",pt:"Porque deveras ter\xe1s uma recompensa; n\xe3o ser\xe1 malograda a tua esperan\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"Hear thou, my son, and be wise, and guide thine heart in the way.",pt:"Ouve tu, filho meu, e s\xea s\xe1bio; e dirige no caminho o teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"Be not among winebibbers; among riotous eaters of flesh:",pt:"N\xe3o estejas entre os beberr\xf5es de vinho, nem entre os comil\xf5es de carne."},{verse:21,en:"For the drunkard and the glutton shall come to poverty: and drowsiness shall clothe a man with rags.",pt:"Porque o beberr\xe3o e o comil\xe3o caem em pobreza; e a sonol\xeancia cobrir\xe1 de trapos o homem."},{verse:22,en:"Hearken unto thy father that begat thee, and despise not thy mother when she is old.",pt:"Ouve a teu pai, que te gerou; e n\xe3o desprezes a tua m\xe3e, quando ela envelhecer."},{verse:23,en:"Buy the truth, and sell it not; also wisdom, and instruction, and understanding.",pt:"Compra a verdade, e n\xe3o a vendas; sim, a sabedoria, a disciplina, e o entendimento."},{verse:24,en:"The father of the righteous shall greatly rejoice: and he that begetteth a wise child shall have joy of him.",pt:"Grandemente se regozijar\xe1 o pai do justo; e quem gerar um filho s\xe1bio, nele se alegrar\xe1."},{verse:25,en:"Thy father and thy mother shall be glad, and she that bare thee shall rejoice.",pt:"Alegrem-se teu pai e tua m\xe3e, e regozije-se aquela que te deu \xe0 luz."},{verse:26,en:"My son, give me thine heart, and let thine eyes observe my ways.",pt:"Filho meu, d\xe1-me o teu cora\xe7\xe3o; e deleitem-se os teus olhos nos meus caminhos."},{verse:27,en:"For a whore is a deep ditch; and a strange woman is a narrow pit.",pt:"Porque cova profunda \xe9 a prostituta; e po\xe7o estreito \xe9 a aventureira."},{verse:28,en:"She also lieth in wait as for a prey, and increaseth the transgressors among men.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m ela, como o salteador, se p\xf5e a espreitar; e multiplica entre os homens os prevaricadores."},{verse:29,en:"Who hath woe? who hath sorrow? who hath contentions? who hath babbling? who hath wounds without cause? who hath redness of eyes?",pt:"Para quem s\xe3o os ais? para quem os pesares? para quem as pelejas, para quem as queixas? para quem as feridas sem causa? e para quem os olhos vermelhos?"},{verse:30,en:"They that tarry long at the wine; they that go to seek mixed wine.",pt:"Para os que se demoram perto do vinho, para os que andam buscando bebida misturada."},{verse:31,en:"Look not thou upon the wine when it is red, when it giveth his colour in the cup, when it moveth itself aright.",pt:"N\xe3o olhes para o vinho quando se mostra vermelho, quando resplandece no copo e se escoa suavemente."},{verse:32,en:"At the last it biteth like a serpent, and stingeth like an adder.",pt:"No seu fim morder\xe1 como a cobra, e como o basilisco picar\xe1."},{verse:33,en:"Thine eyes shall behold strange women, and thine heart shall utter perverse things.",pt:"Os teus olhos ver\xe3o coisas estranhas, e tu falar\xe1s perversidades."},{verse:34,en:"Yea, thou shalt be as he that lieth down in the midst of the sea, or as he that lieth upon the top of a mast.",pt:"o ser\xe1s como o que se deita no meio do mar, e como o que dorme no topo do mastro."},{verse:35,en:"They have stricken me, shalt thou say, and I was not sick; they have beaten me, and I felt it not: when shall I awake? I will seek it yet again.",pt:"E dir\xe0s: Espancaram-me, e n\xe3o me doeu; bateram-me, e n\xe3o o senti; quando virei a despertar? ainda tornarei a busc\xe1-lo outra vez."}]}}),707,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:24,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Be not thou envious against evil men, neither desire to be with them.",pt:"N\xe3o tenhas inveja dos homens malignos; nem desejes estar com eles;"},{verse:2,en:"For their heart studieth destruction, and their lips talk of mischief.",pt:"porque o seu cora\xe7\xe3o medita a viol\xeancia; e os seus l\xe1bios falam maliciosamente."},{verse:3,en:"Through wisdom is an house builded; and by understanding it is established:",pt:"Com a sabedoria se edifica a casa, e com o entendimento ela se estabelece;"},{verse:4,en:"And by knowledge shall the chambers be filled with all precious and pleasant riches.",pt:"e pelo conhecimento se encher\xe3o as c\xe2maras de todas as riquezas preciosas e deleit\xe1veis."},{verse:5,en:"A wise man is strong; yea, a man of knowledge increaseth strength.",pt:"O s\xe1bio \xe9 mais poderoso do que o forte; e o inteligente do que o que possui a for\xe7a."},{verse:6,en:"For by wise counsel thou shalt make thy war: and in multitude of counsellors there is safety.",pt:"Porque com conselhos prudentes tu podes fazer a guerra; e h\xe1 vit\xf3ria na multid\xe3o dos conselheiros."},{verse:7,en:"Wisdom is too high for a fool: he openeth not his mouth in the gate.",pt:"A sabedoria \xe9 alta demais para o insensato; ele n\xe3o abre a sua boca na porta."},{verse:8,en:"He that deviseth to do evil shall be called a mischievous person.",pt:"Aquele que cuida em fazer o mal, mestre de maus intentos o chamar\xe3o."},{verse:9,en:"The thought of foolishness is sin: and the scorner is an abomination to men.",pt:"O des\xedgnio do insensato \xe9 pecado; e abomin\xe1vel aos homens \xe9 o escarnecedor."},{verse:10,en:"If thou faint in the day of adversity, thy strength is small.",pt:"Se enfraqueces no dia da ang\xfastia, a tua for\xe7a \xe9 pequena."},{verse:11,en:"If thou forbear to deliver them that are drawn unto death, and those that are ready to be slain;",pt:"Livra os que est\xe3o sendo levados \xe0 morte, det\xe9m os que v\xe3o trope\xe7ando para a matan\xe7a."},{verse:12,en:"If thou sayest, Behold, we knew it not; doth not he that pondereth the heart consider it? and he that keepeth thy soul, doth not he know it? and shall not he render to every man according to his works?",pt:"Se disseres: Eis que n\xe3o o sabemos; porventura aquele que pesa os cora\xe7\xf5es n\xe3o o percebe? e aquele que guarda a tua vida n\xe3o o sabe? e n\xe3o retribuir\xe1 a cada um conforme a sua obra?"},{verse:13,en:"My son, eat thou honey, because it is good; and the honeycomb, which is sweet to thy taste:",pt:"Come mel, filho meu, porque \xe9 bom, e do favo de mel, que \xe9 doce ao teu paladar."},{verse:14,en:"So shall the knowledge of wisdom be unto thy soul: when thou hast found it, then there shall be a reward, and thy expectation shall not be cut off.",pt:"Sabe que \xe9 assim a sabedoria para a tua alma: se a achares, haver\xe1 para ti recompensa, e n\xe3o ser\xe1 malograda a tua esperan\xe7a."},{verse:15,en:"Lay not wait, O wicked man, against the dwelling of the righteous; spoil not his resting place:",pt:"N\xe3o te ponhas de emboscada, \xf3 \xedmpio, contra a habita\xe7\xe3o do justo; nem assoles a sua pousada."},{verse:16,en:"For a just man falleth seven times, and riseth up again: but the wicked shall fall into mischief.",pt:"Porque sete vezes cai o justo, e se levanta; mas os \xedmpios s\xe3o derribados pela calamidade."},{verse:17,en:"Rejoice not when thine enemy falleth, and let not thine heart be glad when he stumbleth:",pt:"Quando cair o teu inimigo, n\xe3o te alegres, e quando trope\xe7ar, n\xe3o se regozije o teu cora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:18,en:"Lest the LORD see it, and it displease him, and he turn away his wrath from him.",pt:"para que o Senhor n\xe3o o veja, e isso seja mau aos seus olhos, e desvie dele, a sua ira."},{verse:19,en:"Fret not thyself because of evil men, neither be thou envious at the wicked;",pt:"N\xe3o te aflijas por causa dos malfeitores; nem tenhas inveja dos \xedmpios;"},{verse:20,en:"For there shall be no reward to the evil man; the candle of the wicked shall be put out.",pt:"porque o maligno n\xe3o tem futuro; e a l\xe2mpada dos \xedmpios se apagar\xe1."},{verse:21,en:"My son, fear thou the LORD and the king: and meddle not with them that are given to change:",pt:"Filho meu, teme ao Senhor, e ao rei; e n\xe3o te entremetas com os que gostam de mudan\xe7as."},{verse:22,en:"For their calamity shall rise suddenly; and who knoweth the ruin of them both?",pt:"Porque de repente se levantar\xe1 a sua calamidade; e a ru\xedna deles, quem a conhecer\xe1?"},{verse:23,en:"These things also belong to the wise. It is not good to have respect of persons in judgment.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m estes s\xe3o prov\xe9rbios dos s\xe1bios: Fazer acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas no ju\xedzo n\xe3o \xe9 bom."},{verse:24,en:"He that saith unto the wicked, Thou art righteous; him shall the people curse, nations shall abhor him:",pt:"Aquele que disser ao \xedmpio: Justo \xe9s; os povos o amaldi\xe7oar\xe3o, as na\xe7\xf5es o detestar\xe3o;"},{verse:25,en:"But to them that rebuke him shall be delight, and a good blessing shall come upon them.",pt:"mas para os que julgam retamente haver\xe1 del\xedcias, e sobre eles vir\xe1 copiosa b\xean\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Every man shall kiss his lips that giveth a right answer.",pt:"O que responde com palavras retas beija os l\xe1bios."},{verse:27,en:"Prepare thy work without, and make it fit for thyself in the field; and afterwards build thine house.",pt:"Prepara os teus trabalhos de fora, apronta bem o teu campo; e depois edifica a tua casa."},{verse:28,en:"Be not a witness against thy neighbour without cause; and deceive not with thy lips.",pt:"N\xe3o sejas testemunha sem causa contra o teu pr\xf3ximo; e n\xe3o enganes com os teus l\xe1bios."},{verse:29,en:"Say not, I will do so to him as he hath done to me: I will render to the man according to his work.",pt:"N\xe3o digas: Como ele me fez a mim, assim lhe farei a ele; pagarei a cada um segundo a sua obra."},{verse:30,en:"I went by the field of the slothful, and by the vineyard of the man void of understanding;",pt:"Passei junto ao campo do pregui\xe7oso, e junto \xe0 vinha do homem falto de entendimento;"},{verse:31,en:"And, lo, it was all grown over with thorns, and nettles had covered the face thereof, and the stone wall thereof was broken down.",pt:"e eis que tudo estava cheio de cardos, e a sua superf\xedcie coberta de urtigas, e o seu muro de pedra estava derrubado."},{verse:32,en:"Then I saw, and considered it well: I looked upon it, and received instruction.",pt:"O que tendo eu visto, o considerei; e, vendo-o, recebi instru\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:33,en:"Yet a little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to sleep:",pt:"Um pouco para dormir, um pouco para toscanejar, um pouco para cruzar os bra\xe7os em repouso;"},{verse:34,en:"So shall thy poverty come as one that travelleth; and thy want as an armed man.",pt:"assim sobrevir\xe1 a tua pobreza como um salteador, e a tua necessidade como um homem armado."}]}}),708,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:25,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"These are also proverbs of Solomon, which the men of Hezekiah king of Judah copied out.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m estes s\xe3o prov\xe9rbios de Salom\xe3o, os quais transcreveram os homens de Ezequias, rei de Jud\xe1."},{verse:2,en:"It is the glory of God to conceal a thing: but the honour of kings is to search out a matter.",pt:"A gl\xf3ria de Deus \xe9 encobrir as coisas; mas a gl\xf3ria dos reis \xe9 esquadrinh\xe1-las."},{verse:3,en:"The heaven for height, and the earth for depth, and the heart of kings is unsearchable.",pt:"Como o c\xe9u na sua altura, e como a terra na sua profundidade, assim o cora\xe7\xe3o dos reis \xe9 inescrut\xe1vel."},{verse:4,en:"Take away the dross from the silver, and there shall come forth a vessel for the finer.",pt:"Tira da prata a esc\xf3ria, e sair\xe1 um vaso para o fundidor."},{verse:5,en:"Take away the wicked from before the king, and his throne shall be established in righteousness.",pt:"Tira o \xedmpio da presen\xe7a do rei, e o seu trono se firmar\xe1 na justi\xe7a."},{verse:6,en:"Put not forth thyself in the presence of the king, and stand not in the place of great men:",pt:"N\xe3o reclames para ti honra na presen\xe7a do rei, nem te ponhas no lugar dos grandes;"},{verse:7,en:"For better it is that it be said unto thee, Come up hither; than that thou shouldest be put lower in the presence of the prince whom thine eyes have seen.",pt:"porque melhor \xe9 que te digam: Sobe, para aqui; do que seres humilhado perante o pr\xedncipe."},{verse:8,en:"Go not forth hastily to strive, lest thou know not what to do in the end thereof, when thy neighbour hath put thee to shame.",pt:"O que os teus olhos viram, n\xe3o te apresses a revelar, para depois, ao fim, n\xe3o saberes o que h\xe1s de fazer, podendo-te confundir o teu pr\xf3ximo."},{verse:9,en:"Debate thy cause with thy neighbour himself; and discover not a secret to another:",pt:"Pleiteia a tua causa com o teu pr\xf3ximo mesmo; e n\xe3o reveles o segredo de outrem;"},{verse:10,en:"Lest he that heareth it put thee to shame, and thine infamy turn not away.",pt:"para que n\xe3o te desonre aquele que o ouvir, n\xe3o se apartando de ti a inf\xe2mia."},{verse:11,en:"A word fitly spoken is like apples of gold in pictures of silver.",pt:"Como ma\xe7\xe3s de ouro em salvas de prata, assim \xe9 a palavra dita a seu tempo."},{verse:12,en:"As an earring of gold, and an ornament of fine gold, so is a wise reprover upon an obedient ear.",pt:"Como pendentes de ouro e gargantilhas de ouro puro, assim \xe9 o s\xe1bio repreensor para o ouvido obediente."},{verse:13,en:"As the cold of snow in the time of harvest, so is a faithful messenger to them that send him: for he refresheth the soul of his masters.",pt:"Como o frescor de neve no tempo da sega, assim \xe9 o mensageiro fiel para com os que o enviam, porque refrigera o esp\xedrito dos seus senhores."},{verse:14,en:"Whoso boasteth himself of a false gift is like clouds and wind without rain.",pt:"como nuvens e ventos que n\xe3o trazem chuva, assim \xe9 o homem que se gaba de d\xe1divas que n\xe3o fez."},{verse:15,en:"By long forbearing is a prince persuaded, and a soft tongue breaketh the bone.",pt:"Pela longanimidade se persuade o pr\xedncipe, e a l\xedngua branda quebranta os ossos."},{verse:16,en:"Hast thou found honey? eat so much as is sufficient for thee, lest thou be filled therewith, and vomit it.",pt:"Se achaste mel, come somente o que te basta, para que porventura n\xe3o te fartes dele, e o venhas a vomitar."},{verse:17,en:"Withdraw thy foot from thy neighbour\u2019s house; lest he be weary of thee, and so hate thee.",pt:"P\xf5e raramente o teu p\xe9 na casa do teu pr\xf3ximo, para que n\xe3o se enfade de ti, e te aborre\xe7a."},{verse:18,en:"A man that beareth false witness against his neighbour is a maul, and a sword, and a sharp arrow.",pt:"Malho, e espada, e flecha aguda \xe9 o homem que levanta falso testemunho contra o seu pr\xf3ximo."},{verse:19,en:"Confidence in an unfaithful man in time of trouble is like a broken tooth, and a foot out of joint.",pt:"Como dente quebrado, e p\xe9 deslocado, \xe9 a confian\xe7a no homem desleal, no dia da ang\xfastia."},{verse:20,en:"As he that taketh away a garment in cold weather, and as vinegar upon nitre, so is he that singeth songs to an heavy heart.",pt:"O que entoa can\xe7\xf5es ao cora\xe7\xe3o aflito \xe9 como aquele que despe uma pe\xe7a de roupa num dia de frio, e como vinagre sobre a chaga."},{verse:21,en:"If thine enemy be hungry, give him bread to eat; and if he be thirsty, give him water to drink:",pt:"Se o teu inimigo tiver fome, d\xe1-lhe p\xe3o para comer, e se tiver sede, d\xe1-lhe \xe1gua para beber;"},{verse:22,en:"For thou shalt heap coals of fire upon his head, and the LORD shall reward thee.",pt:"porque assim lhe amontoar\xe1s brasas sobre a cabe\xe7a, e o Senhor te recompensar\xe1."},{verse:23,en:"The north wind driveth away rain: so doth an angry countenance a backbiting tongue.",pt:"O vento norte traz chuva, e a l\xedngua caluniadora, o rosto irado."},{verse:24,en:"It is better to dwell in the corner of the housetop, than with a brawling woman and in a wide house.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 morar num canto do eirado, do que com a mulher rixosa numa casa ampla."},{verse:25,en:"As cold waters to a thirsty soul, so is good news from a far country.",pt:"Como \xe1gua fresca para o homem sedento, tais s\xe3o as boas-novas de terra remota."},{verse:26,en:"A righteous man falling down before the wicked is as a troubled fountain, and a corrupt spring.",pt:"Como fonte turva, e manancial polu\xeddo, assim \xe9 o justo que cede lugar diante do \xedmpio."},{verse:27,en:"It is not good to eat much honey: so for men to search their own glory is not glory.",pt:"comer muito mel n\xe3o \xe9 bom; n\xe3o multipliques, pois, as palavras de lisonja."},{verse:28,en:"He that hath no rule over his own spirit is like a city that is broken down, and without walls.",pt:"Como a cidade derribada, que n\xe3o tem muros, assim \xe9 o homem que n\xe3o pode conter o seu esp\xedrito."}]}}),709,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,n,r){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:26,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"As snow in summer, and as rain in harvest, so honour is not seemly for a fool.",pt:"Como a neve no ver\xe3o, e como a chuva no tempo da ceifa, assim n\xe3o conv\xe9m ao tolo a honra."},{verse:2,en:"As the bird by wandering, as the swallow by flying, so the curse causeless shall not come.",pt:"Como o p\xe1ssaro no seu vaguear, como a andorinha no seu voar, assim a maldi\xe7\xe3o sem causa n\xe3o encontra pouso."},{verse:3,en:"A whip for the horse, a bridle for the ass, and a rod for the fool\u2019s back.",pt:"O a\xe7oite \xe9 para o cavalo, o freio para o jumento, e a vara para as costas dos tolos."},{verse:4,en:"Answer not a fool according to his folly, lest thou also be like unto him.",pt:"N\xe3o respondas ao tolo segundo a sua estult\xedcia, para que tamb\xe9m n\xe3o te fa\xe7as semelhante a ele."},{verse:5,en:"Answer a fool according to his folly, lest he be wise in his own conceit.",pt:"Responde ao tolo segundo a sua estult\xedcia, para que ele n\xe3o seja s\xe1bio aos seus pr\xf3prios olhos."},{verse:6,en:"He that sendeth a message by the hand of a fool cutteth off the feet, and drinketh damage.",pt:"Os p\xe9s decepa, e o dano bebe, quem manda mensagens pela m\xe3o dum tolo."},{verse:7,en:"The legs of the lame are not equal: so is a parable in the mouth of fools.",pt:"As pernas do coxo pendem frouxas; assim \xe9 o prov\xe9rbio na boca dos tolos."},{verse:8,en:"As he that bindeth a stone in a sling, so is he that giveth honour to a fool.",pt:"Como o que ata a pedra na funda, assim \xe9 aquele que d\xe1 honra ao tolo."},{verse:9,en:"As a thorn goeth up into the hand of a drunkard, so is a parable in the mouth of fools.",pt:"Como o espinho que entra na m\xe3o do \xe9brio, assim \xe9 o prov\xe9rbio na m\xe3o dos tolos."},{verse:10,en:"The great God that formed all things both rewardeth the fool, and rewardeth transgressors.",pt:"Como o flecheiro que fere a todos, assim \xe9 aquele que assalaria ao transeunte tolo, ou ao \xe9brio."},{verse:11,en:"As a dog returneth to his vomit, so a fool returneth to his folly.",pt:"Como o c\xe3o que torna ao seu v\xf4mito, assim \xe9 o tolo que reitera a sua estult\xedcia."},{verse:12,en:"Seest thou a man wise in his own conceit? there is more hope of a fool than of him.",pt:"V\xeas um homem que \xe9 s\xe1bio a seus pr\xf3prios olhos? Maior esperan\xe7a h\xe1 para o tolo do que para ele."},{verse:13,en:"The slothful man saith, There is a lion in the way; a lion is in the streets.",pt:"Diz o pregui\xe7oso: Um le\xe3o est\xe1 no caminho; um le\xe3o est\xe1 nas ruas."},{verse:14,en:"As the door turneth upon his hinges, so doth the slothful upon his bed.",pt:"Como a porta se revolve nos seus gonzos, assim o faz o pregui\xe7oso na sua cama."},{verse:15,en:"The slothful hideth his hand in his bosom; it grieveth him to bring it again to his mouth.",pt:"O pregui\xe7oso esconde a sua m\xe3o no prato, e nem ao menos quer lev\xe1-la de novo \xe0 boca."},{verse:16,en:"The sluggard is wiser in his own conceit than seven men that can render a reason.",pt:"Mais s\xe1bio \xe9 o pregui\xe7oso a seus olhos do que sete homens que sabem responder bem."},{verse:17,en:"He that passeth by, and meddleth with strife belonging not to him, is like one that taketh a dog by the ears.",pt:"O que, passando, se mete em quest\xe3o alheia \xe9 como aquele que toma um c\xe3o pelas orelhas."},{verse:18,en:"As a mad man who casteth firebrands, arrows, and death,",pt:"Como o louco que atira ti\xe7\xf5es, flechas, e morte,"},{verse:19,en:"So is the man that deceiveth his neighbour, and saith, Am not I in sport?",pt:"assim \xe9 o homem que engana o seu pr\xf3ximo, e diz: Fiz isso por brincadeira."},{verse:20,en:"Where no wood is, there the fire goeth out: so where there is no talebearer, the strife ceaseth.",pt:"Faltando lenha, apaga-se o fogo; e n\xe3o havendo difamador, cessa a contenda."},{verse:21,en:"As coals are to burning coals, and wood to fire; so is a contentious man to kindle strife.",pt:"Como o carv\xe3o para as brasas, e a lenha para o fogo, assim \xe9 o homem contencioso para acender rixas."},{verse:22,en:"The words of a talebearer are as wounds, and they go down into the innermost parts of the belly.",pt:"As palavras do difamador s\xe3o como bocados deliciosos, que descem ao \xedntimo do ventre."},{verse:23,en:"Burning lips and a wicked heart are like a potsherd covered with silver dross.",pt:"Como o vaso de barro coberto de esc\xf3ria de prata, assim s\xe3o os l\xe1bios ardentes e o cora\xe7\xe3o maligno."},{verse:24,en:"He that hateth dissembleth with his lips, and layeth up deceit within him;",pt:"Aquele que odeia dissimula com os seus l\xe1bios; mas no seu interior entesoura o engano."},{verse:25,en:"When he speaketh fair, believe him not: for there are seven abominations in his heart.",pt:"Quando te suplicar com voz suave, n\xe3o o creias; porque sete abomina\xe7\xf5es h\xe1 no teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Whose hatred is covered by deceit, his wickedness shall be shewed before the whole congregation.",pt:"Ainda que o seu \xf3dio se encubra com dissimula\xe7\xe3o, na congrega\xe7\xe3o ser\xe1 revelada a sua mal\xedcia."},{verse:27,en:"Whoso diggeth a pit shall fall therein: and he that rolleth a stone, it will return upon him.",pt:"O que faz uma cova cair\xe1 nela; e a pedra voltar\xe1 sobre aquele que a revolve."},{verse:28,en:"A lying tongue hateth those that are afflicted by it; and a flattering mouth worketh ruin.",pt:"A l\xedngua falsa odeia aqueles a quem ela tenha ferido; e a boca lisonjeira opera a ru\xedna."}]}}),710,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,r,s,n){r.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:27,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Boast not thyself of to morrow; for thou knowest not what a day may bring forth.",pt:"N\xe3o te glories do dia de amanh\xe3; porque n\xe3o sabes o que produzir\xe1 o dia."},{verse:2,en:"Let another man praise thee, and not thine own mouth; a stranger, and not thine own lips.",pt:"Seja outro o que te louve, e n\xe3o a tua boca; o estranho, e n\xe3o os teus l\xe1bios."},{verse:3,en:"A stone is heavy, and the sand weighty; but a fool\u2019s wrath is heavier than them both.",pt:"Pesada \xe9 a pedra, e a areia tamb\xe9m; mas a ira do insensato \xe9 mais pesada do que elas ambas."},{verse:4,en:"Wrath is cruel, and anger is outrageous; but who is able to stand before envy?",pt:"Cruel \xe9 o furor, e impetuosa \xe9 a ira; mas quem pode resistir \xe0 inveja?"},{verse:5,en:"Open rebuke is better than secret love.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 a repreens\xe3o aberta do que o amor encoberto."},{verse:6,en:"Faithful are the wounds of a friend; but the kisses of an enemy are deceitful.",pt:"Fi\xe9is s\xe3o as feridas dum amigo; mas os beijos dum inimigo s\xe3o enganosos."},{verse:7,en:"The full soul loatheth an honeycomb; but to the hungry soul every bitter thing is sweet.",pt:"O que est\xe1 farto despreza o favo de mel; mas para o faminto todo amargo \xe9 doce."},{verse:8,en:"As a bird that wandereth from her nest, so is a man that wandereth from his place.",pt:"Qual a ave que vagueia longe do seu ninho, tal \xe9 o homem que anda vagueando longe do seu lugar."},{verse:9,en:"Ointment and perfume rejoice the heart: so doth the sweetness of a man\u2019s friend by hearty counsel.",pt:"O \xf3leo e o perfume alegram o cora\xe7\xe3o; assim \xe9 o doce conselho do homem para o seu amigo."},{verse:10,en:"Thine own friend, and thy father\u2019s friend, forsake not; neither go into thy brother\u2019s house in the day of thy calamity: for better is a neighbour that is near than a brother far off.",pt:"N\xe3o abandones o teu amigo, nem o amigo de teu pai; nem entres na casa de teu irm\xe3o no dia de tua adversidade. Mais vale um vizinho que est\xe1 perto do que um irm\xe3o que est\xe1 longe."},{verse:11,en:"My son, be wise, and make my heart glad, that I may answer him that reproacheth me.",pt:"S\xea s\xe1bio, filho meu, e alegra o meu cora\xe7\xe3o, para que eu tenha o que responder \xe0quele que me vituperar."},{verse:12,en:"A prudent man foreseeth the evil, and hideth himself; but the simple pass on, and are punished.",pt:"O prudente v\xea o mal e se esconde; mas os insensatos passam adiante e sofrem a pena."},{verse:13,en:"Take his garment that is surety for a stranger, and take a pledge of him for a strange woman.",pt:"Tira a roupa \xe0quele que fica por fiador do estranho, e toma penhor daquele que se obriga por uma estrangeira."},{verse:14,en:"He that blesseth his friend with a loud voice, rising early in the morning, it shall be counted a curse to him.",pt:"O que bendiz ao seu amigo em alta voz, levantando-se de madrugada, isso lhe ser\xe1 contado como maldi\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"A continual dropping in a very rainy day and a contentious woman are alike.",pt:"A goteira cont\xednua num dia chuvoso e a mulher rixosa s\xe3o semelhantes;"},{verse:16,en:"Whosoever hideth her hideth the wind, and the ointment of his right hand, which bewrayeth itself.",pt:"ret\xea-la \xe9 reter o vento, ou segurar o \xf3leo com a destra."},{verse:17,en:"Iron sharpeneth iron; so a man sharpeneth the countenance of his friend.",pt:"Afia-se o ferro com o ferro; assim o homem afia o rosto do seu amigo."},{verse:18,en:"Whoso keepeth the fig tree shall eat the fruit thereof: so he that waiteth on his master shall be honoured.",pt:"O que cuida da figueira comer\xe1 do fruto dela; e o que vela pelo seu senhor ser\xe1 honrado."},{verse:19,en:"As in water face answereth to face, so the heart of man to man.",pt:"Como na \xe1gua o rosto corresponde ao rosto, assim o cora\xe7\xe3o do homem ao homem."},{verse:20,en:"Hell and destruction are never full; so the eyes of man are never satisfied.",pt:"O Seol e o Abadom nunca se fartam, e os olhos do homem nunca se satisfazem."},{verse:21,en:"As the fining pot for silver, and the furnace for gold; so is a man to his praise.",pt:"O crisol \xe9 para a prata, e o forno para o ouro, e o homem \xe9 provado pelos louvores que recebe."},{verse:22,en:"Though thou shouldest bray a fool in a mortar among wheat with a pestle, yet will not his foolishness depart from him.",pt:"Ainda que pisasses o insensato no gral entre gr\xe3os pilados, contudo n\xe3o se apartaria dele a sua estult\xedcia."},{verse:23,en:"Be thou diligent to know the state of thy flocks, and look well to thy herds.",pt:"Procura conhecer o estado das tuas ovelhas; cuida bem dos teus rebanhos;"},{verse:24,en:"For riches are not for ever: and doth the crown endure to every generation?",pt:"porque as riquezas n\xe3o duram para sempre; e duraria a coroa de gera\xe7\xe3o em gera\xe7\xe3o?"},{verse:25,en:"The hay appeareth, and the tender grass sheweth itself, and herbs of the mountains are gathered.",pt:"Quando o feno \xe9 removido, e aparece a erva verde, e recolhem-se as ervas dos montes,"},{verse:26,en:"The lambs are for thy clothing, and the goats are the price of the field.",pt:"os cordeiros te prover\xe3o de vestes, e os bodes, do pre\xe7o do campo."},{verse:27,en:"And thou shalt have goats\u2019 milk enough for thy food, for the food of thy household, and for the maintenance for thy maidens.",pt:"E haver\xe1 bastante leite de cabras para o teu sustento, para o sustento da tua casa e das tuas criadas."}]}}),711,[]);
__d((function(e,a,s,o,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:28,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The wicked flee when no man pursueth: but the righteous are bold as a lion.",pt:"Fogem os \xedmpios, sem que ningu\xe9m os persiga; mas os justos s\xe3o ousados como o le\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"For the transgression of a land many are the princes thereof: but by a man of understanding and knowledge the state thereof shall be prolonged.",pt:"Por causa da transgress\xe3o duma terra s\xe3o muitos os seus pr\xedncipes; mas por virtude de homens prudentes e entendidos, ela subsistir\xe1 por longo tempo."},{verse:3,en:"A poor man that oppresseth the poor is like a sweeping rain which leaveth no food.",pt:"O homem pobre que oprime os pobres, \xe9 como chuva impetuosa, que n\xe3o deixa trigo nenhum."},{verse:4,en:"They that forsake the law praise the wicked: but such as keep the law contend with them.",pt:"Os que abandonam a lei louvam os \xedmpios; mas os que guardam a lei pelejam contra eles."},{verse:5,en:"Evil men understand not judgment: but they that seek the LORD understand all things.",pt:"Os homens maus n\xe3o entendem a justi\xe7a; mas os que buscam ao Senhor a entendem plenamente."},{verse:6,en:"Better is the poor that walketh in his uprightness, than he that is perverse in his ways, though he be rich.",pt:"Melhor \xe9 o pobre que anda na sua integridade, do que o rico perverso nos seus caminhos."},{verse:7,en:"Whoso keepeth the law is a wise son: but he that is a companion of riotous men shameth his father.",pt:"O que guarda a lei \xe9 filho s\xe1bio; mas o companheiro dos comil\xf5es envergonha a seu pai."},{verse:8,en:"He that by usury and unjust gain increaseth his substance, he shall gather it for him that will pity the poor.",pt:"O que aumenta a sua riqueza com juros e usura, ajunta-a para o que se compadece do pobre."},{verse:9,en:"He that turneth away his ear from hearing the law, even his prayer shall be abomination.",pt:"O que desvia os seus ouvidos de ouvir a lei, at\xe9 a sua ora\xe7\xe3o \xe9 abomin\xe1vel."},{verse:10,en:"Whoso causeth the righteous to go astray in an evil way, he shall fall himself into his own pit: but the upright shall have good things in possession.",pt:"O que faz com que os retos se desviem para um mau caminho, ele mesmo cair\xe1 na cova que abriu; mas os inocentes herdar\xe3o o bem."},{verse:11,en:"The rich man is wise in his own conceit; but the poor that hath understanding searcheth him out.",pt:"O homem rico \xe9 s\xe1bio aos seus pr\xf3prios olhos; mas o pobre que tem entendimento o esquadrinha."},{verse:12,en:"When righteous men do rejoice, there is great glory: but when the wicked rise, a man is hidden.",pt:"Quando os justos triunfam h\xe1 grande, gl\xf3ria; mas quando os \xedmpios sobem, escondem-se os homens."},{verse:13,en:"He that covereth his sins shall not prosper: but whoso confesseth and forsaketh them shall have mercy.",pt:"O que encobre as suas transgress\xf5es nunca prosperar\xe1; mas o que as confessa e deixa, alcan\xe7ar\xe1 miseric\xf3rdia."},{verse:14,en:"Happy is the man that feareth alway: but he that hardeneth his heart shall fall into mischief.",pt:"Feliz \xe9 o homem que teme ao Senhor continuamente; mas o que endurece o seu cora\xe7\xe3o vir\xe1 a cair no mal."},{verse:15,en:"As a roaring lion, and a ranging bear; so is a wicked ruler over the poor people.",pt:"Como le\xe3o bramidor, e urso faminto, assim \xe9 o \xedmpio que domina sobre um povo pobre."},{verse:16,en:"The prince that wanteth understanding is also a great oppressor: but he that hateth covetousness shall prolong his days.",pt:"O pr\xedncipe falto de entendimento \xe9 tamb\xe9m opressor cruel; mas o que aborrece a avareza prolongar\xe1 os seus dias."},{verse:17,en:"A man that doeth violence to the blood of any person shall flee to the pit; let no man stay him.",pt:"O homem culpado do sangue de qualquer pessoa ser\xe1 fugitivo at\xe9 a morte; ningu\xe9m o ajude."},{verse:18,en:"Whoso walketh uprightly shall be saved: but he that is perverse in his ways shall fall at once.",pt:"O que anda retamente salvar-se-\xe1; mas o perverso em seus caminhos cair\xe1 de repente."},{verse:19,en:"He that tilleth his land shall have plenty of bread: but he that followeth after vain persons shall have poverty enough.",pt:"O que lavra a sua terra se fartar\xe1 de p\xe3o; mas o que segue os ociosos se encher\xe1 de pobreza."},{verse:20,en:"A faithful man shall abound with blessings: but he that maketh haste to be rich shall not be innocent.",pt:"O homem fiel gozar\xe1 de abundantes b\xean\xe7\xe3os; mas o que se apressa a enriquecer n\xe3o ficar\xe1 impune."},{verse:21,en:"To have respect of persons is not good: for for a piece of bread that man will transgress.",pt:"Fazer acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas n\xe3o \xe9 bom; mas at\xe9 por um bocado de p\xe3o prevaricar\xe1 o homem."},{verse:22,en:"He that hasteth to be rich hath an evil eye, and considereth not that poverty shall come upon him.",pt:"Aquele que \xe9 cobi\xe7oso corre atr\xe1s das riquezas; e n\xe3o sabe que h\xe1 de vir sobre ele a pen\xfaria."},{verse:23,en:"He that rebuketh a man afterwards shall find more favour than he that flattereth with the tongue.",pt:"O que repreende a um homem achar\xe1 depois mais favor do que aquele que lisonjeia com a l\xedngua."},{verse:24,en:"Whoso robbeth his father or his mother, and saith, It is no transgression; the same is the companion of a destroyer.",pt:"O que rouba a seu pai, ou a sua m\xe3e, e diz: Isso n\xe3o \xe9 transgress\xe3o; esse \xe9 companheiro do destruidor."},{verse:25,en:"He that is of a proud heart stirreth up strife: but he that putteth his trust in the LORD shall be made fat.",pt:"O cobi\xe7oso levanta contendas; mas o que confia no senhor prosperar\xe1."},{verse:26,en:"He that trusteth in his own heart is a fool: but whoso walketh wisely, he shall be delivered.",pt:"O que confia no seu pr\xf3prio cora\xe7\xe3o \xe9 insensato; mas o que anda sabiamente ser\xe1 livre."},{verse:27,en:"He that giveth unto the poor shall not lack: but he that hideth his eyes shall have many a curse.",pt:"O que d\xe1 ao pobre n\xe3o ter\xe1 falta; mas o que esconde os seus olhos ter\xe1 muitas maldi\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:28,en:"When the wicked rise, men hide themselves: but when they perish, the righteous increase.",pt:"Quando os \xedmpios sobem, escondem-se os homens; mas quando eles perecem, multiplicam-se os justos."}]}}),712,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:29,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"He, that being often reproved hardeneth his neck, shall suddenly be destroyed, and that without remedy.",pt:"Aquele que, sendo muitas vezes repreendido, endurece a cerviz, ser\xe1 quebrantado de repente sem que haja cura."},{verse:2,en:"When the righteous are in authority, the people rejoice: but when the wicked beareth rule, the people mourn.",pt:"Quando os justos governam, alegra-se o povo; mas quando o \xedmpio domina, o povo geme."},{verse:3,en:"Whoso loveth wisdom rejoiceth his father: but he that keepeth company with harlots spendeth his substance.",pt:"O que ama a sabedoria alegra a seu pai; mas o companheiro de prostitutas desperdi\xe7a a sua riqueza."},{verse:4,en:"The king by judgment establisheth the land: but he that receiveth gifts overthroweth it.",pt:"O rei pela justi\xe7a estabelece a terra; mas o que exige presentes a transtorna."},{verse:5,en:"A man that flattereth his neighbour spreadeth a net for his feet.",pt:"O homem que lisonjeia a seu pr\xf3ximo arma-lhe uma rede aos passos."},{verse:6,en:"In the transgression of an evil man there is a snare: but the righteous doth sing and rejoice.",pt:"Na transgress\xe3o do homem mau h\xe1 la\xe7o; mas o justo canta e se regozija."},{verse:7,en:"The righteous considereth the cause of the poor: but the wicked regardeth not to know it.",pt:"O justo toma conhecimento da causa dos pobres; mas o \xedmpio n\xe3o tem entendimento para a conhecer."},{verse:8,en:"Scornful men bring a city into a snare: but wise men turn away wrath.",pt:"Os escarnecedores abrasam a cidade; mas os s\xe1bios desviam a ira."},{verse:9,en:"If a wise man contendeth with a foolish man, whether he rage or laugh, there is no rest.",pt:"O s\xe1bio que pleiteia com o insensato, quer este se agaste quer se ria, n\xe3o ter\xe1 descanso."},{verse:10,en:"The bloodthirsty hate the upright: but the just seek his soul.",pt:"Os homens sanguin\xe1rios odeiam o \xedntegro; mas os retos procuram o seu bem."},{verse:11,en:"A fool uttereth all his mind: but a wise man keepeth it in till afterwards.",pt:"O tolo derrama toda a sua ira; mas o s\xe1bio a reprime e aplaca."},{verse:12,en:"If a ruler hearken to lies, all his servants are wicked.",pt:"O governador que d\xe1 aten\xe7\xe3o \xe0s palavras mentirosas achar\xe1 que todos os seus servos s\xe3o \xedmpios."},{verse:13,en:"The poor and the deceitful man meet together: the LORD lighteneth both their eyes.",pt:"O pobre e o opressor se encontram; o Senhor alumia os olhos de ambos."},{verse:14,en:"The king that faithfully judgeth the poor, his throne shall be established for ever.",pt:"Se o rei julgar os pobres com eq\xfcidade, o seu trono ser\xe1 estabelecido para sempre."},{verse:15,en:"The rod and reproof give wisdom: but a child left to himself bringeth his mother to shame.",pt:"A vara e a repreens\xe3o d\xe3o sabedoria; mas a crian\xe7a entregue a si mesma envergonha a sua m\xe3e."},{verse:16,en:"When the wicked are multiplied, transgression increaseth: but the righteous shall see their fall.",pt:"Quando os \xedmpios se multiplicam, multiplicam-se as transgress\xf5es; mas os justos ver\xe3o a queda deles."},{verse:17,en:"Correct thy son, and he shall give thee rest; yea, he shall give delight unto thy soul.",pt:"Corrige a teu filho, e ele te dar\xe1 descanso; sim, deleitar\xe1 o teu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:18,en:"Where there is no vision, the people perish: but he that keepeth the law, happy is he.",pt:"Onde n\xe3o h\xe1 profecia, o povo se corrompe; mas o que guarda a lei esse \xe9 bem-aventurado."},{verse:19,en:"A servant will not be corrected by words: for though he understand he will not answer.",pt:"O servo n\xe3o se emendar\xe1 com palavras; porque, ainda que entenda, n\xe3o atender\xe1."},{verse:20,en:"Seest thou a man that is hasty in his words? there is more hope of a fool than of him.",pt:"V\xeas um homem precipitado nas suas palavras? Maior esperan\xe7a h\xe1 para o tolo do que para ele."},{verse:21,en:"He that delicately bringeth up his servant from a child shall have him become his son at the length.",pt:"Aquele que cria delicadamente o seu servo desde a meninice, no fim t\xea-lo-\xe1 por herdeiro."},{verse:22,en:"An angry man stirreth up strife, and a furious man aboundeth in transgression.",pt:"O homem iracundo levanta contendas, e o furioso multiplica as transgress\xf5es."},{verse:23,en:"A man\u2019s pride shall bring him low: but honour shall uphold the humble in spirit.",pt:"A soberba do homem o abater\xe1; mas o humilde de esp\xedrito obter\xe1 honra."},{verse:24,en:"Whoso is partner with a thief hateth his own soul: he heareth cursing, and bewrayeth it not.",pt:"O que \xe9 s\xf3cio do ladr\xe3o odeia a sua pr\xf3pria alma; sendo ajuramentado, nada denuncia."},{verse:25,en:"The fear of man bringeth a snare: but whoso putteth his trust in the LORD shall be safe.",pt:"O receio do homem lhe arma la\xe7os; mas o que confia no Senhor est\xe1 seguro."},{verse:26,en:"Many seek the ruler\u2019s favour; but every man\u2019s judgment cometh from the LORD.",pt:"Muitos buscam o favor do pr\xedncipe; mas \xe9 do Senhor que o homem recebe a justi\xe7a."},{verse:27,en:"An unjust man is an abomination to the just: and he that is upright in the way is abomination to the wicked.",pt:"O \xedmpio \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para os justos; e o que \xe9 reto no seu caminho \xe9 abomina\xe7\xe3o para o \xedmpio."}]}}),713,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,t,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:30,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The words of Agur the son of Jakeh, even the prophecy: the man spake unto Ithiel, even unto Ithiel and Ucal,",pt:"Palavras de Agur, filho de Jaqu\xe9 de Mass\xe1. Diz o homem a Itiel, e a Ucal:"},{verse:2,en:"Surely I am more brutish than any man, and have not the understanding of a man.",pt:"Na verdade que eu sou mais est\xfapido do que ningu\xe9m; n\xe3o tenho o entendimento do homem;"},{verse:3,en:"I neither learned wisdom, nor have the knowledge of the holy.",pt:"n\xe3o aprendi a sabedoria, nem tenho o conhecimento do Santo."},{verse:4,en:"Who hath ascended up into heaven, or descended? who hath gathered the wind in his fists? who hath bound the waters in a garment? who hath established all the ends of the earth? what is his name, and what is his son\u2019s name, if thou canst tell?",pt:"Quem subiu ao c\xe9u e desceu? quem encerrou os ventos nos seus punhos? mas amarrou as \xe1guas no seu manto? quem estabeleceu todas as extremidades da terra? qual \xe9 o seu nome, e qual \xe9 o nome de seu filho? Certamente o sabes!"},{verse:5,en:"Every word of God is pure: he is a shield unto them that put their trust in him.",pt:"Toda palavra de Deus \xe9 pura; ele \xe9 um escudo para os que nele confiam."},{verse:6,en:"Add thou not unto his words, lest he reprove thee, and thou be found a liar.",pt:"Nada acrescentes \xe0s suas palavras, para que ele n\xe3o te repreenda e tu sejas achado mentiroso."},{verse:7,en:"Two things have I required of thee; deny me them not before I die:",pt:"Duas coisas te pe\xe7o; n\xe3o mas negues, antes que morra:"},{verse:8,en:"Remove far from me vanity and lies: give me neither poverty nor riches; feed me with food convenient for me:",pt:"Alonga de mim a falsidade e a mentira; n\xe3o me d\xeas nem a pobreza nem a riqueza: d\xe1-me s\xf3 o p\xe3o que me \xe9 necess\xe1rio;"},{verse:9,en:"Lest I be full, and deny thee, and say, Who is the LORD? or lest I be poor, and steal, and take the name of my God in vain.",pt:"para que eu de farto n\xe3o te negue, e diga: Quem \xe9 o Senhor? ou, empobrecendo, n\xe3o venha a furtar, e profane o nome de Deus."},{verse:10,en:"Accuse not a servant unto his master, lest he curse thee, and thou be found guilty.",pt:"N\xe3o calunies o servo diante de seu senhor, para que ele n\xe3o te amaldi\xe7oe e fiques tu culpado."},{verse:11,en:"There is a generation that curseth their father, and doth not bless their mother.",pt:"H\xe1 gente que amaldi\xe7oa a seu pai, e que n\xe3o bendiz a sua m\xe3e."},{verse:12,en:"There is a generation that are pure in their own eyes, and yet is not washed from their filthiness.",pt:"H\xe1 gente que \xe9 pura aos seus olhos, e contudo nunca foi lavada da sua imund\xedcia."},{verse:13,en:"There is a generation, O how lofty are their eyes! and their eyelids are lifted up.",pt:"H\xe1 gente cujos olhos s\xe3o altivos, e cujas p\xe1lpebras s\xe3o levantadas para cima."},{verse:14,en:"There is a generation, whose teeth are as swords, and their jaw teeth as knives, to devour the poor from off the earth, and the needy from among men.",pt:"H\xe1 gente cujos dentes s\xe3o como espadas; e cujos queixais sao como facas, para devorarem da terra os aflitos, e os necessitados dentre os homens."},{verse:15,en:"The horseleach hath two daughters, crying, Give, give. There are three things that are never satisfied, yea, four things say not, It is enough:",pt:"A sanguessuga tem duas filhas, a saber: D\xe1, D\xe1. H\xe1 tr\xeas coisas que nunca se fartam; sim, quatro que nunca dizem: Basta;"},{verse:16,en:"The grave; and the barren womb; the earth that is not filled with water; and the fire that saith not, It is enough.",pt:"o Seol, a madre est\xe9ril, a terra que n\xe3o se farta d'\xe1gua, e o fogo que nunca diz: Basta."},{verse:17,en:"The eye that mocketh at his father, and despiseth to obey his mother, the ravens of the valley shall pick it out, and the young eagles shall eat it.",pt:"Os olhos que zombam do pai, ou desprezam a obedi\xeancia \xe0 m\xe3e, ser\xe3o arrancados pelos corvos do vale e devorados pelos filhos da \xe1guia."},{verse:18,en:"There be three things which are too wonderful for me, yea, four which I know not:",pt:"H\xe1 tr\xeas coisas que s\xe3o maravilhosas demais para mim, sim, h\xe1 quatro que n\xe3o conhe\xe7o:"},{verse:19,en:"The way of an eagle in the air; the way of a serpent upon a rock; the way of a ship in the midst of the sea; and the way of a man with a maid.",pt:"o caminho da \xe1guia no ar, o caminho da cobra na penha, o caminho do navio no meio do mar, e o caminho do homem com uma virgem."},{verse:20,en:"Such is the way of an adulterous woman; she eateth, and wipeth her mouth, and saith, I have done no wickedness.",pt:"Tal \xe9 o caminho da mulher ad\xfaltera: ela come, e limpa a sua boca, e diz: n\xe3o pratiquei iniq\xfcidade."},{verse:21,en:"For three things the earth is disquieted, and for four which it cannot bear:",pt:"Por tr\xeas coisas estremece a terra, sim, h\xe1 quatro que n\xe3o pode suportar:"},{verse:22,en:"For a servant when he reigneth; and a fool when he is filled with meat;",pt:"o escravo quando reina; o tolo quando se farta de comer;"},{verse:23,en:"For an odious woman when she is married; and an handmaid that is heir to her mistress.",pt:"a mulher desdenhada quando se casa; e a serva quando fica herdeira da sua senhora."},{verse:24,en:"There be four things which are little upon the earth, but they are exceeding wise:",pt:"Quatro coisas h\xe1 na terra que s\xe3o pequenas, entretanto s\xe3o extremamente s\xe1bias;"},{verse:25,en:"The ants are a people not strong, yet they prepare their meat in the summer;",pt:"as formigas s\xe3o um povo sem for\xe7a, todavia no ver\xe3o preparam a sua comida;"},{verse:26,en:"The conies are but a feeble folk, yet make they their houses in the rocks;",pt:"os querogrilos s\xe3o um povo d\xe9bil, contudo fazem a sua casa nas rochas;"},{verse:27,en:"The locusts have no king, yet go they forth all of them by bands;",pt:"os gafanhotos n\xe3o t\xeam rei, contudo marcham todos enfileirados;"},{verse:28,en:"The spider taketh hold with her hands, and is in kings\u2019 palaces.",pt:"a lagartixa apanha-se com as m\xe3os, contudo anda nos pal\xe1cios dos reis."},{verse:29,en:"There be three things which go well, yea, four are comely in going:",pt:"H\xe1 tr\xeas que andam com eleg\xe2ncia, sim, quatro que se movem airosamente:"},{verse:30,en:"A lion which is strongest among beasts, and turneth not away for any;",pt:"o le\xe3o, que \xe9 o mais forte entre os animais, e que n\xe3o se desvia diante de ningu\xe9m;"},{verse:31,en:"A greyhound; an he goat also; and a king, against whom there is no rising up.",pt:"o galo emproado, o bode, e o rei \xe0 frente do seu povo."},{verse:32,en:"If thou hast done foolishly in lifting up thyself, or if thou hast thought evil, lay thine hand upon thy mouth.",pt:"Se procedeste loucamente em te elevares, ou se maquinaste o mal, p\xf5e a m\xe3o sobre a boca."},{verse:33,en:"Surely the churning of milk bringeth forth butter, and the wringing of the nose bringeth forth blood: so the forcing of wrath bringeth forth strife.",pt:"Como o espremer do leite produz queijo verde, e o espremer do nariz produz sangue, assim o espremer da ira produz contenda."}]}}),714,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Proverbs",bookPt:"Prov\xe9rbios",chapter:31,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"The words of king Lemuel, the prophecy that his mother taught him.",pt:"As palavras do rei Lemuel, rei de Mass\xe1, que lhe ensinou sua m\xe3e."},{verse:2,en:"What, my son? and what, the son of my womb? and what, the son of my vows?",pt:"Que te direi, filho meu? e que te direi, \xf3 filho do meu ventre? e que te direi, \xf3 filho dos meus votos?"},{verse:3,en:"Give not thy strength unto women, nor thy ways to that which destroyeth kings.",pt:"N\xe3o d\xeas \xe0s mulheres a tua for\xe7a, nem os teus caminhos \xe0s que destroem os reis."},{verse:4,en:"It is not for kings, O Lemuel, it is not for kings to drink wine; nor for princes strong drink:",pt:"N\xe3o \xe9 dos reis, \xf3 Lemuel, n\xe3o \xe9 dos reis beber vinho, nem dos pr\xedncipes desejar bebida forte;"},{verse:5,en:"Lest they drink, and forget the law, and pervert the judgment of any of the afflicted.",pt:"para que n\xe3o bebam, e se esque\xe7am da lei, e pervertam o direito de quem anda aflito."},{verse:6,en:"Give strong drink unto him that is ready to perish, and wine unto those that be of heavy hearts.",pt:"Dai bebida forte ao que est\xe1 para perecer, e o vinho ao que est\xe1 em amargura de esp\xedrito."},{verse:7,en:"Let him drink, and forget his poverty, and remember his misery no more.",pt:"Bebam e se esque\xe7am da sua pobreza, e da sua mis\xe9ria n\xe3o se lembrem mais."},{verse:8,en:"Open thy mouth for the dumb in the cause of all such as are appointed to destruction.",pt:"Abre a tua boca a favor do mudo, a favor do direito de todos os desamparados."},{verse:9,en:"Open thy mouth, judge righteously, and plead the cause of the poor and needy.",pt:"Abre a tua boca; julga retamente, e faze justi\xe7a aos pobres e aos necessitados."},{verse:10,en:"Who can find a virtuous woman? for her price is far above rubies.",pt:"\xc1lefe. Mulher virtuosa, quem a pode achar? Pois o seu valor muito excede ao de j\xf3ias preciosas."},{verse:11,en:"The heart of her husband doth safely trust in her, so that he shall have no need of spoil.",pt:"Bete. O cora\xe7\xe3o do seu marido confia nela, e n\xe3o lhe haver\xe1 falta de lucro."},{verse:12,en:"She will do him good and not evil all the days of her life.",pt:"Gu\xedmel. Ela lhe faz bem, e n\xe3o mal, todos os dias da sua vida."},{verse:13,en:"She seeketh wool, and flax, and worketh willingly with her hands.",pt:"D\xe1lete. Ela busca l\xe3 e linho, e trabalha de boa vontade com as m\xe3os."},{verse:14,en:"She is like the merchants\u2019 ships; she bringeth her food from afar.",pt:"H\xea. \xc9 como os navios do negociante; de longe traz o seu p\xe3o."},{verse:15,en:"She riseth also while it is yet night, and giveth meat to her household, and a portion to her maidens.",pt:"Vave. E quando ainda est\xe1 escuro, ela se levanta, e d\xe1 mantimento \xe0 sua casa, e a tarefa \xe0s suas servas."},{verse:16,en:"She considereth a field, and buyeth it: with the fruit of her hands she planteth a vineyard.",pt:"Zaine. Considera um campo, e compra-o; planta uma vinha com o fruto de suas maos."},{verse:17,en:"She girdeth her loins with strength, and strengtheneth her arms.",pt:"Hete. Cinge os seus lombos de for\xe7a, e fortalece os seus bra\xe7os."},{verse:18,en:"She perceiveth that her merchandise is good: her candle goeth not out by night.",pt:"Tete. Prova e v\xea que \xe9 boa a sua mercadoria; e a sua l\xe2mpada n\xe3o se apaga de noite."},{verse:19,en:"She layeth her hands to the spindle, and her hands hold the distaff.",pt:"Iode. Estende as m\xe3os ao fuso, e as suas m\xe3os pegam na roca."},{verse:20,en:"She stretcheth out her hand to the poor; yea, she reacheth forth her hands to the needy.",pt:"Cafe. Abre a m\xe3o para o pobre; sim, ao necessitado estende as suas m\xe3os."},{verse:21,en:"She is not afraid of the snow for her household: for all her household are clothed with scarlet.",pt:"L\xe2mede. N\xe3o tem medo da neve pela sua fam\xedlia; pois todos os da sua casa est\xe3o vestidos de escarlate."},{verse:22,en:"She maketh herself coverings of tapestry; her clothing is silk and purple.",pt:"Meme. Faz para si cobertas; de linho fino e de p\xfarpura \xe9 o seu vestido."},{verse:23,en:"Her husband is known in the gates, when he sitteth among the elders of the land.",pt:"Nune. Conhece-se o seu marido nas portas, quando se assenta entre os anci\xe3os da terra."},{verse:24,en:"She maketh fine linen, and selleth it; and delivereth girdles unto the merchant.",pt:"S\xe2merue. Faz vestidos de linho, e vende-os, e entrega cintas aos mercadores."},{verse:25,en:"Strength and honour are her clothing; and she shall rejoice in time to come.",pt:"Aine. A for\xe7a e a dignidade s\xe3o os seus vestidos; e ri-se do tempo vindouro."},{verse:26,en:"She openeth her mouth with wisdom; and in her tongue is the law of kindness.",pt:"P\xea. Abre a sua boca com sabedoria, e o ensino da benevol\xeancia est\xe1 na sua l\xedngua."},{verse:27,en:"She looketh well to the ways of her household, and eateth not the bread of idleness.",pt:"Tsad\xea. Olha pelo governo de sua casa, e n\xe3o come o p\xe3o da pregui\xe7a."},{verse:28,en:"Her children arise up, and call her blessed; her husband also, and he praiseth her.",pt:"C\xf4fe. Levantam-se seus filhos, e lhe chamam bem-aventurada, como tamb\xe9m seu marido, que a louva, dizendo:"},{verse:29,en:"Many daughters have done virtuously, but thou excellest them all.",pt:"Reche. Muitas mulheres t\xeam procedido virtuosamente, mas tu a todas sobrepujas."},{verse:30,en:"Favour is deceitful, and beauty is vain: but a woman that feareth the LORD, she shall be praised.",pt:"Chine. Enganosa \xe9 a gra\xe7a, e v\xe3 \xe9 a formosura; mas a mulher que teme ao Senhor, essa ser\xe1 louvada."},{verse:31,en:"Give her of the fruit of her hands; and let her own works praise her in the gates.",pt:"Tau. Dai-lhe do fruto das suas m\xe3os, e louvem-na nas portas as suas obras."}]}}),715,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Paul, a servant of Jesus Christ, called to be an apostle, separated unto the gospel of God,",pt:"Paulo, servo de Jesus Cristo, chamado para ser ap\xf3stolo, separado para o evangelho de Deus,"},{verse:2,en:"(Which he had promised afore by his prophets in the holy scriptures,)",pt:"que ele antes havia prometido pelos seus profetas nas santas Escrituras,"},{verse:3,en:"Concerning his Son Jesus Christ our Lord, which was made of the seed of David according to the flesh;",pt:"acerca de seu Filho, que nasceu da descend\xeancia de Davi segundo a carne,"},{verse:4,en:"And declared to be the Son of God with power, according to the spirit of holiness, by the resurrection from the dead:",pt:"e que com poder foi declarado Filho de Deus segundo o esp\xedrito de santidade, pela ressurrei\xe7\xe3o dentre os mortos - Jesus Cristo nosso Senhor,"},{verse:5,en:"By whom we have received grace and apostleship, for obedience to the faith among all nations, for his name:",pt:"pelo qual recebemos a gra\xe7a e o apostolado, por amor do seu nome, para a obedi\xeancia da f\xe9 entre todos os gentios,"},{verse:6,en:"Among whom are ye also the called of Jesus Christ:",pt:"entre os quais sois tamb\xe9m v\xf3s chamados para serdes de Jesus Cristo;"},{verse:7,en:"To all that be in Rome, beloved of God, called to be saints: Grace to you and peace from God our Father, and the Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"a todos os que estais em Roma, amados de Deus, chamados para serdes santos: Gra\xe7a a v\xf3s, e paz da parte de Deus nosso Pai, e do Senhor Jesus Cristo."},{verse:8,en:"First, I thank my God through Jesus Christ for you all, that your faith is spoken of throughout the whole world.",pt:"Primeiramente dou gra\xe7as ao meu Deus, mediante Jesus Cristo, por todos v\xf3s, porque em todo o mundo \xe9 anunciada a vossa f\xe9."},{verse:9,en:"For God is my witness, whom I serve with my spirit in the gospel of his Son, that without ceasing I make mention of you always in my prayers;",pt:"Pois Deus, a quem sirvo em meu esp\xedrito, no evangelho de seu Filho, me \xe9 testemunha de como incessantemente fa\xe7o men\xe7\xe3o de v\xf3s,"},{verse:10,en:"Making request, if by any means now at length I might have a prosperous journey by the will of God to come unto you.",pt:"pedindo sempre em minhas ora\xe7\xf5es que, afinal, pela vontade de Deus, se me ofere\xe7a boa ocasi\xe3o para ir ter convosco."},{verse:11,en:"For I long to see you, that I may impart unto you some spiritual gift, to the end ye may be established;",pt:"Porque desejo muito ver-vos, para vos comunicar algum dom espiritual, a fim de que sejais fortalecidos;"},{verse:12,en:"That is, that I may be comforted together with you by the mutual faith both of you and me.",pt:"isto \xe9, para que juntamente convosco eu seja consolado em v\xf3s pela f\xe9 m\xfatua, vossa e minha."},{verse:13,en:"Now I would not have you ignorant, brethren, that oftentimes I purposed to come unto you, (but was let hitherto,) that I might have some fruit among you also, even as among other Gentiles.",pt:"E n\xe3o quero que ignoreis, irm\xe3os, que muitas vezes propus visitar-vos (mas at\xe9 agora tenho sido impedido), para conseguir algum fruto entre v\xf3s, como tamb\xe9m entre os demais gentios."},{verse:14,en:"I am debtor both to the Greeks, and to the Barbarians; both to the wise, and to the unwise.",pt:"Eu sou devedor, tanto a gregos como a b\xe1rbaros, tanto a s\xe1bios como a ignorantes."},{verse:15,en:"So, as much as in me is, I am ready to preach the gospel to you that are at Rome also.",pt:"De modo que, quanto est\xe1 em mim, estou pronto para anunciar o evangelho tamb\xe9m a v\xf3s que estais em Roma."},{verse:16,en:"For I am not ashamed of the gospel of Christ: for it is the power of God unto salvation to every one that believeth; to the Jew first, and also to the Greek.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o me envergonho do evangelho, pois \xe9 o poder de Deus para salva\xe7\xe3o de todo aquele que cr\xea; primeiro do judeu, e tamb\xe9m do grego."},{verse:17,en:"For therein is the righteousness of God revealed from faith to faith: as it is written, The just shall live by faith.",pt:"Porque no evangelho \xe9 revelada, de f\xe9 em f\xe9, a justi\xe7a de Deus, como est\xe1 escrito: Mas o justo viver\xe1 da f\xe9."},{verse:18,en:"For the wrath of God is revealed from heaven against all ungodliness and unrighteousness of men, who hold the truth in unrighteousness;",pt:"Pois do c\xe9u \xe9 revelada a ira de Deus contra toda a impiedade e injusti\xe7a dos homens que det\xeam a verdade em injusti\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"Because that which may be known of God is manifest in them; for God hath shewed it unto them.",pt:"Porquanto, o que de Deus se pode conhecer, neles se manifesta, porque Deus lho manifestou."},{verse:20,en:"For the invisible things of him from the creation of the world are clearly seen, being understood by the things that are made, even his eternal power and Godhead; so that they are without excuse:",pt:"Pois os seus atributos invis\xedveis, o seu eterno poder e divindade, s\xe3o claramente vistos desde a cria\xe7\xe3o do mundo, sendo percebidos mediante as coisas criadas, de modo que eles s\xe3o inescus\xe1veis;"},{verse:21,en:"Because that, when they knew God, they glorified him not as God, neither were thankful; but became vain in their imaginations, and their foolish heart was darkened.",pt:"porquanto, tendo conhecido a Deus, contudo n\xe3o o glorificaram como Deus, nem lhe deram gra\xe7as, antes nas suas especula\xe7\xf5es se desvaneceram, e o seu cora\xe7\xe3o insensato se obscureceu."},{verse:22,en:"Professing themselves to be wise, they became fools,",pt:"Dizendo-se s\xe1bios, tornaram-se estultos,"},{verse:23,en:"And changed the glory of the uncorruptible God into an image made like to corruptible man, and to birds, and fourfooted beasts, and creeping things.",pt:"e mudaram a gl\xf3ria do Deus incorrupt\xedvel em semelhan\xe7a da imagem de homem corrupt\xedvel, e de aves, e de quadr\xfapedes, e de r\xe9pteis."},{verse:24,en:"Wherefore God also gave them up to uncleanness through the lusts of their own hearts, to dishonour their own bodies between themselves:",pt:"Por isso Deus os entregou, nas concupisc\xeancias de seus cora\xe7\xf5es, \xe0 imund\xedcia, para serem os seus corpos desonrados entre si;"},{verse:25,en:"Who changed the truth of God into a lie, and worshipped and served the creature more than the Creator, who is blessed for ever. Amen.",pt:"pois trocaram a verdade de Deus pela mentira, e adoraram e serviram \xe0 criatura antes que ao Criador, que \xe9 bendito eternamente. Am\xe9m."},{verse:26,en:"For this cause God gave them up unto vile affections: for even their women did change the natural use into that which is against nature:",pt:"Pelo que Deus os entregou a paix\xf5es infames. Porque at\xe9 as suas mulheres mudaram o uso natural no que \xe9 contr\xe1rio \xe0 natureza;"},{verse:27,en:"And likewise also the men, leaving the natural use of the woman, burned in their lust one toward another; men with men working that which is unseemly, and receiving in themselves that recompence of their error which was meet.",pt:"semelhantemente, tamb\xe9m os var\xf5es, deixando o uso natural da mulher, se inflamaram em sua sensualidade uns para como os outros, var\xe3o com var\xe3o, cometendo torpeza e recebendo em si mesmos a devida recompensa do seu erro."},{verse:28,en:"And even as they did not like to retain God in their knowledge, God gave them over to a reprobate mind, to do those things which are not convenient;",pt:"E assim como eles rejeitaram o conhecimento de Deus, Deus, por sua vez, os entregou a um sentimento depravado, para fazerem coisas que n\xe3o conv\xeam;"},{verse:29,en:"Being filled with all unrighteousness, fornication, wickedness, covetousness, maliciousness; full of envy, murder, debate, deceit, malignity; whisperers,",pt:"estando cheios de toda a injusti\xe7a, mal\xedcia, cobi\xe7a, maldade; cheios de inveja, homic\xeddio, contenda, dolo, malignidade;"},{verse:30,en:"Backbiters, haters of God, despiteful, proud, boasters, inventors of evil things, disobedient to parents,",pt:"sendo murmuradores, detratores, aborrecedores de Deus, injuriadores, soberbos, presun\xe7osos, inventores de males, desobedientes ao pais;"},{verse:31,en:"Without understanding, covenantbreakers, without natural affection, implacable, unmerciful:",pt:"n\xe9scios, infi\xe9is nos contratos, sem afei\xe7\xe3o natural, sem miseric\xf3rdia;"},{verse:32,en:"Who knowing the judgment of God, that they which commit such things are worthy of death, not only do the same, but have pleasure in them that do them.",pt:"os quais, conhecendo bem o decreto de Deus, que declara dignos de morte os que tais coisas praticam, n\xe3o somente as fazem, mas tamb\xe9m aprovam os que as praticam."}]}}),716,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,s,n,r){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Therefore thou art inexcusable, O man, whosoever thou art that judgest: for wherein thou judgest another, thou condemnest thyself; for thou that judgest doest the same things.",pt:"Portanto, \xe9s inescus\xe1vel, \xf3 homem, qualquer que sejas, quando julgas, porque te condenas a ti mesmo naquilo em que julgas a outro; pois tu que julgas, praticas o mesmo."},{verse:2,en:"But we are sure that the judgment of God is according to truth against them which commit such things.",pt:"E bem sabemos que o ju\xedzo de Deus \xe9 segundo a verdade, contra os que tais coisas praticam."},{verse:3,en:"And thinkest thou this, O man, that judgest them which do such things, and doest the same, that thou shalt escape the judgment of God?",pt:"E tu, \xf3 homem, que julgas os que praticam tais coisas, cuidas que, fazendo-as tu, escapar\xe1s ao ju\xedzo de Deus?"},{verse:4,en:"Or despisest thou the riches of his goodness and forbearance and longsuffering; not knowing that the goodness of God leadeth thee to repentance?",pt:"Ou desprezas tu as riquezas da sua benignidade, e paci\xeancia e longanimidade, ignorando que a benignidade de Deus te conduz ao arrependimento?"},{verse:5,en:"But after thy hardness and impenitent heart treasurest up unto thyself wrath against the day of wrath and revelation of the righteous judgment of God;",pt:"Mas, segundo a tua dureza e teu cora\xe7\xe3o impenitente, entesouras ira para ti no dia da ira e da revela\xe7\xe3o do justo ju\xedzo de Deus,"},{verse:6,en:"Who will render to every man according to his deeds:",pt:"que retribuir\xe1 a cada um segundo as suas obras;"},{verse:7,en:"To them who by patient continuance in well doing seek for glory and honour and immortality, eternal life:",pt:"a saber: a vida eterna aos que, com perseveran\xe7a em favor o bem, procuram gl\xf3ria, e honra e incorrup\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:8,en:"But unto them that are contentious, and do not obey the truth, but obey unrighteousness, indignation and wrath,",pt:"mas ira e indigna\xe7\xe3o aos que s\xe3o contenciosos, e desobedientes \xe0 iniq\xfcidade;"},{verse:9,en:"Tribulation and anguish, upon every soul of man that doeth evil, of the Jew first, and also of the Gentile;",pt:"tribula\xe7\xe3o e ang\xfastia sobre a alma de todo homem que pratica o mal, primeiramente do judeu, e tamb\xe9m do grego;"},{verse:10,en:"But glory, honour, and peace, to every man that worketh good, to the Jew first, and also to the Gentile:",pt:"gl\xf3ria, por\xe9m, e honra e paz a todo aquele que pratica o bem, primeiramente ao judeu, e tamb\xe9m ao grego;"},{verse:11,en:"For there is no respect of persons with God.",pt:"pois para com Deus n\xe3o h\xe1 acep\xe7\xe3o de pessoas."},{verse:12,en:"For as many as have sinned without law shall also perish without law: and as many as have sinned in the law shall be judged by the law;",pt:"Porque todos os que sem lei pecaram, sem lei tamb\xe9m perecer\xe3o; e todos os que sob a lei pecaram, pela lei ser\xe3o julgados."},{verse:13,en:"(For not the hearers of the law are just before God, but the doers of the law shall be justified.",pt:"Pois n\xe3o s\xe3o justos diante de Deus os que s\xf3 ouvem a lei; mas ser\xe3o justificados os que praticam a lei"},{verse:14,en:"For when the Gentiles, which have not the law, do by nature the things contained in the law, these, having not the law, are a law unto themselves:",pt:"(porque, quando os gentios, que n\xe3o t\xeam lei, fazem por natureza as coisas da lei, eles, embora n\xe3o tendo lei, para si mesmos s\xe3o lei."},{verse:15,en:"Which shew the work of the law written in their hearts, their conscience also bearing witness, and their thoughts the mean while accusing or else excusing one another;)",pt:"pois mostram a obra da lei escrita em seus cora\xe7\xf5es, testificando juntamente a sua consci\xeancia e os seus pensamentos, quer acusando-os, quer defendendo-os),"},{verse:16,en:"In the day when God shall judge the secrets of men by Jesus Christ according to my gospel.",pt:"no dia em que Deus h\xe1 de julgar os segredos dos homens, por Cristo Jesus, segundo o meu evangelho."},{verse:17,en:"Behold, thou art called a Jew, and restest in the law, and makest thy boast of God,",pt:"Mas se tu \xe9s chamado judeu, e repousas na lei, e te glorias em Deus;"},{verse:18,en:"And knowest his will, and approvest the things that are more excellent, being instructed out of the law;",pt:"e conheces a sua vontade e aprovas as coisas excelentes, sendo instru\xeddo na lei;"},{verse:19,en:"And art confident that thou thyself art a guide of the blind, a light of them which are in darkness,",pt:"e confias que \xe9s guia dos cegos, luz dos que est\xe3o em trevas,"},{verse:20,en:"An instructor of the foolish, a teacher of babes, which hast the form of knowledge and of the truth in the law.",pt:"instruidor dos n\xe9scios, mestre de crian\xe7as, que tens na lei a forma da ci\xeancia e da verdade;"},{verse:21,en:"Thou therefore which teachest another, teachest thou not thyself? thou that preachest a man should not steal, dost thou steal?",pt:"tu, pois, que ensinas a outrem, n\xe3o te ensinas a ti mesmo? Tu, que pregas que n\xe3o se deve furtar, furtas?"},{verse:22,en:"Thou that sayest a man should not commit adultery, dost thou commit adultery? thou that abhorrest idols, dost thou commit sacrilege?",pt:"Tu, que dizes que n\xe3o se deve cometer adult\xe9rio, adult\xe9ras? Tu, que abominas os \xeddolos, roubas os templos?"},{verse:23,en:"Thou that makest thy boast of the law, through breaking the law dishonourest thou God?",pt:"Tu, que te glorias na lei, desonras a Deus pela transgress\xe3o da lei?"},{verse:24,en:"For the name of God is blasphemed among the Gentiles through you, as it is written.",pt:"Assim pois, por vossa causa, o nome de Deus \xe9 blasfemado entre os gentios, como est\xe1 escrito."},{verse:25,en:"For circumcision verily profiteth, if thou keep the law: but if thou be a breaker of the law, thy circumcision is made uncircumcision.",pt:"Porque a circuncis\xe3o \xe9, na verdade, proveitosa, se guardares a lei; mas se tu \xe9s transgressor da lei, a tua circuncis\xe3o tem-se tornado em incircuncis\xe3o."},{verse:26,en:"Therefore if the uncircumcision keep the righteousness of the law, shall not his uncircumcision be counted for circumcision?",pt:"Se, pois, a incircuncis\xe3o guardar os preceitos da lei, porventura a incircuncis\xe3o n\xe3o ser\xe1 reputada como circuncis\xe3o?"},{verse:27,en:"And shall not uncircumcision which is by nature, if it fulfil the law, judge thee, who by the letter and circumcision dost transgress the law?",pt:"E a incircuncis\xe3o que por natureza o \xe9, se cumpre a lei, julgar\xe1 a ti, que com a letra e a circuncis\xe3o \xe9s transgressor da lei."},{verse:28,en:"For he is not a Jew, which is one outwardly; neither is that circumcision, which is outward in the flesh:",pt:"Porque n\xe3o \xe9 judeu o que o \xe9 exteriormente, nem \xe9 circuncis\xe3o a que o \xe9 exteriormente na carne."},{verse:29,en:"But he is a Jew, which is one inwardly; and circumcision is that of the heart, in the spirit, and not in the letter; whose praise is not of men, but of God.",pt:"Mas \xe9 judeu aquele que o \xe9 interiormente, e circuncis\xe3o \xe9 a do cora\xe7\xe3o, no esp\xedrito, e n\xe3o na letra; cujo louvor n\xe3o prov\xe9m dos homens, mas de Deus."}]}}),717,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"What advantage then hath the Jew? or what profit is there of circumcision?",pt:"Que vantagem, pois, tem o judeu? ou qual a utilidade da circuncis\xe3o?"},{verse:2,en:"Much every way: chiefly, because that unto them were committed the oracles of God.",pt:"Muita, em todo sentido; primeiramente, porque lhe foram confiados os or\xe1culos de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"For what if some did not believe? shall their unbelief make the faith of God without effect?",pt:"Pois qu\xea? Se alguns foram infi\xe9is, porventura a sua infidelidade anular\xe1 a fidelidade de Deus?"},{verse:4,en:"God forbid: yea, let God be true, but every man a liar; as it is written, That thou mightest be justified in thy sayings, and mightest overcome when thou art judged.",pt:"De modo nenhum; antes seja Deus verdadeiro, e todo homem mentiroso; como est\xe1 escrito: Para que sejas justificado em tuas palavras, e ven\xe7as quando fores julgado."},{verse:5,en:"But if our unrighteousness commend the righteousness of God, what shall we say? Is God unrighteous who taketh vengeance? (I speak as a man)",pt:"E, se a nossa injusti\xe7a prova a justi\xe7a de Deus, que diremos? Acaso Deus, que castiga com ira, \xe9 injusto? (Falo como homem.)"},{verse:6,en:"God forbid: for then how shall God judge the world?",pt:"De modo nenhum; do contr\xe1rio, como julgar\xe1 Deus o mundo?"},{verse:7,en:"For if the truth of God hath more abounded through my lie unto his glory; why yet am I also judged as a sinner?",pt:"Mas, se pela minha mentira abundou mais a verdade de Deus para sua gl\xf3ria, por que sou eu ainda julgado como pecador?"},{verse:8,en:"And not rather, (as we be slanderously reported, and as some affirm that we say,) Let us do evil, that good may come? whose damnation is just.",pt:"E por que n\xe3o dizemos: Fa\xe7amos o mal para que venha o bem? - como alguns caluniosamente afirmam que dizemos; a condena\xe7\xe3o dos quais \xe9 justa."},{verse:9,en:"What then? are we better than they? No, in no wise: for we have before proved both Jews and Gentiles, that they are all under sin;",pt:"Pois qu\xea? Somos melhores do que eles? De maneira nenhuma, pois j\xe1 demonstramos que, tanto judeus como gregos, todos est\xe3o debaixo do pecado;"},{verse:10,en:"As it is written, There is none righteous, no, not one:",pt:"como est\xe1 escrito: N\xe3o h\xe1 justo, nem sequer um."},{verse:11,en:"There is none that understandeth, there is none that seeketh after God.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 quem entenda; n\xe3o h\xe1 quem busque a Deus."},{verse:12,en:"They are all gone out of the way, they are together become unprofitable; there is none that doeth good, no, not one.",pt:"Todos se extraviaram; juntamente se fizeram in\xfateis. N\xe3o h\xe1 quem fa\xe7a o bem, n\xe3o h\xe1 nem um s\xf3."},{verse:13,en:"Their throat is an open sepulchre; with their tongues they have used deceit; the poison of asps is under their lips:",pt:"A sua garganta \xe9 um sepulcro aberto; com as suas l\xednguas tratam enganosamente; pe\xe7onha de \xe1spides est\xe1 debaixo dos seus l\xe1bios;"},{verse:14,en:"Whose mouth is full of cursing and bitterness:",pt:"a sua boca est\xe1 cheia de maldi\xe7\xe3o e amargura."},{verse:15,en:"Their feet are swift to shed blood:",pt:"Os seus p\xe9s s\xe3o ligeiros para derramar sangue."},{verse:16,en:"Destruction and misery are in their ways:",pt:"Nos seus caminhos h\xe1 destrui\xe7\xe3o e mis\xe9ria;"},{verse:17,en:"And the way of peace have they not known:",pt:"e n\xe3o conheceram o caminho da paz."},{verse:18,en:"There is no fear of God before their eyes.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 temor de Deus diante dos seus olhos."},{verse:19,en:"Now we know that what things soever the law saith, it saith to them who are under the law: that every mouth may be stopped, and all the world may become guilty before God.",pt:"Ora, n\xf3s sabemos que tudo o que a lei diz, aos que est\xe3o debaixo da lei o diz, para que se cale toda boca e todo o mundo fique sujeito ao ju\xedzo de Deus;"},{verse:20,en:"Therefore by the deeds of the law there shall no flesh be justified in his sight: for by the law is the knowledge of sin.",pt:"porquanto pelas obras da lei nenhum homem ser\xe1 justificado diante dele; pois o que vem pela lei \xe9 o pleno conhecimento do pecado."},{verse:21,en:"But now the righteousness of God without the law is manifested, being witnessed by the law and the prophets;",pt:"Mas agora, sem lei, tem-se manifestado a justi\xe7a de Deus, que \xe9 atestada pela lei e pelos profetas;"},{verse:22,en:"Even the righteousness of God which is by faith of Jesus Christ unto all and upon all them that believe: for there is no difference:",pt:"isto \xe9, a justi\xe7a de Deus pela f\xe9 em Jesus Cristo para todos os que cr\xeaem; pois n\xe3o h\xe1 distin\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:23,en:"For all have sinned, and come short of the glory of God;",pt:"Porque todos pecaram e destitu\xeddos est\xe3o da gl\xf3ria de Deus;"},{verse:24,en:"Being justified freely by his grace through the redemption that is in Christ Jesus:",pt:"sendo justificados gratuitamente pela sua gra\xe7a, mediante a reden\xe7\xe3o que h\xe1 em Cristo Jesus,"},{verse:25,en:"Whom God hath set forth to be a propitiation through faith in his blood, to declare his righteousness for the remission of sins that are past, through the forbearance of God;",pt:"ao qual Deus prop\xf4s como propicia\xe7\xe3o, pela f\xe9, no seu sangue, para demonstra\xe7\xe3o da sua justi\xe7a por ter ele na sua paci\xeancia, deixado de lado os delitos outrora cometidos;"},{verse:26,en:"To declare, I say, at this time his righteousness: that he might be just, and the justifier of him which believeth in Jesus.",pt:"para demonstra\xe7\xe3o da sua justi\xe7a neste tempo presente, para que ele seja justo e tamb\xe9m justificador daquele que tem f\xe9 em Jesus."},{verse:27,en:"Where is boasting then? It is excluded. By what law? of works? Nay: but by the law of faith.",pt:"Onde est\xe1 logo a jact\xe2ncia? Foi exclu\xedda. Por que lei? Das obras? N\xe3o; mas pela lei da f\xe9."},{verse:28,en:"Therefore we conclude that a man is justified by faith without the deeds of the law.",pt:"conclu\xedmos pois que o homem \xe9 justificado pela f\xe9 sem as obras da lei."},{verse:29,en:"Is he the God of the Jews only? is he not also of the Gentiles? Yes, of the Gentiles also:",pt:"\xc9 porventura Deus somente dos judeus? N\xe3o \xe9 tamb\xe9m dos gentios? Tamb\xe9m dos gentios, certamente,"},{verse:30,en:"Seeing it is one God, which shall justify the circumcision by faith, and uncircumcision through faith.",pt:"se \xe9 que Deus \xe9 um s\xf3, que pela f\xe9 h\xe1 de justificar a circuncis\xe3o, e tamb\xe9m por meio da f\xe9 a incircuncis\xe3o."},{verse:31,en:"Do we then make void the law through faith? God forbid: yea, we establish the law.",pt:"Anulamos, pois, a lei pela f\xe9? De modo nenhum; antes estabelecemos a lei."}]}}),718,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"What shall we say then that Abraham our father, as pertaining to the flesh, hath found?",pt:"Que diremos, pois, ter alcan\xe7ado Abra\xe3o, nosso pai segundo a carne?"},{verse:2,en:"For if Abraham were justified by works, he hath whereof to glory; but not before God.",pt:"Porque, se Abra\xe3o foi justificado pelas obras, tem de que se gloriar, mas n\xe3o diante de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"For what saith the scripture? Abraham believed God, and it was counted unto him for righteousness.",pt:"Pois, que diz a Escritura? Creu Abra\xe3o a Deus, e isso lhe foi imputado como justi\xe7a."},{verse:4,en:"Now to him that worketh is the reward not reckoned of grace, but of debt.",pt:"Ora, ao que trabalha n\xe3o se lhe conta a recompensa como d\xe1diva, mas sim como d\xedvida;"},{verse:5,en:"But to him that worketh not, but believeth on him that justifieth the ungodly, his faith is counted for righteousness.",pt:"por\xe9m ao que n\xe3o trabalha, mas cr\xea naquele que justifica o \xedmpio, a sua f\xe9 lhe \xe9 contada como justi\xe7a;"},{verse:6,en:"Even as David also describeth the blessedness of the man, unto whom God imputeth righteousness without works,",pt:"assim tamb\xe9m Davi declara bem-aventurado o homem a quem Deus atribui a justi\xe7a sem as obras, dizendo:"},{verse:7,en:"Saying, Blessed are they whose iniquities are forgiven, and whose sins are covered.",pt:"Bem-aventurados aqueles cujas iniq\xfcidades s\xe3o perdoadas, e cujos pecados s\xe3o cobertos."},{verse:8,en:"Blessed is the man to whom the Lord will not impute sin.",pt:"Bem-aventurado o homem a quem o Senhor n\xe3o imputar\xe1 o pecado."},{verse:9,en:"Cometh this blessedness then upon the circumcision only, or upon the uncircumcision also? for we say that faith was reckoned to Abraham for righteousness.",pt:"Vem, pois, esta bem-aventuran\xe7a sobre a circuncis\xe3o somente, ou tamb\xe9m sobre a incircuncis\xe3o? Porque dizemos: A Abra\xe3o foi imputada a f\xe9 como justi\xe7a."},{verse:10,en:"How was it then reckoned? when he was in circumcision, or in uncircumcision? Not in circumcision, but in uncircumcision.",pt:"Como, pois, lhe foi imputada? Estando na circuncis\xe3o, ou na incircuncis\xe3o? N\xe3o na circuncis\xe3o, mas sim na incircuncis\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"And he received the sign of circumcision, a seal of the righteousness of the faith which he had yet being uncircumcised: that he might be the father of all them that believe, though they be not circumcised; that righteousness might be imputed unto them also:",pt:"E recebeu o sinal da circuncis\xe3o, selo da justi\xe7a da f\xe9 que teve quando ainda n\xe3o era circuncidado, para que fosse pai de todos os que cr\xeaem, estando eles na incircuncis\xe3o, a fim de que a justi\xe7a lhes seja imputada,"},{verse:12,en:"And the father of circumcision to them who are not of the circumcision only, but who also walk in the steps of that faith of our father Abraham, which he had being yet uncircumcised.",pt:"bem como fosse pai dos circuncisos, dos que n\xe3o somente s\xe3o da circuncis\xe3o, mas tamb\xe9m andam nas pisadas daquela f\xe9 que teve nosso pai Abra\xe3o, antes de ser circuncidado."},{verse:13,en:"For the promise, that he should be the heir of the world, was not to Abraham, or to his seed, through the law, but through the righteousness of faith.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o foi pela lei que veio a Abra\xe3o, ou \xe0 sua descend\xeancia, a promessa de que havia de ser herdeiro do mundo, mas pela justi\xe7a da f\xe9."},{verse:14,en:"For if they which are of the law be heirs, faith is made void, and the promise made of none effect:",pt:"Pois, se os que s\xe3o da lei s\xe3o herdeiros, logo a f\xe9 \xe9 v\xe3 e a promessa \xe9 anulada."},{verse:15,en:"Because the law worketh wrath: for where no law is, there is no transgression.",pt:"Porque a lei opera a ira; mas onde n\xe3o h\xe1 lei tamb\xe9m n\xe3o h\xe1 transgress\xe3o."},{verse:16,en:"Therefore it is of faith, that it might be by grace; to the end the promise might be sure to all the seed; not to that only which is of the law, but to that also which is of the faith of Abraham; who is the father of us all,",pt:"Porquanto procede da f\xe9 o ser herdeiro, para que seja segundo a gra\xe7a, a fim de que a promessa seja firme a toda a descend\xeancia, n\xe3o somente \xe0 que \xe9 da lei, mas tamb\xe9m \xe0 que \xe9 da f\xe9 que teve Abra\xe3o, o qual \xe9 pai de todos n\xf3s."},{verse:17,en:"(As it is written, I have made thee a father of many nations,) before him whom he believed, even God, who quickeneth the dead, and calleth those things which be not as though they were.",pt:"(como est\xe1 escrito: Por pai de muitas na\xe7\xf5es te constitu\xed) perante aquele no qual creu, a saber, Deus, que vivifica os mortos, e chama as coisas que n\xe3o s\xe3o, como se j\xe1 fossem."},{verse:18,en:"Who against hope believed in hope, that he might become the father of many nations, according to that which was spoken, So shall thy seed be.",pt:"O qual, em esperan\xe7a, creu contra a esperan\xe7a, para que se tornasse pai de muitas na\xe7\xf5es, conforme o que lhe fora dito: Assim ser\xe1 a tua descend\xeancia;"},{verse:19,en:"And being not weak in faith, he considered not his own body now dead, when he was about an hundred years old, neither yet the deadness of Sarah\u2019s womb:",pt:"e sem se enfraquecer na f\xe9, considerou o seu pr\xf3prio corpo j\xe1 amortecido (pois tinha quase cem anos), e o amortecimento do ventre de Sara;"},{verse:20,en:"He staggered not at the promise of God through unbelief; but was strong in faith, giving glory to God;",pt:"contudo, \xe0 vista da promessa de Deus, n\xe3o vacilou por incredulidade, antes foi fortalecido na f\xe9, dando gl\xf3ria a Deus,"},{verse:21,en:"And being fully persuaded that, what he had promised, he was able also to perform.",pt:"e estando cert\xedssimo de que o que Deus tinha prometido, tamb\xe9m era poderoso para o fazer."},{verse:22,en:"And therefore it was imputed to him for righteousness.",pt:"Pelo que tamb\xe9m isso lhe foi imputado como justi\xe7a."},{verse:23,en:"Now it was not written for his sake alone, that it was imputed to him;",pt:"Ora, n\xe3o \xe9 s\xf3 por causa dele que est\xe1 escrito que lhe foi imputado;"},{verse:24,en:"But for us also, to whom it shall be imputed, if we believe on him that raised up Jesus our Lord from the dead;",pt:"mas tamb\xe9m por causa de n\xf3s a quem h\xe1 de ser imputado, a n\xf3s os que cremos naquele que dos mortos ressuscitou a Jesus nosso Senhor;"},{verse:25,en:"Who was delivered for our offences, and was raised again for our justification.",pt:"o qual foi entregue por causa das nossas transgress\xf5es, e ressuscitado para a nossa justifica\xe7\xe3o."}]}}),719,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,n,r,t){n.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Therefore being justified by faith, we have peace with God through our Lord Jesus Christ:",pt:"Justificados, pois, pela f\xe9, tenhamos paz com Deus, por nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo,"},{verse:2,en:"By whom also we have access by faith into this grace wherein we stand, and rejoice in hope of the glory of God.",pt:"por quem obtivemos tamb\xe9m nosso acesso pela f\xe9 a esta gra\xe7a, na qual estamos firmes, e gloriemo-nos na esperan\xe7a da gl\xf3ria de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"And not only so, but we glory in tribulations also: knowing that tribulation worketh patience;",pt:"E n\xe3o somente isso, mas tamb\xe9m gloriemo-nos nas tribula\xe7\xf5es; sabendo que a tribula\xe7\xe3o produz a perseveran\xe7a,"},{verse:4,en:"And patience, experience; and experience, hope:",pt:"e a perseveran\xe7a a experi\xeancia, e a experi\xeancia a esperan\xe7a;"},{verse:5,en:"And hope maketh not ashamed; because the love of God is shed abroad in our hearts by the Holy Ghost which is given unto us.",pt:"e a esperan\xe7a n\xe3o desaponta, porquanto o amor de Deus est\xe1 derramado em nossos cora\xe7\xf5es pelo Esp\xedrito Santo que nos foi dado."},{verse:6,en:"For when we were yet without strength, in due time Christ died for the ungodly.",pt:"Pois, quando ainda \xe9ramos fracos, Cristo morreu a seu tempo pelos \xedmpios."},{verse:7,en:"For scarcely for a righteous man will one die: yet peradventure for a good man some would even dare to die.",pt:"Porque dificilmente haver\xe1 quem morra por um justo; pois poder\xe1 ser que pelo homem bondoso algu\xe9m ouse morrer."},{verse:8,en:"But God commendeth his love toward us, in that, while we were yet sinners, Christ died for us.",pt:"Mas Deus d\xe1 prova do seu amor para conosco, em que, quando \xe9ramos ainda pecadores, Cristo morreu por n\xf3s."},{verse:9,en:"Much more then, being now justified by his blood, we shall be saved from wrath through him.",pt:"Logo muito mais, sendo agora justificados pelo seu sangue, seremos por ele salvos da ira."},{verse:10,en:"For if, when we were enemies, we were reconciled to God by the death of his Son, much more, being reconciled, we shall be saved by his life.",pt:"Porque se n\xf3s, quando \xe9ramos inimigos, fomos reconciliados com Deus pela morte de seu Filho, muito mais, estando j\xe1 reconciliados, seremos salvos pela sua vida."},{verse:11,en:"And not only so, but we also joy in God through our Lord Jesus Christ, by whom we have now received the atonement.",pt:"E n\xe3o somente isso, mas tamb\xe9m nos gloriamos em Deus por nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo, pelo qual agora temos recebido a reconcilia\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Wherefore, as by one man sin entered into the world, and death by sin; and so death passed upon all men, for that all have sinned:",pt:"Portanto, assim como por um s\xf3 homem entrou o pecado no mundo, e pelo pecado a morte, assim tamb\xe9m a morte passou a todos os homens, porquanto todos pecaram."},{verse:13,en:"(For until the law sin was in the world: but sin is not imputed when there is no law.",pt:"Porque antes da lei j\xe1 estava o pecado no mundo, mas onde n\xe3o h\xe1 lei o pecado n\xe3o \xe9 levado em conta."},{verse:14,en:"Nevertheless death reigned from Adam to Moses, even over them that had not sinned after the similitude of Adam\u2019s transgression, who is the figure of him that was to come.",pt:"No entanto a morte reinou desde Ad\xe3o at\xe9 Mois\xe9s, mesmo sobre aqueles que n\xe3o pecaram \xe0 semelhan\xe7a da transgress\xe3o de Ad\xe3o o qual \xe9 figura daquele que havia de vir."},{verse:15,en:"But not as the offence, so also is the free gift. For if through the offence of one many be dead, much more the grace of God, and the gift by grace, which is by one man, Jesus Christ, hath abounded unto many.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o \xe9 assim o dom gratuito como a ofensa; porque, se pela ofensa de um morreram muitos, muito mais a gra\xe7a de Deus, e o dom pela gra\xe7a de um s\xf3 homem, Jesus Cristo, abund muitos."},{verse:16,en:"And not as it was by one that sinned, so is the gift: for the judgment was by one to condemnation, but the free gift is of many offences unto justification.",pt:"Tamb\xe9m n\xe3o \xe9 assim o dom como a ofensa, que veio por um s\xf3 que pecou; porque o ju\xedzo veio, na verdade, de uma s\xf3 ofensa para condena\xe7\xe3o, mas o dom gratuito veio de muitas ofensas para justifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"For if by one man\u2019s offence death reigned by one; much more they which receive abundance of grace and of the gift of righteousness shall reign in life by one, Jesus Christ.)",pt:"Porque, se pela ofensa de um s\xf3, a morte veio a reinar por esse, muito mais os que recebem a abund\xe2ncia da gra\xe7a, e do dom da justi\xe7a, reinar\xe3o em vida por um s\xf3, Jesus Cristo."},{verse:18,en:"Therefore as by the offence of one judgment came upon all men to condemnation; even so by the righteousness of one the free gift came upon all men unto justification of life.",pt:"Portanto, assim como por uma s\xf3 ofensa veio o ju\xedzo sobre todos os homens para condena\xe7\xe3o, assim tamb\xe9m por um s\xf3 ato de justi\xe7a veio a gra\xe7a sobre todos os homens para justifica\xe7\xe3o e vida."},{verse:19,en:"For as by one man\u2019s disobedience many were made sinners, so by the obedience of one shall many be made righteous.",pt:"Porque, assim como pela desobedi\xeancia de um s\xf3 homem muitos foram constitu\xeddos pecadores, assim tamb\xe9m pela obedi\xeancia de um muitos ser\xe3o constitu\xeddos justos."},{verse:20,en:"Moreover the law entered, that the offence might abound. But where sin abounded, grace did much more abound:",pt:"Sobreveio, por\xe9m, a lei para que a ofensa abundasse; mas, onde o pecado abundou, superabundou a gra\xe7a;"},{verse:21,en:"That as sin hath reigned unto death, even so might grace reign through righteousness unto eternal life by Jesus Christ our Lord.",pt:"para que, assim como o pecado veio a reinar na morte, assim tamb\xe9m viesse a reinar a gra\xe7a pela justi\xe7a para a vida eterna, por Jesus Cristo nosso Senhor."}]}}),720,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"What shall we say then? Shall we continue in sin, that grace may abound?",pt:"Que diremos, pois? Permaneceremos no pecado, para que abunde a gra\xe7a?"},{verse:2,en:"God forbid. How shall we, that are dead to sin, live any longer therein?",pt:"De modo nenhum. N\xf3s, que j\xe1 morremos para o pecado, como viveremos ainda nele?"},{verse:3,en:"Know ye not, that so many of us as were baptized into Jesus Christ were baptized into his death?",pt:"Ou, porventura, ignorais que todos quantos fomos batizados em Cristo Jesus fomos batizados na sua morte?"},{verse:4,en:"Therefore we are buried with him by baptism into death: that like as Christ was raised up from the dead by the glory of the Father, even so we also should walk in newness of life.",pt:"Fomos, pois, sepultados com ele pelo batismo na morte, para que, como Cristo foi ressuscitado dentre os mortos pela gl\xf3ria do Pai, assim andemos n\xf3s tamb\xe9m em novidade de vida."},{verse:5,en:"For if we have been planted together in the likeness of his death, we shall be also in the likeness of his resurrection:",pt:"Porque, se temos sido unidos a ele na semelhan\xe7a da sua morte, certamente tamb\xe9m o seremos na semelhan\xe7a da sua ressurrei\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:6,en:"Knowing this, that our old man is crucified with him, that the body of sin might be destroyed, that henceforth we should not serve sin.",pt:"sabendo isto, que o nosso homem velho foi crucificado com ele, para que o corpo do pecado fosse desfeito, a fim de n\xe3o servirmos mais ao pecado."},{verse:7,en:"For he that is dead is freed from sin.",pt:"Pois quem est\xe1 morto est\xe1 justificado do pecado."},{verse:8,en:"Now if we be dead with Christ, we believe that we shall also live with him:",pt:"Ora, se j\xe1 morremos com Cristo, cremos que tamb\xe9m com ele viveremos,"},{verse:9,en:"Knowing that Christ being raised from the dead dieth no more; death hath no more dominion over him.",pt:"sabendo que, tendo Cristo ressurgido dentre os mortos, j\xe1 n\xe3o morre mais; a morte n\xe3o mais tem dom\xednio sobre ele."},{verse:10,en:"For in that he died, he died unto sin once: but in that he liveth, he liveth unto God.",pt:"Pois quanto a ter morrido, de uma vez por todas morreu para o pecado, mas quanto a viver, vive para Deus."},{verse:11,en:"Likewise reckon ye also yourselves to be dead indeed unto sin, but alive unto God through Jesus Christ our Lord.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s considerai-vos como mortos para o pecado, mas vivos para Deus, em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:12,en:"Let not sin therefore reign in your mortal body, that ye should obey it in the lusts thereof.",pt:"N\xe3o reine, portanto, o pecado em vosso corpo mortal, para obedecerdes \xe0s suas concupisc\xeancias;"},{verse:13,en:"Neither yield ye your members as instruments of unrighteousness unto sin: but yield yourselves unto God, as those that are alive from the dead, and your members as instruments of righteousness unto God.",pt:"nem tampouco apresenteis os vossos membros ao pecado como instrumentos de iniq\xfcidade; mas apresentai-vos a Deus, como redivivos dentre os mortos, e os vossos membros a Deus, como instrumentos de justi\xe7a."},{verse:14,en:"For sin shall not have dominion over you: for ye are not under the law, but under grace.",pt:"Pois o pecado n\xe3o ter\xe1 dom\xednio sobre v\xf3s, porquanto n\xe3o estais debaixo da lei, mas debaixo da gra\xe7a."},{verse:15,en:"What then? shall we sin, because we are not under the law, but under grace? God forbid.",pt:"Pois qu\xea? Havemos de pecar porque n\xe3o estamos debaixo da lei, mas debaixo da gra\xe7a? De modo nenhum."},{verse:16,en:"Know ye not, that to whom ye yield yourselves servants to obey, his servants ye are to whom ye obey; whether of sin unto death, or of obedience unto righteousness?",pt:"N\xe3o sabeis que daquele a quem vos apresentais como servos para lhe obedecer, sois servos desse mesmo a quem obedeceis, seja do pecado para a morte, ou da obedi\xeancia para a justi\xe7a?"},{verse:17,en:"But God be thanked, that ye were the servants of sin, but ye have obeyed from the heart that form of doctrine which was delivered you.",pt:"Mas gra\xe7as a Deus que, embora tendo sido servos do pecado, obedecestes de cora\xe7\xe3o \xe0 forma de doutrina a que fostes entregues;"},{verse:18,en:"Being then made free from sin, ye became the servants of righteousness.",pt:"e libertos do pecado, fostes feitos servos da justi\xe7a."},{verse:19,en:"I speak after the manner of men because of the infirmity of your flesh: for as ye have yielded your members servants to uncleanness and to iniquity unto iniquity; even so now yield your members servants to righteousness unto holiness.",pt:"Falo como homem, por causa da fraqueza da vossa carne. Pois assim como apresentastes os vossos membros como servos da impureza e da iniq\xfcidade para iniq\xfcidade, assim apresentai agora os vossos membros como servos da justi\xe7a para santifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:20,en:"For when ye were the servants of sin, ye were free from righteousness.",pt:"Porque, quando \xe9reis servos do pecado, est\xe1veis livres em rela\xe7\xe3o \xe0 justi\xe7a."},{verse:21,en:"What fruit had ye then in those things whereof ye are now ashamed? for the end of those things is death.",pt:"E que fruto t\xednheis ent\xe3o das coisas de que agora vos envergonhais? pois o fim delas \xe9 a morte."},{verse:22,en:"But now being made free from sin, and become servants to God, ye have your fruit unto holiness, and the end everlasting life.",pt:"Mas agora, libertos do pecado, e feitos servos de Deus, tendes o vosso fruto para santifica\xe7\xe3o, e por fim a vida eterna."},{verse:23,en:"For the wages of sin is death; but the gift of God is eternal life through Jesus Christ our Lord.",pt:"Porque o sal\xe1rio do pecado \xe9 a morte, mas o dom gratuito de Deus \xe9 a vida eterna em Cristo Jesus nosso Senhor."}]}}),721,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,n,i){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:7,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Know ye not, brethren, (for I speak to them that know the law,) how that the law hath dominion over a man as long as he liveth?",pt:"Ou ignorais, irm\xe3os (pois falo aos que conhecem a lei), que a lei tem dom\xednio sobre o homem por todo o tempo que ele vive?"},{verse:2,en:"For the woman which hath an husband is bound by the law to her husband so long as he liveth; but if the husband be dead, she is loosed from the law of her husband.",pt:"Porque a mulher casada est\xe1 ligada pela lei a seu marido enquanto ele viver; mas, se ele morrer, ela est\xe1 livre da lei do marido."},{verse:3,en:"So then if, while her husband liveth, she be married to another man, she shall be called an adulteress: but if her husband be dead, she is free from that law; so that she is no adulteress, though she be married to another man.",pt:"De sorte que, enquanto viver o marido, ser\xe1 chamado ad\xfaltera, se for de outro homem; mas, se ele morrer, ela est\xe1 livre da lei, e assim n\xe3o ser\xe1 ad\xfaltera se for de outro marido."},{verse:4,en:"Wherefore, my brethren, ye also are become dead to the law by the body of Christ; that ye should be married to another, even to him who is raised from the dead, that we should bring forth fruit unto God.",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m v\xf3s, meus irm\xe3os, fostes mortos quanto \xe0 lei mediante o corpo de Cristo, para pertencerdes a outro, \xe0quele que ressurgiu dentre os mortos a fim de que demos fruto para Deus."},{verse:5,en:"For when we were in the flesh, the motions of sins, which were by the law, did work in our members to bring forth fruit unto death.",pt:"Pois, quando est\xe1vamos na carne, as paix\xf5es dos pecados, suscitadas pela lei, operavam em nossos membros para darem fruto para a morte."},{verse:6,en:"But now we are delivered from the law, that being dead wherein we were held; that we should serve in newness of spirit, and not in the oldness of the letter.",pt:"Mas agora fomos libertos da lei, havendo morrido para aquilo em que est\xe1vamos retidos, para servirmos em novidade de esp\xedrito, e n\xe3o na velhice da letra."},{verse:7,en:"What shall we say then? Is the law sin? God forbid. Nay, I had not known sin, but by the law: for I had not known lust, except the law had said, Thou shalt not covet.",pt:"Que diremos pois? \xc9 a lei pecado? De modo nenhum. Contudo, eu n\xe3o conheci o pecado sen\xe3o pela lei; porque eu n\xe3o conheceria a concupisc\xeancia, se a lei n\xe3o dissesse: N\xe3o cobi\xe7ar\xe1s."},{verse:8,en:"But sin, taking occasion by the commandment, wrought in me all manner of concupiscence. For without the law sin was dead.",pt:"Mas o pecado, tomando ocasi\xe3o, pelo mandamento operou em mim toda esp\xe9cie de concupisc\xeancia; porquanto onde n\xe3o h\xe1 lei est\xe1 morto o pecado."},{verse:9,en:"For I was alive without the law once: but when the commandment came, sin revived, and I died.",pt:"E outrora eu vivia sem a lei; mas assim que veio o mandamento, reviveu o pecado, e eu morri;"},{verse:10,en:"And the commandment, which was ordained to life, I found to be unto death.",pt:"e o mandamento que era para vida, esse achei que me era para morte."},{verse:11,en:"For sin, taking occasion by the commandment, deceived me, and by it slew me.",pt:"Porque o pecado, tomando ocasi\xe3o, pelo mandamento me enganou, e por ele me matou."},{verse:12,en:"Wherefore the law is holy, and the commandment holy, and just, and good.",pt:"De modo que a lei \xe9 santa, e o mandamento santo, justo e bom."},{verse:13,en:"Was then that which is good made death unto me? God forbid. But sin, that it might appear sin, working death in me by that which is good; that sin by the commandment might become exceeding sinful.",pt:"Logo o bom tornou-se morte para mim? De modo nenhum; mas o pecado, para que se mostrasse pecado, operou em mim a morte por meio do bem; a fim de que pelo mandamento o pecado se manifestasse excessivamente maligno."},{verse:14,en:"For we know that the law is spiritual: but I am carnal, sold under sin.",pt:"Porque bem sabemos que a lei \xe9 espiritual; mas eu sou carnal, vendido sob o pecado."},{verse:15,en:"For that which I do I allow not: for what I would, that do I not; but what I hate, that do I.",pt:"Pois o que fa\xe7o, n\xe3o o entendo; porque o que quero, isso n\xe3o pratico; mas o que aborre\xe7o, isso fa\xe7o."},{verse:16,en:"If then I do that which I would not, I consent unto the law that it is good.",pt:"E, se fa\xe7o o que n\xe3o quero, consinto com a lei, que \xe9 boa."},{verse:17,en:"Now then it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me.",pt:"Agora, por\xe9m, n\xe3o sou mais eu que fa\xe7o isto, mas o pecado que habita em mim."},{verse:18,en:"For I know that in me (that is, in my flesh,) dwelleth no good thing: for to will is present with me; but how to perform that which is good I find not.",pt:"Porque eu sei que em mim, isto \xe9, na minha carne, n\xe3o habita bem algum; com efeito o querer o bem est\xe1 em mim, mas o efetu\xe1-lo n\xe3o est\xe1."},{verse:19,en:"For the good that I would I do not: but the evil which I would not, that I do.",pt:"Pois n\xe3o fa\xe7o o bem que quero, mas o mal que n\xe3o quero, esse pratico."},{verse:20,en:"Now if I do that I would not, it is no more I that do it, but sin that dwelleth in me.",pt:"Ora, se eu fa\xe7o o que n\xe3o quero, j\xe1 o n\xe3o fa\xe7o eu, mas o pecado que habita em mim."},{verse:21,en:"I find then a law, that, when I would do good, evil is present with me.",pt:"Acho ent\xe3o esta lei em mim, que, mesmo querendo eu fazer o bem, o mal est\xe1 comigo."},{verse:22,en:"For I delight in the law of God after the inward man:",pt:"Porque, segundo o homem interior, tenho prazer na lei de Deus;"},{verse:23,en:"But I see another law in my members, warring against the law of my mind, and bringing me into captivity to the law of sin which is in my members.",pt:"mas vejo nos meus membros outra lei guerreando contra a lei do meu entendimento, e me levando cativo \xe0 lei do pecado, que est\xe1 nos meus membros."},{verse:24,en:"O wretched man that I am! who shall deliver me from the body of this death?",pt:"Miser\xe1vel homem que eu sou! quem me livrar\xe1 do corpo desta morte?"},{verse:25,en:"I thank God through Jesus Christ our Lord. So then with the mind I myself serve the law of God; but with the flesh the law of sin.",pt:"Gra\xe7as a Deus, por Jesus Cristo nosso Senhor! De modo que eu mesmo com o entendimento sirvo \xe0 lei de Deus, mas com a carne \xe0 lei do pecado."}]}}),722,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:8,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"There is therefore now no condemnation to them which are in Christ Jesus, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit.",pt:"Portanto, agora nenhuma condena\xe7\xe3o h\xe1 para os que est\xe3o em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:2,en:"For the law of the Spirit of life in Christ Jesus hath made me free from the law of sin and death.",pt:"Porque a lei do Esp\xedrito da vida, em Cristo Jesus, te livrou da lei do pecado e da morte."},{verse:3,en:"For what the law could not do, in that it was weak through the flesh, God sending his own Son in the likeness of sinful flesh, and for sin, condemned sin in the flesh:",pt:"Porquanto o que era imposs\xedvel \xe0 lei, visto que se achava fraca pela carne, Deus enviando o seu pr\xf3prio Filho em semelhan\xe7a da carne do pecado, e por causa do pecado, na carne condenou o pecado."},{verse:4,en:"That the righteousness of the law might be fulfilled in us, who walk not after the flesh, but after the Spirit.",pt:"para que a justa exig\xeancia da lei se cumprisse em n\xf3s, que n\xe3o andamos segundo a carne, mas segundo o Esp\xedrito."},{verse:5,en:"For they that are after the flesh do mind the things of the flesh; but they that are after the Spirit the things of the Spirit.",pt:"Pois os que s\xe3o segundo a carne inclinam-se para as coisas da carne; mas os que s\xe3o segundo o Esp\xedrito para as coisas do Esp\xedrito."},{verse:6,en:"For to be carnally minded is death; but to be spiritually minded is life and peace.",pt:"Porque a inclina\xe7\xe3o da carne \xe9 morte; mas a inclina\xe7\xe3o do Esp\xedrito \xe9 vida e paz."},{verse:7,en:"Because the carnal mind is enmity against God: for it is not subject to the law of God, neither indeed can be.",pt:"Porquanto a inclina\xe7\xe3o da carne \xe9 inimizade contra Deus, pois n\xe3o \xe9 sujeita \xe0 lei de Deus, nem em verdade o pode ser;"},{verse:8,en:"So then they that are in the flesh cannot please God.",pt:"e os que est\xe3o na carne n\xe3o podem agradar a Deus."},{verse:9,en:"But ye are not in the flesh, but in the Spirit, if so be that the Spirit of God dwell in you. Now if any man have not the Spirit of Christ, he is none of his.",pt:"V\xf3s, por\xe9m, n\xe3o estais na carne, mas no Esp\xedrito, se \xe9 que o Esp\xedrito de Deus habita em v\xf3s. Mas, se algu\xe9m n\xe3o tem o Esp\xedrito de Cristo, esse tal n\xe3o \xe9 dele."},{verse:10,en:"And if Christ be in you, the body is dead because of sin; but the Spirit is life because of righteousness.",pt:"Ora, se Cristo est\xe1 em v\xf3s, o corpo, na verdade, est\xe1 morto por causa do pecado, mas o esp\xedrito vive por causa da justi\xe7a."},{verse:11,en:"But if the Spirit of him that raised up Jesus from the dead dwell in you, he that raised up Christ from the dead shall also quicken your mortal bodies by his Spirit that dwelleth in you.",pt:"E, se o Esp\xedrito daquele que dos mortos ressuscitou a Jesus habita em v\xf3s, aquele que dos mortos ressuscitou a Cristo Jesus h\xe1 de vivificar tamb\xe9m os vossos corpos mortais, pelo seu Esp\xedrito que em v\xf3s habita."},{verse:12,en:"Therefore, brethren, we are debtors, not to the flesh, to live after the flesh.",pt:"Portanto, irm\xe3os, somos devedores, n\xe3o \xe0 carne para vivermos segundo a carne;"},{verse:13,en:"For if ye live after the flesh, ye shall die: but if ye through the Spirit do mortify the deeds of the body, ye shall live.",pt:"porque se viverdes segundo a carne, haveis de morrer; mas, se pelo Esp\xedrito mortificardes as obras do corpo, vivereis."},{verse:14,en:"For as many as are led by the Spirit of God, they are the sons of God.",pt:"Pois todos os que s\xe3o guiados pelo Esp\xedrito de Deus, esses s\xe3o filhos de Deus."},{verse:15,en:"For ye have not received the spirit of bondage again to fear; but ye have received the Spirit of adoption, whereby we cry, Abba, Father.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o recebestes o esp\xedrito de escravid\xe3o, para outra vez estardes com temor, mas recebestes o esp\xedrito de ado\xe7\xe3o, pelo qual clamamos: Aba, Pai!"},{verse:16,en:"The Spirit itself beareth witness with our spirit, that we are the children of God:",pt:"O Esp\xedrito mesmo testifica com o nosso esp\xedrito que somos filhos de Deus;"},{verse:17,en:"And if children, then heirs; heirs of God, and joint-heirs with Christ; if so be that we suffer with him, that we may be also glorified together.",pt:"e, se filhos, tamb\xe9m herdeiros, herdeiros de Deus e co-herdeiros de Cristo; se \xe9 certo que com ele padecemos, para que tamb\xe9m com ele sejamos glorificados."},{verse:18,en:"For I reckon that the sufferings of this present time are not worthy to be compared with the glory which shall be revealed in us.",pt:"Pois tenho para mim que as afli\xe7\xf5es deste tempo presente n\xe3o se podem comparar com a gl\xf3ria que em n\xf3s h\xe1 de ser revelada."},{verse:19,en:"For the earnest expectation of the creature waiteth for the manifestation of the sons of God.",pt:"Porque a cria\xe7\xe3o aguarda com ardente expectativa a revela\xe7\xe3o dos filhos de Deus."},{verse:20,en:"For the creature was made subject to vanity, not willingly, but by reason of him who hath subjected the same in hope,",pt:"Porquanto a cria\xe7\xe3o ficou sujeita \xe0 vaidade, n\xe3o por sua vontade, mas por causa daquele que a sujeitou,"},{verse:21,en:"Because the creature itself also shall be delivered from the bondage of corruption into the glorious liberty of the children of God.",pt:"na esperan\xe7a de que tamb\xe9m a pr\xf3pria cria\xe7\xe3o h\xe1 de ser liberta do cativeiro da corrup\xe7\xe3o, para a liberdade da gl\xf3ria dos filhos de Deus."},{verse:22,en:"For we know that the whole creation groaneth and travaileth in pain together until now.",pt:"Porque sabemos que toda a cria\xe7\xe3o, conjuntamente, geme e est\xe1 com dores de parto at\xe9 agora;"},{verse:23,en:"And not only they, but ourselves also, which have the firstfruits of the Spirit, even we ourselves groan within ourselves, waiting for the adoption, to wit, the redemption of our body.",pt:"e n\xe3o s\xf3 ela, mas at\xe9 n\xf3s, que temos as prim\xedcias do Esp\xedrito, tamb\xe9m gememos em n\xf3s mesmos, aguardando a nossa adora\xe7\xe3o, a saber, a reden\xe7\xe3o do nosso corpo."},{verse:24,en:"For we are saved by hope: but hope that is seen is not hope: for what a man seeth, why doth he yet hope for?",pt:"Porque na esperan\xe7a fomos salvos. Ora, a esperan\xe7a que se v\xea n\xe3o \xe9 esperan\xe7a; pois o que algu\xe9m v\xea, como o espera?"},{verse:25,en:"But if we hope for that we see not, then do we with patience wait for it.",pt:"Mas, se esperamos o que n\xe3o vemos, com paci\xeancia o aguardamos."},{verse:26,en:"Likewise the Spirit also helpeth our infirmities: for we know not what we should pray for as we ought: but the Spirit itself maketh intercession for us with groanings which cannot be uttered.",pt:"Do mesmo modo tamb\xe9m o Esp\xedrito nos ajuda na fraqueza; porque n\xe3o sabemos o que havemos de pedir como conv\xe9m, mas o Esp\xedrito mesmo intercede por n\xf3s com gemidos inexprim\xedveis."},{verse:27,en:"And he that searcheth the hearts knoweth what is the mind of the Spirit, because he maketh intercession for the saints according to the will of God.",pt:"E aquele que esquadrinha os cora\xe7\xf5es sabe qual \xe9 a inten\xe7\xe3o do Esp\xedrito: que ele, segundo a vontade de Deus, intercede pelos santos."},{verse:28,en:"And we know that all things work together for good to them that love God, to them who are the called according to his purpose.",pt:"E sabemos que todas as coisas concorrem para o bem daqueles que amam a Deus, daqueles que s\xe3o chamados segundo o seu prop\xf3sito."},{verse:29,en:"For whom he did foreknow, he also did predestinate to be conformed to the image of his Son, that he might be the firstborn among many brethren.",pt:"Porque os que dantes conheceu, tamb\xe9m os predestinou para serem conformes \xe0 imagem de seu Filho, a fim de que ele seja o primog\xeanito entre muitos irm\xe3os;"},{verse:30,en:"Moreover whom he did predestinate, them he also called: and whom he called, them he also justified: and whom he justified, them he also glorified.",pt:"e aos que predestinou, a estes tamb\xe9m chamou; e aos que chamou, a estes tamb\xe9m justificou; e aos que justificou, a estes tamb\xe9m glorificou."},{verse:31,en:"What shall we then say to these things? If God be for us, who can be against us?",pt:"Que diremos, pois, a estas coisas? Se Deus \xe9 por n\xf3s, quem ser\xe1 contra n\xf3s?"},{verse:32,en:"He that spared not his own Son, but delivered him up for us all, how shall he not with him also freely give us all things?",pt:"Aquele que nem mesmo a seu pr\xf3prio Filho poupou, antes o entregou por todos n\xf3s, como n\xe3o nos dar\xe1 tamb\xe9m com ele todas as coisas?"},{verse:33,en:"Who shall lay any thing to the charge of God\u2019s elect? It is God that justifieth.",pt:"Quem intentar\xe1 acusa\xe7\xe3o contra os escolhidos de Deus? \xc9 Deus quem os justifica;"},{verse:34,en:"Who is he that condemneth? It is Christ that died, yea rather, that is risen again, who is even at the right hand of God, who also maketh intercession for us.",pt:"Quem os condenar\xe1? Cristo Jesus \xe9 quem morreu, ou antes quem ressurgiu dentre os mortos, o qual est\xe1 \xe0 direita de Deus, e tamb\xe9m intercede por n\xf3s;"},{verse:35,en:"Who shall separate us from the love of Christ? shall tribulation, or distress, or persecution, or famine, or nakedness, or peril, or sword?",pt:"quem nos separar\xe1 do amor de Cristo? a tribula\xe7\xe3o, ou a ang\xfastia, ou a persegui\xe7\xe3o, ou a fome, ou a nudez, ou o perigo, ou a espada?"},{verse:36,en:"As it is written, For thy sake we are killed all the day long; we are accounted as sheep for the slaughter.",pt:"Como est\xe1 escrito: Por amor de ti somos entregues \xe0 morte o dia todo; fomos considerados como ovelhas para o matadouro."},{verse:37,en:"Nay, in all these things we are more than conquerors through him that loved us.",pt:"Mas em todas estas coisas somos mais que vencedores, por aquele que nos amou."},{verse:38,en:"For I am persuaded, that neither death, nor life, nor angels, nor principalities, nor powers, nor things present, nor things to come,",pt:"Porque estou certo de que, nem a morte, nem a vida, nem anjos, nem principados, nem coisas presentes, nem futuras, nem potestades,"},{verse:39,en:"Nor height, nor depth, nor any other creature, shall be able to separate us from the love of God, which is in Christ Jesus our Lord.",pt:"nem a altura, nem a profundidade, nem qualquer outra criatura nos poder\xe1 separar do amor de Deus, que est\xe1 em Cristo Jesus nosso Senhor."}]}}),723,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:9,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I say the truth in Christ, I lie not, my conscience also bearing me witness in the Holy Ghost,",pt:"Digo a verdade em Cristo, n\xe3o minto, dando testemunho comigo a minha consci\xeancia no Esp\xedrito Santo,"},{verse:2,en:"That I have great heaviness and continual sorrow in my heart.",pt:"que tenho grande tristeza e incessante dor no meu cora\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"For I could wish that myself were accursed from Christ for my brethren, my kinsmen according to the flesh:",pt:"Porque eu mesmo desejaria ser separado de Cristo, por amor de meus irm\xe3os, que s\xe3o meus parentes segundo a carne;"},{verse:4,en:"Who are Israelites; to whom pertaineth the adoption, and the glory, and the covenants, and the giving of the law, and the service of God, and the promises;",pt:"os quais s\xe3o israelitas, de quem \xe9 a ado\xe7\xe3o, e a gl\xf3ria, e os pactos, e a promulga\xe7\xe3o da lei, e o culto, e as promessas;"},{verse:5,en:"Whose are the fathers, and of whom as concerning the flesh Christ came, who is over all, God blessed for ever. Amen.",pt:"de quem s\xe3o os patriarcas; e de quem descende o Cristo segundo a carne, o qual \xe9 sobre todas as coisas, Deus bendito eternamente. Am\xe9m."},{verse:6,en:"Not as though the word of God hath taken none effect. For they are not all Israel, which are of Israel:",pt:"N\xe3o que a palavra de Deus haja falhado. Porque nem todos os que s\xe3o de Israel s\xe3o israelitas;"},{verse:7,en:"Neither, because they are the seed of Abraham, are they all children: but, In Isaac shall thy seed be called.",pt:"nem por serem descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o s\xe3o todos filhos; mas: Em Isaque ser\xe1 chamada a tua descend\xeancia."},{verse:8,en:"That is, They which are the children of the flesh, these are not the children of God: but the children of the promise are counted for the seed.",pt:"Isto \xe9, n\xe3o s\xe3o os filhos da carne que s\xe3o filhos de Deus; mas os filhos da promessa s\xe3o contados como descend\xeancia."},{verse:9,en:"For this is the word of promise, At this time will I come, and Sarah shall have a son.",pt:"Porque a palavra da promessa \xe9 esta: Por este tempo virei, e Sara ter\xe1 um filho."},{verse:10,en:"And not only this; but when Rebecca also had conceived by one, even by our father Isaac;",pt:"E n\xe3o somente isso, mas tamb\xe9m a Rebeca, que havia concebido de um, de Isaque, nosso pai"},{verse:11,en:"(For the children being not yet born, neither having done any good or evil, that the purpose of God according to election might stand, not of works, but of him that calleth;)",pt:"(pois n\xe3o tendo os g\xeameos ainda nascido, nem tendo praticado bem ou mal, para que o prop\xf3sito de Deus segundo a elei\xe7\xe3o permanecesse firme, n\xe3o por causa das obras, mas por aquele que chama),"},{verse:12,en:"It was said unto her, The elder shall serve the younger.",pt:"foi-lhe dito: O maior servir\xe1 o menor."},{verse:13,en:"As it is written, Jacob have I loved, but Esau have I hated.",pt:"Como est\xe1 escrito: Amei a Jac\xf3, e aborreci a Esa\xfa."},{verse:14,en:"What shall we say then? Is there unrighteousness with God? God forbid.",pt:"Que diremos, pois? H\xe1 injusti\xe7a da parte de Deus? De modo nenhum."},{verse:15,en:"For he saith to Moses, I will have mercy on whom I will have mercy, and I will have compassion on whom I will have compassion.",pt:"Porque diz a Mois\xe9s: Terei miseric\xf3rdia de quem me aprouver ter misericordia, e terei compaix\xe3o de quem me aprouver ter compaix\xe3o."},{verse:16,en:"So then it is not of him that willeth, nor of him that runneth, but of God that sheweth mercy.",pt:"Assim, pois, isto n\xe3o depende do que quer, nem do que corre, mas de Deus que usa de miseric\xf3rdia."},{verse:17,en:"For the scripture saith unto Pharaoh, Even for this same purpose have I raised thee up, that I might shew my power in thee, and that my name might be declared throughout all the earth.",pt:"Pois diz a Escritura a Fara\xf3: Para isto mesmo te levantei: para em ti mostrar o meu poder, e para que seja anunciado o meu nome em toda a terra."},{verse:18,en:"Therefore hath he mercy on whom he will have mercy, and whom he will he hardeneth.",pt:"Portanto, tem miseric\xf3rdia de quem quer, e a quem quer endurece."},{verse:19,en:"Thou wilt say then unto me, Why doth he yet find fault? For who hath resisted his will?",pt:"Dir-me-\xe1s ent\xe3o. Por que se queixa ele ainda? Pois, quem resiste \xe0 sua vontade?"},{verse:20,en:"Nay but, O man, who art thou that repliest against God? Shall the thing formed say to him that formed it, Why hast thou made me thus?",pt:"Mas, \xf3 homem, quem \xe9s tu, que a Deus replicas? Porventura a coisa formada dir\xe1 ao que a formou: Por que me fizeste assim?"},{verse:21,en:"Hath not the potter power over the clay, of the same lump to make one vessel unto honour, and another unto dishonour?",pt:"Ou n\xe3o tem o oleiro poder sobre o barro, para da mesma massa fazer um vaso para uso honroso e outro para uso desonroso?"},{verse:22,en:"What if God, willing to shew his wrath, and to make his power known, endured with much longsuffering the vessels of wrath fitted to destruction:",pt:"E que direis, se Deus, querendo mostrar a sua ira, e dar a conhecer o seu poder, suportou com muita paci\xeancia os vasos da ira, preparados para a perdi\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:23,en:"And that he might make known the riches of his glory on the vessels of mercy, which he had afore prepared unto glory,",pt:"para que tamb\xe9m desse a conhecer as riquezas da sua gl\xf3ria nos vasos de miseric\xf3rdia, que de antem\xe3o preparou para a gl\xf3ria,"},{verse:24,en:"Even us, whom he hath called, not of the Jews only, but also of the Gentiles?",pt:"os quais somos n\xf3s, a quem tamb\xe9m chamou, n\xe3o s\xf3 dentre os judeus, mas tamb\xe9m dentre os gentios?"},{verse:25,en:"As he saith also in Osee, I will call them my people, which were not my people; and her beloved, which was not beloved.",pt:"Como diz ele tamb\xe9m em Os\xe9ias: Chamarei meu povo ao que n\xe3o era meu povo; e amada \xe0 que n\xe3o era amada."},{verse:26,en:"And it shall come to pass, that in the place where it was said unto them, Ye are not my people; there shall they be called the children of the living God.",pt:"E suceder\xe1 que no lugar em que lhes foi dito: V\xf3s n\xe3o sois meu povo; a\xed ser\xe3o chamados filhos do Deus vivo."},{verse:27,en:"Esaias also crieth concerning Israel, Though the number of the children of Israel be as the sand of the sea, a remnant shall be saved:",pt:"Tamb\xe9m Isa\xedas exclama acerca de Israel: Ainda que o n\xfamero dos filhos de Israel seja como a areia do mar, o remanescente \xe9 que ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:28,en:"For he will finish the work, and cut it short in righteousness: because a short work will the Lord make upon the earth.",pt:"Porque o Senhor executar\xe1 a sua palavra sobre a terra, consumando-a e abreviando-a."},{verse:29,en:"And as Esaias said before, Except the Lord of Sabaoth had left us a seed, we had been as Sodoma, and been made like unto Gomorrha.",pt:"E como antes dissera Isa\xedas: Se o Senhor dos Ex\xe9rcitos n\xe3o nos tivesse deixado descend\xeancia, ter\xedamos sido feitos como Sodoma, e ser\xedamos semelhantes a Gomorra."},{verse:30,en:"What shall we say then? That the Gentiles, which followed not after righteousness, have attained to righteousness, even the righteousness which is of faith.",pt:"Que diremos pois? Que os gentios, que n\xe3o buscavam a justi\xe7a, alcan\xe7aram a justi\xe7a, mas a justi\xe7a que vem da f\xe9."},{verse:31,en:"But Israel, which followed after the law of righteousness, hath not attained to the law of righteousness.",pt:"Mas Israel, buscando a lei da justi\xe7a, n\xe3o atingiu esta lei."},{verse:32,en:"Wherefore? Because they sought it not by faith, but as it were by the works of the law. For they stumbled at that stumblingstone;",pt:"Por que? Porque n\xe3o a buscavam pela f\xe9, mas como que pelas obras; e trope\xe7aram na pedra de trope\xe7o;"},{verse:33,en:"As it is written, Behold, I lay in Sion a stumblingstone and rock of offence: and whosoever believeth on him shall not be ashamed.",pt:"como est\xe1 escrito: Eis que eu ponho em Si\xe3o uma pedra de trope\xe7o; e uma rocha de esc\xe2ndalo; e quem nela crer n\xe3o ser\xe1 confundido."}]}}),724,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,t,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:10,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Brethren, my heart\u2019s desire and prayer to God for Israel is, that they might be saved.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, o bom desejo do meu cora\xe7\xe3o e a minha s\xfaplica a Deus por Israel \xe9 para sua salva\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"For I bear them record that they have a zeal of God, but not according to knowledge.",pt:"Porque lhes dou testemunho de que t\xeam zelo por Deus, mas n\xe3o com entendimento."},{verse:3,en:"For they being ignorant of God\u2019s righteousness, and going about to establish their own righteousness, have not submitted themselves unto the righteousness of God.",pt:"Porquanto, n\xe3o conhecendo a justi\xe7a de Deus, e procurando estabelecer a sua pr\xf3pria, n\xe3o se sujeitaram \xe0 justi\xe7a de Deus."},{verse:4,en:"For Christ is the end of the law for righteousness to every one that believeth.",pt:"Pois Cristo \xe9 o fim da lei para justificar a todo aquele que cr\xea."},{verse:5,en:"For Moses describeth the righteousness which is of the law, That the man which doeth those things shall live by them.",pt:"Porque Mois\xe9s escreve que o homem que pratica a justi\xe7a que vem da lei viver\xe1 por ela."},{verse:6,en:"But the righteousness which is of faith speaketh on this wise, Say not in thine heart, Who shall ascend into heaven? (that is, to bring Christ down from above:)",pt:"Mas a justi\xe7a que vem da f\xe9 diz assim: N\xe3o digas em teu cora\xe7\xe3o: Quem subir\xe1 ao c\xe9u? (isto \xe9, a trazer do alto a Cristo;)"},{verse:7,en:"Or, Who shall descend into the deep? (that is, to bring up Christ again from the dead.)",pt:"ou: Quem descer\xe1 ao abismo? (isto \xe9, a fazer subir a Cristo dentre os mortos)."},{verse:8,en:"But what saith it? The word is nigh thee, even in thy mouth, and in thy heart: that is, the word of faith, which we preach;",pt:"Mas que diz? A palavra est\xe1 perto de ti, na tua boca e no teu cora\xe7\xe3o; isto \xe9, a palavra da f\xe9, que pregamos."},{verse:9,en:"That if thou shalt confess with thy mouth the Lord Jesus, and shalt believe in thine heart that God hath raised him from the dead, thou shalt be saved.",pt:"Porque, se com a tua boca confessares a Jesus como Senhor, e em teu cora\xe7\xe3o creres que Deus o ressuscitou dentre os mortos, ser\xe1 salvo;"},{verse:10,en:"For with the heart man believeth unto righteousness; and with the mouth confession is made unto salvation.",pt:"pois \xe9 com o cora\xe7\xe3o que se cr\xea para a justi\xe7a, e com a boca se faz confiss\xe3o para a salva\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"For the scripture saith, Whosoever believeth on him shall not be ashamed.",pt:"Porque a Escritura diz: Ningu\xe9m que nele cr\xea ser\xe1 confundido."},{verse:12,en:"For there is no difference between the Jew and the Greek: for the same Lord over all is rich unto all that call upon him.",pt:"Porquanto n\xe3o h\xe1 distin\xe7\xe3o entre judeu e grego; porque o mesmo Senhor o \xe9 de todos, rico para com todos os que o invocam."},{verse:13,en:"For whosoever shall call upon the name of the Lord shall be saved.",pt:"Porque: Todo aquele que invocar o nome do Senhor ser\xe1 salvo."},{verse:14,en:"How then shall they call on him in whom they have not believed? and how shall they believe in him of whom they have not heard? and how shall they hear without a preacher?",pt:"Como pois invocar\xe3o aquele em quem n\xe3o creram? e como crer\xe3o naquele de quem n\xe3o ouviram falar? e como ouvir\xe3o, se n\xe3o h\xe1 quem pregue?"},{verse:15,en:"And how shall they preach, except they be sent? as it is written, How beautiful are the feet of them that preach the gospel of peace, and bring glad tidings of good things!",pt:"E como pregar\xe3o, se n\xe3o forem enviados? assim como est\xe1 escrito: Qu\xe3o formosos os p\xe9s dos que anunciam coisas boas!"},{verse:16,en:"But they have not all obeyed the gospel. For Esaias saith, Lord, who hath believed our report?",pt:"Mas nem todos deram ouvidos ao evangelho; pois Isa\xedas diz: Senhor, quem deu cr\xe9dito \xe0 nossa mensagem?"},{verse:17,en:"So then faith cometh by hearing, and hearing by the word of God.",pt:"Logo a f\xe9 \xe9 pelo ouvir, e o ouvir pela palavra de Cristo."},{verse:18,en:"But I say, Have they not heard? Yes verily, their sound went into all the earth, and their words unto the ends of the world.",pt:"Mas pergunto: Porventura n\xe3o ouviram? Sim, por certo: Por toda a terra saiu a voz deles, e as suas palavras at\xe9 os confins do mundo."},{verse:19,en:"But I say, Did not Israel know? First Moses saith, I will provoke you to jealousy by them that are no people, and by a foolish nation I will anger you.",pt:"Mas pergunto ainda: Porventura Israel n\xe3o o soube? Primeiro diz Mois\xe9s: Eu vos porei em ci\xfames com aqueles que n\xe3o s\xe3o povo, com um povo insensato vos provocarei \xe0 ira."},{verse:20,en:"But Esaias is very bold, and saith, I was found of them that sought me not; I was made manifest unto them that asked not after me.",pt:"E Isa\xedas ousou dizer: Fui achado pelos que n\xe3o me buscavam, manifestei-me aos que por mim n\xe3o perguntavam."},{verse:21,en:"But to Israel he saith, All day long I have stretched forth my hands unto a disobedient and gainsaying people.",pt:"Quanto a Israel, por\xe9m, diz: Todo o dia estendi as minhas m\xe3os a um povo rebelde e contradizente."}]}}),725,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:11,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I say then, Hath God cast away his people? God forbid. For I also am an Israelite, of the seed of Abraham, of the tribe of Benjamin.",pt:"Pergunto, pois: Acaso rejeitou Deus ao seu povo? De modo nenhum; por que eu tamb\xe9m sou israelita, da descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o, da tribo de Benjamim."},{verse:2,en:"God hath not cast away his people which he foreknew. Wot ye not what the scripture saith of Elias? how he maketh intercession to God against Israel, saying,",pt:"Deus n\xe3o rejeitou ao seu povo que antes conheceu. Ou n\xe3o sabeis o que a Escritura diz de Elias, como ele fala a Deus contra Israel, dizendo:"},{verse:3,en:"Lord, they have killed thy prophets, and digged down thine altars; and I am left alone, and they seek my life.",pt:"Senhor, mataram os teus profetas, e derribaram os teus altares; e s\xf3 eu fiquei, e procuraram tirar-me a vida?"},{verse:4,en:"But what saith the answer of God unto him? I have reserved to myself seven thousand men, who have not bowed the knee to the image of Baal.",pt:"Mas que lhe diz a resposta divina? Reservei para mim sete mil var\xf5es que n\xe3o dobraram os joelhos diante de Baal."},{verse:5,en:"Even so then at this present time also there is a remnant according to the election of grace.",pt:"Assim, pois, tamb\xe9m no tempo presente ficou um remanescente segundo a elei\xe7\xe3o da gra\xe7a."},{verse:6,en:"And if by grace, then is it no more of works: otherwise grace is no more grace. But if it be of works, then is it no more grace: otherwise work is no more work.",pt:"Mas se \xe9 pela gra\xe7a, j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9 pelas obras; de outra maneira, a gra\xe7a j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9 gra\xe7a."},{verse:7,en:"What then? Israel hath not obtained that which he seeketh for; but the election hath obtained it, and the rest were blinded",pt:"Pois qu\xea? O que Israel busca, isso n\xe3o o alcan\xe7ou; mas os eleitos alcan\xe7aram; e os outros foram endurecidos,"},{verse:8,en:"(According as it is written, God hath given them the spirit of slumber, eyes that they should not see, and ears that they should not hear;) unto this day.",pt:"como est\xe1 escrito: Deus lhes deu um esp\xedrito entorpecido, olhos para n\xe3o verem, e ouvidos para n\xe3o ouvirem, at\xe9 o dia de hoje."},{verse:9,en:"And David saith, Let their table be made a snare, and a trap, and a stumblingblock, and a recompence unto them:",pt:"E Davi diz: Torne-se-lhes a sua mesa em la\xe7o, e em armadilha, e em trope\xe7o, e em retribui\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"Let their eyes be darkened, that they may not see, and bow down their back alway.",pt:"escure\xe7am-se-lhes os olhos para n\xe3o verem, e tu encurva-lhes sempre as costas."},{verse:11,en:"I say then, Have they stumbled that they should fall? God forbid: but rather through their fall salvation is come unto the Gentiles, for to provoke them to jealousy.",pt:"Logo, pergunto: Porventura trope\xe7aram de modo que ca\xedssem? De maneira nenhuma, antes pelo seu trope\xe7o veio a salva\xe7\xe3o aos gentios, para os incitar \xe0 emula\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"Now if the fall of them be the riches of the world, and the diminishing of them the riches of the Gentiles; how much more their fulness?",pt:"Ora se o trope\xe7o deles \xe9 a riqueza do mundo, e a sua diminui\xe7\xe3o a riqueza dos gentios, quanto mais a sua plenitude!"},{verse:13,en:"For I speak to you Gentiles, inasmuch as I am the apostle of the Gentiles, I magnify mine office:",pt:"Mas \xe9 a v\xf3s, gentios, que falo; e, porquanto sou ap\xf3stolo dos gentios, glorifico o meu minist\xe9rio,"},{verse:14,en:"If by any means I may provoke to emulation them which are my flesh, and might save some of them.",pt:"para ver se de algum modo posso incitar \xe0 emula\xe7\xe3o os da minha ra\xe7a e salvar alguns deles."},{verse:15,en:"For if the casting away of them be the reconciling of the world, what shall the receiving of them be, but life from the dead?",pt:"Porque, se a sua rejei\xe7\xe3o \xe9 a reconcilia\xe7\xe3o do mundo, qual ser\xe1 a sua admiss\xe3o, sen\xe3o a vida dentre os mortos?"},{verse:16,en:"For if the firstfruit be holy, the lump is also holy: and if the root be holy, so are the branches.",pt:"Se as prim\xedcias s\xe3o santas, tamb\xe9m a massa o \xe9; e se a raiz \xe9 santa, tamb\xe9m os ramos o s\xe3o."},{verse:17,en:"And if some of the branches be broken off, and thou, being a wild olive tree, wert graffed in among them, and with them partakest of the root and fatness of the olive tree;",pt:"E se alguns dos ramos foram quebrados, e tu, sendo zambujeiro, foste enxertado no lugar deles e feito participante da raiz e da seiva da oliveira,"},{verse:18,en:"Boast not against the branches. But if thou boast, thou bearest not the root, but the root thee.",pt:"n\xe3o te glories contra os ramos; e, se contra eles te gloriares, n\xe3o \xe9s tu que sustentas a raiz, mas a raiz a ti."},{verse:19,en:"Thou wilt say then, The branches were broken off, that I might be graffed in.",pt:"Dir\xe1s ent\xe3o: Os ramos foram quebrados, para que eu fosse enxertado."},{verse:20,en:"Well; because of unbelief they were broken off, and thou standest by faith. Be not highminded, but fear:",pt:"Est\xe1 bem; pela sua incredulidade foram quebrados, e tu pela tua f\xe9 est\xe1s firme. N\xe3o te ensoberbe\xe7as, mas teme;"},{verse:21,en:"For if God spared not the natural branches, take heed lest he also spare not thee.",pt:"porque, se Deus n\xe3o poupou os ramos naturais, n\xe3o te poupar\xe1 a ti."},{verse:22,en:"Behold therefore the goodness and severity of God: on them which fell, severity; but toward thee, goodness, if thou continue in his goodness: otherwise thou also shalt be cut off.",pt:"Considera pois a bondade e a severidade de Deus: para com os que ca\xedram, severidade; para contigo, a bondade de Deus, se permaneceres nessa bondade; do contr\xe1rio tamb\xe9m tu ser\xe1s cortado."},{verse:23,en:"And they also, if they abide not still in unbelief, shall be graffed in: for God is able to graff them in again.",pt:"E ainda eles, se n\xe3o permanecerem na incredulidade, ser\xe3o enxertados; porque poderoso \xe9 Deus para os enxertar novamente."},{verse:24,en:"For if thou wert cut out of the olive tree which is wild by nature, and wert graffed contrary to nature into a good olive tree: how much more shall these, which be the natural branches, be graffed into their own olive tree?",pt:"Pois se tu foste cortado do natural zambujeiro, e contra a natureza enxertado em oliveira leg\xedtima, quanto mais n\xe3o ser\xe3o enxertados na sua pr\xf3pria oliveira esses que s\xe3o ramos naturais!"},{verse:25,en:"For I would not, brethren, that ye should be ignorant of this mystery, lest ye should be wise in your own conceits; that blindness in part is happened to Israel, until the fulness of the Gentiles be come in.",pt:"Porque n\xe3o quero, irm\xe3os, que ignoreis este mist\xe9rio (para que n\xe3o presumais de v\xf3s mesmos): que o endurecimento veio em parte sobre Israel, at\xe9 que a plenitude dos gentios haja entrado;"},{verse:26,en:"And so all Israel shall be saved: as it is written, There shall come out of Sion the Deliverer, and shall turn away ungodliness from Jacob:",pt:"e assim todo o Israel ser\xe1 salvo, como est\xe1 escrito: Vir\xe1 de Si\xe3o o Libertador, e desviar\xe1 de Jac\xf3 as impiedades;"},{verse:27,en:"For this is my covenant unto them, when I shall take away their sins.",pt:"e este ser\xe1 o meu pacto com eles, quando eu tirar os seus pecados."},{verse:28,en:"As concerning the gospel, they are enemies for your sakes: but as touching the election, they are beloved for the fathers\u2019 sakes.",pt:"Quanto ao evangelho, eles na verdade, s\xe3o inimigos por causa de v\xf3s; mas, quanto \xe0 elei\xe7\xe3o, amados por causa dos pais."},{verse:29,en:"For the gifts and calling of God are without repentance.",pt:"Porque os dons e a voca\xe7\xe3o de Deus s\xe3o irretrat\xe1veis."},{verse:30,en:"For as ye in times past have not believed God, yet have now obtained mercy through their unbelief:",pt:"Pois, assim como v\xf3s outrora fostes desobedientes a Deus, mas agora alcan\xe7astes miseric\xf3rdia pela desobedi\xeancia deles,"},{verse:31,en:"Even so have these also now not believed, that through your mercy they also may obtain mercy.",pt:"assim tamb\xe9m estes agora foram desobedientes, para tamb\xe9m alcan\xe7arem miseric\xf3rdia pela miseric\xf3rdia a v\xf3s demonstrada."},{verse:32,en:"For God hath concluded them all in unbelief, that he might have mercy upon all.",pt:"Porque Deus encerrou a todos debaixo da desobedi\xeancia, a fim de usar de miseric\xf3rdia para com todos."},{verse:33,en:"O the depth of the riches both of the wisdom and knowledge of God! how unsearchable are his judgments, and his ways past finding out!",pt:"\xd3 profundidade das riquezas, tanto da sabedoria, como da ci\xeancia de Deus! Qu\xe3o insond\xe1veis s\xe3o os seus ju\xedzos, e qu\xe3o inescrut\xe1veis os seus caminhos!"},{verse:34,en:"For who hath known the mind of the Lord? or who hath been his counsellor?",pt:"Pois, quem jamais conheceu a mente do Senhor? ou quem se fez seu conselheiro?"},{verse:35,en:"Or who hath first given to him, and it shall be recompensed unto him again?",pt:"Ou quem lhe deu primeiro a ele, para que lhe seja recompensado?"},{verse:36,en:"For of him, and through him, and to him, are all things: to whom be glory for ever. Amen.",pt:"Porque dele, e por ele, e para ele, s\xe3o todas as coisas; gl\xf3ria, pois, a ele eternamente. Am\xe9m."}]}}),726,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,i,t,n){i.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:12,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I beseech you therefore, brethren, by the mercies of God, that ye present your bodies a living sacrifice, holy, acceptable unto God, which is your reasonable service.",pt:"Rogo-vos pois, irm\xe3os, pela compaix\xe3o de Deus, que apresenteis os vossos corpos como um sacrif\xedcio vivo, santo e agrad\xe1vel a Deus, que \xe9 o vosso culto racional."},{verse:2,en:"And be not conformed to this world: but be ye transformed by the renewing of your mind, that ye may prove what is that good, and acceptable, and perfect, will of God.",pt:"E n\xe3o vos conformeis a este mundo, mas transformai-vos pela renova\xe7\xe3o da vossa mente, para que experimenteis qual seja a boa, agrad\xe1vel, e perfeita vontade de Deus."},{verse:3,en:"For I say, through the grace given unto me, to every man that is among you, not to think of himself more highly than he ought to think; but to think soberly, according as God hath dealt to every man the measure of faith.",pt:"Porque pela gra\xe7a que me foi dada, digo a cada um dentre v\xf3s que n\xe3o tenha de si mesmo mais alto conceito do que conv\xe9m; mas que pense de si sobriamente, conforme a medida da f\xe9 que Deus, repartiu a cada um."},{verse:4,en:"For as we have many members in one body, and all members have not the same office:",pt:"Pois assim como em um corpo temos muitos membros, e nem todos os membros t\xeam a mesma fun\xe7\xe3o,"},{verse:5,en:"So we, being many, are one body in Christ, and every one members one of another.",pt:"assim n\xf3s, embora muitos, somos um s\xf3 corpo em Cristo, e individualmente uns dos outros."},{verse:6,en:"Having then gifts differing according to the grace that is given to us, whether prophecy, let us prophesy according to the proportion of faith;",pt:"De modo que, tendo diferentes dons segundo a gra\xe7a que nos foi dada, se \xe9 profecia, seja ela segundo a medida da f\xe9;"},{verse:7,en:"Or ministry, let us wait on our ministering: or he that teacheth, on teaching;",pt:"se \xe9 minist\xe9rio, seja em ministrar; se \xe9 ensinar, haja dedica\xe7\xe3o ao ensino;"},{verse:8,en:"Or he that exhorteth, on exhortation: he that giveth, let him do it with simplicity; he that ruleth, with diligence; he that sheweth mercy, with cheerfulness.",pt:"ou que exorta, use esse dom em exortar; o que reparte, fa\xe7a-o com liberalidade; o que preside, com zelo; o que usa de miseric\xf3rdia, com alegria."},{verse:9,en:"Let love be without dissimulation. Abhor that which is evil; cleave to that which is good.",pt:"O amor seja n\xe3o fingido. Aborrecei o mal e apegai-vos ao bem."},{verse:10,en:"Be kindly affectioned one to another with brotherly love; in honour preferring one another;",pt:"Amai-vos cordialmente uns aos outros com amor fraternal, preferindo-vos em honra uns aos outros;"},{verse:11,en:"Not slothful in business; fervent in spirit; serving the Lord;",pt:"n\xe3o sejais vagarosos no cuidado; sede fervorosos no esp\xedrito, servindo ao Senhor;"},{verse:12,en:"Rejoicing in hope; patient in tribulation; continuing instant in prayer;",pt:"alegrai-vos na esperan\xe7a, sede pacientes na tribula\xe7\xe3o, perseverai na ora\xe7\xe3o;"},{verse:13,en:"Distributing to the necessity of saints; given to hospitality.",pt:"acudi aos santos nas suas necessidades, exercei a hospitalidade;"},{verse:14,en:"Bless them which persecute you: bless, and curse not.",pt:"aben\xe7oai aos que vos perseguem; aben\xe7oai, e n\xe3o amaldi\xe7oeis;"},{verse:15,en:"Rejoice with them that do rejoice, and weep with them that weep.",pt:"alegrai-vos com os que se alegram; chorai com os que choram;"},{verse:16,en:"Be of the same mind one toward another. Mind not high things, but condescend to men of low estate. Be not wise in your own conceits.",pt:"sede un\xe2nimes entre v\xf3s; n\xe3o ambicioneis coisas altivas mas acomodai-vos \xe0s humildes; n\xe3o sejais s\xe1bios aos vossos olhos;"},{verse:17,en:"Recompense to no man evil for evil. Provide things honest in the sight of all men.",pt:"a ningu\xe9m torneis mal por mal; procurai as coisas dignas, perante todos os homens."},{verse:18,en:"If it be possible, as much as lieth in you, live peaceably with all men.",pt:"Se for poss\xedvel, quanto depender de v\xf3s, tende paz com todos os homens."},{verse:19,en:"Dearly beloved, avenge not yourselves, but rather give place unto wrath: for it is written, Vengeance is mine; I will repay, saith the Lord.",pt:"N\xe3o vos vingueis a v\xf3s mesmos, amados, mas dai lugar \xe0 ira de Deus, porque est\xe1 escrito: Minha \xe9 a vingan\xe7a, eu retribuirei, diz o Senhor."},{verse:20,en:"Therefore if thine enemy hunger, feed him; if he thirst, give him drink: for in so doing thou shalt heap coals of fire on his head.",pt:"Antes, se o teu inimigo tiver fome, d\xe1-lhe de comer; se tiver sede, d\xe1-lhe de beber; porque, fazendo isto amontoar\xe1s brasas de fogo sobre a sua cabe\xe7a."},{verse:21,en:"Be not overcome of evil, but overcome evil with good.",pt:"N\xe3o te deixes vencer do mal, mas vence o mal com o bem."}]}}),727,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,s,r,n){s.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:13,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Let every soul be subject unto the higher powers. For there is no power but of God: the powers that be are ordained of God.",pt:"Toda alma esteja sujeita \xe0s autoridades superiores; porque n\xe3o h\xe1 autoridade que n\xe3o venha de Deus; e as que existem foram ordenadas por Deus."},{verse:2,en:"Whosoever therefore resisteth the power, resisteth the ordinance of God: and they that resist shall receive to themselves damnation.",pt:"Por isso quem resiste \xe0 autoridade resiste \xe0 ordena\xe7\xe3o de Deus; e os que resistem trar\xe3o sobre si mesmos a condena\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"For rulers are not a terror to good works, but to the evil. Wilt thou then not be afraid of the power? do that which is good, and thou shalt have praise of the same:",pt:"Porque os magistrados n\xe3o s\xe3o motivo de temor para os que fazem o bem, mas para os que fazem o mal. Queres tu, pois, n\xe3o temer a autoridade? Faze o bem, e ter\xe1s louvor dela;"},{verse:4,en:"For he is the minister of God to thee for good. But if thou do that which is evil, be afraid; for he beareth not the sword in vain: for he is the minister of God, a revenger to execute wrath upon him that doeth evil.",pt:"porquanto ela \xe9 ministro de Deus para teu bem. Mas, se fizeres o mal, teme, pois n\xe3o traz debalde a espada; porque \xe9 ministro de Deus, e vingador em ira contra aquele que pratica o mal."},{verse:5,en:"Wherefore ye must needs be subject, not only for wrath, but also for conscience sake.",pt:"Pelo que \xe9 necess\xe1rio que lhe estejais sujeitos, n\xe3o somente por causa da ira, mas tamb\xe9m por causa da consci\xeancia."},{verse:6,en:"For for this cause pay ye tribute also: for they are God\u2019s ministers, attending continually upon this very thing.",pt:"Por esta raz\xe3o tamb\xe9m pagais tributo; porque s\xe3o ministros de Deus, para atenderem a isso mesmo."},{verse:7,en:"Render therefore to all their dues: tribute to whom tribute is due; custom to whom custom; fear to whom fear; honour to whom honour.",pt:"Dai a cada um o que lhe \xe9 devido: a quem tributo, tributo; a quem imposto, imposto; a quem temor, temor; a quem honra, honra."},{verse:8,en:"Owe no man any thing, but to love one another: for he that loveth another hath fulfilled the law.",pt:"A ningu\xe9m devais coisa alguma, sen\xe3o o amor rec\xedproco; pois quem ama ao pr\xf3ximo tem cumprido a lei."},{verse:9,en:"For this, Thou shalt not commit adultery, Thou shalt not kill, Thou shalt not steal, Thou shalt not bear false witness, Thou shalt not covet; and if there be any other commandment, it is briefly comprehended in this saying, namely, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself.",pt:"Com efeito: N\xe3o adulterar\xe1s; n\xe3o matar\xe1s; n\xe3o furtar\xe1s; n\xe3o cobi\xe7ar\xe1s; e se h\xe1 algum outro mandamento, tudo nesta palavra se resume: Amar\xe1s ao teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo."},{verse:10,en:"Love worketh no ill to his neighbour: therefore love is the fulfilling of the law.",pt:"O amor n\xe3o faz mal ao pr\xf3ximo. De modo que o amor \xe9 o cumprimento da lei."},{verse:11,en:"And that, knowing the time, that now it is high time to awake out of sleep: for now is our salvation nearer than when we believed.",pt:"E isso fazei, conhecendo o tempo, que j\xe1 \xe9 hora de despertardes do sono; porque a nossa salva\xe7\xe3o est\xe1 agora mais perto de n\xf3s do que quando nos tornamos crentes."},{verse:12,en:"The night is far spent, the day is at hand: let us therefore cast off the works of darkness, and let us put on the armour of light.",pt:"A noite \xe9 passada, e o dia \xe9 chegado; dispamo-nos, pois, das obras das trevas, e vistamo-nos das armas da luz."},{verse:13,en:"Let us walk honestly, as in the day; not in rioting and drunkenness, not in chambering and wantonness, not in strife and envying.",pt:"Andemos honestamente, como de dia: n\xe3o em glutonarias e bebedeiras, n\xe3o em impudic\xedcias e dissolu\xe7\xf5es, n\xe3o em contendas e inveja."},{verse:14,en:"But put ye on the Lord Jesus Christ, and make not provision for the flesh, to fulfil the lusts thereof.",pt:"Mas revesti-vos do Senhor Jesus Cristo; e n\xe3o tenhais cuidado da carne em suas concupisc\xeancias."}]}}),728,[]);
__d((function(e,o,t,a,r,s,n){r.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:14,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Him that is weak in the faith receive ye, but not to doubtful disputations.",pt:"Ora, ao que \xe9 fraco na f\xe9, acolhei-o, mas n\xe3o para condenar-lhe os escr\xfapulos."},{verse:2,en:"For one believeth that he may eat all things: another, who is weak, eateth herbs.",pt:"Um cr\xea que de tudo se pode comer, e outro, que \xe9 fraco, come s\xf3 legumes."},{verse:3,en:"Let not him that eateth despise him that eateth not; and let not him which eateth not judge him that eateth: for God hath received him.",pt:"Quem come n\xe3o despreze a quem n\xe3o come; e quem n\xe3o come n\xe3o julgue a quem come; pois Deus o acolheu."},{verse:4,en:"Who art thou that judgest another man\u2019s servant? to his own master he standeth or falleth. Yea, he shall be holden up: for God is able to make him stand.",pt:"Quem \xe9s tu, que julgas o servo alheio? Para seu pr\xf3prio senhor ele est\xe1 em p\xe9 ou cai; mas estar\xe1 firme, porque poderoso \xe9 o Senhor para o firmar."},{verse:5,en:"One man esteemeth one day above another: another esteemeth every day alike. Let every man be fully persuaded in his own mind.",pt:"Um faz diferen\xe7a entre dia e dia, mas outro julga iguais todos os dias. Cada um esteja inteiramente convicto em sua pr\xf3pria mente."},{verse:6,en:"He that regardeth the day, regardeth it unto the Lord; and he that regardeth not the day, to the Lord he doth not regard it. He that eateth, eateth to the Lord, for he giveth God thanks; and he that eateth not, to the Lord he eateth not, and giveth God thanks.",pt:"Aquele que faz caso do dia, para o Senhor o faz. E quem come, para o Senhor come, porque d\xe1 gra\xe7as a Deus; e quem n\xe3o come, para o Senhor n\xe3o come, e d\xe1 gra\xe7as a Deus."},{verse:7,en:"For none of us liveth to himself, and no man dieth to himself.",pt:"Porque nenhum de n\xf3s vive para si, e nenhum morre para si."},{verse:8,en:"For whether we live, we live unto the Lord; and whether we die, we die unto the Lord: whether we live therefore, or die, we are the Lord\u2019s.",pt:"Pois, se vivemos, para o Senhor vivemos; se morremos, para o Senhor morremos. De sorte que, quer vivamos quer morramos, somos do Senhor."},{verse:9,en:"For to this end Christ both died, and rose, and revived, that he might be Lord both of the dead and living.",pt:"Porque foi para isto mesmo que Cristo morreu e tornou a viver, para ser Senhor tanto de mortos como de vivos."},{verse:10,en:"But why dost thou judge thy brother? or why dost thou set at nought thy brother? for we shall all stand before the judgment seat of Christ.",pt:"Mas tu, por que julgas teu irm\xe3o? Ou tu, tamb\xe9m, por que desprezas teu irm\xe3o? Pois todos havemos de comparecer ante o tribunal de Deus."},{verse:11,en:"For it is written, As I live, saith the Lord, every knee shall bow to me, and every tongue shall confess to God.",pt:"Porque est\xe1 escrito: Por minha vida, diz o Senhor, diante de mim se dobrar\xe1 todo joelho, e toda l\xedngua louvar\xe1 a Deus."},{verse:12,en:"So then every one of us shall give account of himself to God.",pt:"Assim, pois, cada um de n\xf3s dar\xe1 conta de si mesmo a Deus."},{verse:13,en:"Let us not therefore judge one another any more: but judge this rather, that no man put a stumblingblock or an occasion to fall in his brother\u2019s way.",pt:"Portanto n\xe3o nos julguemos mais uns aos outros; antes o seja o vosso prop\xf3sito n\xe3o p\xf4r trope\xe7o ou esc\xe2ndalo ao vosso irm\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"I know, and am persuaded by the Lord Jesus, that there is nothing unclean of itself: but to him that esteemeth any thing to be unclean, to him it is unclean.",pt:"Eu sei, e estou certo no Senhor Jesus, que nada \xe9 de si mesmo imundo a n\xe3o ser para aquele que assim o considera; para esse \xe9 imundo."},{verse:15,en:"But if thy brother be grieved with thy meat, now walkest thou not charitably. Destroy not him with thy meat, for whom Christ died.",pt:"Pois, se pela tua comida se entristece teu irm\xe3o, j\xe1 n\xe3o andas segundo o amor. N\xe3o fa\xe7as perecer por causa da tua comida aquele por quem Cristo morreu."},{verse:16,en:"Let not then your good be evil spoken of:",pt:"N\xe3o seja pois censurado o vosso bem;"},{verse:17,en:"For the kingdom of God is not meat and drink; but righteousness, and peace, and joy in the Holy Ghost.",pt:"porque o reino de Deus n\xe3o consiste no comer e no beber, mas na justi\xe7a, na paz, e na alegria no Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:18,en:"For he that in these things serveth Christ is acceptable to God, and approved of men.",pt:"Pois quem nisso serve a Cristo agrad\xe1vel \xe9 a Deus e aceito aos homens."},{verse:19,en:"Let us therefore follow after the things which make for peace, and things wherewith one may edify another.",pt:"Assim, pois, sigamos as coisas que servem para a paz e as que contribuem para a edifica\xe7\xe3o m\xfatua."},{verse:20,en:"For meat destroy not the work of God. All things indeed are pure; but it is evil for that man who eateth with offence.",pt:"N\xe3o destruas por causa da comida a obra de Deus. Na verdade tudo \xe9 limpo, mas \xe9 um mal para o homem dar motivo de trope\xe7o pelo comer."},{verse:21,en:"It is good neither to eat flesh, nor to drink wine, nor any thing whereby thy brother stumbleth, or is offended, or is made weak.",pt:"Bom \xe9 n\xe3o comer carne, nem beber vinho, nem fazer outra coisa em que teu irm\xe3o tropece."},{verse:22,en:"Hast thou faith? have it to thyself before God. Happy is he that condemneth not himself in that thing which he alloweth.",pt:"A f\xe9 que tens, guarda-a contigo mesmo diante de Deus. Bem-aventurado aquele que n\xe3o se condena a si mesmo naquilo que aprova."},{verse:23,en:"And he that doubteth is damned if he eat, because he eateth not of faith: for whatsoever is not of faith is sin.",pt:"Mas aquele que tem d\xfavidas, se come est\xe1 condenado, porque o que faz n\xe3o prov\xe9m da f\xe9; e tudo o que n\xe3o prov\xe9m da f\xe9 \xe9 pecado."}]}}),729,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:15,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"We then that are strong ought to bear the infirmities of the weak, and not to please ourselves.",pt:"Ora n\xf3s, que somos fortes, devemos suportar as fraquezas dos fracos, e n\xe0o agradar a n\xf3s mesmos."},{verse:2,en:"Let every one of us please his neighbour for his good to edification.",pt:"Portanto cada um de n\xf3s agrade ao seu pr\xf3ximo, visando o que \xe9 bom para edifica\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"For even Christ pleased not himself; but, as it is written, The reproaches of them that reproached thee fell on me.",pt:"Porque tamb\xe9m Cristo n\xe3o se agradou a si mesmo, mas como est\xe1 escrito: Sobre mim ca\xedram as inj\xfarias dos que te injuriavam."},{verse:4,en:"For whatsoever things were written aforetime were written for our learning, that we through patience and comfort of the scriptures might have hope.",pt:"Porquanto, tudo que dantes foi escrito, para nosso ensino foi escrito, para que, pela const\xe2ncia e pela consola\xe7\xe3o provenientes das Escrituras, tenhamos esperan\xe7a."},{verse:5,en:"Now the God of patience and consolation grant you to be likeminded one toward another according to Christ Jesus:",pt:"Ora, o Deus de const\xe2ncia e de consola\xe7\xe3o vos d\xea o mesmo sentimento uns para com os outros, segundo Cristo Jesus."},{verse:6,en:"That ye may with one mind and one mouth glorify God, even the Father of our Lord Jesus Christ.",pt:"Para que un\xe2nimes, e a uma boca, glorifiqueis ao Deus e Pai de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo."},{verse:7,en:"Wherefore receive ye one another, as Christ also received us to the glory of God.",pt:"Portanto recebei-vos uns aos outros, como tamb\xe9m Cristo nos recebeu, para gl\xf3ria de Deus."},{verse:8,en:"Now I say that Jesus Christ was a minister of the circumcision for the truth of God, to confirm the promises made unto the fathers:",pt:"Digo pois que Cristo foi feito ministro da circuncis\xe3o, por causa da verdade de Deus, para confirmar as promessas feitas aos pais;"},{verse:9,en:"And that the Gentiles might glorify God for his mercy; as it is written, For this cause I will confess to thee among the Gentiles, and sing unto thy name.",pt:"e para que os gentios glorifiquem a Deus pela sua miseric\xf3rdia, como est\xe1 escrito: Portanto eu te louvarei entre os gentios, e cantarei ao teu nome."},{verse:10,en:"And again he saith, Rejoice, ye Gentiles, with his people.",pt:"E outra vez diz: Alegrai-vos, gentios, juntamente com o povo."},{verse:11,en:"And again, Praise the Lord, all ye Gentiles; and laud him, all ye people.",pt:"E ainda: Louvai ao Senhor, todos os gentios, e louvem-no, todos os povos."},{verse:12,en:"And again, Esaias saith, There shall be a root of Jesse, and he that shall rise to reign over the Gentiles; in him shall the Gentiles trust.",pt:"E outra vez, diz tamb\xe9m Isa\xedas: Haver\xe1 a raiz de Jess\xe9, aquele que se levanta para reger os gentios; nele os gentios esperar\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"Now the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace in believing, that ye may abound in hope, through the power of the Holy Ghost.",pt:"Ora, o Deus de esperan\xe7a vos encha de todo o gozo e paz na vossa f\xe9, para que abundeis na esperan\xe7a pelo poder do Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:14,en:"And I myself also am persuaded of you, my brethren, that ye also are full of goodness, filled with all knowledge, able also to admonish one another.",pt:"Eu, da minha parte, irm\xe3os meus, estou persuadido a vosso respeito, que v\xf3s j\xe1 estais cheios de bondade, cheios de todo o conhecimento e capazes, v\xf3s mesmos, de admoestar-vos uns aos outros."},{verse:15,en:"Nevertheless, brethren, I have written the more boldly unto you in some sort, as putting you in mind, because of the grace that is given to me of God,",pt:"Mas em parte vos escrevo mais ousadamente, como para vos trazer outra vez isto \xe0 mem\xf3ria, por causa da gra\xe7a que por Deus me foi dada,"},{verse:16,en:"That I should be the minister of Jesus Christ to the Gentiles, ministering the gospel of God, that the offering up of the Gentiles might be acceptable, being sanctified by the Holy Ghost.",pt:"para ser ministro de Cristo Jesus entre os gentios, ministrando o evangelho de Deus, para que sejam aceit\xe1veis os gentios como oferta, santificada pelo Esp\xedrito Santo."},{verse:17,en:"I have therefore whereof I may glory through Jesus Christ in those things which pertain to God.",pt:"Tenho, portanto, motivo para me gloriar em Cristo Jesus, nas coisas concernentes a Deus;"},{verse:18,en:"For I will not dare to speak of any of those things which Christ hath not wrought by me, to make the Gentiles obedient, by word and deed,",pt:"porque n\xe3o ousarei falar de coisa alguma sen\xe3o daquilo que Cristo por meu interm\xe9dio tem feito, para obedi\xeancia da parte dos gentios, por palavra e por obras,"},{verse:19,en:"Through mighty signs and wonders, by the power of the Spirit of God; so that from Jerusalem, and round about unto Illyricum, I have fully preached the gospel of Christ.",pt:"pelo poder de sinais e prod\xedgios, no poder do Esp\xedrito Santo; de modo que desde Jerusal\xe9m e arredores, at\xe9 a Il\xedria, tenho divulgado o evangelho de Cristo;"},{verse:20,en:"Yea, so have I strived to preach the gospel, not where Christ was named, lest I should build upon another man\u2019s foundation:",pt:"deste modo esfor\xe7ando-me por anunciar o evangelho, n\xe3o onde Cristo houvera sido nomeado, para n\xe3o edificar sobre fundamento alheio;"},{verse:21,en:"But as it is written, To whom he was not spoken of, they shall see: and they that have not heard shall understand.",pt:"antes, como est\xe1 escrito: Aqueles a quem n\xe3o foi anunciado, o ver\xe3o; e os que n\xe3o ouviram, entender\xe3o."},{verse:22,en:"For which cause also I have been much hindered from coming to you.",pt:"Pelo que tamb\xe9m muitas vezes tenho sido impedido de ir ter convosco;"},{verse:23,en:"But now having no more place in these parts, and having a great desire these many years to come unto you;",pt:"mas agora, n\xe3o tendo mais o que me detenha nestas regi\xf5es, e tendo j\xe1 h\xe1 muitos anos grande desejo de ir visitar-vos,"},{verse:24,en:"Whensoever I take my journey into Spain, I will come to you: for I trust to see you in my journey, and to be brought on my way thitherward by you, if first I be somewhat filled with your company.",pt:"eu o farei quando for \xe0 Espanha; pois espero ver-vos de passagem e por v\xf3s ser encaminhado para l\xe1, depois de ter gozado um pouco da vossa companhia."},{verse:25,en:"But now I go unto Jerusalem to minister unto the saints.",pt:"Mas agora vou a Jerusal\xe9m para ministrar aos santos."},{verse:26,en:"For it hath pleased them of Macedonia and Achaia to make a certain contribution for the poor saints which are at Jerusalem.",pt:"Porque pareceu bem \xe0 Maced\xf4nia e \xe0 Acaia levantar uma oferta fraternal para os pobres dentre os santos que est\xe3o em Jerusal\xe9m."},{verse:27,en:"It hath pleased them verily; and their debtors they are. For if the Gentiles have been made partakers of their spiritual things, their duty is also to minister unto them in carnal things.",pt:"Isto pois lhes pareceu bem, como devedores que s\xe3o para com eles. Porque, se os gentios foram participantes das b\xean\xe7\xe3os espirituais dos judeus, devem tamb\xe9m servir a estes com as materiais."},{verse:28,en:"When therefore I have performed this, and have sealed to them this fruit, I will come by you into Spain.",pt:"Tendo, pois, conclu\xeddo isto, e havendo-lhes consignado este fruto, de l\xe1, passando por v\xf3s, irei \xe0 Espanha."},{verse:29,en:"And I am sure that, when I come unto you, I shall come in the fulness of the blessing of the gospel of Christ.",pt:"E bem sei que, quando for visitar-vos, chegarei na plenitude da b\xean\xe7\xe3o de Cristo."},{verse:30,en:"Now I beseech you, brethren, for the Lord Jesus Christ\u2019s sake, and for the love of the Spirit, that ye strive together with me in your prayers to God for me;",pt:"Rogo-vos, irm\xe3os, por nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo e pelo amor do Esp\xedrito, que luteis juntamente comigo nas vossas ora\xe7\xf5es por mim a Deus,"},{verse:31,en:"That I may be delivered from them that do not believe in Judaea; and that my service which I have for Jerusalem may be accepted of the saints;",pt:"para que eu seja livre dos rebeldes que est\xe3o na Jud\xe9ia, e que este meu minist\xe9rio em Jerusal\xe9m seja aceit\xe1vel aos santos;"},{verse:32,en:"That I may come unto you with joy by the will of God, and may with you be refreshed.",pt:"a fim de que, pela vontade de Deus, eu chegue at\xe9 v\xf3s com alegria, e possa entre v\xf3s recobrar as for\xe7as."},{verse:33,en:"Now the God of peace be with you all. Amen.",pt:"E o Deus de paz seja com todos v\xf3s. Am\xe9m."}]}}),730,[]);
__d((function(e,a,o,s,r,t,i){r.exports={book:"Romans",bookPt:"Romanos",chapter:16,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"I commend unto you Phebe our sister, which is a servant of the church which is at Cenchrea:",pt:"Recomendo-vos a nossa irm\xe3 Febe, que \xe9 serva da igreja que est\xe1 em Cencr\xe9ia;"},{verse:2,en:"That ye receive her in the Lord, as becometh saints, and that ye assist her in whatsoever business she hath need of you: for she hath been a succourer of many, and of myself also.",pt:"para que a recebais no Senhor, de um modo digno dos santos, e a ajudeis em qualquer coisa que de v\xf3s necessitar; porque ela tem sido o amparo de muitos, e de mim em particular."},{verse:3,en:"Greet Priscilla and Aquila my helpers in Christ Jesus:",pt:"Saudai a Prisca e a \xc1q\xfcila, meus cooperadores em Cristo Jesus,"},{verse:4,en:"Who have for my life laid down their own necks: unto whom not only I give thanks, but also all the churches of the Gentiles.",pt:"os quais pela minha vida expuseram as suas cabe\xe7as; o que n\xe3o s\xf3 eu lhes agrade\xe7o, mas tamb\xe9m todas as igrejas dos gentios."},{verse:5,en:"Likewise greet the church that is in their house. Salute my wellbeloved Epaenetus, who is the firstfruits of Achaia unto Christ.",pt:"Saudai tamb\xe9m a igreja que est\xe1 na casa deles. Saudai a Ep\xeaneto, meu amado, que \xe9 as prim\xedcias da \xc1sia para Cristo."},{verse:6,en:"Greet Mary, who bestowed much labour on us.",pt:"Saudai a Maria, que muito trabalhou por v\xf3s."},{verse:7,en:"Salute Andronicus and Junia, my kinsmen, and my fellowprisoners, who are of note among the apostles, who also were in Christ before me.",pt:"Saudai a Andr\xf4nico e a J\xfanias, meus parentes e meus companheiros de pris\xe3o, os quais s\xe3o bem conceituados entre os ap\xf3stolos, e que estavam em Cristo antes de mim."},{verse:8,en:"Greet Amplias my beloved in the Lord.",pt:"Saudai a Ampliato, meu amado no Senhor."},{verse:9,en:"Salute Urbane, our helper in Christ, and Stachys my beloved.",pt:"Saudai a Urbano, nosso cooperador em Cristo, e a Est\xe1quis, meu amado."},{verse:10,en:"Salute Apelles approved in Christ. Salute them which are of Aristobulus\u2019 household.",pt:"Saudai a Apeles, aprovado em Cristo. Saudai aos da casa de Arist\xf3bulo."},{verse:11,en:"Salute Herodion my kinsman. Greet them that be of the household of Narcissus, which are in the Lord.",pt:"Saudai a Herodi\xe3o, meu parente. Saudai aos da casa de Narciso que est\xe3o no Senhor."},{verse:12,en:"Salute Tryphena and Tryphosa, who labour in the Lord. Salute the beloved Persis, which laboured much in the Lord.",pt:"Saudai a Trifena e a Trifosa, que trabalham no Senhor. Saudai a amada P\xe9rside, que muito trabalhou no Senhor."},{verse:13,en:"Salute Rufus chosen in the Lord, and his mother and mine.",pt:"Saudai a Rufo, eleito no Senhor, e a sua m\xe3e e minha."},{verse:14,en:"Salute Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermas, Patrobas, Hermes, and the brethren which are with them.",pt:"Saudai a As\xedncrito, a Flegonte, a Hermes, a P\xe1trobas, a Hermes, e aos irm\xe3os que est\xe3o com eles."},{verse:15,en:"Salute Philologus, and Julia, Nereus, and his sister, and Olympas, and all the saints which are with them.",pt:"Saudai a Fil\xf3logo e a J\xfalia, a Nereu e a sua irm\xe3, e a Olimpas, e a todos os santos que com eles est\xe3o."},{verse:16,en:"Salute one another with an holy kiss. The churches of Christ salute you.",pt:"Saudai-vos uns aos outros com \xf3sculo santo. Todas as igrejas de Cristo vos sa\xfadam."},{verse:17,en:"Now I beseech you, brethren, mark them which cause divisions and offences contrary to the doctrine which ye have learned; and avoid them.",pt:"Rogo-vos, irm\xe3os, que noteis os que promovem dissens\xf5es e esc\xe2ndalos contra a doutrina que aprendestes; desviai-vos deles."},{verse:18,en:"For they that are such serve not our Lord Jesus Christ, but their own belly; and by good words and fair speeches deceive the hearts of the simple.",pt:"Porque os tais n\xe3o servem a Cristo nosso Senhor, mas ao seu ventre; e com palavras suaves e lisonjas enganam os cora\xe7\xf5es dos inocentes."},{verse:19,en:"For your obedience is come abroad unto all men. I am glad therefore on your behalf: but yet I would have you wise unto that which is good, and simple concerning evil.",pt:"Pois a vossa obedi\xeancia \xe9 conhecida de todos. Comprazo-me, portanto, em v\xf3s; e quero que sejais s\xe1bios para o bem, mas simples para o mal."},{verse:20,en:"And the God of peace shall bruise Satan under your feet shortly. The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you. Amen.",pt:"E o Deus de paz em breve esmagar\xe1 a Satan\xe1s debaixo dos vossos p\xe9s. A gra\xe7a de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo seja convosco."},{verse:21,en:"Timotheus my workfellow, and Lucius, and Jason, and Sosipater, my kinsmen, salute you.",pt:"Sa\xfadam-vos Tim\xf3teo, meu cooperador, e L\xfacio, e J\xe1son, e Sos\xedpatro, meus parentes."},{verse:22,en:"I Tertius, who wrote this epistle, salute you in the Lord.",pt:"Eu, T\xe9rcio, que escrevo esta carta, vos sa\xfado no Senhor."},{verse:23,en:"Gaius mine host, and of the whole church, saluteth you. Erastus the chamberlain of the city saluteth you, and Quartus a brother.",pt:"Sa\xfada-vos Gaio, hospedeiro meu e de toda a igreja. Sa\xfada-vos Erasto, tesoureiro da cidade, e tamb\xe9m o irm\xe3o Quarto."},{verse:24,en:"The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you all. Amen.",pt:"[A gra\xe7a de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo seja com todos v\xf3s. Am\xe9m.]"},{verse:25,en:"Now to him that is of power to stablish you according to my gospel, and the preaching of Jesus Christ, according to the revelation of the mystery, which was kept secret since the world began,",pt:"Ora, \xe0quele que \xe9 poderoso para vos confirmar, segundo o meu evangelho e a prega\xe7\xe3o de Jesus Cristo, conforme a revela\xe7\xe3o do mist\xe9rio guardado em sil\xeancio desde os tempos eternos,"},{verse:26,en:"But now is made manifest, and by the scriptures of the prophets, according to the commandment of the everlasting God, made known to all nations for the obedience of faith:",pt:"mas agora manifesto e, por meio das Escrituras prof\xe9ticas, segundo o mandamento do Deus, eterno, dado a conhecer a todas as na\xe7\xf5es para obedi\xeancia da f\xe9;"},{verse:27,en:"To God only wise, be glory through Jesus Christ for ever. Amen.",pt:"ao \xfanico Deus s\xe1bio seja dada gl\xf3ria por Jesus Cristo para todo o sempre. Am\xe9m."}]}}),731,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:1,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Paul, an apostle, (not of men, neither by man, but by Jesus Christ, and God the Father, who raised him from the dead;)",pt:"Paulo, ap\xf3stolo (n\xe3o da parte dos homens, nem por interm\xe9dio de homem algum, mas sim por Jesus Cristo, e por Deus Pai, que o ressuscitou dentre os mortos),"},{verse:2,en:"And all the brethren which are with me, unto the churches of Galatia:",pt:"e todos os irm\xe3os que est\xe3o comigo, \xe0s igrejas da Gal\xe1cia:"},{verse:3,en:"Grace be to you and peace from God the Father, and from our Lord Jesus Christ,",pt:"Gra\xe7a a v\xf3s, e paz da parte de Deus nosso Pai, e do Senhor Jesus Cristo,"},{verse:4,en:"Who gave himself for our sins, that he might deliver us from this present evil world, according to the will of God and our Father:",pt:"o qual se deu a si mesmo por nossos pecados, para nos livrar do presente s\xe9culo mau, segundo a vontade de nosso Deus e Pai,"},{verse:5,en:"To whom be glory for ever and ever. Amen.",pt:"a quem seja a gl\xf3ria para todo o sempre. Am\xe9m."},{verse:6,en:"I marvel that ye are so soon removed from him that called you into the grace of Christ unto another gospel:",pt:"Estou admirado de que t\xe3o depressa estejais desertando daquele que vos chamou na gra\xe7a de Cristo, para outro evangelho,"},{verse:7,en:"Which is not another; but there be some that trouble you, and would pervert the gospel of Christ.",pt:"o qual n\xe3o \xe9 outro; sen\xe3o que h\xe1 alguns que vos perturbam e querem perverter o evangelho de Cristo."},{verse:8,en:"But though we, or an angel from heaven, preach any other gospel unto you than that which we have preached unto you, let him be accursed.",pt:"Mas, ainda que n\xf3s mesmos ou um anjo do c\xe9u vos pregasse outro evangelho al\xe9m do que j\xe1 vos pregamos, seja an\xe1tema."},{verse:9,en:"As we said before, so say I now again, If any man preach any other gospel unto you than that ye have received, let him be accursed.",pt:"Como antes temos dito, assim agora novamente o digo: Se algu\xe9m vos pregar outro evangelho al\xe9m do que j\xe1 recebestes, seja an\xe1tema."},{verse:10,en:"For do I now persuade men, or God? or do I seek to please men? for if I yet pleased men, I should not be the servant of Christ.",pt:"Pois busco eu agora o favor dos homens, ou o favor de Deus? ou procuro agradar aos homens? se estivesse ainda agradando aos homens, n\xe3o seria servo de Cristo."},{verse:11,en:"But I certify you, brethren, that the gospel which was preached of me is not after man.",pt:"Mas fa\xe7o-vos saber, irm\xe3os, que o evangelho que por mim foi anunciado n\xe3o \xe9 segundo os homens;"},{verse:12,en:"For I neither received it of man, neither was I taught it, but by the revelation of Jesus Christ.",pt:"porque n\xe3o o recebi de homem algum, nem me foi ensinado; mas o recebi por revela\xe7\xe3o de Jesus Cristo."},{verse:13,en:"For ye have heard of my conversation in time past in the Jews\u2019 religion, how that beyond measure I persecuted the church of God, and wasted it:",pt:"Pois j\xe1 ouvistes qual foi outrora o meu procedimento no juda\xedsmo, como sobremaneira perseguia a igreja de Deus e a assolava,"},{verse:14,en:"And profited in the Jews\u2019 religion above many my equals in mine own nation, being more exceedingly zealous of the traditions of my fathers.",pt:"e na minha na\xe7\xe3o excedia em juda\xedsmo a muitos da minha idade, sendo extremamente zeloso das tradi\xe7\xf5es de meus pais."},{verse:15,en:"But when it pleased God, who separated me from my mother\u2019s womb, and called me by his grace,",pt:"Mas, quando aprouve a Deus, que desde o ventre de minha m\xe3e me separou, e me chamou pela sua gra\xe7a,"},{verse:16,en:"To reveal his Son in me, that I might preach him among the heathen; immediately I conferred not with flesh and blood:",pt:"revelar seu Filho em mim, para que eu o pregasse entre os gentios, n\xe3o consultei carne e sangue,"},{verse:17,en:"Neither went I up to Jerusalem to them which were apostles before me; but I went into Arabia, and returned again unto Damascus.",pt:"nem subi a Jerusal\xe9m para estar com os que j\xe1 antes de mim eram ap\xf3stolos, mas parti para a Ar\xe1bia, e voltei outra vez a Damasco."},{verse:18,en:"Then after three years I went up to Jerusalem to see Peter, and abode with him fifteen days.",pt:"Depois, passados tr\xeas anos, subi a Jerusal\xe9m para visitar a Cefas, e demorei com ele quinze dias."},{verse:19,en:"But other of the apostles saw I none, save James the Lord\u2019s brother.",pt:"Mas n\xe3o vi a nenhum outro dos ap\xf3stolos, sen\xe3o a Tiago, irm\xe3o do Senhor."},{verse:20,en:"Now the things which I write unto you, behold, before God, I lie not.",pt:"Ora, acerca do que vos escrevo, eis que diante de Deus testifico que n\xe3o minto."},{verse:21,en:"Afterwards I came into the regions of Syria and Cilicia;",pt:"Depois fui para as regi\xf5es da S\xedria e da Cil\xedcia."},{verse:22,en:"And was unknown by face unto the churches of Judaea which were in Christ:",pt:"N\xe3o era conhecido de vista das igrejas de Cristo na Jud\xe9ia;"},{verse:23,en:"But they had heard only, That he which persecuted us in times past now preacheth the faith which once he destroyed.",pt:"mas somente tinham ouvido dizer: Aquele que outrora nos perseguia agora prega a f\xe9 que antes procurava destruir;"},{verse:24,en:"And they glorified God in me.",pt:"e glorificavam a Deus a respeito de mim."}]}}),732,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:2,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Then fourteen years after I went up again to Jerusalem with Barnabas, and took Titus with me also.",pt:"Depois, passados catorze anos, subi outra vez a Jerusal\xe9m com Barnab\xe9, levando tamb\xe9m comigo a Tito."},{verse:2,en:"And I went up by revelation, and communicated unto them that gospel which I preach among the Gentiles, but privately to them which were of reputation, lest by any means I should run, or had run, in vain.",pt:"E subi devido a uma revela\xe7\xe3o, e lhes expus o evangelho que prego entre os gentios, mas em particular aos que eram de destaque, para que de algum modo n\xe3o estivesse correndo ou n\xe3o tivesse corrido em v\xe3o."},{verse:3,en:"But neither Titus, who was with me, being a Greek, was compelled to be circumcised:",pt:"Mas nem mesmo Tito, que estava comigo, embora sendo grego, foi constrangido a circuncidar-se;"},{verse:4,en:"And that because of false brethren unawares brought in, who came in privily to spy out our liberty which we have in Christ Jesus, that they might bring us into bondage:",pt:"e isto por causa dos falsos irm\xe3os intrusos, os quais furtivamente entraram a espiar a nossa liberdade, que temos em Cristo Jesus, para nos escravizar;"},{verse:5,en:"To whom we gave place by subjection, no, not for an hour; that the truth of the gospel might continue with you.",pt:"aos quais nem ainda por uma hora cedemos em sujei\xe7\xe3o, para que a verdade do evangelho permanecesse entre v\xf3s."},{verse:6,en:"But of these who seemed to be somewhat, (whatsoever they were, it maketh no matter to me: God accepteth no man\u2019s person:) for they who seemed to be somewhat in conference added nothing to me:",pt:"Ora, daqueles que pareciam ser alguma coisa (quais outrora tenham sido, nada me importa; Deus n\xe3o aceita a apar\xeancia do homem), esses, digo, que pareciam ser alguma coisa, nada me acrescentaram;"},{verse:7,en:"But contrariwise, when they saw that the gospel of the uncircumcision was committed unto me, as the gospel of the circumcision was unto Peter;",pt:"antes, pelo contr\xe1rio, quando viram que o evangelho da incircuncis\xe3o me fora confiado, como a Pedro o da circuncis\xe3o"},{verse:8,en:"(For he that wrought effectually in Peter to the apostleship of the circumcision, the same was mighty in me toward the Gentiles:)",pt:"(porque aquele que operou a favor de Pedro para o apostolado da circuncis\xe3o, operou tamb\xe9m a meu favor para com os gentios),"},{verse:9,en:"And when James, Cephas, and John, who seemed to be pillars, perceived the grace that was given unto me, they gave to me and Barnabas the right hands of fellowship; that we should go unto the heathen, and they unto the circumcision.",pt:"e quando conheceram a gra\xe7a que me fora dada, Tiago, Cefas e Jo\xe3o, que pareciam ser as colunas, deram a mim e a Barnab\xe9 as destras de comunh\xe3o, para que n\xf3s f\xf4ssemos aos gentios, e eles \xe0 circuncis\xe3o;"},{verse:10,en:"Only they would that we should remember the poor; the same which I also was forward to do.",pt:"recomendando-nos somente que nos lembr\xe1ssemos dos pobres; o que tamb\xe9m procurei fazer com dilig\xeancia."},{verse:11,en:"But when Peter was come to Antioch, I withstood him to the face, because he was to be blamed.",pt:"Quando, por\xe9m, Cefas veio a Antioquia, resisti-lhe na cara, porque era repreens\xedvel."},{verse:12,en:"For before that certain came from James, he did eat with the Gentiles: but when they were come, he withdrew and separated himself, fearing them which were of the circumcision.",pt:"Pois antes de chegarem alguns da parte de Tiago, ele comia com os gentios; mas quando eles chegaram, se foi retirando e se apartava deles, temendo os que eram da circuncis\xe3o."},{verse:13,en:"And the other Jews dissembled likewise with him; insomuch that Barnabas also was carried away with their dissimulation.",pt:"E os outros judeus tamb\xe9m dissimularam com ele, de modo que at\xe9 Barnab\xe9 se deixou levar pela sua dissimula\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:14,en:"But when I saw that they walked not uprightly according to the truth of the gospel, I said unto Peter before them all, If thou, being a Jew, livest after the manner of Gentiles, and not as do the Jews, why compellest thou the Gentiles to live as do the Jews?",pt:"Mas, quando vi que n\xe3o andavam retamente conforme a verdade do evangelho, disse a Cefas perante todos: Se tu, sendo judeu, vives como os gentios, e n\xe3o como os judeus, como \xe9 que obrigas os gentios a viverem como judeus?"},{verse:15,en:"We who are Jews by nature, and not sinners of the Gentiles,",pt:"N\xf3s, judeus por natureza e n\xe3o pecadores dentre os gentios,"},{verse:16,en:"Knowing that a man is not justified by the works of the law, but by the faith of Jesus Christ, even we have believed in Jesus Christ, that we might be justified by the faith of Christ, and not by the works of the law: for by the works of the law shall no flesh be justified.",pt:"sabendo, contudo, que o homem n\xe3o \xe9 justificado por obras da lei, mas sim, pela f\xe9 em Cristo Jesus, temos tamb\xe9m crido em Cristo Jesus para sermos justificados pela f\xe9 em Cristo, e n\xe3o por obras da lei; pois por obras da lei nenhuma carne ser\xe1 justificada."},{verse:17,en:"But if, while we seek to be justified by Christ, we ourselves also are found sinners, is therefore Christ the minister of sin? God forbid.",pt:"Mas se, procurando ser justificados em Cristo, fomos n\xf3s mesmos tamb\xe9m achados pecadores, \xe9 porventura Cristo ministro do pecado? De modo nenhum."},{verse:18,en:"For if I build again the things which I destroyed, I make myself a transgressor.",pt:"Porque, se torno a edificar aquilo que destru\xed, constituo-me a mim mesmo transgressor."},{verse:19,en:"For I through the law am dead to the law, that I might live unto God.",pt:"Pois eu pela lei morri para a lei, a fim de viver para Deus."},{verse:20,en:"I am crucified with Christ: nevertheless I live; yet not I, but Christ liveth in me: and the life which I now live in the flesh I live by the faith of the Son of God, who loved me, and gave himself for me.",pt:"J\xe1 estou crucificado com Cristo; e vivo, n\xe3o mais eu, mas Cristo vive em mim; e a vida que agora vivo na carne, vivo-a na f\xe9 no filho de Deus, o qual me amou, e se entregou a si mesmo por mim."},{verse:21,en:"I do not frustrate the grace of God: for if righteousness come by the law, then Christ is dead in vain.",pt:"N\xe3o fa\xe7o nula a gra\xe7a de Deus; porque, se a justi\xe7a vem mediante a lei, logo Cristo morreu em v\xe3o."}]}}),733,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,i){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:3,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"O foolish Galatians, who hath bewitched you, that ye should not obey the truth, before whose eyes Jesus Christ hath been evidently set forth, crucified among you?",pt:"\xf3 insensatos g\xe1latas! quem vos fascinou a v\xf3s, ante cujos olhos foi representado Jesus Cristo como crucificado?"},{verse:2,en:"This only would I learn of you, Received ye the Spirit by the works of the law, or by the hearing of faith?",pt:"S\xf3 isto quero saber de v\xf3s: Foi por obras da lei que recebestes o Esp\xedrito, ou pelo ouvir com f\xe9?"},{verse:3,en:"Are ye so foolish? having begun in the Spirit, are ye now made perfect by the flesh?",pt:"Sois v\xf3s t\xe3o insensatos? tendo come\xe7ado pelo Esp\xedrito, \xe9 pela carne que agora acabareis?"},{verse:4,en:"Have ye suffered so many things in vain? if it be yet in vain.",pt:"Ser\xe1 que padecestes tantas coisas em v\xe3o? Se \xe9 que isso foi em v\xe3o."},{verse:5,en:"He therefore that ministereth to you the Spirit, and worketh miracles among you, doeth he it by the works of the law, or by the hearing of faith?",pt:"Aquele pois que vos d\xe1 o Esp\xedrito, e que opera milagres entre v\xf3s, acaso o faz pelas obras da lei, ou pelo ouvir com f\xe9?"},{verse:6,en:"Even as Abraham believed God, and it was accounted to him for righteousness.",pt:"Assim como Abra\xe3o creu a Deus, e isso lhe foi imputado como justi\xe7a."},{verse:7,en:"Know ye therefore that they which are of faith, the same are the children of Abraham.",pt:"Sabei, pois, que os que s\xe3o da f\xe9, esses s\xe3o filhos de Abra\xe3o."},{verse:8,en:"And the scripture, foreseeing that God would justify the heathen through faith, preached before the gospel unto Abraham, saying, In thee shall all nations be blessed.",pt:"Ora, a Escritura, prevendo que Deus havia de justificar pela f\xe9 os gentios, anunciou previamente a boa nova a Abra\xe3o, dizendo: Em ti ser\xe3o aben\xe7oadas todas as na\xe7\xf5es."},{verse:9,en:"So then they which be of faith are blessed with faithful Abraham.",pt:"De modo que os que s\xe3o da f\xe9 s\xe3o aben\xe7oados com o crente Abra\xe3o."},{verse:10,en:"For as many as are of the works of the law are under the curse: for it is written, Cursed is every one that continueth not in all things which are written in the book of the law to do them.",pt:"Pois todos quantos s\xe3o das obras da lei est\xe3o debaixo da maldi\xe7\xe3o; porque escrito est\xe1: Maldito todo aquele que n\xe3o permanece em todas as coisas que est\xe3o escritas no livro da lei, para faz\xea-las."},{verse:11,en:"But that no man is justified by the law in the sight of God, it is evident: for, The just shall live by faith.",pt:"\xc9 evidente que pela lei ningu\xe9m \xe9 justificado diante de Deus, porque: O justo viver\xe1 da f\xe9;"},{verse:12,en:"And the law is not of faith: but, The man that doeth them shall live in them.",pt:"ora, a lei n\xe3o \xe9 da f\xe9, mas: O que fizer estas coisas, por elas viver\xe1."},{verse:13,en:"Christ hath redeemed us from the curse of the law, being made a curse for us: for it is written, Cursed is every one that hangeth on a tree:",pt:"Cristo nos resgatou da maldi\xe7\xe3o da lei, fazendo-se maldi\xe7\xe3o por n\xf3s; porque est\xe1 escrito: Maldito todo aquele que for pendurado no madeiro;"},{verse:14,en:"That the blessing of Abraham might come on the Gentiles through Jesus Christ; that we might receive the promise of the Spirit through faith.",pt:"para que aos gentios viesse a b\xean\xe7\xe3o de Abra\xe3o em Jesus Cristo, a fim de que n\xf3s receb\xeassemos pela f\xe9 a promessa do Esp\xedrito."},{verse:15,en:"Brethren, I speak after the manner of men; Though it be but a man\u2019s covenant, yet if it be confirmed, no man disannulleth, or addeth thereto.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, como homem falo. Um testamento, embora de homem, uma vez confirmado, ningu\xe9m o anula, nem lhe acrescenta coisa alguma."},{verse:16,en:"Now to Abraham and his seed were the promises made. He saith not, And to seeds, as of many; but as of one, And to thy seed, which is Christ.",pt:"Ora, a Abra\xe3o e a seu descendente foram feitas as promessas; n\xe3o diz: E a seus descendentes, como falando de muitos, mas como de um s\xf3: E a teu descendente, que \xe9 Cristo."},{verse:17,en:"And this I say, that the covenant, that was confirmed before of God in Christ, the law, which was four hundred and thirty years after, cannot disannul, that it should make the promise of none effect.",pt:"E digo isto: Ao testamento anteriormente confirmado por Deus, a lei, que veio quatrocentos e trinta anos depois, n\xe3o invalida, de forma a tornar inoperante a promessa."},{verse:18,en:"For if the inheritance be of the law, it is no more of promise: but God gave it to Abraham by promise.",pt:"Pois se da lei prov\xe9m a heran\xe7a, j\xe1 n\xe3o prov\xe9m mais da promessa; mas Deus, pela promessa, a deu gratuitamente a Abra\xe3o."},{verse:19,en:"Wherefore then serveth the law? It was added because of transgressions, till the seed should come to whom the promise was made; and it was ordained by angels in the hand of a mediator.",pt:"Logo, para que \xe9 a lei? Foi acrescentada por causa das transgress\xf5es, at\xe9 que viesse o descendente a quem a promessa tinha sido feita; e foi ordenada por meio de anjos, pela m\xe3o de um mediador."},{verse:20,en:"Now a mediator is not a mediator of one, but God is one.",pt:"Ora, o mediador n\xe3o o \xe9 de um s\xf3, mas Deus \xe9 um s\xf3."},{verse:21,en:"Is the law then against the promises of God? God forbid: for if there had been a law given which could have given life, verily righteousness should have been by the law.",pt:"\xc9 a lei, ent\xe3o, contra as promessas de Deus? De modo nenhum; porque, se fosse dada uma lei que pudesse vivificar, a justi\xe7a, na verdade, teria sido pela lei."},{verse:22,en:"But the scripture hath concluded all under sin, that the promise by faith of Jesus Christ might be given to them that believe.",pt:"Mas a Escritura encerrou tudo debaixo do pecado, para que a promessa pela f\xe9 em Jesus Cristo fosse dada aos que cr\xeaem."},{verse:23,en:"But before faith came, we were kept under the law, shut up unto the faith which should afterwards be revealed.",pt:"Mas, antes que viesse a f\xe9, est\xe1vamos guardados debaixo da lei, encerrados para aquela f\xe9 que se havia de revelar."},{verse:24,en:"Wherefore the law was our schoolmaster to bring us unto Christ, that we might be justified by faith.",pt:"De modo que a lei se tornou nosso aio, para nos conduzir a Cristo, a fim de que pela f\xe9 f\xf4ssemos justificados."},{verse:25,en:"But after that faith is come, we are no longer under a schoolmaster.",pt:"Mas, depois que veio a f\xe9, j\xe1 n\xe3o estamos debaixo de aio."},{verse:26,en:"For ye are all the children of God by faith in Christ Jesus.",pt:"Pois todos sois filhos de Deus pela f\xe9 em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:27,en:"For as many of you as have been baptized into Christ have put on Christ.",pt:"Porque todos quantos fostes batizados em Cristo vos revestistes de Cristo."},{verse:28,en:"There is neither Jew nor Greek, there is neither bond nor free, there is neither male nor female: for ye are all one in Christ Jesus.",pt:"N\xe3o h\xe1 judeu nem grego; n\xe3o h\xe1 escravo nem livre; n\xe3o h\xe1 homem nem mulher; porque todos v\xf3s sois um em Cristo Jesus."},{verse:29,en:"And if ye be Christ\u2019s, then are ye Abraham\u2019s seed, and heirs according to the promise.",pt:"E, se sois de Cristo, ent\xe3o sois descend\xeancia de Abra\xe3o, e herdeiros conforme a promessa."}]}}),734,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,t,r,n){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:4,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Now I say, That the heir, as long as he is a child, differeth nothing from a servant, though he be lord of all;",pt:"Ora, digo que por todo o tempo em que o herdeiro \xe9 menino, em nada difere de um servo, ainda que seja senhor de tudo;"},{verse:2,en:"But is under tutors and governors until the time appointed of the father.",pt:"mas est\xe1 debaixo de tutores e curadores at\xe9 o tempo determinado pelo pai."},{verse:3,en:"Even so we, when we were children, were in bondage under the elements of the world:",pt:"Assim tamb\xe9m n\xf3s, quando \xe9ramos meninos, est\xe1vamos reduzidos \xe0 servid\xe3o debaixo dos rudimentos do mundo;"},{verse:4,en:"But when the fulness of the time was come, God sent forth his Son, made of a woman, made under the law,",pt:"mas, vindo a plenitude dos tempos, Deus enviou seu Filho, nascido de mulher, nascido debaixo de lei,"},{verse:5,en:"To redeem them that were under the law, that we might receive the adoption of sons.",pt:"para resgatar os que estavam debaixo de lei, a fim de recebermos a ado\xe7\xe3o de filhos."},{verse:6,en:"And because ye are sons, God hath sent forth the Spirit of his Son into your hearts, crying, Abba, Father.",pt:"E, porque sois filhos, Deus enviou aos nossos cora\xe7\xf5es o Esp\xedrito de seu Filho, que clama: Aba, Pai."},{verse:7,en:"Wherefore thou art no more a servant, but a son; and if a son, then an heir of God through Christ.",pt:"Portanto j\xe1 n\xe3o \xe9s mais servo, mas filho; e se \xe9s filho, \xe9s tamb\xe9m herdeiro por Deus."},{verse:8,en:"Howbeit then, when ye knew not God, ye did service unto them which by nature are no gods.",pt:"Outrora, quando n\xe3o conhec\xedeis a Deus, serv\xedeis aos que por natureza n\xe3o s\xe3o deuses;"},{verse:9,en:"But now, after that ye have known God, or rather are known of God, how turn ye again to the weak and beggarly elements, whereunto ye desire again to be in bondage?",pt:"agora, por\xe9m, que j\xe1 conheceis a Deus, ou, melhor, sendo conhecidos por Deus, como tornais outra vez a esses rudimentos fracos e pobres, aos quais de novo quereis servir?"},{verse:10,en:"Ye observe days, and months, and times, and years.",pt:"Guardais dias, e meses, e tempos, e anos."},{verse:11,en:"I am afraid of you, lest I have bestowed upon you labour in vain.",pt:"Temo a vosso respeito n\xe3o haja eu trabalhado em v\xe3o entre v\xf3s."},{verse:12,en:"Brethren, I beseech you, be as I am; for I am as ye are: ye have not injured me at all.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, rogo-vos que vos torneis como eu, porque tamb\xe9m eu me tornei como v\xf3s. Nenhum mal me fizestes;"},{verse:13,en:"Ye know how through infirmity of the flesh I preached the gospel unto you at the first.",pt:"e v\xf3s sabeis que por causa de uma enfermidade da carne vos anunciei o evangelho a primeira vez,"},{verse:14,en:"And my temptation which was in my flesh ye despised not, nor rejected; but received me as an angel of God, even as Christ Jesus.",pt:"e aquilo que na minha carne era para v\xf3s uma tenta\xe7\xe3o, n\xe3o o desprezastes nem o repelistes, antes me recebestes como a um anjo de Deus, mesmo como a Cristo Jesus."},{verse:15,en:"Where is then the blessedness ye spake of? for I bear you record, that, if it had been possible, ye would have plucked out your own eyes, and have given them to me.",pt:"Onde est\xe1, pois, aquela vossa satisfa\xe7\xe3o? Porque vos dou testemunho de que, se poss\xedvel fora, ter\xedeis arrancado os vossos olhos, e mos ter\xedeis dado."},{verse:16,en:"Am I therefore become your enemy, because I tell you the truth?",pt:"Tornei-me acaso vosso inimigo, porque vos disse a verdade?"},{verse:17,en:"They zealously affect you, but not well; yea, they would exclude you, that ye might affect them.",pt:"Eles vos procuram zelosamente n\xe3o com bons motivos, mas querem vos excluir, para que zelosamente os procureis a eles."},{verse:18,en:"But it is good to be zealously affected always in a good thing, and not only when I am present with you.",pt:"No que \xe9 bom, \xe9 bom serdes sempre procurados, e n\xe3o s\xf3 quando estou presente convosco."},{verse:19,en:"My little children, of whom I travail in birth again until Christ be formed in you,",pt:"Meus filhinhos, por quem de novo sinto as dores de parto, at\xe9 que Cristo seja formado em v\xf3s;"},{verse:20,en:"I desire to be present with you now, and to change my voice; for I stand in doubt of you.",pt:"eu bem quisera estar presente convosco agora, e mudar o tom da minha voz; porque estou perplexo a vosso respeito."},{verse:21,en:"Tell me, ye that desire to be under the law, do ye not hear the law?",pt:"Dizei-me, os que quereis estar debaixo da lei, n\xe3o ouvis v\xf3s a lei?"},{verse:22,en:"For it is written, that Abraham had two sons, the one by a bondmaid, the other by a freewoman.",pt:"Porque est\xe1 escrito que Abra\xe3o teve dois filhos, um da escrava, e outro da livre."},{verse:23,en:"But he who was of the bondwoman was born after the flesh; but he of the freewoman was by promise.",pt:"Todavia o que era da escrava nasceu segundo a carne, mas, o que era da livre, por promessa."},{verse:24,en:"Which things are an allegory: for these are the two covenants; the one from the mount Sinai, which gendereth to bondage, which is Agar.",pt:"O que se entende por alegoria: pois essas mulheres s\xe3o dois pactos; um do monte Sinai, que d\xe1 \xe0 luz filhos para a servid\xe3o, e que \xe9 Agar."},{verse:25,en:"For this Agar is mount Sinai in Arabia, and answereth to Jerusalem which now is, and is in bondage with her children.",pt:"Ora, esta Agar \xe9 o monte Sinai na Ar\xe1bia e corresponde \xe0 Jerusal\xe9m atual, pois \xe9 escrava com seus filhos."},{verse:26,en:"But Jerusalem which is above is free, which is the mother of us all.",pt:"Mas a Jerusal\xe9m que \xe9 de cima \xe9 livre; a qual \xe9 nossa m\xe3e."},{verse:27,en:"For it is written, Rejoice, thou barren that bearest not; break forth and cry, thou that travailest not: for the desolate hath many more children than she which hath an husband.",pt:"Pois est\xe1 escrito: Alegra-te, est\xe9ril, que n\xe3o d\xe1s \xe0 luz; esfor\xe7a-te e clama, tu que n\xe3o est\xe1s de parto; porque mais s\xe3o os filhos da desolada do que os da que tem marido."},{verse:28,en:"Now we, brethren, as Isaac was, are the children of promise.",pt:"Ora v\xf3s, irm\xe3os, sois filhos da promessa, como Isaque."},{verse:29,en:"But as then he that was born after the flesh persecuted him that was born after the Spirit, even so it is now.",pt:"Mas, como naquele tempo o que nasceu segundo a carne perseguia ao que nasceu segundo o Esp\xedrito, assim \xe9 tamb\xe9m agora."},{verse:30,en:"Nevertheless what saith the scripture? Cast out the bondwoman and her son: for the son of the bondwoman shall not be heir with the son of the free woman.",pt:"Que diz, por\xe9m, a Escritura? Lan\xe7a fora a escrava e seu filho, porque de modo algum o filho da escrava herdar\xe1 com o filho da livre."},{verse:31,en:"So then, brethren, we are not children of the bondwoman, but of the free.",pt:"Pelo que, irm\xe3os, n\xe3o somos filhos da escrava, mas da livre."}]}}),735,[]);
__d((function(e,o,s,a,t,i,r){t.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:5,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Stand fast therefore in the liberty wherewith Christ hath made us free, and be not entangled again with the yoke of bondage.",pt:"Para a liberdade Cristo nos libertou; permanecei, pois, firmes e n\xe3o vos dobreis novamente a um jogo de escravid\xe3o."},{verse:2,en:"Behold, I Paul say unto you, that if ye be circumcised, Christ shall profit you nothing.",pt:"Eis que eu, Paulo, vos digo que, se vos deixardes circuncidar, Cristo de nada vos aproveitar\xe1."},{verse:3,en:"For I testify again to every man that is circumcised, that he is a debtor to do the whole law.",pt:"E de novo testifico a todo homem que se deixa circuncidar, que est\xe1 obrigado a guardar toda a lei."},{verse:4,en:"Christ is become of no effect unto you, whosoever of you are justified by the law; ye are fallen from grace.",pt:"Separados estais de Cristo, v\xf3s os que vos justificais pela lei; da gra\xe7a deca\xedstes."},{verse:5,en:"For we through the Spirit wait for the hope of righteousness by faith.",pt:"N\xf3s, entretanto, pelo Esp\xedrito aguardamos a esperan\xe7a da justi\xe7a que prov\xe9m da f\xe9."},{verse:6,en:"For in Jesus Christ neither circumcision availeth any thing, nor uncircumcision; but faith which worketh by love.",pt:"Porque em Cristo Jesus nem a circuncis\xe3o nem a incircuncis\xe3o vale coisa alguma; mas sim a f\xe9 que opera pelo amor."},{verse:7,en:"Ye did run well; who did hinder you that ye should not obey the truth?",pt:"Corr\xedeis bem; quem vos impediu de obedecer \xe0 verdade?"},{verse:8,en:"This persuasion cometh not of him that calleth you.",pt:"Esta persuas\xe3o n\xe3o vem daquele que vos chama."},{verse:9,en:"A little leaven leaveneth the whole lump.",pt:"Um pouco de fermento leveda a massa toda."},{verse:10,en:"I have confidence in you through the Lord, that ye will be none otherwise minded: but he that troubleth you shall bear his judgment, whosoever he be.",pt:"Confio de v\xf3s, no Senhor, que de outro modo n\xe3o haveis de pensar; mas aquele que vos perturba, seja quem for, sofrer\xe1 a condena\xe7\xe3o."},{verse:11,en:"And I, brethren, if I yet preach circumcision, why do I yet suffer persecution? then is the offence of the cross ceased.",pt:"Eu, por\xe9m, irm\xe3os, se \xe9 que prego ainda a circuncis\xe3o, por que ainda sou perseguido? Nesse caso o esc\xe2ndalo da cruz estaria aniquilado."},{verse:12,en:"I would they were even cut off which trouble you.",pt:"Oxal\xe1 se mutilassem aqueles que vos andam inquietando."},{verse:13,en:"For, brethren, ye have been called unto liberty; only use not liberty for an occasion to the flesh, but by love serve one another.",pt:"Porque v\xf3s, irm\xe3os, fostes chamados \xe0 liberdade. Mas n\xe3o useis da liberdade para dar ocasi\xe3o \xe0 carne, antes pelo amor servi-vos uns aos outros."},{verse:14,en:"For all the law is fulfilled in one word, even in this; Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself.",pt:"Pois toda a lei se cumpre numa s\xf3 palavra, a saber: Amar\xe1s ao teu pr\xf3ximo como a ti mesmo."},{verse:15,en:"But if ye bite and devour one another, take heed that ye be not consumed one of another.",pt:"Se v\xf3s, por\xe9m, vos mordeis e devorais uns aos outros, vede n\xe3o vos consumais uns aos outros."},{verse:16,en:"This I say then, Walk in the Spirit, and ye shall not fulfil the lust of the flesh.",pt:"Digo, por\xe9m: Andai pelo Esp\xedrito, e n\xe3o haveis de cumprir a cobi\xe7a da carne."},{verse:17,en:"For the flesh lusteth against the Spirit, and the Spirit against the flesh: and these are contrary the one to the other: so that ye cannot do the things that ye would.",pt:"Porque a carne luta contra o Esp\xedrito, e o Esp\xedrito contra a carne; e estes se op\xf5em um ao outro, para que n\xe3o fa\xe7ais o que quereis."},{verse:18,en:"But if ye be led of the Spirit, ye are not under the law.",pt:"Mas, se sois guiados pelo Esp\xedrito, n\xe3o estais debaixo da lei."},{verse:19,en:"Now the works of the flesh are manifest, which are these; Adultery, fornication, uncleanness, lasciviousness,",pt:"Ora, as obras da carne s\xe3o manifestas, as quais s\xe3o: a prostitui\xe7\xe3o, a impureza, a lasc\xedvia,"},{verse:20,en:"Idolatry, witchcraft, hatred, variance, emulations, wrath, strife, seditions, heresies,",pt:"a idolatria, a feiti\xe7aria, as inimizades, as contendas, os ci\xfames, as iras, as fac\xe7\xf5es, as dissens\xf5es, os partidos,"},{verse:21,en:"Envyings, murders, drunkenness, revellings, and such like: of the which I tell you before, as I have also told you in time past, that they which do such things shall not inherit the kingdom of God.",pt:"as invejas, as bebedices, as orgias, e coisas semelhantes a estas, contra as quais vos previno, como j\xe1 antes vos preveni, que os que tais coisas praticam n\xe3o herdar\xe3o o reino de Deus."},{verse:22,en:"But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, gentleness, goodness, faith,",pt:"Mas o fruto do Esp\xedrito \xe9: o amor, o gozo, a paz, a longanimidade, a benignidade, a bondade, a fidelidade."},{verse:23,en:"Meekness, temperance: against such there is no law.",pt:"a mansid\xe3o, o dom\xednio pr\xf3prio; contra estas coisas n\xe3o h\xe1 lei."},{verse:24,en:"And they that are Christ\u2019s have crucified the flesh with the affections and lusts.",pt:"E os que s\xe3o de Cristo Jesus crucificaram a carne com as suas paix\xf5es e concupisc\xeancias."},{verse:25,en:"If we live in the Spirit, let us also walk in the Spirit.",pt:"Se vivemos pelo Esp\xedrito, andemos tamb\xe9m pelo Esp\xedrito."},{verse:26,en:"Let us not be desirous of vain glory, provoking one another, envying one another.",pt:"N\xe3o nos tornemos vangloriosos, provocando-nos uns aos outros, invejando-nos uns aos outros."}]}}),736,[]);
__d((function(e,o,a,s,r,t,n){r.exports={book:"Galatians",bookPt:"G\xe1latas",chapter:6,translationEn:"KJV (Public Domain)",translationPt:"Almeida (Public Domain)",verses:[{verse:1,en:"Brethren, if a man be overtaken in a fault, ye which are spiritual, restore such an one in the spirit of meekness; considering thyself, lest thou also be tempted.",pt:"Irm\xe3os, se um homem chegar a ser surpreendido em algum delito, v\xf3s que sois espirituais corrigi o tal com esp\xedrito de mansid\xe3o; e olha por ti mesmo, para que tamb\xe9m tu n\xe3o sejas tentado."},{verse:2,en:"Bear ye one another\u2019s burdens, and so fulfil the law of Christ.",pt:"Levai as cargas uns dos outros, e assim cumprireis a lei de Cristo."},{verse:3,en:"For if a man think himself to be something, when he is nothing, he deceiveth himself.",pt:"Pois, se algu\xe9m pensa ser alguma coisa, n\xe3o sendo nada, engana-se a si mesmo."},{verse:4,en:"But let every man prove his own work, and then shall he have rejoicing in himself alone, and not in another.",pt:"Mas prove cada um a sua pr\xf3pria obra, e ent\xe3o ter\xe1 motivo de gl\xf3ria somente em si mesmo, e n\xe3o em outrem;"},{verse:5,en:"For every man shall bear his own burden.",pt:"porque cada qual levar\xe1 o seu pr\xf3prio fardo."},{verse:6,en:"Let him that is taught in the word communicate unto him that teacheth in all good things.",pt:"E o que est\xe1 sendo instru\xeddo na palavra, fa\xe7a participante em todas as boas coisas aquele que o instrui."},{verse:7,en:"Be not deceived; God is not mocked: for whatsoever a man soweth, that shall he also reap.",pt:"N\xe3o vos enganeis; Deus n\xe3o se deixa escarnecer; pois tudo o que o homem semear, isso tamb\xe9m ceifar\xe1."},{verse:8,en:"For he that soweth to his flesh shall of the flesh reap corruption; but he that soweth to the Spirit shall of the Spirit reap life everlasting.",pt:"Porque quem semeia na sua carne, da carne ceifar\xe1 a corrup\xe7\xe3o; mas quem semeia no Esp\xedrito, do Esp\xedrito ceifar\xe1 a vida eterna."},{verse:9,en:"And let us not be weary in well doing: for in due season we shall reap, if we faint not.",pt:"E n\xe3o nos cansemos de fazer o bem, porque a seu tempo ceifaremos, se n\xe3o houvermos desfalecido."},{verse:10,en:"As we have therefore opportunity, let us do good unto all men, especially unto them who are of the household of faith.",pt:"Ent\xe3o, enquanto temos oportunidade, fa\xe7amos bem a todos, mas principamente aos dom\xe9sticos da f\xe9."},{verse:11,en:"Ye see how large a letter I have written unto you with mine own hand.",pt:"Vede com que grandes letras vos escrevo com minha pr\xf3pria m\xe3o."},{verse:12,en:"As many as desire to make a fair shew in the flesh, they constrain you to be circumcised; only lest they should suffer persecution for the cross of Christ.",pt:"Todos os que querem ostentar boa apar\xeancia na carne, esses vos obrigam a circuncidar-vos, somente para n\xe3o serem perseguidos por causa da cruz de Cristo."},{verse:13,en:"For neither they themselves who are circumcised keep the law; but desire to have you circumcised, that they may glory in your flesh.",pt:"Porque nem ainda esses mesmos que se circuncidam guardam a lei, mas querem que vos circuncideis, para se gloriarem na vossa carne."},{verse:14,en:"But God forbid that I should glory, save in the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ, by whom the world is crucified unto me, and I unto the world.",pt:"Mas longe esteja de mim gloriar-me, a n\xe3o ser na cruz de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo, pela qual o mundo est\xe1 crucificado para mim e eu para o mundo."},{verse:15,en:"For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision availeth any thing, nor uncircumcision, but a new creature.",pt:"Pois nem a circuncis\xe3o nem a incircuncis\xe3o \xe9 coisa alguma, mas sim o ser uma nova criatura."},{verse:16,en:"And as many as walk according to this rule, peace be on them, and mercy, and upon the Israel of God.",pt:"E a todos quantos andarem conforme esta norma, paz e miseric\xf3rdia sejam sobre eles e sobre o Israel de Deus."},{verse:17,en:"From henceforth let no man trouble me: for I bear in my body the marks of the Lord Jesus.",pt:"Daqui em diante ningu\xe9m me moleste; porque eu trago no meu corpo as marcas de Jesus."},{verse:18,en:"Brethren, the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Amen.",pt:"A gra\xe7a de nosso Senhor Jesus Cristo seja, irm\xe3os, com o vosso esp\xedrito. Am\xe9m."}]}}),737,[]);
